{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "no_mem", "phase": "test", "task_id": "13#0", "task_desc": "Hello. I need to make a change to my existing flight reservation. I currently have a return flight from Atlanta to Los Angeles that has a stop, and I'd like to change it to a nonstop flight from Atlanta to Las Vegas instead. I'm not looking to book a new ticket, just modify the one I already have.\nMy user ID is james_lee_6136. \n\nBut I have to say, I'm only interested in changing my existing reservation, not booking a new flight. Since you're telling me that changing the destination from LAX to L", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I can help you look into modifying your reservation. First, I'll need your user ID to locate your account and reservation.\n\nAlso, I should note an important policy constraint: flight modifications cannot change the **origin, destination, or trip type** of an existing reservation. Changing your destination from Los Angeles (LAX) to Las Vegas (LAS) would not be permitted as a modification \u2014 that would require booking a new reservation instead.\n\nCould you please provide your user ID so I can review your current reservation details?\ntool: Transfer successful\nassistant: YOU ARE BEING TRANSFERRED TO A HUMAN AGENT. PLEASE HOLD ON.", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 1, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 0, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "aa50189e", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T11:02:42"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "no_mem", "phase": "test", "task_id": "3#0", "task_desc": "Hello, I'm calling because I need to find out exactly how many suitcases my booking lets me bring on my upcoming flight. I've got a ton of stuff I have to take with me and I'm pretty stressed out about it, so it's really important that the details are right. I believe I'm a Gold member, if that makes a difference. Can you look into that for me?\nSure, yes. My user ID is anya_garcia_5901. And I do have my confirmation number \u2014 it's JMO1MG. I really need to get this sorted out because I have a lot ", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'd be happy to help you find out exactly how many checked bags your booking includes. To look this up, I'll need a couple of details from you first:\n\n1. Your **user ID** (for example, something like \"sara_doe_496\").\n2. Your **reservation ID** (for example, \"ZFA04Y\"). If you don't have your reservation ID handy, I can help locate it once I have your user ID.\n\nCould you please provide your user ID so I can pull up your profile and reservation?\nassistant: Thank you! Let me pull up your profile and reservation details so I can give you the exact baggage allowance.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"anya_garcia_5901\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Anya\", \"last_name\": \"Garcia\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"555 Highland Drive\", \"address2\": \"Suite 243\", \"city\": \"San Antonio\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"TX\", \"zip\": \"78256\"}, \"email\": \"anya.garcia8816@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1992-11-12\", \"payment_methods\": {\"gift_card_2550356\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_2550356\", \"amount\": 149.0}, \"certificate_7583008\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_7583008\", \"amount\": 150.0}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Mei\", \"last_name\": \"Lee\", \"dob\": \"1989-12-13\"}], \"membership\": \"silver\", \"reservations\": [\"82K