{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "no_mem", "phase": "test", "task_id": "31#0", "task_desc": "Hello, I have a flight booked out of JFK on May 17, but my cat is very sick and I need to get back home earlier to take care of him. I\u2019d like to change my flight to a nonstop one if possible.\nI\u2019m Daiki Lee, and my user ID is daiki_lee_6144. I\u2019m afraid I don\u2019t have my reservation ID on me right now \u2014 I hope you can look that up with my user ID?\nI really didn't want to cancel or book a new flight \u2014 I just needed to modify my existing reservation to a nonstop out of JFK on May 17 to get home to my ", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'm sorry to hear about your cat. I can help you look into changing your flight. \n\nTo get started, I'll need your user ID. Also, if you have your reservation ID handy, please share that as well. If you don't know your reservation ID, I can help locate it once I have your user ID.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"daiki_lee_6144\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Daiki\", \"last_name\": \"Lee\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"410 River Road\", \"address2\": \"Suite 380\", \"city\": \"Fort Worth\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"TX\", \"zip\": \"76173\"}, \"email\": \"daiki.lee6987@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1976-10-08\", \"payment_methods\": {\"credit_card_6198952\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_6198952\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"9734\"}, \"gift_card_3112961\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_3112961\", \"amount\": 51.0}, \"gift_card_5128346\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_5128346\", \"amount\": 262.0}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Raj\", \"last_name\": \"Muller\", \"dob\": \"1967-10-16\"}], \"membership\": \"regular\", \"reservations\": [\"DF89BM\", \"COVE6R\", \"IIHXDG\"]}\nassistant: I found your profile. You have three reservations (DF89BM, COVE6R, IIHXDG). Let me check the details to