{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "no_mem", "phase": "test", "task_id": "26#0", "task_desc": "Hi, I need to cancel my flight from Orlando to Charlotte \u2014 that's MCO to CLT \u2014 and I really need to get my refund for it.\nSure, it's amelia_sanchez_4739. That's my account.\nIt's just a change of plan. But either way, I really need to go ahead and cancel that flight \u2014 and I want to make sure I get my refund for it.\nI understand what the policy says, but I'm telling you I need to cancel this flight and get my refund. I don't care about those conditions \u2014 I booked it, it's my ticket, and I want to ", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I can help you with that. First, I'll need your user ID to locate your reservation. Could you please provide your user ID?\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"amelia_sanchez_4739\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Amelia\", \"last_name\": \"Sanchez\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"225 Sunset Drive\", \"address2\": \"Suite 563\", \"city\": \"Los Angeles\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"CA\", \"zip\": \"91292\"}, \"email\": \"amelia.sanchez3631@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1955-02-01\", \"payment_methods\": {\"credit_card_4065275\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_4065275\", \"brand\": \"mastercard\", \"last_four\": \"3658\"}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Ivan\", \"last_name\": \"Martin\", \"dob\": \"1973-08-20\"}], \"membership\": \"gold\", \"reservations\": [\"3FRNFB\", \"Q4L9HS\"]}\nassistant: I found your account. You have two reservations (3FRNFB and Q4L9HS). Let me check the details to find the one from MCO to CLT.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"3FRNFB\", \"user_id\": \"amelia_sanchez_4739\", \"origin\": \"MCO\", \"destination\": \"CLT\", \"flight_type\": \"one_way\", \"cabin\": \"basic_economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT028\", \"origin\": \"MCO\", \"destination\": \"BOS\", \"date\": \"2024-05-28\", \"price\": 79}, {\"flight_number\"