{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "no_mem", "phase": "test", "task_id": "5#0", "task_desc": "Hello, I'm a valued Gold member with your airline, and I'm extremely frustrated right now. My flight HAT045 from Phoenix to Seattle has been delayed, and because of that I'm going to miss a very important meeting I had planned. I need to talk to someone about this!\nYes, of course. My name is Mei Brown and my user ID is mei_brown_7075. As I mentioned, I'm a Gold member and this delay on flight HAT045 from PHX to SEA is really unacceptable \u2014 I'm going to miss an important business meeting because ", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'm sorry to hear about the delay and the impact on your meeting. I'd like to help you with this. As a Gold member, you may be eligible for compensation regarding the delayed flight.\n\nTo confirm the facts and assist you, I'll need to look up your reservation. Could you please provide your user ID?\nassistant: Thank you, Mei. Let me look up your profile and reservation details to confirm the facts about the delay.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"mei_brown_7075\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Mei\", \"last_name\": \"Brown\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"853 Chestnut Street\", \"address2\": \"Suite 497\", \"city\": \"Washington\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"DC\", \"zip\": \"20195\"}, \"email\": \"mei.brown7062@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1986-12-14\", \"payment_methods\": {\"certificate_6761175\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_6761175\", \"amount\": 250.0}, \"gift_card_8987598\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_8987598\", \"amount\": 130.0}, \"credit_card_4920843\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_4920843\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"1663\"}, \"credit_card_1815425\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_1815425\", \"brand\": \"mastercard\", \"last_four\": \"9812\"}, \"certificate_1585255\": {\"source\": \"ce