{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "no_mem", "phase": "test", "task_id": "21#0", "task_desc": "Hi, I'm Sofia Kim. I need to change the return flight for my Houston to Denver trip \u2014 the departure is on May 27. This is urgent and I need to get it done ASAP. I want to change the return to the fastest possible trip on that same day, May 27.\nMy user ID is sofia_kim_7287. I'm sorry, but I don't remember my reservation ID.\nYes, please proceed with the change.\n\nFor the payment, I want you to use the gift card with the smallest balance \u2014 that would be gift_card_6276644 with $113 on it.\nActually, y", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: Hello Sofia! I'd be happy to help you change the return flight for your Houston to Denver trip.\n\nTo get started, I'll need your **user ID** (for example, a format like `sara_doe_496`). \n\nAlso, do you happen to know your **reservation ID**? If not, I can help locate it once I have your user ID.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"sofia_kim_7287\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Sofia\", \"last_name\": \"Kim\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"825 Laurel Lane\", \"address2\": \"Suite 595\", \"city\": \"Houston\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"TX\", \"zip\": \"77243\"}, \"email\": \"sofia.kim1937@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1950-06-24\", \"payment_methods\": {\"certificate_8544743\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_8544743\", \"amount\": 250.0}, \"credit_card_9879898\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_9879898\", \"brand\": \"mastercard\", \"last_four\": \"9725\"}, \"gift_card_7091239\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_7091239\", \"amount\": 157.0}, \"gift_card_6276644\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_6276644\", \"amount\": 113.0}, \"gift_card_7480005\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_7480005\", \"amount\": 6.0}, \"certificate_9932251\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_9932251\", \"amount\": 250.0}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Mia\", \"last_name\": \"Jackson\", \"dob\": \"1986-05-05\"}], \"membership\": \"silver\", \"reservations\": [\"OI5L9G\", \"AQLBTL\", \"KA7I60\", \"I57WUD\", \"OBUT9V\", \"4BMN53\", \"Q0ZF0J\"]}\nassistant: Thank you, Sofia. I found your profile. You have several reservations, so let me locate the Houston to Denver round trip. I'll check your reservations one by one.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"OI5L9G\", \"user_id\": \"sofia_kim_7287\", \"origin\": \"MCO\", \"destination\": \"CLT\", \"flight_type\": \"one_way\", \"cabin\": \"business\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT017\", \"origin\": \"MCO\", \"destination\": \"BOS\", \"date\": \"2024-05-25\", \"price\": 523}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT277\", \"origin\": \"BOS\", \"destination\": \"CLT\", \"date\": \"2024-05-25\", \"price\": 501}], \"passengers\": [{\"", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 12, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 0, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "aa50189e", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T11:02:42"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "no_mem", "phase": "test", "task_id": "8#1", "task_desc": "Hello, I need to book a one-way trip from Chicago O'Hare to Philadelphia on May 26. I want it to be the exact same flight I was on back on May 10 from ORD to PHL. I'm not interested in any other options.\nSure, my user ID is sophia_silva_7557.\nGreat, HAT271 works for me since it's the same as my May 10 flight.\n\nFor passengers: I'm Sophia Silva \u2014 my date of birth is already in my user profile, so I'd rather not provide it again. I'd also like to add a second passenger, Kevin Smith, born April 12, ", "score": 0.0, "em": 0.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: To help you book this trip, I'll first need your user ID. Could you please provide it?\nassistant: Thank you. Let me look up your profile and past reservations to find the flight you took on May 10 from ORD to PHL.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"sophia_silva_7557\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Sophia\", \"last_name\": \"Silva\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"141 Cedar Avenue\", \"address2\": \"Suite 436\", \"city\": \"Columbus\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"OH\", \"zip\": \"43282\"}, \"email\": \"sophia.silva5929@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1957-10-05\", \"payment_methods\": {\"certificate_8045380\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_8045380\", \"amount\": 500.0}, \"certificate_3887113\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_3887113\", \"amount\": 150.0}, \"credit_card_4196779\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_4196779\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"7238\"}, \"gift_card_5094406\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_5094406\", \"amount\": 274.0}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Yara\", \"last_name\": \"Silva\", \"dob\": \"1972-06-16\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Isabella\", \"last_name\": \"Moore\", \"dob\": \"1988-06-04\"}], \"membership\": \"regular\", \"reservations\": [\"NM1VX1\", \"KC18K6\", \"S61CZX\", \"H8Q05L\", \"WUNA5K\"]}\nassistant: Let me check your reservations to find the flight from ORD to PHL on May 10.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"NM1VX1\", \"user_id\": \"sophia_silva_7557\", \"origin\": \"MSP\", \"destination\": \"EWR\", \"flight_type\": \"round_trip\", \"cabin\": \"basic_economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT300\", \"origin\": \"MSP\", \"destination\": \"EWR\", \"date\": \"2024-05-25\", \"price\": 100}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT208\", \"origin\": \"EWR\", \"destination\": \"MSP\", \"date\": \"2024-05-27\", \"price\": 53}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Yara\", \"last_name\": \"Silva\", \"dob\": \"1972-06-16\"}], \"payment_history\": [{\"payment_id\": \"gift_card_5094406\", \"amount\": 183}], \"created_at\": \"2024-05-03T08:46:43\", \"total_baggages\": 0, \"nonfree_baggages\": 0, \"insurance\": \"yes\", \"status\": null}\ntool: {\"reservation_id\"", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 7, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 0, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "aa50189e", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T11:02:42"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "no_mem", "phase": "test", "task_id": "24#0", "task_desc": "Hi, I'm Mia. I need to remove a passenger from one of my existing bookings, and I also want to look into booking a new flight from New York out to the West Coast. Can you help me with both of those things?\nThanks for clarifying. My user ID is **mia_kim_4397**.\n\nSince you can\u2019t remove Ethan from my reservation **H9ZU1C**, then please just go ahead and cancel that entire reservation for me \u2014 I\u2019ll rebook myself later as you suggested.\n\nNow for the new trip: I\u2019m looking for the cheapest **direct rou", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: Hello Mia! I can help with your requests, but I need to clarify a couple of things:\n\n**Regarding removing a passenger from an existing booking:** Per our policy, the number of passengers on a reservation cannot be modified \u2014 this applies to both self-service and even human agents. So I'm unable to remove a passenger from your booking. If you'd like, I can help you modify passenger details (such as names or dates of birth) without changing the count, or you could look into cancelling the entire reservation if that fits your needs.\n\n**Regarding booking a new flight from New York to the West Coast:** I'd be happy to help with that! To get started, I'll need a few details. First, could you please provide your **user ID** (for example, a format like `mia_smith_123`)? \n\nOnce I have that, I'll also need:\n- Your departure airport in New York (e.g., JFK, LGA, or EWR) and your West Coast destination airport\n- Trip type (one way or round trip)\n- Cabin class (basic economy, economy, or business)\n- Passenger details (first name, last name, and date of birth for each passenger \u2014 up to 5)\n- Your preferred travel date(s)\n- Payment method(s) already on file in your profile\n- Whether you'd like to add travel insurance ($30 per passenger)\n\nPlease share your user ID and any of the above details you have, and we'll get started!\nassistant: I'll help you with both tasks. Let me start by gathering the necessary information \u2014 your user profile, the reservation details for H9ZU1C, and the list of available airports so I can find West Coast destinations.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"mia_kim_4397\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Mia\", \"last_name\": \"Kim\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"681 Cedar Street\", \"address2\": \"Suite 847\", \"city\": \"Washington\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"DC\", \"zip\": \"20017\"}, \"email\": \"mia.kim6850@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1965-06-09\", \"payment_methods\": {\"gift_card_7359776\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_7359776\", \"amount\": 39.0}, \"g", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 19, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 0, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "aa50189e", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T11:02:42"}
