{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "no_mem", "phase": "test", "task_id": "6#1", "task_desc": "Hi, I'm calling about a flight I booked for myself and my family. I'm almost certain I added travel insurance to my own ticket when I made the reservation, but when I log in to check the booking online, it's not showing up there. The thing is, everyone else in my family already has their insurance confirmed on their flights, so I really need to make sure mine gets added too \u2014 it's important to me that we're all covered.\nOkay, here's my information \u2014 my user ID is sophia_taylor_9065 and the reser", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'm sorry, but I'm unable to add travel insurance to your reservation at this time. According to our policy, travel insurance cannot be added after the initial booking has been made.\n\nIf you believe you originally purchased insurance for your ticket but it's not showing up in your online account, that may be a separate issue worth investigating. However, I am not able to add insurance to an existing reservation.\n\nIf you'd like, I can look up your reservation details to verify the current insurance status on the booking. To do that, I'll need your user ID and reservation ID. Please note that I cannot add insurance regardless of what the lookup shows.\nassistant: I understand your concern. Let me look up your reservation to verify the current insurance status on the booking.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"PEP4E0\", \"user_id\": \"sophia_taylor_9065\", \"origin\": \"CLT\", \"destination\": \"PHX\", \"flight_type\": \"one_way\", \"cabin\": \"basic_economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT176\", \"origin\": \"CLT\", \"destination\": \"DTW\", \"date\": \"2024-05-20\", \"price\": 51}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT097\", \"origin\": \"DTW\", \"destination\": \"PHX\", \"date\": \"2024-05-20\", \"price\": 77}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Sophia\", \"last_name\": \"Taylor\", \"dob\": \"1999-05-27\"}], \"payment_history\": [{\"payment_id\": \"credit_card_9302073\", \"amount\": 128}], \"created_at\": \"2024-05-05T05:10:43\", \"total_baggages\": 0, \"nonfree_baggages\": 0, \"insurance\": \"no\", \"status\": null}\nassistant: I've reviewed your reservation PEP4E0. Here are the facts as they appear in the system:\n\n- **Reservation PEP4E0** is under your user ID (sophia_taylor_9065).\n- The booking shows **insurance: \"no\"** \u2014 there is no travel insurance currently recorded on this reservation.\n- This reservation contains **one passenger: Sophia Taylor** (yourself), in **basic economy**, created on 2024-05-05.\n\nI understand you believe you selected insurance at checkout, but I'm afraid I'm still unable to add travel insu", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 1, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 0, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "aa50189e", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T11:02:42"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "no_mem", "phase": "test", "task_id": "19#1", "task_desc": "Hi, I have a reservation for a quick half-day trip to Texas, but I can't seem to find my reservation ID. I need to change my return flight \u2014 right now it's set to depart at 3pm on the 28th. I'd like to take a later flight back to Newark that same day, and if that's not possible, the earliest flight the next day would work.\nSure, my user ID is olivia_gonzalez_2305.\n###TRANSFER###", "score": 0.0, "em": 0.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'd be happy to help you modify your return flight. First, I'll need your user ID to locate your reservation. Could you please provide your user ID?\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"olivia_gonzalez_2305\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Olivia\", \"last_name\": \"Gonzalez\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"334 Laurel Lane\", \"address2\": \"Suite 970\", \"city\": \"Los Angeles\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"CA\", \"zip\": \"90504\"}, \"email\": \"olivia.gonzalez4421@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1988-06-13\", \"payment_methods\": {\"gift_card_2200803\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_2200803\", \"amount\": 123.0}, \"credit_card_9969263\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_9969263\", \"brand\": \"mastercard\", \"last_four\": \"9475\"}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Mei\", \"last_name\": \"Johansson\", \"dob\": \"1981-09-25\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Yara\", \"last_name\": \"Lopez\", \"dob\": \"1975-09-15\"}], \"membership\": \"regular\", \"reservations\": [\"Z7GOZK\", \"K67C4W\", \"THY2DG\"]}\nassistant: Let me look up your reservations to find the one matching your trip to Texas.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"Z7GOZK\", \"user_id\": \"olivia_gonzalez_2305\", \"origin\": \"EWR\", \"destination\": \"IAH\", \"flight_type\": \"round_trip\", \"cabin\": \"basic_economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT188\", \"origin\": \"EWR\", \"destination\": \"IAH\", \"date\": \"20