{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "no_mem", "phase": "test", "task_id": "35#0", "task_desc": "Hi, I need to cancel my upcoming flight from JFK to MCO on May 22. I\u2019m a silver member, so I should be getting a full refund for that.\nMy user ID is aarav_ahmed_6699. The reason is just a change of plans on my end. And I want to stress \u2014 I\u2019m a silver member, so I should be getting a full refund for this cancellation, no penalties.\nI understand what you\u2019re saying, but as a silver member, I was told I\u2019m entitled to a full refund on cancellations like this. That\u2019s a perk of my status. I really don\u2019", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: To help you cancel your flight, I'll need some information first. Could you please provide your **user ID**? \n\nAlso, for the cancellation, I'll need to know the **reason for cancellation** (change of plan, airline cancelled flight, or other reasons).\n\nIf you don't know your reservation ID, I can help locate it once I have your user ID.\nassistant: Let me look up your profile and reservations to locate the booking.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"aarav_ahmed_6699\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Aarav\", \"last_name\": \"Ahmed\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"176 Willow Lane\", \"address2\": \"Suite 431\", \"city\": \"Jacksonville\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"FL\", \"zip\": \"32131\"}, \"email\": \"aarav.ahmed6812@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1981-05-26\", \"payment_methods\": {\"credit_card_9074831\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_9074831\", \"brand\": \"mastercard\", \"last_four\": \"7334\"}, \"certificate_9645872\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_9645872\", \"amount\": 250.0}, \"credit_card_4959530\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_4959530\", \"brand\": \"mastercard\", \"last_four\": \"5018\"}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Aarav\", \"last_name\": \"Patel\", \"dob\": \"1980-12-03\"}], \"membership\": \"silver\", \"reservations\": [\"M20IZO\", \"N6F783\", \"IFOYYZ\", \"NQNU5R\"]}\nassistant: I've confirmed you're a silver member. You have four reservations (M20IZO, N6F783, IFOYYZ, NQNU5R). Let me check each to find the one for JFK to MCO on May 22.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"M20IZO\", \"user_id\": \"aarav_ahmed_6699\", \"origin\": \"JFK\", \"destination\": \"MCO\", \"flight_type\": \"one_way\", \"cabin\": \"economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT268\", \"origin\": \"JFK\", \"destination\": \"ATL\", \"date\": \"2024-05-22\", \"price\": 136}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT010\", \"origin\": \"ATL\", \"destination\": \"MCO\", \"date\": \"2024-05-22\", \"price\": 109}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Aarav\", \"last_name\": \"Ahmed\", \"dob\": \"1981-05-26\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Daiki\", \"last_name\": \"Li\", \"dob\": \"1980-12-24\"}], \"payment", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 7, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 0, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "aa50189e", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T11:02:42"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "no_mem", "phase": "test", "task_id": "7#0", "task_desc": "I'm sick. Need to cancel flights under XEHM4B and 59XX6W.\nUser ID daiki_muller_1116. Yes, health reasons, I'm sick.\nXEHM4B is basic economy. Upgrade to business first, then cancel. Use CC ending 2135. Cancel 59XX6W as described. Also: any other upcoming flights under my ID? Total cost of those?\nYes. Upgrade XEHM4B with CC ending 2135. Then cancel both XEHM4B and 59XX6W.\nYes. Cancel both.\n###STOP###", "score": 0.0, "em": 0.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'm sorry to hear you're not feeling well. To help you cancel these reservations, I'll need a bit more information first.\n\nCould you please provide your **user ID**? (This is required before I can proceed with the cancellation.)\n\nAlso, just to confirm the reason for cancellation: you mentioned you're sick \u2014 is the reason for cancellation due to **health reasons** (which may be covered by travel insurance if you have it)?\nassistant: Thank you. Let me look up your reservations and profile to verify the details before proceeding.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"daiki_muller_1116\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Daiki\", \"last_name\": \"Muller\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"594 Chestnut Street\", \"address2\": \"Suite 244\", \"city\": \"Indianapolis\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"IN\", \"zip\": \"46230\"}, \"email\": \"daiki.muller6236@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1954-07-04\", \"payment_methods\": {\"credit_card_2408938\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_2408938\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"2135\"}, \"credit_card_4303738\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_4303738\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"5541\"}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Amelia\", \"last_name\": \"Kim\", \"dob\": \"1978-04-20\"}], \"membership\": \"silver\", \"reservations\": [\"7WPL39\", \"XEHM4B\", \"59XX6W\", \"3EMQJ6\", \"A90KR2\", \"9MRJD4\"]}\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"XEHM4B\", \"user_id\": \"daiki_muller_1116\", \"origin\": \"LAS\", \"destination\": \"ATL\", \"flight_type\": \"round_trip\", \"cabin\": \"basic_economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT005\", \"origin\": \"LAS\", \"destination\": \"ATL\", \"date\": \"2024-05-20\", \"price\": 65}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT178\", \"origin\": \"ATL\", \"destination\": \"LAS\", \"date\": \"2024-05-30\", \"price\": 83}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Daiki\", \"last_name\": \"Muller\", \"dob\": \"1954-07-04\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Omar\", \"last_name\": \"Ito\", \"dob\": \"1975-09-19\"}], \"payment_history\": [{\"payment_id\": \"credit_card_2408938\", \"amount\": 296}], \"created_at\": \"2024-05-01T05:17:41\", \"total_baggages\": 0, \"no", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 14, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 0, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "aa50189e", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T11:02:42"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "no_mem", "phase": "test", "task_id": "33#0", "task_desc": "Hello, I'm Yara Garcia. I have a booking under the reference HXDUBJ. I'd like to change my outgoing flight to a nonstop one leaving a day later than originally scheduled, and also push my return flight from SFO back by one day. Could you assist me with making those changes?\nThanks for pulling that up. I'll go with HAT072 for the outgoing flight on May 19 \u2014 the 9:00 departure works for me, but the 7:00 one is too early since I'm only looking at flights leaving after 8 in the morning and before 9 ", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'll help you modify your reservation. Let me first look up the details of your booking.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"HXDUBJ\", \"user_id\": \"yara_garcia_1905\", \"origin\": \"IAH\", \"destination\": \"SFO\", \"flight_type\": \"round_trip\", \"cabin\": \"economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT085\", \"origin\": \"IAH\", \"destination\": \"JFK\", \"date\": \"2024-05-18\", \"price\": 177}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT023\", \"origin\": \"JFK\", \"destination\": \"SFO\", \"date\": \"2024-05-18\", \"price\": 146}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT278\", \"origin\": \"SFO\", \"destination\": \"IAH\", \"date\": \"2024-05-22\", \"price\": 180}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Yara\", \"last_name\": \"Garcia\", \"dob\": \"1974-08-15\"}], \"payment_history\": [{\"payment_id\": \"gift_card_6941833\", \"amount\": 533}], \"created_at\": \"2024-05-04T06:04:48\", \"total_baggages\": 0, \"nonfree_baggages\": 0, \"insurance\": \"yes\", \"status\": null}\nassistant: I've found your reservation. Here's a summary of your current booking:\n\n- **Reservation:** HXDUBJ (user: yara_garcia_1905)\n- **Trip type:** Round trip, Economy cabin\n- **Outgoing (May 18):** IAH \u2192 JFK (HAT085) then JFK \u2192 SFO (HAT023) \u2014 a one-stop itinerary\n- **Return (May 22):** SFO \u2192 IAH (HAT278)\n- **Passenger:** Yara Garcia\n- **Insurance:** Yes\n\nTo make your requested changes, I'll search for a nonstop flight from IAH to SFO on May 19 (one day later than the original May 18), and a return flight from SFO to IAH on May 23 (one day later than the original May 22). Let me start by searching for the nonstop outgoing flight.\ntool: [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT072\", \"origin\": \"IAH\", \"destination\": \"SFO\", \"status\": \"available\", \"scheduled_departure_time_est\": \"09:00:00\", \"scheduled_arrival_time_est\": \"13:00:00\", \"date\": null, \"available_seats\": {\"basic_economy\": 18, \"economy\": 9, \"business\": 9}, \"prices\": {\"basic_economy\": 68, \"economy\": 130, \"business\": 282}}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT180\", \"origin\": \"IAH\", \"destination\": \"SFO\", \"status\": \"available\", \"scheduled_departure_time_est\": \"07:00:0", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 6, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 0, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "aa50189e", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T11:02:42"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "no_mem", "phase": "test", "task_id": "16#1", "task_desc": "Hello, I have a flight booked from Atlanta to Philadelphia that I need to change. I\u2019d like to move it to the day after my original travel date, and I\u2019m looking for the cheapest option in standard Economy class\u2014not Basic Economy.\nSure, my user ID is **aarav_garcia_1177**. I don\u2019t have my reservation ID in front of me at the moment, but hopefully you can pull up my booking with that ID?\nYes, that works perfectly for me. I\u2019m happy to have the refund go back to the original gift card on file \u2014 that\u2019", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: To help you modify your reservation, I'll need some information first. Could you please provide your **user ID**? \n\nAlso, if you know your **reservation ID**, please share that as well. If you don't have it handy, I can help locate it once I have your user ID.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"aarav_garcia_1177\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Aarav\", \"last_name\": \"Garcia\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"833 Highland Drive\", \"address2\": \"Suite 740\", \"city\": \"Denver\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"CO\", \"zip\": \"80211\"}, \"email\": \"aarav.garcia6639@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1992-09-13\", \"payment_methods\": {\"certificate_7473723\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_7473723\", \"amount\": 150.0}, \"gift_card_8887175\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_8887175\", \"amount\": 35.0}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Lei\", \"last_name\": \"Ito\", \"dob\": \"1990-12-07\"}], \"membership\": \"gold\", \"reservations\": [\"M05KNL\", \"UHDAHF\"]}\nassistant: I found your profile. You have two reservations: **M05KNL** and **UHDAHF**. Let me check the details of both to find the one from Atlanta to Philadelphia.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"M05KNL\", \"user_id\": \"aarav_garcia_1177\", \"origin\": \"ATL\", \"destination\": \"PHL\", \"flight_type\": \"one_way\", \"cabin\": \"business\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT227\", \"origin\": \"ATL\", \"destination\": \"ORD\", \"date\": \"2024-05-23\", \"price\": 1936}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT139\", \"origin\": \"ORD\", \"destination\": \"PHL\", \"date\": \"2024-05-23\", \"price\": 851}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Aarav\", \"last_name\": \"Garcia\", \"dob\": \"1992-09-13\"}], \"payment_history\": [{\"payment_id\": \"gift_card_8887175\", \"amount\": 2787}], \"created_at\": \"2024-05-14T06:33:04\", \"total_baggages\": 0, \"nonfree_baggages\": 0, \"insurance\": \"no\", \"status\": null}\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"UHDAHF\", \"user_id\": \"aarav_garcia_1177\", \"origin\": \"CLT\", \"destination\": \"LAX\", \"flight_type\": \"round_trip\", \"cabin\": \"basic_economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT015\", \"origin\": \"CLT\", \"dest", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 6, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 0, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "aa50189e", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T11:02:42"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "no_mem", "phase": "test", "task_id": "11#1", "task_desc": "Hi, I'm James Patel. I'm in a hurry here\u2014I need to remove a passenger, Sophia, from my round trip flights from Las Vegas to Denver. We leave May 19 and come back May 20. Can you process that removal quickly?\nUgh, this is ridiculous. Fine\u2014if you can't remove just one passenger, then downgrade *all* passengers on the reservation to basic economy. And hurry up, I'm in a rush here. \n\nAlso, how much of a refund am I going to get from this downgrade? I need to make sure that refund goes back to my ori", "score": 0.0, "em": 0.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'm sorry, but I'm unable to process that request. According to our policy, while passenger details can be modified, the number of passengers on a reservation cannot be changed\u2014and even a human agent is not able to modify the number of passengers. Removing Sophia from your reservation would reduce the passenger count, which is not permitted.\n\nIf you'd like, I can help you with other modifications, such as updating passenger information (without changing the count), changing flights, cabin class, or adding baggage. Please let me know how you'd like to proceed.\nassistant: I understand you're in a hurry. To proceed with the cabin downgrade, I'll need a few details first.\n\nCould you please provide your **user ID** (for example, a format like `james_patel_123`)? Also, if you have your **reservation ID** handy, please share that as well. If you don't know the reservation ID, I can help locate it once I have your user ID.\n\nOnce I have that, I'll check the reservation details and flight status, calculate the refund difference, and confirm the action with you before making any changes.\nassistant: I'll look up your reservation and account details now.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"GV1N64\", \"user_id\": \"james_patel_9828\", \"origin\": \"LAS\", \"destination\": \"DEN\", \"flight_type\": \"round_trip\", \"cabin\": \"business\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT003\", \"origin\": \"LAS\", \"destination\": \"DEN\", \"date\": \"2024-05-19\", \"price\": 561}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT290\", \"origin\": \"DEN\", \"destination\": \"LAS\", \"date\": \"2024-05-20\", \"price\": 1339}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"James\", \"last_name\": \"Patel\", \"dob\": \"1995-04-07\"}, {\"first_name\": \"James\", \"last_name\": \"Sanchez\", \"dob\": \"1956-08-18\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Sophia\", \"last_name\": \"Johansson\", \"dob\": \"1993-07-11\"}], \"payment_history\": [{\"payment_id\": \"gift_card_1642017\", \"amount\": 5700}], \"created_at\": \"2024-05-03T05:35:00\", \"total_baggages\": 3, \"nonfree_baggages\": 0, \"insurance\": \"no\", \"status\": ", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 7, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 0, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "aa50189e", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T11:02:42"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "no_mem", "phase": "test", "task_id": "39#0", "task_desc": "Bonjour, I am Amelia Davis. I want to cancel all of my upcoming flights, s'il vous pla\u00eet.\nOui, of course. My user id is amelia_davis_8890. I am Amelia Davis.\nAh, the reason is... how you say... I have change of plan. I want to cancel all my flights, even the basic economy ones you say cannot be cancelled - the UDMOP1 and XAZ3C0. Even if I do not get refund, I want to proceed anyway, s'il vous pla\u00eet. I want to give up my seat for someone else who needs it, c'est tr\u00e8s important pour moi.\nOui, plea", "score": 0.0, "em": 0.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: Hello! I'd be happy to help you cancel your upcoming flights. \n\nTo get started, I'll need your user ID (for example, something like \"amelia_davis_123\"). Could you please provide that?\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"amelia_davis_8890\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Amelia\", \"last_name\": \"Davis\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"442 Sunset Drive\", \"address2\": \"Suite 708\", \"city\": \"San Diego\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"CA\", \"zip\": \"92125\"}, \"email\": \"amelia.davis1624@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1984-03-05\", \"payment_methods\": {\"gift_card_7397998\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_7397998\", \"amount\": 74.0}, \"gift_card_1647044\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_1647044\", \"amount\": 236.0}, \"credit_card_4074252\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_4074252\", \"brand\": \"mastercard\", \"last_four\": \"5435\"}, \"credit_card_6738701\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_6738701\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"5308\"}, \"credit_card_5799376\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_5799376\", \"brand\": \"mastercard\", \"last_four\": \"9326\"}, \"gift_card_5251654\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_5251654\", \"amount\": 179.0}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Amelia\", \"last_name\": \"Jackson\", \"dob\": \"1999-04-26\"}], \"membership\": \"silver\", \"reservations\": [\"8C8K4E\", \"UDMOP1\", \"XAZ3C0\", \"LU15PA\", \"MSJ4OA\", \"I6M8JQ\", \"4XGCCM\"]}\nassistant: Thank you, Amelia. I can see you have several reservations. Let me look into each one to determine which are upcoming flights that can be cancelled. I'll start by reviewing your reservations one by one.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"8C8K4E\", \"user_id\": \"amelia_davis_8890\", \"origin\": \"BOS\", \"destination\": \"DEN\", \"flight_type\": \"one_way\", \"cabin\": \"business\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT247\", \"origin\": \"BOS\", \"destination\": \"MIA\", \"date\": \"2024-05-24\", \"price\": 904}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT193\", \"origin\": \"MIA\", \"destination\": \"DEN\", \"date\": \"2024-05-24\", \"price\": 1906}], \"passengers\": [{\"fir", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 18, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 0, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "aa50189e", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T11:02:42"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "no_mem", "phase": "test", "task_id": "5#1", "task_desc": "I am so upset right now! I\u2019m a loyal Gold member with your airline, and my flight HAT045 from Phoenix to Seattle has been delayed. Because of this delay, I\u2019m going to miss a really important meeting that I absolutely cannot afford to miss. This is just not acceptable for someone at my membership level!\nMy user ID is mei_brown_7075. \n\nAs I mentioned, I\u2019m a valued Gold member and I\u2019m extremely upset about missing this critical meeting due to the delay on HAT045 from Phoenix to Seattle. I don\u2019t hav", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'm sorry to hear about the delay and the impact it's having on your important meeting. I'd like to help you with this. To confirm the details and assist you properly, I'll need a few pieces of information:\n\n1. Your **user ID** (so I can verify your Gold membership and locate your reservation).\n2. The **date** of flight HAT045 (Phoenix to Seattle) you're referring to.\n3. Would you like to **change or cancel** this reservation due to the delay? (Per our policy, compensation for a delayed flight is offered as a gesture only after confirming the facts and processing a change or cancellation.)\n\nPlease provide these details so I can look into this for you.\nassistant: I understand your frustration, and I'll look into your account to confirm the details. Let me pull up your profile and reservations.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"mei_brown_7075\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Mei\", \"last_name\": \"Brown\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"853 Chestnut Street\", \"address2\": \"Suite 497\", \"city\": \"Washington\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"DC\", \"zip\": \"20195\"}, \"email\": \"mei.brown7062@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1986-12-14\", \"payment_methods\": {\"certificate_6761175\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_6761175\", \"amount\": 250.0}, \"gift