{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "no_mem", "phase": "test", "task_id": "10#0", "task_desc": "Hi, this is Liam Khan. I've got a flight from Houston (IAH) to Seattle (SEA) coming up on May 23rd, and I need to push it back a day to May 24th. Also, for that same flight, I\u2019d like to upgrade to business class for all the passengers on my booking.\nSure, my user ID is liam_khan_2521.\nThanks for putting that together. I understand that because the cabin has to stay uniform, you had to upgrade the whole round trip to business \u2014 that's alright, I'm fine with upgrading both the outbound and return ", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: Hello Liam! I'd be happy to help you modify your flight and upgrade to business class.\n\nTo get started, I'll need your **user ID** (for example, something like `liam_khan_123`). Could you please provide that? \n\nIf you don't know your reservation ID, I can help locate it once I have your user ID.\nassistant: Thank you! Let me look up your profile and reservations.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"liam_khan_2521\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Liam\", \"last_name\": \"Khan\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"626 Willow Lane\", \"address2\": \"Suite 707\", \"city\": \"New York\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"NY\", \"zip\": \"10148\"}, \"email\": \"liam.khan7273@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1979-09-27\", \"payment_methods\": {\"certificate_9254323\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_9254323\", \"amount\": 500.0}, \"gift_card_7194529\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_7194529\", \"amount\": 62.0}, \"credit_card_7434610\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_7434610\", \"brand\": \"mastercard\", \"last_four\": \"9448\"}, \"credit_card_7231150\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_7231150\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"3422\"}, \"certificate_1849235\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_1849235\", \"a