{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "no_mem", "phase": "test", "task_id": "17#1", "task_desc": "Hi, I have an upcoming flight from New York to Chicago, and I need to make a few changes: I\u2019d like to add 3 checked bags, change the passenger to myself, and upgrade the booking to economy class.\nSure, my user ID is omar_rossi_1241. I don\u2019t have the reservation ID handy, but hopefully you can pull up the booking with that.\nYes, all of those details look correct \u2014 the passenger change to me, the 3 checked bags (glad they're free with my gold status), and the upgrade to economy. But for the $209 d", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: To help you modify your reservation, I'll need a few details first. Could you please provide:\n\n1. Your **user ID** (e.g., 'sara_doe_496')\n2. Your **reservation ID** (e.g., 'ZFA04Y') \u2014 if you don't know it, I can help locate it using your user ID.\n\nOnce I have these, I can look up your booking and assist with adding checked bags, updating the passenger, and changing the cabin class to economy.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"omar_rossi_1241\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Omar\", \"last_name\": \"Rossi\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"901 Pine Lane\", \"address2\": \"Suite 360\", \"city\": \"Houston\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"TX\", \"zip\": \"77271\"}, \"email\": \"omar.rossi5980@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1970-06-06\", \"payment_methods\": {\"gift_card_8190333\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_8190333\", \"amount\": 280.0}, \"credit_card_6754990\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_6754990\", \"brand\": \"mastercard\", \"last_four\": \"3848\"}, \"certificate_8390038\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_8390038\", \"amount\": 150.0}, \"certificate_1778167\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_1778167\", \"amount\": 250.0}, \"gift_card_6490722\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_64907