{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "no_mem", "phase": "test", "task_id": "39#1", "task_desc": "Bonjour, my name is Amelia Davis. I need to cancel all of my upcoming flights, s'il vous pla\u00eet. I am from France originally, so excuse my English\u2014it is not perfect.\nAh, oui, my user id is amelia_davis_8890. And I am sorry, I do not know any of my reservation ids, but you said you can find them, non? \n\nFor the reason... it is other, I think. I just need to cancel all my flights. Perhaps I can give up my seat for someone else who needs it, mais that is my wish.\nOui, yes, please go ahead and cancel", "score": 0.0, "em": 0.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: Bonjour Amelia! I'd be happy to help you cancel your upcoming flights. \n\nTo get started, I'll need your **user ID** (for example, something like \"amelia_davis_123\"). Could you please provide that? \n\nAlso, if you don't know your reservation ID(s), I can help locate them once I have your user ID. And may I ask the **reason for cancellation** (change of plan, airline cancelled flight, or other reasons)?\nassistant: Merci! Let me look up your profile to find your reservation(s).\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"amelia_davis_8890\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Amelia\", \"last_name\": \"Davis\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"442 Sunset Drive\", \"address2\": \"Suite 708\", \"city\": \"San Diego\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"CA\", \"zip\": \"92125\"}, \"email\": \"amelia.davis1624@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1984-03-05\", \"payment_methods\": {\"gift_card_7397998\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_7397998\", \"amount\": 74.0}, \"gift_card_1647044\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_1647044\", \"amount\": 236.0}, \"credit_card_4074252\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_4074252\", \"brand\": \"mastercard\", \"last_four\": \"5435\"}, \"credit_card_6738701\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_6738701\", \"brand\": \"vi