{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "no_mem", "phase": "test", "task_id": "33#1", "task_desc": "Hello, this is Yara Garcia. I'm calling about my booking with confirmation code HXDUBJ. I'd like to adjust my travel plans: for the outgoing flight, I want to switch to a nonstop option that departs a day later than originally scheduled. Also, I need to push my return flight from SFO back by one day as well. Can you help me with that?\nHi, thanks for laying that out. First, yes \u2014 my user ID is yara_garcia_1905, that's correct.\n\nFor the outgoing nonstop flight, I'll go with **HAT072 departing at 0", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'll help you modify your reservation. Let me first look up the details of your booking.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"HXDUBJ\", \"user_id\": \"yara_garcia_1905\", \"origin\": \"IAH\", \"destination\": \"SFO\", \"flight_type\": \"round_trip\", \"cabin\": \"economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT085\", \"origin\": \"IAH\", \"destination\": \"JFK\", \"date\": \"2024-05-18\", \"price\": 177}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT023\", \"origin\": \"JFK\", \"destination\": \"SFO\", \"date\": \"2024-05-18\", \"price\": 146}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT278\", \"origin\": \"SFO\", \"destination\": \"IAH\", \"date\": \"2024-05-22\", \"price\": 180}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Yara\", \"last_name\": \"Garcia\", \"dob\": \"1974-08-15\"}], \"payment_history\": [{\"payment_id\": \"gift_card_6941833\", \"amount\": 533}], \"created_at\": \"2024-05-04T06:04:48\", \"total_baggages\": 0, \"nonfree_baggages\": 0, \"insurance\": \"yes\", \"status\": null}\nassistant: Thank you, Yara. I've located your reservation HXDUBJ. I can see it's a round-trip economy booking from IAH to SFO with a one-stop outgoing flight (IAH\u2192JFK\u2192SFO on 2024-05-18) and a return flight (SFO\u2192IAH on 2024-05-22).\n\nTo proceed with the modification, I'll need your user ID for verification. Based on the reservation, it appears to be **yara_garcia_1905** \u2014 could you please confirm this is correct?\n\nIn the meantime, let me search for a nonstop outgoing option departing a day later (2024-05-19).\ntool: [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT072\", \"origin\": \"IAH\", \"destination\": \"SFO\", \"status\": \"available\", \"scheduled_departure_time_est\": \"09:00:00\", \"scheduled_arrival_time_est\": \"13:00:00\", \"date\": null, \"available_seats\": {\"basic_economy\": 18, \"economy\": 9, \"business\": 9}, \"prices\": {\"basic_economy\": 68, \"economy\": 130, \"business\": 282}}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT180\", \"origin\": \"IAH\", \"destination\": \"SFO\", \"status\": \"available\", \"scheduled_departure_time_est\": \"07:00:00\", \"scheduled_arrival_time_est\": \"11:00:00\", \"date\": null, \"available_seats\": {\"basic_economy\": 4, \"economy\": 17, \"business\": 1", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 6, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 0, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "aa50189e", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T11:02:42"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "no_mem", "phase": "test", "task_id": "18#1", "task_desc": "Ugh, I'm so frustrated right now. I just hit some money troubles and I need to downgrade all of my business class flights to economy \u2014 and I mean all of them. I don't want to change any of the flight details or the passengers, just the cabin class. Can you handle that for me?\nYeah, fine. It's omar_davis_3817. Name's Omar Davis. Just please hurry this up \u2014 I'm already stressed enough about the money situation as it is.\nUgh, this whole situation is such a headache, but fine \u2014 I'll work with you. Y", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'm sorry to hear about your situation. I can help you downgrade the cabin class from business to economy for your reservations. \n\nTo get started, I'll need your user ID so I can locate your reservations. Could you please provide your user ID?\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"omar_davis_3817\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Omar\", \"last_name\": \"Davis\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"281 Spruce Street\", \"address2\": \"Suite 942\", \"city\": \"San Diego\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"CA\", \"zip\": \"92164\"}, \"email\": \"omar.davis7857@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1982-10-19\", \"payment_methods\": {\"gift_card_3481935\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_3481935\", \"amount\": 22.0}, \"credit_card_2929732\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_2929732\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"7803\"}, \"credit_card_9525117\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_9525117\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"2172\"}, \"gift_card_6847880\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_6847880\", \"amount\": 31.0}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Juan\", \"last_name\": \"Ahmed\", \"dob\": \"1992-11-19\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Anya\", \"last_name\": \"Thomas\", \"dob\": \"1990-10-11\"}], \"membership\": \"regular\", \"re