{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "no_mem", "phase": "test", "task_id": "11#0", "task_desc": "Hi, I'm James Patel. I need to remove a passenger named Sophia from my round trip flights from LAS to DEN \u2014 departure May 19, return May 20. I'm in a rush, so can you just get this sorted quickly?\nUgh, this is ridiculous. Fine \u2014 if you can't remove Sophia from the booking, then just downgrade all passengers on the reservation to basic economy instead. \n\nMy user ID is james_patel_9828. I don't have the reservation ID handy at the moment, I'll need to dig it up. But I'm in a hurry here, so just ge", "score": 0.0, "em": 0.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'm sorry, but I'm unable to process this request. According to our policy, the number of passengers on a reservation cannot be modified \u2014 you may update passenger details (such as names or dates of birth), but you cannot add or remove passengers. This restriction applies even to human agents.\n\nIf you'd like, I can help you with other modifications to your reservation, such as changing flights, cabin class, or adding baggage. Please let me know your user ID and reservation ID if you'd like to explore those options.\nassistant: I'll help you locate your reservation and look into the cabin downgrade. Let me start by pulling up your user profile to find the reservation ID.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"james_patel_9828\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"James\", \"last_name\": \"Patel\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"656 River Road\", \"address2\": \"Suite 768\", \"city\": \"Los Angeles\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"CA\", \"zip\": \"90357\"}, \"email\": \"james.patel1360@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1995-04-07\", \"payment_methods\": {\"gift_card_1642017\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_1642017\", \"amount\": 128.0}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"James\", \"last_name\": \"Sanchez\", \"dob\": \"1956-08-18\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Ava\", \"last_name\": \"