{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "no_mem", "phase": "test", "task_id": "0#0", "task_desc": "Hi, I need to cancel my flight reservation. The confirmation code is EHGLP3.\nSure, my user ID is emma_kim_9957.\nIt's sort of other reasons \u2014 I was out of town and wasn't able to keep the booking, so I need to cancel it.\nWait, that doesn't seem right. When I booked my last trip, I was told by your agency that I didn't need to add insurance because I had booked with you before and that previous trip already had coverage through the same agency. \n\nAlso, just to be clear, I'm not going to go through", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: To cancel your reservation, I'll need your user ID for verification. Could you please provide your user ID?\nassistant: Thank you. Let me look up your reservation details.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"EHGLP3\", \"user_id\": \"emma_kim_9957\", \"origin\": \"PHX\", \"destination\": \"JFK\", \"flight_type\": \"one_way\", \"cabin\": \"basic_economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT156\", \"origin\": \"PHX\", \"destination\": \"SEA\", \"date\": \"2024-05-17\", \"price\": 50}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT021\", \"origin\": \"SEA\", \"destination\": \"JFK\", \"date\": \"2024-05-17\", \"price\": 54}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Evelyn\", \"last_name\": \"Taylor\", \"dob\": \"1965-01-16\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Anya\", \"last_name\": \"Silva\", \"dob\": \"1971-11-22\"}], \"payment_history\": [{\"payment_id\": \"credit_card_5832574\", \"amount\": 208}], \"created_at\": \"2024-05-04T23:12:06\", \"total_baggages\": 0, \"nonfree_baggages\": 0, \"insurance\": \"no\", \"status\": null}\nassistant: Let me check the status of your flights to verify they haven't been flown or cancelled by the airline.\ntool: available\ntool: available\nassistant: Both flights are currently available and scheduled for 2024-05-17 (in the future), so no portion has been flown. \n\nTo proceed with the cancellation request, I need to know the reason for cancellation. Could you please let me know the reason? (Options: change of plan, airline cancelled flight, or other reasons)\nassistant: I'm sorry, but I'm unable to cancel this reservation. Based on our cancellation policy, a flight can only be cancelled if one of the following applies:\n\n1. The booking was made within the last 24 hours \u2014 your booking was created on 2024-05-04, which is well beyond 24 hours ago.\n2. The flight is cancelled by the airline \u2014 both flights (HAT156 and HAT021) are currently available, not cancelled.\n3. It is a business class flight \u2014 your cabin is basic economy.\n4. You have travel insurance covering the reason \u2014 your reservation does not include travel insurance.\n\nSince none of th", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 4, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 1, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "aa50189e", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T11:18:02"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "no_mem", "phase": "test", "task_id": "27#0", "task_desc": "Hi, I'm Ethan Martin and I am really upset right now. I was supposed to be on flight HAT039 from Atlanta to Seattle, and it's been delayed. I need to know what in the world is going on and why this happened \u2014 this is completely unacceptable.\nMy user ID is ethan_martin_2396. I don't have the exact flight date handy right now, but it was supposed to be today's HAT039 from ATL to SEA.\n\nHold on \u2014 you're telling me you can't even give me the reason for the delay? That's the whole point of why I'm cal", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'm sorry to hear about the delay. I can help you confirm the flight status and look into your options. To do that, I'll need a bit more information:\n\n1. Your user ID (so I can locate your reservation).\n2. The date of the flight HAT039 you were scheduled on (in YYYY-MM-DD format).\n\nPlease note that I can confirm the flight status through our system, but I'm not able to provide the specific cause of the delay. Once I have the details, I can check the status and let you know about any options available to you, such as changing or cancelling the reservation.\nassistant: I understand your frustration, and I'll do what I can within our system. Let me first confirm the flight status for today.\ntool: delayed\nassistant: I've confirmed through our system that flight HAT039 from ATL to SEA scheduled for today, 2024-05-15, is currently **delayed**.\n\nRegarding your two requests:\n\n1. **Reason for the delay:** I'm not able to provide the specific cause of the delay. That information is not available through our reservation system, and I can only share details that come from our tools or from you. For the cause of the delay, you may need to check with airport staff or the airline's operations desk at the gate.\n\n2. **Compensation:** Per our policy, a compensation certificate for a delayed flight is offered only when the reservation is changed or cancelled. Since you've indicated you do not wish to change or cancel your reservation and still need to travel to Seattle, I'm unable to offer compensation in this situation.\n\nIf your plans change and you'd like to modify or cancel the reservation, let me know and I can look into your options. Otherwise, is there anything else I can help you with regarding your booking?\ntool: Transfer successful\nassistant: YOU ARE BEING TRANSFERRED TO A HUMAN AGENT. PLEASE HOLD ON.", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 2, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 1, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "aa50189e", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T11:18:02"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "no_mem", "phase": "test", "task_id": "6#0", "task_desc": "Hi, I was reviewing my upcoming flight booking online and I\u2019m pretty sure I added travel insurance when I booked, but I can\u2019t see it anywhere on the reservation. I\u2019m flying with my family, and everyone else in my group already has insurance on their tickets\u2014so I really need to get mine sorted out and added to my flight too.\nI understand what you\u2019re saying about policy, but I really need to insist on this\u2014my whole family is flying together on this trip and every single one of them already has ins", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I\u2019m sorry, but per our policy, travel insurance cannot be added after the initial booking has been made. Once a reservation is created, insurance can only be included at the time of booking and cannot be added later.\n\nIf you\u2019d like, I can help you verify the current details of your reservation to confirm whether insurance was included at the time of booking. To do that, I\u2019ll need your user ID and reservation ID. If you don\u2019t have your reservation ID handy, I can help locate it using your user ID.\n\nPlease let me know your user ID and I\u2019ll be happy to look into the reservation details for you.\nassistant: I understand your concern, and I\u2019ll be happy to verify the details of your reservation. However, I must clarify that per our policy, travel insurance cannot be added after the initial booking has been made\u2014this is a firm rule I\u2019m not able to override, even if insurance was intended to be selected at checkout.\n\nLet me pull up your reservation to confirm the current insurance status and see what we can do.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"PEP4E0\", \"user_id\": \"sophia_taylor_9065\", \"origin\": \"CLT\", \"destination\": \"PHX\", \"flight_type\": \"one_way\", \"cabin\": \"basic_economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"