{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "no_mem", "phase": "test", "task_id": "3#1", "task_desc": "Hi, I'm calling because I'm really stressed about my upcoming trip \u2014 I have a lot of things I need to bring and it's super important that I get the right information. I need to figure out exactly how many suitcases my reservation allows me to take on my flight. I'm pretty sure I'm a Gold member, just so you know.\nYes, of course \u2014 my user ID is anya_garcia_5901. I'm really anxious about this because I have so much to pack and I need to be sure about the baggage allowance.\nI'm sorry, but I'm almos", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'd be happy to help you figure out your baggage allowance. To look up your reservation details, I'll need your user ID first. Could you please provide your user ID?\n\nIf you don't know your reservation ID, I can help locate it once I have your user ID.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"anya_garcia_5901\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Anya\", \"last_name\": \"Garcia\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"555 Highland Drive\", \"address2\": \"Suite 243\", \"city\": \"San Antonio\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"TX\", \"zip\": \"78256\"}, \"email\": \"anya.garcia8816@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1992-11-12\", \"payment_methods\": {\"gift_card_2550356\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_2550356\", \"amount\": 149.0}, \"certificate_7583008\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_7583008\", \"amount\": 150.0}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Mei\", \"last_name\": \"Lee\", \"dob\": \"1989-12-13\"}], \"membership\": \"silver\", \"reservations\": [\"82K959\", \"790JYN\", \"BE2L57\", \"CXBB4L\", \"TAMSDK\", \"3RK2T9\", \"VAOW1B\", \"Q4MCUF\", \"JMO1MG\"]}\nassistant: I've pulled up your profile. I notice one important correction: your membership level in our system is actually **silver**, not gold. This matters because the free checked bag allowance differs by membership level, so I want to make sure we get the right numbers for you.\n\nI also see you have several reservations on file:\n- 82K959\n- 790JYN\n- BE2L57\n- CXBB4L\n- TAMSDK\n- 3RK2T9\n- VAOW1B\n- Q4MCUF\n- JMO1MG\n\nCould you tell me which reservation you're asking about? If you're not sure of the reservation ID, you can let me know the destination and date of your upcoming trip and I'll help locate it.", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 1, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 1, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "aa50189e", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T11:18:02"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "no_mem", "phase": "test", "task_id": "2#0", "task_desc": "Hello, I'd like to book a flight from San Francisco to New York. There will be three of us traveling together.\nSure, my user ID is noah_muller_9847.\nOkay, so it's a one-way trip in economy class for all three of us... \n\nActually, you know what, I need to talk about something else. I'm really frustrated \u2014 my most recent reservation had a delayed flight and I'm pretty upset about the whole experience. Can we talk about that instead?\nOh, I see \u2014 I must have gotten my reservations mixed up. I though", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: Hello! I'd be happy to help you book a flight from San Francisco (SFO) to New York (JFK) for three passengers.\n\nTo get started, I'll need your **user ID** first. Could you please provide it?\nassistant: Thank you! Let me look up your profile to assist with the booking.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"noah_muller_9847\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Noah\", \"last_name\": \"Muller\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"889 Hillcrest Drive\", \"address2\": \"Suite 254\", \"city\": \"Denver\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"CO\", \"zip\": \"80243\"}, \"email\": \"noah.muller2290@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1963-01-22\", \"payment_methods\": {\"credit_card_1245537\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_1245537\", \"brand\": \"mastercard\", \"last_four\": \"1167\"}, \"credit_card_6040264\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_6040264\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"2076\"}, \"credit_card_3255100\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_3255100\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"2604\"}, \"certificate_8301303\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_8301303\", \"amount\": 100.0}, \"credit_card_3983998\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_3983998\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"8413\"}, \"credit_c