{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "no_mem", "phase": "test", "task_id": "29#0", "task_desc": "Hello, this is Raj Brown. I'm calling because I've been having some health problems and I need to adjust my travel plans. I did purchase trip insurance for this trip, so I'd like any change fees waived. I have a reservation under VA5SGQ \u2014 it's a roundtrip from Detroit to LaGuardia \u2014 and I want to change it to nonstop flights from Detroit to JFK and back, keeping the same dates as my current booking. Can you help me with that?\nYes, my user ID is raj_brown_5782, that's correct. And as I mentioned,", "score": 0.0, "em": 0.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'll help you with that. Let me first look up your reservation details.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"VA5SGQ\", \"user_id\": \"raj_brown_5782\", \"origin\": \"DTW\", \"destination\": \"LGA\", \"flight_type\": \"round_trip\", \"cabin\": \"economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT035\", \"origin\": \"DTW\", \"destination\": \"PHX\", \"date\": \"2024-05-17\", \"price\": 163}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT066\", \"origin\": \"PHX\", \"destination\": \"LGA\", \"date\": \"2024-05-17\", \"price\": 184}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT002\", \"origin\": \"LGA\", \"destination\": \"PHX\", \"date\": \"2024-05-19\", \"price\": 174}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT106\", \"origin\": \"PHX\", \"destination\": \"DTW\", \"date\": \"2024-05-20\", \"price\": 135}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Raj\", \"last_name\": \"Brown\", \"dob\": \"1967-03-12\"}], \"payment_history\": [{\"payment_id\": \"credit_card_8003957\", \"amount\": 686}], \"created_at\": \"2024-05-08T18:28:13\", \"total_baggages\": 0, \"nonfree_baggages\": 0, \"insurance\": \"yes\", \"status\": null}\nassistant: I've located your reservation. Here are the details I found:\n\n- **Reservation ID:** VA5SGQ\n- **User ID:** raj_brown_5782\n- **Trip:** Round trip, Detroit (DTW) \u2194 LaGuardia (LGA)\n- **Cabin:** Economy\n- **Current flights (