{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "no_mem", "phase": "test", "task_id": "13#1", "task_desc": "Hello. I'm calling because I need to make a change to an upcoming return flight I have booked. Right now it's a one-stop flight from Atlanta to Los Angeles, and I'd like to change it to a nonstop flight from Atlanta to Las Vegas instead. I'm not looking to book anything new \u2014 I just want to modify my existing reservation.\nI understand the policy, but that's not the answer I was looking for. Since you're telling me the change I need isn't possible through you, I'd like to be transferred to someon", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'm sorry, but I'm unable to make this change to your reservation. According to our policy, flight modifications cannot change the **origin, destination, or trip type** of an existing reservation. Since your request would change the destination from Los Angeles (LAX) to Las Vegas (LAS), this falls outside what can be modified.\n\nHere are your options within policy:\n- **Modify the existing reservation** while keeping Atlanta (ATL) as the origin and Los Angeles (LAX) as the destination (e.g., change to a nonstop ATL\u2192LAX flight, change dates, cabin class, baggage, or passenger details).\n- **Cancel the current reservation** (subject to cancellation rules) and book a new one-way or round-trip reservation from Atlanta to Las Vegas.\n\nIf you'd like to pursue either of these options, please provide your **user ID** and **reservation ID** so I can assist you further.", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 0, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 1, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "aa50189e", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T11:18:02"}
