{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "no_mem", "phase": "test", "task_id": "36#0", "task_desc": "I... I don't know how to even say this... my wife... she passed away yesterday. I have a flight booked and I need to move it out two days. I can't cancel it, I just... I need the date changed. Please, I'm begging you...\nThank you... I appreciate that. My user ID is lucas_brown_4047. The reservation is under EUJUY6. I just... I can't deal with this right now, but I need to be there for the arrangements, so moving the flight two days later would help me so much.\n###TRANSFER###", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'm sorry for your loss. I'll help you change the date of your flight. To locate your reservation, I'll need your user ID first. Could you please provide your user ID?\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"EUJUY6\", \"user_id\": \"lucas_brown_4047\", \"origin\": \"ORD\", \"destination\": \"LAS\", \"flight_type\": \"round_trip\", \"cabin\": \"basic_economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT238\", \"origin\": \"ORD\", \"destination\": \"DEN\", \"date\": \"2024-05-14\", \"price\": 96}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT290\", \"origin\": \"DEN\", \"destination\": \"LAS\", \"date\": \"2024-05-14\", \"price\": 64}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT266\", \"origin\": \"LAS\", \"destination\": \"IAH\", \"date\": \"2024-05-16\", \"price\": 70}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT044\", \"origin\": \"IAH\", \"destination\": \"ORD\", \"date\": \"2024-05-16\", \"price\": 76}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Lucas\", \"last_name\": \"Brown\", \"dob\": \"1965-01-01\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Daiki\", \"last_name\": \"Thomas\", \"dob\": \"1996-06-21\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Daiki\", \"last_name\": \"Lopez\", \"dob\": \"1967-04-08\"}], \"payment_history\": [{\"payment_id\": \"gift_card_9049233\", \"amount\": 1008}], \"created_at\": \"2024-05-07T19:04:46\", \"total_baggages\": 0, \"nonfree_baggages\": 0, \"insurance\": \"yes\", \"status\": null}\nassistant: I'm sorry for your loss. I've looked up your reservation EUJUY6.\n\nI'm not able to change the flight dates through my system for two reasons: this booking is in **basic economy**, and basic economy reservations cannot be modified (flight dates cannot be changed); and the outbound flights on May 14 have already departed.\n\nSince I can't make this change myself, I'm connecting you with a human agent who can review your circumstances and look into what options may be available to you.", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 1, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 1, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "aa50189e", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T11:18:02"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "no_mem", "phase": "test", "task_id": "19#1", "task_desc": "Hi, I have a whirlwind half-day trip to Texas booked with you, but I can't remember my reservation ID. My current return flight leaves at 3pm on the 28th, and I\u2019d like to change to a later flight back to Newark that same day if possible, or the earliest one the next day if that\u2019s not available.\nSure, my user ID is olivia_gonzalez_2305.\n###TRANSFER###", "score": 0.0, "em": 0.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: To help you locate your reservation and modify your flight, I'll need your user ID first. Could you please provide your user ID (for example, something like \"sara_doe_496\")?\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"olivia_gonzalez_2305\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Olivia\", \"last_name\": \"Gonzalez\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"334 Laurel Lane\", \"address2\": \"Suite 970\", \"city\": \"Los Angeles\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"CA\", \"zip\": \"90504\"}, \"email\": \"olivia.gonzalez4421@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1988-06-13\", \"payment_methods\": {\"gift_card_2200803\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_2200803\", \"amount\": 123.0}, \"credit_card_9969263\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_9969263\", \"brand\": \"mastercard\", \"last_four\": \"9475\"}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Mei\", \"last_name\": \"Johansson\", \"dob\": \"1981-09-25\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Yara\", \"last_name\": \"Lopez\", \"dob\": \"1975-09-15\"}], \"membership\": \"regular\", \"reservations\": [\"Z7GOZK\", \"K67C4W\", \"THY2DG\"]}\nassistant: I found your profile. You have three reservations (Z7GOZK, K67C4W, THY2DG). Let me look at the details of each to find the one matching your Texas trip with a return flight to Newark on the 28th.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"Z7GOZK\", \"user_id\": \"olivia_gonzalez_2305\", \"origin\": \"EWR\", \"destination\": \"IAH\", \"flight_type\": \"round_trip\", \"cabin\": \"basic_economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT188\", \"origin\": \"EWR\", \"destination\": \"IAH\", \"date\": \"2024-05-28\", \"price\": 52}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT207\", \"origin\": \"IAH\", \"destination\": \"EWR\", \"date\": \"2024-05-28\", \"price\": 87}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Olivia\", \"last_name\": \"Gonzalez\", \"dob\": \"1988-06-13\"}], \"payment_history\": [{\"payment_id\": \"gift_card_2200803\", \"amount\": 169}], \"created_at\": \"2024-05-13T19:41:32\", \"total_baggages\": 0, \"nonfree_baggages\": 0, \"insurance\": \"yes\", \"status\": null}\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"K67C4W\", \"user_id\": \"olivia_gonzalez_2305\", \"origin\": \"LAS\", \"destination\": \"MCO\", \"flight_type\": \"one_way\"", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 5, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 1, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "aa50189e", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T11:18:02"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "no_mem", "phase": "test", "task_id": "4#1", "task_desc": "I am absolutely furious right now! I had a business flight booked earlier this month that your airline canceled, and because of that cancellation I ended up missing a critically important meeting. This whole situation caused me a huge amount of stress and real damage, and I expect to be compensated for both the missed meeting and the massive inconvenience your company put me through.\nMy user ID is sophia_silva_7557. But honestly, a $100 certificate is an insult after what I went through! I had a", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'm sorry to hear about your experience. I'd like to help and look into this for you.\n\nTo confirm the facts and assist with your compensation request, I'll need some information first. Per our policy, compensation for cancelled flights is offered as a certificate gesture of $100 per passenger after verifying the details. Please note that compensation is limited to this policy and does not cover missed meetings or other consequential damages.\n\nTo get started, could you please provide your **user ID**? Once I have that, I can locate your reservation and verify the cancellation.\nassistant: I understand your frustration, but I must follow our compensation policy, which only allows a certificate gesture for cancelled flights and does not cover missed meetings or consequential losses. Let me first verify the facts of your reservation before discussing any compensation.\n\nLet me look up your account details.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"sophia_silva_7557\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Sophia\", \"last_name\": \"Silva\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"141 Cedar Avenue\", \"address2\": \"Suite 436\", \"city\": \"Columbus\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"OH\", \"zip\": \"43282\"}, \"email\": \"sophia.silva5929@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1957-10-05\", \"payment_methods\": {\"certificate_8045380\": {\