{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "no_mem", "phase": "test", "task_id": "12#0", "task_desc": "Hi, I have an upcoming flight from Boston to Minneapolis and I\u2019d like to make some changes to my reservation. I want to upgrade the cabin class for all passengers on the booking to business, and I also need to add 2 checked bags under my name using my Gold membership.\nSure, my user ID is chen_lee_6825 and the reservation ID is YAX4DR. The flight is from Boston to Minneapolis.\nThanks for the breakdown, but I see the total upgrade cost is $1,200 for both of us, and I can only pay up to $650 in fee", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: To help you modify your reservation, I'll need a few details first. Could you please provide:\n\n1. Your **user ID** (e.g., 'sara_doe_496')\n2. Your **reservation ID** (e.g., 'ZFA04Y') \u2014 if you don't know it, I can help locate it using your user ID.\n\nOnce I have these, I'll look up your booking and confirm the details before making any changes.\nassistant: Let me look up your reservation and profile details.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"YAX4DR\", \"user_id\": \"chen_lee_6825\", \"origin\": \"BOS\", \"destination\": \"MSP\", \"flight_type\": \"one_way\", \"cabin\": \"economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT235\", \"origin\": \"BOS\", \"destination\": \"MCO\", \"date\": \"2024-05-18\", \"price\": 122}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT298\", \"origin\": \"MCO\", \"destination\": \"MSP\", \"date\": \"2024-05-19\", \"price\": 127}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Chen\", \"last_name\": \"Lee\", \"dob\": \"1967-12-12\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Noah\", \"last_name\": \"Hernandez\", \"dob\": \"1968-01-06\"}], \"payment_history\": [{\"payment_id\": \"credit_card_4938634\", \"amount\": 498}], \"created_at\": \"2024-05-05T23:00:15\", \"total_baggages\": 0, \"nonfree_baggages\": 0, \"insurance\": \"no\", \"status\": null}\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"chen_lee_6825\", \"name\": {\"first_name\":