{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "no_mem", "phase": "test", "task_id": "1#1", "task_desc": "Hello. I called earlier and spoke with a support rep on the phone who told me a service agent would be able to help me cancel my reservation. I'd like to get that started.\nSure, my user ID is raj_sanchez_7340. I don't have the reservation ID handy right now, but as you mentioned, you should be able to locate my booking with that information.\nI'm not entirely sure which of those is the one I need to cancel. The trip I'm looking to cancel is from Philadelphia to LaGuardia. Could you pull up the de", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: Hello! I'd be happy to help you cancel your reservation. \n\nTo get started, I'll need your user ID. Could you please provide that? If you also have your reservation ID handy, please share that as well\u2014but if not, I can help locate it once I have your user ID.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"raj_sanchez_7340\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Raj\", \"last_name\": \"Sanchez\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"794 Sunset Drive\", \"address2\": \"Suite 598\", \"city\": \"Charlotte\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"NC\", \"zip\": \"28271\"}, \"email\": \"raj.sanchez1048@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1965-09-13\", \"payment_methods\": {\"credit_card_7891819\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_7891819\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"4388\"}, \"gift_card_4964153\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_4964153\", \"amount\": 163.0}, \"gift_card_3226531\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_3226531\", \"amount\": 50.0}, \"certificate_4594761\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_4594761\", \"amount\": 150.0}, \"gift_card_1591784\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_1591784\", \"amount\": 57.0}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Olivia\", \"last_name\": \"Taylor\", \"dob\": \"1976-06-27\"}], \"membership\": \"silver\", \