{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "no_mem", "phase": "test", "task_id": "5#1", "task_desc": "I'm a Gold member with your airline, and I'm extremely upset about my flight HAT045 from Phoenix to Seattle being delayed. This is really unacceptable because I'm going to miss a very important meeting as a result. I need to speak with you about getting this made right.\nMy user ID is mei_brown_7075. I'm sorry, I don't have my reservation ID or the exact flight date in front of me right now \u2014 can you look those up with my user ID?\n\nAnd just to be clear, I am a valued Gold member and I'm absolutel", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'm sorry to hear about the delay with your flight HAT045. I'd like to help make this right. To confirm the details and assist you, I'll need some information first:\n\n1. Your user ID\n2. Your reservation ID (if you don't have it, I can help locate it using your user ID)\n3. The date of the flight HAT045 you're referring to\n\nOnce I have these, I can check the flight status and your reservation details to confirm the facts. Please note that compensation for delayed flights is offered as a certificate when you'd like to change or cancel the affected reservation. Let me know how you'd like to proceed.\nassistant: I'll look up your reservations using your user ID.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"mei_brown_7075\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Mei\", \"last_name\": \"Brown\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"853 Chestnut Street\", \"address2\": \"Suite 497\", \"city\": \"Washington\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"DC\", \"zip\": \"20195\"}, \"email\": \"mei.brown7062@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1986-12-14\", \"payment_methods\": {\"certificate_6761175\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_6761175\", \"amount\": 250.0}, \"gift_card_8987598\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_8987598\", \"amount\": 130.0}, \"credit_card_4920843\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": 