{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "no_mem", "phase": "test", "task_id": "25#1", "task_desc": "Hi, I'm Ivan Muller. I need to book a flight for my friend Ivan Smith \u2014 basically the same itinerary as the reservation I already have with you. He's listed in my user profile. I only want him on the new booking, no baggage or insurance. I've got a certificate I'd like to use if the fare ends up over $400; if it's lower, I'll pay with my gift card and credit card instead. And if I do use the certificate, I'd like to know what balance would be left on it afterward.\nSure, my user ID is ivan_muller", "score": 0.0, "em": 0.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: Hello! I'd be happy to help you book a flight for Ivan Smith with the same itinerary as your existing reservation.\n\nTo get started, I'll need your **user ID** (in the format like `sara_doe_496`) so I can look up your profile and existing reservation. Could you please provide that?\n\nI'll also need Ivan Smith's **date of birth** (in YYYY-MM-DD format) to add him as a passenger.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"ivan_muller_7015\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Ivan\", \"last_name\": \"Muller\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"256 Pine Lane\", \"address2\": \"Suite 661\", \"city\": \"New York\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"NY\", \"zip\": \"10029\"}, \"email\": \"ivan.muller6623@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1968-04-25\", \"payment_methods\": {\"certificate_8998287\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_8998287\", \"amount\": 500.0}, \"credit_card_3563913\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_3563913\", \"brand\": \"mastercard\", \"last_four\": \"6710\"}, \"gift_card_8516878\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_8516878\", \"amount\": 128.0}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Ivan\", \"last_name\": \"Smith\", \"dob\": \"1986-03-14\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Lucas\", \"last_name\": \"Davis\", \"dob\": \"1988-10-12\"}], \"membership\": \"gold\", \"reservations\": [\"G72NSF\"]}\nassistant: Thank you! I found your profile. I can see Ivan Smith (DOB: 1986-03-14) is saved in your profile. Now let me pull up your existing reservation to get the same itinerary.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"G72NSF\", \"user_id\": \"ivan_muller_7015\", \"origin\": \"DTW\", \"destination\": \"SEA\", \"flight_type\": \"one_way\", \"cabin\": \"economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT097\", \"origin\": \"DTW\", \"destination\": \"PHX\", \"date\": \"2024-05-17\", \"price\": 158}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT251\", \"origin\": \"PHX\", \"destination\": \"SEA\", \"date\": \"2024-05-17\", \"price\": 141}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Ivan\", \"last_name\": \"Muller\", \"dob\": \"1968-04-25\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Isabella\", \"last_name\": \"Moore\", \"dob\": \"1952-01-28\"}], \"payment_history\": [{\"payment_id\":", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 3, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 1, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "aa50189e", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T11:18:02"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "no_mem", "phase": "test", "task_id": "16#1", "task_desc": "Hello, I have a trip booked from Atlanta to Philadelphia and I need to make a change. I\u2019d like to move it to the day after my original flight date, and I\u2019m hoping to find the cheapest option in standard Economy class\u2014not Basic Economy. Can you help me with that?\nSure, my user ID is aarav_garcia_1177. I don\u2019t have my reservation ID handy right now\u2014can you look that up for me with the user ID?\nYes, that works for me. I\u2019m happy to have the refund of the difference go back to my original gift card o", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: To help you modify your reservation, I'll need a few details first. Could you please provide your **user ID**? \n\nAlso, if you have your **reservation ID** handy, please share that as well. If you don't know it, I can help locate it once I have your user ID.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"aarav_garcia_1177\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Aarav\", \"last_name\": \"Garcia\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"833 Highland Drive\", \"address2\": \"Suite 740\", \"city\": \"Denver\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"CO\", \"zip\": \"80211\"}, \"email\": \"aarav.garcia6639@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1992-09-13\", \"payment_methods\": {\"certificate_7473723\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_7473723\", \"amount\": 150.0}, \"gift_card_8887175\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_8887175\", \"amount\": 35.0}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Lei\", \"last_name\": \"Ito\", \"dob\": \"1990-12-07\"}], \"membership\": \"gold\", \"reservations\": [\"M05KNL\", \"UHDAHF\"]}\nassistant: I found your profile. You have two reservations: **M05KNL** and **UHDAHF**. Let me check the details of both to find the one from Atlanta (ATL) to Philadelphia (PHL).\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"M05KNL\", \"user_id\": \"aarav_garcia_1177\", \"origin\": \"ATL\", 