{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "no_mem", "phase": "test", "task_id": "31#1", "task_desc": "Hello, I'm calling because I need to change my upcoming flight. My cat is very sick and I have to get home as soon as possible to take care of him. I currently have a flight from JFK on May 17, and I'd like to change it to a nonstop flight so I can get there quicker.\nMy user ID is daiki_lee_6144. I'm sorry, but I don't know my reservation ID \u2014 I didn't have it handy when I booked. Can you look that up for me with my user ID?\n###TRANSFER###", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'm sorry to hear about your cat. I'll help you change your flight. \n\nTo get started, I'll need your user ID. Also, if you have your reservation ID handy, please provide that as well. If you don't know your reservation ID, I can help locate it once I have your user ID.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"daiki_lee_6144\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Daiki\", \"last_name\": \"Lee\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"410 River Road\", \"address2\": \"Suite 380\", \"city\": \"Fort Worth\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"TX\", \"zip\": \"76173\"}, \"email\": \"daiki.lee6987@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1976-10-08\", \"payment_methods\": {\"credit_card_6198952\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_6198952\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"9734\"}, \"gift_card_3112961\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_3112961\", \"amount\": 51.0}, \"gift_card_5128346\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_5128346\", \"amount\": 262.0}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Raj\", \"last_name\": \"Muller\", \"dob\": \"1967-10-16\"}], \"membership\": \"regular\", \"reservations\": [\"DF89BM\", \"COVE6R\", \"IIHXDG\"]}\nassistant: I found your user profile. You have three reservations: DF89BM, COVE6R, and IIHXDG. Let me check the details of each to find the one with your JFK flight on May 17.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"D