{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "no_mem", "phase": "test", "task_id": "2#1", "task_desc": "Hi, I'd like to book a flight from San Francisco to New York. We have three people traveling. Could you help me find available flights?\nSure, my user ID is noah_muller_9847. \n\nActually, wait \u2014 I\u2019m really frustrated with the delayed flight in my most recent reservation. I\u2019d like to talk about that instead. Can we switch to that?\nOh, I see \u2014 I must have been mixed up. I thought that delayed flight was on my most recent booking, but I guess it was actually the older one you mentioned, the BOS to LA", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'd be happy to help you book a flight from San Francisco (SFO) to New York (JFK) for 3 passengers.\n\nTo get started, I'll need a few details:\n1. **Your user ID** (e.g., something like 'sara_doe_496')\n2. **Trip type** \u2014 is this a one-way or round-trip flight?\n\nOnce I have your user ID, I can look up your profile and help find available flights.\nassistant: I'm sorry to hear about the delayed flight. Let me look up your profile and recent reservations to help with this.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"noah_muller_9847\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Noah\", \"last_name\": \"Muller\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"889 Hillcrest Drive\", \"address2\": \"Suite 254\", \"city\": \"Denver\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"CO\", \"zip\": \"80243\"}, \"email\": \"noah.muller2290@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1963-01-22\", \"payment_methods\": {\"credit_card_1245537\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_1245537\", \"brand\": \"mastercard\", \"last_four\": \"1167\"}, \"credit_card_6040264\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_6040264\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"2076\"}, \"credit_card_3255100\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_3255100\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"2604\"}, \"certificate_8301303\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_8301303\", \"amount\": 100.0}, \"credit_card_3983998\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_3983998\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"8413\"}, \"credit_card_7574394\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_7574394\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"1798\"}, \"credit_card_6873705\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_6873705\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"2267\"}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Lei\", \"last_name\": \"Patel\", \"dob\": \"1959-11-15\"}], \"membership\": \"gold\", \"reservations\": [\"SDZQKO\", \"4OG6T3\"]}\nassistant: I found your profile. You have two reservations: **SDZQKO** and **4OG6T3**. Let me check the details of your reservations to find the one with the delayed flight.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"SDZQKO\", ", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 12, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 1, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "aa50189e", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T11:18:02"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "no_mem", "phase": "test", "task_id": "35#0", "task_desc": "Hello, I'm Aarav Ahmed \u2014 my user ID is aarav_ahmed_6699. I need to cancel my upcoming flight on May 22 from JFK to MCO. Just so you know, I'm a silver member with your airline, so I should be getting a full refund for that cancellation.\nWait, that doesn't sound right to me. I'm a silver member \u2014 that tier specifically gets a full refund on cancellations, that's one of the benefits I signed up for. I really don't want to be transferred to a human agent; you should be able to handle this right her", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'll help you cancel your flight. Let me first locate your reservation using your user ID.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"aarav_ahmed_6699\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Aarav\", \"last_name\": \"Ahmed\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"176 Willow Lane\", \"address2\": \"Suite 431\", \"city\": \"Jacksonville\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"FL\", \"zip\": \"32131\"}, \"email\": \"aarav.ahmed6812@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1981-05-26\", \"payment_methods\": {\"credit_card_9074831\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_9074831\", \"brand\": \"mastercard\", \"last_four\": \"7334\"}, \"certificate_9645872\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_9645872\", \"amount\": 250.0}, \"credit_card_4959530\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_4959530\", \"brand\": \"mastercard\", \"last_four\": \"5018\"}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Aarav\", \"last_name\": \"Patel\", \"dob\": \"1980-12-03\"}], \"membership\": \"silver\", \"reservations\": [\"M20IZO\", \"N6F783\", \"IFOYYZ\", \"NQNU5R\"]}\nassistant: I found your profile. You have several reservations. Let me check the details of each to find the one from JFK to MCO on May 22.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"M20IZO\", \"user_id\": \"aarav_ahmed_6699\", \"origin\": \"JFK\", \"destination\": \