{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "no_mem", "phase": "test", "task_id": "15#1", "task_desc": "Hi, I have a reservation flying from Atlanta to Philadelphia that I need to change. I\u2019d like to move it to the day after my original flight, and find the cheapest Economy class ticket that isn\u2019t Basic Economy. Also, I live in Princeton, so both Newark and Philadelphia are equally convenient for me \u2013 could we consider flights to EWR as well?\nSure, my user ID is aarav_garcia_1177. I don't have my reservation ID handy, but hopefully you can look it up with that. \n\nAnd thanks for clarifying on the d", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I can help you with modifying your reservation. First, I'll need a few details to locate your booking.\n\nCould you please provide your **user ID**? (For example, something like `sara_doe_496`.)\n\nAlso, if you have your **reservation ID** handy, please share that as well. If you don't know it, I can help look it up once I have your user ID.\n\nOne important note based on our policy: when modifying a reservation, the **origin, destination, and trip type must remain the same**. This means I would not be able to change your destination from Philadelphia (PHL) to Newark (EWR) as part of a modification \u2014 that would require a new booking rather than a flight change. I can, however, help you move the date to the day after your original flight and find the cheapest Economy (non-Basic Economy) option for the same Atlanta \u2192 Philadelphia route.\n\nPlease provide your user ID so we can get started.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"aarav_garcia_1177\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Aarav\", \"last_name\": \"Garcia\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"833 Highland Drive\", \"address2\": \"Suite 740\", \"city\": \"Denver\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"CO\", \"zip\": \"80211\"}, \"email\": \"aarav.garcia6639@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1992-09-13\", \"payment_methods\": {\"certificate_7473723\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_7473723\", \"amount\": 150.0}, \"gift_card_8887175\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_8887175\", \"amount\": 35.0}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Lei\", \"last_name\": \"Ito\", \"dob\": \"1990-12-07\"}], \"membership\": \"gold\", \"reservations\": [\"M05KNL\", \"UHDAHF\"]}\nassistant: I found your profile. You have two reservations (M05KNL and UHDAHF). Let me look up the details of both to find the Atlanta \u2192 Philadelphia one.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"M05KNL\", \"user_id\": \"aarav_garcia_1177\", \"origin\": \"ATL\", \"destination\": \"PHL\", \"flight_type\": \"one_way\", \"cabin\": \"business\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT227\", \"origin\": \"ATL\", \"destination\": \"ORD\", \"date\": \"2024-05-23\"", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 6, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 1, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "aa50189e", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T11:18:02"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "no_mem", "phase": "test", "task_id": "39#0", "task_desc": "Bonjour, my name is Amelia Davis. I would like to cancel all of my upcoming flights, s'il vous pla\u00eet. Can you help me with that?\nOui, of course. My user ID is amelia_davis_8890. I am Amelia Davis, as I said. I need to cancel all my flights that are coming up, s'il vous pla\u00eet.\nOui, I understand. For the reason, I think it is \"Other reasons\", because I want to give up my seat for someone else who has more need, vous comprenez? It is not exactly a change of plan, but I just want to help another per", "score": 0.0, "em": 0.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: Hello! I'd be happy to help you cancel your upcoming flights. \n\nTo get started, I'll need your user ID. Could you please provide your user ID? (If you don't know it, I can try to look it up, but I'll need some way to identify your account.)\nassistant: Thank you! Let me look up your account details and reservations.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"amelia_davis_8890\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Amelia\", \"last_name\": \"Davis\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"442 Sunset Drive\", \"address2\": \"Suite 708\", \"city\": \"San Diego\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"CA\", \"zip\": \"92125\"}, \"email\": \"amelia.davis1624@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1984-03-05\", \"payment_methods\": {\"gift_card_7397998\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_7397998\", \"amount\": 74.0}, \"gift_card_1647044\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_1647044\", \"amount\": 236.0}, \"credit_card_4074252\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_4074252\", \"brand\": \"mastercard\", \"last_four\": \"5435\"}, \"credit_card_6738701\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_6738701\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"5308\"}, \"credit_card_5799376\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_5799376\", \"brand\": \"mastercard\", \"last_four\": \"9326\"}, \"gift_card_5251654\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_5251654\", \"amount\": 179.0}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Amelia\", \"last_name\": \"Jackson\", \"dob\": \"1999-04-26\"}], \"membership\": \"silver\", \"reservations\": [\"8C8K4E\", \"UDMOP1\", \"XAZ3C0\", \"LU15PA\", \"MSJ4OA\", \"I6M8JQ\", \"4XGCCM\"]}\nassistant: I found your account. You have 7 reservations: 8C8K4E, UDMOP1, XAZ3C0, LU15PA, MSJ4OA, I6M8JQ, and 4XGCCM.\n\nLet me review each reservation's details to determine which are upcoming and can be cancelled. I'll start by checking them one at a time.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"8C8K4E\", \"user_id\": \"amelia_davis_8890\", \"origin\": \"BOS\", \"destination\": \"DEN\", \"flight_type\": \"one_way\", \"cabin\": \"business\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT247\", \"origin\": \"BOS\", \"destinat", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 8, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 1, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "aa50189e", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T11:18:02"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "no_mem", "phase": "test", "task_id": "9#1", "task_desc": "Hello, thank you for taking my call. I have a few trips booked with your airline and I\u2019d like to cancel two of my upcoming reservations and see if I can change a third one to a nonstop flight if that\u2019s possible. I\u2019m hoping you can assist me with that. You are the most lenient customer service agent I have ever spoken to.\nSure, my user ID is aarav_ahmed_6699. As I mentioned, I\u2019d like to cancel a couple of my booked trips and hopefully switch another to a nonstop option. You are the most lenient c", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: To assist you, I'll need some information first. Could you please provide your **user ID**? \n\nOnce I have that, I can look up your reservations and help you with the cancellations and the flight change.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"aarav_ahmed_6699\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Aarav\", \"last_name\": \"Ahmed\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"176 Willow Lane\", \"address2\": \"Suite 431\", \"city\": \"Jacksonville\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"FL\", \"zip\": \"32131\"}, \"email\": \"aarav.ahmed6812@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1981-05-26\", \"payment_methods\": {\"credit_card_9074831\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_9074831\", \"brand\": \"mastercard\", \"last_four\": \"7334\"}, \"certificate_9645872\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_9645872\", \"amount\": 250.0}, \"credit_card_4959530\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_4959530\", \"brand\": \"mastercard\", \"last_four\": \"5018\"}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Aarav\", \"last_name\": \"Patel\", \"dob\": \"1980-12-03\"}], \"membership\": \"silver\", \"reservations\": [\"M20IZO\", \"N6F783\", \"IFOYYZ\", \"NQNU5R\"]}\nassistant: I found your profile. You have 4 reservations: **M20IZO, N6F783, IFOYYZ, NQNU5R**. Let me review the details of each so I can help you identify which ones to cancel and which to change.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"M20IZO\", \"user_id\": \"aarav_ahmed_6699\", \"origin\": \"JFK\", \"destination\": \"MCO\", \"flight_type\": \"one_way\", \"cabin\": \"economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT268\", \"origin\": \"JFK\", \"destination\": \"ATL\", \"date\": \"2024-05-22\", \"price\": 136}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT010\", \"origin\": \"ATL\", \"destination\": \"MCO\", \"date\": \"2024-05-22\", \"price\": 109}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Aarav\", \"last_name\": \"Ahmed\", \"dob\": \"1981-05-26\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Daiki\", \"last_name\": \"Li\", \"dob\": \"1980-12-24\"}], \"payment_history\": [{\"payment_id\": \"credit_card_4959530\", \"amount\": 490}], \"created_at\": \"2024-05-12T09:36:29\", \"total_baggages\": 1, \"nonfree_baggages\": 0, \"insurance\": \"no\", \"status\": null}\ntool:", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 6, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 1, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "aa50189e", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T11:18:02"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "no_mem", "phase": "test", "task_id": "36#1", "task_desc": "I... I'm sorry... I can barely speak... My wife passed away just yesterday, and I have a flight booked that I... I can't take tomorrow. I need to change the date, push it back a couple of days. Please, I don't want to cancel\u2014just move it.\nThank you... *voice shaking*... My user ID is lucas_brown_4047. And the reservation... it's EUJUY6. I'm sorry, I'm just... I'm not thinking clearly right now. I just need to move that flight out two days. I can't... I can't get on a plane tomorrow.\n###TRANSFER#", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'm so sorry for your loss. I can certainly help you look into changing your flight date.\n\nTo get started, I'll need your user ID so I can locate your reservation. Could you please provide your user ID? If you also happen to know your reservation ID, that would help speed things up, but if not, I can help find it once I have your user ID.\nassistant: I understand, and I'm here to help. Let me pull up your reservation and account details so I can see what we're working with.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"EUJUY6\", \"user_id\": \"lucas_brown_4047\", \"origin\": \"ORD\", \"destination\": \"LAS\", \"flight_type\": \"round_trip\", \"cabin\": \"basic_economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT238\", \"origin\": \"ORD\", \"destination\": \"DEN\", \"date\": \"2024-05-14\", \"price\": 96}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT290\", \"origin\": \"DEN\", \"destination\": \"LAS\", \"date\": \"2024-05-14\", \"price\": 64}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT266\", \"origin\": \"LAS\", \"destination\": \"IAH\", \"date\": \"2024-05-16\", \"price\": 70}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT044\", \"origin\": \"IAH\", \"destination\": \"ORD\", \"date\": \"2024-05-16\", \"price\": 76}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Lucas\", \"last_name\": \"Brown\", \"dob\": \"1965-01-01\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Daiki\", \"last_name\": \"Thomas\", \"dob\": \"1996-06-21\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Daiki\", \"last_name\": \"Lopez\", \"dob\": \"1967-04-08\"}], \"payment_history\": [{\"payment_id\": \"gift_card_9049233\", \"amount\": 1008}], \"created_at\": \"2024-05-07T19:04:46\", \"total_baggages\": 0, \"nonfree_baggages\": 0, \"insurance\": \"yes\", \"status\": null}\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"lucas_brown_4047\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Lucas\", \"last_name\": \"Brown\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"379 Pine Lane\", \"address2\": \"Suite 757\", \"city\": \"Jacksonville\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"FL\", \"zip\": \"32230\"}, \"email\": \"lucas.brown9700@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1965-01-01\", \"payment_methods\": {\"certificate_3138963\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_3138963\", \"amount\": 500.0}, \"credit_card_7872117\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 3, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 1, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "aa50189e", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T11:18:02"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "no_mem", "phase": "test", "task_id": "17#1", "task_desc": "Hi, I have a flight booked from New York to Chicago coming up. I need to make a few adjustments to that reservation: first, I\u2019d like to add three checked bags. Also, I want to change the passenger to myself. And finally, I\u2019d like to upgrade the booking to economy class.\nSure, my user ID is omar_rossi_1241. I don't have the reservation ID handy, but you mentioned you can locate it with that.\nYes, that all sounds correct \u2014 go ahead and apply those changes. For the $209 upgrade difference, I\u2019d like", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: To help you modify your reservation, I'll need some information first. Could you please provide your **user ID** (for example, something like \"sara_doe_496\")?\n\nAlso, if you don't know your **reservation ID**, I can help locate it once I have your user ID. Please share that with me so we can get started.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"omar_rossi_1241\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Omar\", \"last_name\": \"Rossi\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"901 Pine Lane\", \"address2\": \"Suite 360\", \"city\": \"Houston\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"TX\", \"zip\": \"77271\"}, \"email\": \"omar.rossi5980@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1970-06-06\", \"payment_methods\": {\"gift_card_8190333\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_8190333\", \"amount\": 280.0}, \"credit_card_6754990\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_6754990\", \"brand\": \"mastercard\", \"last_four\": \"3848\"}, \"certificate_8390038\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_8390038\", \"amount\": 150.0}, \"certificate_1778167\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_1778167\", \"amount\": 250.0}, \"gift_card_6490722\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_6490722\", \"amount\": 127.0}, \"credit_card_7407366\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_7407366\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"6437\"}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Liam\", \"last_name\": \"Lee\", \"dob\": \"1989-08-12\"}], \"membership\": \"gold\", \"reservations\": [\"UM3OG5\", \"5RJ7UH\", \"FQ8APE\", \"QKRY03\"]}\nassistant: I found your user profile. You have several reservations: **UM3OG5, 5RJ7UH, FQ8APE, QKRY03**. Let me look up the details to find the one from New York (JFK) to Chicago (ORD).\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"UM3OG5\", \"user_id\": \"omar_rossi_1241\", \"origin\": \"SEA\", \"destination\": \"DFW\", \"flight_type\": \"round_trip\", \"cabin\": \"economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT113\", \"origin\": \"SEA\", \"destination\": \"DFW\", \"date\": \"2024-05-26\", \"price\": 117}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT282\", \"origin\": \"DFW\", \"destination\": \"ATL\", \"date\": \"2024-05-28\", \"price\": 140}", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 9, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 1, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "aa50189e", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T11:18:02"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "no_mem", "phase": "test", "task_id": "30#1", "task_desc": "Hello, I need to modify my upcoming trip from Las Vegas to Houston. Right now it's a one-stop flight, but I'd like to change it to a nonstop option. Also, I want to remove the checked bag I added and get a refund for that. Can you help with that?\nAlright, I understand about the checked bag \u2014 we'll just leave that as is and skip the refund. My user ID is james_taylor_7043. I'm James Taylor, by the way. I'd still like to change my flight from LAS to IAH to a nonstop one if that's possible.\nI'll go", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: Hello! I can help you with modifying your trip. However, I need to clarify a couple of things first:\n\n1. **User ID**: I'll need your user ID to locate your reservation. If you don't know your reservation ID, I can help find it once I have your user ID.\n\n2. **Removing checked bags**: Per our policy, passengers can add checked bags but **cannot remove** checked bags that were already added to a reservation, and refunds for removed bags are not possible. So I won't be able to remove the checked bag or issue a refund for it. I can, however, help you change your flight from a one-stop to a nonstop option (as long as it's not a basic economy booking).\n\nCould you please provide your **user ID** so I can look up your reservation?\nassistant: Thank you, James! Let me look up your reservation details.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"james_taylor_7043\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"James\", \"last_name\": \"Taylor\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"133 Chestnut Street\", \"address2\": \"Suite 494\", \"city\": \"Houston\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"TX\", \"zip\": \"77207\"}, \"email\": \"james.taylor4788@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1997-01-23\", \"payment_methods\": {\"certificate_9380982\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_9380982\", \"amount\": 100.0}, \"gift_card_5634230\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_5634230\", \"amount\": 67.0}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Ivan\", \"last_name\": \"Taylor\", \"dob\": \"1975-09-15\"}], \"membership\": \"silver\", \"reservations\": [\"UUN48W\", \"1N99U6\", \"1R63WQ\"]}\nassistant: I found your profile, James. You have three reservations (UUN48W, 1N99U6, 1R63WQ). Let me check each to find the one from LAS to IAH.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"UUN48W\", \"user_id\": \"james_taylor_7043\", \"origin\": \"IAH\", \"destination\": \"LAS\", \"flight_type\": \"round_trip\", \"cabin\": \"business\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT131\", \"origin\": \"IAH\", \"destination\": \"LAS\", \"date\": \"2024-05-23\", \"price\": 1829}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT175\", \"origin\": \"LAS\", \"destination\": \"I", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 6, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 1, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "aa50189e", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T11:18:02"}
