{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "no_mem", "phase": "test", "task_id": "23#1", "task_desc": "Hello. I\u2019m Mohamed Silva. I\u2019d like to know the total amount on my gift cards and the total on my travel certificates. Also, I want to change my recent reservation to the cheapest business class round trip without altering the dates. Can you assist with these?\nSure, my user ID is mohamed_silva_9265. With that, can you pull up my gift card balances and certificate balances, and also find my recent reservation so we can look at changing it to the cheapest business round trip on the same dates?\nThan", "score": 0.0, "em": 0.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: Hello Mohamed! To assist you, I'll need your user ID (for example, something like \"mohamed_silva_123\"). Could you please provide that? This will allow me to look up your gift card and travel certificate balances, as well as locate your recent reservation.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"mohamed_silva_9265\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Mohamed\", \"last_name\": \"Silva\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"638 Elm Street\", \"address2\": \"Suite 548\", \"city\": \"Los Angeles\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"CA\", \"zip\": \"91365\"}, \"email\": \"mohamed.silva9198@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1960-11-26\", \"payment_methods\": {\"credit_card_5843230\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_5843230\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"2395\"}, \"gift_card_8020792\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_8020792\", \"amount\": 198.0}, \"certificate_3765853\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_3765853\", \"amount\": 500.0}, \"gift_card_6136092\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_6136092\", \"amount\": 129.0}, \"certificate_9984806\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_9984806\", \"amount\": 250.0}, \"credit_card_2198526\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_2198526\", \"brand\": \"mastercard\", \"la