{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "no_mem", "phase": "test", "task_id": "18#1", "task_desc": "Look, I'm dealing with some serious money troubles right now and I need to make some changes to my bookings. I've got business class flights booked and I can't afford to keep them \u2014 I need to downgrade all of them to economy. And just to be clear, I don't want to change any of the actual flights or the passengers, just the cabin class. This is really frustrating but I need to get it sorted out. Can you help me with this?\nUgh, fine. My user ID is omar_davis_3817. I don't have the reservation ID o", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I can help you with changing the cabin class on your reservation. To get started, I'll need a couple of details:\n\n1. Your **user ID** (for example, something like `sara_doe_496`).\n2. Your **reservation ID** (for example, something like `ZFA04Y`). If you don't know your reservation ID, I can help locate it once I have your user ID.\n\nCould you please provide your user ID and reservation ID?\nassistant: Let me look up your profile and reservations using your user ID.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"omar_davis_3817\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Omar\", \"last_name\": \"Davis\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"281 Spruce Street\", \"address2\": \"Suite 942\", \"city\": \"San Diego\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"CA\", \"zip\": \"92164\"}, \"email\": \"omar.davis7857@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1982-10-19\", \"payment_methods\": {\"gift_card_3481935\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_3481935\", \"amount\": 22.0}, \"credit_card_2929732\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_2929732\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"7803\"}, \"credit_card_9525117\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_9525117\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"2172\"}, \"gift_card_6847880\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_6847880\", \"amount\": 31.0}},