{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "no_mem", "phase": "test", "task_id": "16#0", "task_desc": "Hello, I have a flight booked from Atlanta to Philadelphia and I need to change it to the day after my original travel date. I\u2019m hoping to find the cheapest available fare in standard Economy class\u2014not Basic Economy. Can you help me with that?\nSure, my user ID is aarav_garcia_1177. I don\u2019t have my reservation ID in front of me right now\u2014can you look that up on your end using my user ID?\nYes, I\u2019d like to go with the cheapest standard Economy option you listed\u2014HAT110 and HAT172 for $207 on May 24t", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: To help you modify your reservation, I'll need some information first. Could you please provide your **user ID**? \n\nAlso, if you know your **reservation ID**, please share that as well. If you don't have it, I can help locate it once I have your user ID.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"aarav_garcia_1177\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Aarav\", \"last_name\": \"Garcia\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"833 Highland Drive\", \"address2\": \"Suite 740\", \"city\": \"Denver\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"CO\", \"zip\": \"80211\"}, \"email\": \"aarav.garcia6639@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1992-09-13\", \"payment_methods\": {\"certificate_7473723\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_7473723\", \"amount\": 150.0}, \"gift_card_8887175\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_8887175\", \"amount\": 35.0}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Lei\", \"last_name\": \"Ito\", \"dob\": \"1990-12-07\"}], \"membership\": \"gold\", \"reservations\": [\"M05KNL\", \"UHDAHF\"]}\nassistant: I found your profile. You have two reservations: **M05KNL** and **UHDAHF**. Let me check the details of both to find the one from Atlanta (ATL) to Philadelphia (PHL).\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"M05KNL\", \"user_id\": \"aarav_garcia_1177\", \"origin\": \"ATL\", \"d