{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "no_mem", "phase": "test", "task_id": "6#0", "task_desc": "Hi, I'm a bit confused about my upcoming flight booking. I'm pretty sure I selected travel insurance when I was checking out, but when I log in to look at my trip details online, there's no sign of any insurance on my ticket. I'm traveling with my family and everyone else on the reservation already has coverage for their flight, so I really need to make sure mine gets added too.\nMy user ID is sophia_taylor_9065 and the reservation number is PEP4E0.\n\nBut wait \u2014 I really need to push back on that.", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I understand your concern about the travel insurance. I can help you verify the current insurance status on your reservation.\n\nHowever, I should let you know that per our policy, **travel insurance cannot be added after the initial booking has been made**. So if it's not currently showing on your reservation, I won't be able to add it now.\n\nTo look up your reservation and confirm whether insurance is currently on it, I'll need your **user ID** and **reservation ID**. Could you please provide those?\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"PEP4E0\", \"user_id\": \"sophia_taylor_9065\", \"origin\": \"CLT\", \"destination\": \"PHX\", \"flight_type\": \"one_way\", \"cabin\": \"basic_economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT176\", \"origin\": \"CLT\", \"destination\": \"DTW\", \"date\": \"2024-05-20\", \"price\": 51}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT097\", \"origin\": \"DTW\", \"destination\": \"PHX\", \"date\": \"2024-05-20\", \"price\": 77}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Sophia\", \"last_name\": \"Taylor\", \"dob\": \"1999-05-27\"}], \"payment_history\": [{\"payment_id\": \"credit_card_9302073\", \"amount\": 128}], \"created_at\": \"2024-05-05T05:10:43\", \"total_baggages\": 0, \"nonfree_baggages\": 0, \"insurance\": \"no\", \"status\": null}\nassistant: I've looked up your reservation PE