{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "no_mem", "phase": "test", "task_id": "4#0", "task_desc": "Look, I'm really upset and I need to get this sorted out. My name is Sophia Silva. I had a business flight booked earlier this month that got canceled by your airline, and it completely messed things up for me. I expect to be compensated for the inconvenience, and I'm not leaving this conversation without a resolution.\nIt's sophia_silva_7557. But honestly, just pulling up my ID isn't enough \u2014 you need to understand what this cost me. That cancellation made me miss a critical business meeting ear", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'm sorry to hear about the inconvenience with your canceled flight. To confirm the facts and assist you with compensation, I'll need to look up your reservation details. Could you please provide your user ID?\nassistant: I understand your frustration. Let me look up your profile and reservations to confirm the details of the canceled flight.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"sophia_silva_7557\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Sophia\", \"last_name\": \"Silva\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"141 Cedar Avenue\", \"address2\": \"Suite 436\", \"city\": \"Columbus\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"OH\", \"zip\": \"43282\"}, \"email\": \"sophia.silva5929@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1957-10-05\", \"payment_methods\": {\"certificate_8045380\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_8045380\", \"amount\": 500.0}, \"certificate_3887113\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_3887113\", \"amount\": 150.0}, \"credit_card_4196779\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_4196779\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"7238\"}, \"gift_card_5094406\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_5094406\", \"amount\": 274.0}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Yara\", \"last_name\": \"Silva\", \"dob\": \"1972-06-16\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Isabella\", \"last_name