{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "no_mem", "phase": "test", "task_id": "15#0", "task_desc": "Hello, I have a trip booked from Atlanta to Philadelphia that I need to adjust. I\u2019d like to shift it to the following day and find the most affordable Economy seat\u2014though not the Basic Economy fare. Since I\u2019m based in Princeton, either Philadelphia or Newark airports work for me, so please consider options to EWR as well.\nSure, my user ID is **aarav_garcia_1177** \u2014 and my name is Aarav Garcia, in case you need to confirm.\n\nI understand what you\u2019re saying about the booking policy. I had been hopi", "score": 0.0, "em": 0.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: Hello! I'd be happy to help you adjust your trip. To get started, I'll need some information to locate your reservation.\n\nCould you please provide your **user ID**? \n\nAlso, if you have your **reservation ID** handy, that would help speed things up\u2014but if not, I can help locate it once I have your user ID.\n\nOne important note based on our booking policy: flight modifications cannot change the **origin, destination, or trip type** of an existing reservation. So if your current booking is to Philadelphia (PHL), I would not be able to change the destination to Newark (EWR)\u2014only the date and/or cabin class can be adjusted. I'll confirm the details once I can access your reservation.\nassistant: Thank you, Aarav! Let me look up your profile and reservation details.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"aarav_garcia_1177\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Aarav\", \"last_name\": \"Garcia\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"833 Highland Drive\", \"address2\": \"Suite 740\", \"city\": \"Denver\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"CO\", \"zip\": \"80211\"}, \"email\": \"aarav.garcia6639@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1992-09-13\", \"payment_methods\": {\"certificate_7473723\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_7473723\", \"amount\": 150.0}, \"gift_card_8887175\": {\"