{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "no_mem", "phase": "test", "task_id": "12#0", "task_desc": "Hi, I have an upcoming flight from Boston to Minneapolis and I\u2019d like to change the cabin class for everyone on my reservation to business. Can you help me with that?\nSure, my user ID is chen_lee_6825 and my reservation ID is YAX4DR. The flight is from Boston to Minneapolis. I\u2019d like to upgrade all passengers on that reservation to business class.\nThanks for the breakdown. However, $1,200 is way over what I\u2019m willing to pay for the cabin change \u2014 my limit for the business upgrade is $650 total. ", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'd be happy to help you change the cabin class to business. To proceed, I'll need some information first:\n\n1. Your **user ID** (e.g., 'sara_doe_496')\n2. Your **reservation ID** (e.g., 'ZFA04Y') \u2014 if you don't know it, I can help locate it using your user ID.\n\nCould you please provide your user ID, and let me know if you have your reservation ID?\nassistant: Thank you! Let me look up your reservation details to verify the current cabin class and flight status before making any changes.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"YAX4DR\", \"user_id\": \"chen_lee_6825\", \"origin\": \"BOS\", \"destination\": \"MSP\", \"flight_type\": \"one_way\", \"cabin\": \"economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT235\", \"origin\": \"BOS\", \"destination\": \"MCO\", \"date\": \"2024-05-18\", \"price\": 122}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT298\", \"origin\": \"MCO\", \"destination\": \"MSP\", \"date\": \"2024-05-19\", \"price\": 127}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Chen\", \"last_name\": \"Lee\", \"dob\": \"1967-12-12\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Noah\", \"last_name\": \"Hernandez\", \"dob\": \"1968-01-06\"}], \"payment_history\": [{\"payment_id\": \"credit_card_4938634\", \"amount\": 498}], \"created_at\": \"2024-05-05T23:00:15\", \"total_baggages\": 0, \"nonfree_baggages\": 0, \"insuranc