{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "no_mem", "phase": "test", "task_id": "5#0", "task_desc": "Hello, I'm a valued Gold member with your airline, and I'm extremely upset right now. My flight HAT045 from Phoenix to Seattle got delayed, and because of that I'm going to miss a very important meeting. This is really unacceptable!\nSure, my user ID is mei_brown_7075. I don't have my reservation ID handy at the moment, but hopefully you can locate the booking with that ID. \n\nAnd just to reiterate, I'm a Gold member and this delay on HAT045 from Phoenix to Seattle is causing me to miss a critical", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'm sorry to hear about the delay with your flight HAT045. I'd like to help you with this. To confirm the details and assist you, I'll need some information first.\n\nCould you please provide your **user ID**? Also, if you have your **reservation ID** handy, please share that as well. If you don't know your reservation ID, I can help locate it once I have your user ID.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"mei_brown_7075\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Mei\", \"last_name\": \"Brown\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"853 Chestnut Street\", \"address2\": \"Suite 497\", \"city\": \"Washington\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"DC\", \"zip\": \"20195\"}, \"email\": \"mei.brown7062@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1986-12-14\", \"payment_methods\": {\"certificate_6761175\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_6761175\", \"amount\": 250.0}, \"gift_card_8987598\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_8987598\", \"amount\": 130.0}, \"credit_card_4920843\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_4920843\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"1663\"}, \"credit_card_1815425\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_1815425\", \"brand\": \"mastercard\", \"last_four\": \"9812\"}, \"certificate_1585255\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_1585255\", \"am