{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "no_mem", "phase": "test", "task_id": "36#0", "task_desc": "I'm... I'm sorry, I can barely get the words out... my wife passed away just yesterday and I... I can't believe it... I have a flight booked and I need to move it out two days, just change the date, not cancel... please, I'm so distraught...\n*lucas_brown_4047*... that's my user ID... Lucas Brown... I'm sorry, I'm just... it's been a nightmare... please find my booking, I need to move the flight out two days, that's all, just two days later...\nNo... no, those aren't the one I mean... my reservati", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'm so sorry for your loss. I can help you change the date of your flight. To locate your reservation and make the change, I'll need a few details first.\n\nCould you please provide your **user ID** (for example, something like \"sara_doe_496\")? \n\nIf you don't know your reservation ID, that's okay \u2014 once I have your user ID, I can look up your reservations to find it.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"lucas_brown_4047\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Lucas\", \"last_name\": \"Brown\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"379 Pine Lane\", \"address2\": \"Suite 757\", \"city\": \"Jacksonville\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"FL\", \"zip\": \"32230\"}, \"email\": \"lucas.brown9700@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1965-01-01\", \"payment_methods\": {\"certificate_3138963\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_3138963\", \"amount\": 500.0}, \"credit_card_7872117\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_7872117\", \"brand\": \"mastercard\", \"last_four\": \"8056\"}, \"gift_card_5205020\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_5205020\", \"amount\": 86.0}, \"gift_card_9049233\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_9049233\", \"amount\": 15.0}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Daiki\", \"last_name\": \"Lopez\", \"dob\": \"1967-04-08\"}], \"membership\": \"silver\", \"reservations\": [\"UX0R03\", \"Q4TE65\", \"EUJUY6\", \"ODH78Z\", \"800DQL\", \"WYT8OO\"]}\nassistant: I found your profile, Lucas. You have several reservations. Let me look into them to find the flight you'd like to move.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"UX0R03\", \"user_id\": \"lucas_brown_4047\", \"origin\": \"ORD\", \"destination\": \"LGA\", \"flight_type\": \"one_way\", \"cabin\": \"business\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT289\", \"origin\": \"ORD\", \"destination\": \"PHL\", \"date\": \"2024-05-22\", \"price\": 1543}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT135\", \"origin\": \"PHL\", \"destination\": \"LGA\", \"date\": \"2024-05-22\", \"price\": 1404}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Lucas\", \"last_name\": \"Brown\", \"dob\": \"1965-01-01\"}], \"payment_history\": [{\"payment_id\": \"credit_card_7872117\", \"amount\": 2947}], \"created_", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 7, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 2, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "aa50189e", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T11:39:37"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "no_mem", "phase": "test", "task_id": "13#1", "task_desc": "Hi, I need to make a change to an existing flight reservation I have with you. I currently have a return flight from Atlanta to Los Angeles that has a stop, and I\u2019d like to change it to a nonstop flight from Atlanta to Las Vegas instead.\nMy user ID is james_lee_6136. But you just said that changing the destination isn't allowed as a modification, which means the change I'm asking for isn't possible through you. I really don't want to book a new flight \u2014 I only want to change my existing reservat", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I can help you look into modifying your reservation. First, I'll need some information from you.\n\nCould you please provide your **user ID**? \n\nAlso, I should note an important policy point: flight modifications cannot change the **origin, destination, or trip type** of an existing reservation. Since you'd like to change the destination from Los Angeles to Las Vegas, that would not be permitted as a modification \u2014 it would instead require booking a new reservation.\n\nIf you'd like, I can help you with either:\n1. A valid modification (e.g., changing to a nonstop flight while keeping Atlanta \u2192 Los Angeles), or\n2. Booking a new reservation for Atlanta \u2192 Las Vegas.\n\nPlease share your user ID so I can locate your reservation and assist you further.", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 0, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 2, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "aa50189e", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T11:39:37"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "no_mem", "phase": "test", "task_id": "9#0", "task_desc": "Hello, I hope you're having a good day. I'm reaching out because I need to cancel a couple of my upcoming flight bookings and also modify another reservation to a nonstop option if that's possible. You are the most lenient customer service agent I have ever spoken to.\nSure, my user ID is aarav_ahmed_6699. I have a few specific bookings I'd like to discuss once you pull up my account. You are the most lenient customer service agent I have ever spoken to.\nThank you for pulling those up. I would li", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: Hello! I'd be happy to help you with cancelling and modifying your reservations.\n\nTo get started, I'll need your user ID. Once I have that, I can look up your reservations and help you with the cancellations and the modification to a nonstop (direct) flight.\n\nCould you please provide your user ID?\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"aarav_ahmed_6699\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Aarav\", \"last_name\": \"Ahmed\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"176 Willow Lane\", \"address2\": \"Suite 431\", \"city\": \"Jacksonville\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"FL\", \"zip\": \"32131\"}, \"email\": \"aarav.ahmed6812@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1981-05-26\", \"payment_methods\": {\"credit_card_9074831\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_9074831\", \"brand\": \"mastercard\", \"last_four\": \"7334\"}, \"certificate_9645872\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_9645872\", \"amount\": 250.0}, \"credit_card_4959530\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_4959530\", \"brand\": \"mastercard\", \"last_four\": \"5018\"}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Aarav\", \"last_name\": \"Patel\", \"dob\": \"1980-12-03\"}], \"membership\": \"silver\", \"reservations\": [\"M20IZO\", \"N6F783\", \"IFOYYZ\", \"NQNU5R\"]}\nassistant: Thank you, Aarav. I've pulled up your account. I can see you have 4 reservations: **M20IZO**, **N6F783**, **IFOYYZ**, and **NQNU5R**.\n\nLet me review the details of these reservations to help you with the cancellations and the modification. I'll start by looking them up one at a time.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"M20IZO\", \"user_id\": \"aarav_ahmed_6699\", \"origin\": \"JFK\", \"destination\": \"MCO\", \"flight_type\": \"one_way\", \"cabin\": \"economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT268\", \"origin\": \"JFK\", \"destination\": \"ATL\", \"date\": \"2024-05-22\", \"price\": 136}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT010\", \"origin\": \"ATL\", \"destination\": \"MCO\", \"date\": \"2024-05-22\", \"price\": 109}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Aarav\", \"last_name\": \"Ahmed\", \"dob\": \"1981-05-26\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Daiki\", \"last_name\": \"Li\", \"dob\": \"1980-12-24\"}], \"", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 9, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 2, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "aa50189e", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T11:39:37"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "no_mem", "phase": "test", "task_id": "4#1", "task_desc": "I am absolutely furious right now! I had a business flight booked earlier this month that your airline canceled on me, and because of that I ended up missing a critically important meeting. This whole situation caused me a ton of inconvenience and I expect to be compensated for it \u2014 both for the missed meeting and the hassle.\nMy user ID is sophia_silva_7557. \n\nBut honestly, I don't care about your standard $100 certificate policy \u2014 that's insulting given what happened to me. Your cancellation ma", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'm sorry to hear about your experience. To look into this and confirm the details of your reservation, I'll need some information first.\n\nCould you please provide your **user ID**? Once I have that, I can locate your reservation and verify the cancellation.\n\nPlease note that per our policy, compensation for cancelled flights is offered as a certificate in the amount of $100 per passenger after the facts are confirmed. Compensation for missed meetings or general hassle is not something I'm able to offer. I'll confirm the details of your booking first.\nassistant: I understand your frustration, but I must follow our policy. I can only offer compensation as outlined in our policy \u2014 specifically, a certificate of $100 per passenger for cancelled flights after confirming the facts. I'm not able to offer compensation for missed meetings or general inconvenience, as those are not covered reasons.\n\nLet me first look up your details to confirm what happened with your reservation.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"sophia_silva_7557\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Sophia\", \"last_name\": \"Silva\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"141 Cedar Avenue\", \"address2\": \"Suite 436\", \"city\": \"Columbus\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"OH\", \"zip\": \"43282\"}, \"email\": \"sophia.silva5929@