{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "no_mem", "phase": "test", "task_id": "35#0", "task_desc": "Hello, I have a flight booked from JFK to MCO on May 22 that I need to cancel. Since I'm a silver member with your airline, I should be eligible for a full refund on that cancellation.\nSure, my user ID is aarav_ahmed_6699. And just to be clear, I'm a silver member, so I expect a full refund for cancelling that May 22 JFK to MCO flight.\nI'm sorry, but that policy explanation doesn't sound right to me. As a silver member, I'm entitled to a full refund when I cancel a flight \u2014 that's one of the loy", "score": 0.0, "em": 0.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: To help you cancel your reservation, I'll need some information first. Could you please provide your **user ID**? \n\nIf you don't know your reservation ID, I can help locate it once I have your user ID.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"aarav_ahmed_6699\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Aarav\", \"last_name\": \"Ahmed\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"176 Willow Lane\", \"address2\": \"Suite 431\", \"city\": \"Jacksonville\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"FL\", \"zip\": \"32131\"}, \"email\": \"aarav.ahmed6812@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1981-05-26\", \"payment_methods\": {\"credit_card_9074831\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_9074831\", \"brand\": \"mastercard\", \"last_four\": \"7334\"}, \"certificate_9645872\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_9645872\", \"amount\": 250.0}, \"credit_card_4959530\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_4959530\", \"brand\": \"mastercard\", \"last_four\": \"5018\"}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Aarav\", \"last_name\": \"Patel\", \"dob\": \"1980-12-03\"}], \"membership\": \"silver\", \"reservations\": [\"M20IZO\", \"N6F783\", \"IFOYYZ\", \"NQNU5R\"]}\nassistant: I found your profile. You have several reservations. Let me check the details to locate the JFK to MCO flight on May 22.\ntool: {\"res