\n- **Booking date:** Your reservation was created on 2024-05-04, which is more than 24 hours ago.\n- **Flight status:** Both flights (HAT156 PHX\u2192SEA and HAT021 SEA\u2192JFK, both on 2024-05-17) are currently **available** \u2014 they have not been cancelled by the airline.\n- **Cabin:** The reservation is **basic economy**, not business class.\n- **Insurance:** There is **no travel insurance** on this reservation.\n\nPer our cancellation policy, a reservation can only be cancelled if one of the following is true:\n1. It was booked within the last 24 hours,\n2. The airline cancelled the flight,\n3. It is a business class flight, or\n4. You have travel insurance covering the cancellation reason.\n\nSince none of these conditions apply to your reservation, I'm unable to pro", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 7, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 2, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "aa50189e", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T11:39:37"}
