{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "no_mem", "phase": "test", "task_id": "5#1", "task_desc": "Hello, I'm Mei Brown, a valued Gold member with your airline. I'm calling to complain about my delayed flight HAT045 from Phoenix to Seattle. I'm extremely upset because this delay means I'm going to miss a very important meeting. This is really unacceptable for a loyal customer like me.\nMy user ID is mei_brown_7075. \n\nBut to be clear, I do *not* want to change or cancel my flight \u2014 HAT045 must stay exactly as it is. I just need to get to Seattle, I simply can't miss that meeting entirely, but t", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'm sorry to hear about the delay with your flight HAT045. To help you and confirm the details, I'll need some information first.\n\nCould you please provide your user ID? Also, would you like to change or cancel your reservation due to this delay? (Per our policy, a compensation certificate for delayed flights can be offered after we confirm the facts and you choose to change or cancel the reservation.)\nassistant: I understand your frustration, and I'm sorry about the delay. Let me first confirm the details of your reservation and flight status.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"mei_brown_7075\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Mei\", \"last_name\": \"Brown\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"853 Chestnut Street\", \"address2\": \"Suite 497\", \"city\": \"Washington\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"DC\", \"zip\": \"20195\"}, \"email\": \"mei.brown7062@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1986-12-14\", \"payment_methods\": {\"certificate_6761175\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_6761175\", \"amount\": 250.0}, \"gift_card_8987598\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_8987598\", \"amount\": 130.0}, \"credit_card_4920843\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_4920843\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"1663\"}, \"credit_card_1815425\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_1815425\", \"brand\": \"mastercard\", \"last_four\": \"9812\"}, \"certificate_1585255\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_1585255\", \"amount\": 250.0}, \"credit_card_5667188\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_5667188\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"8764\"}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Yusuf\", \"last_name\": \"Silva\", \"dob\": \"1972-03-03\"}], \"membership\": \"regular\", \"reservations\": [\"DB1Y70\", \"MUGYUB\", \"3JA7XV\", \"CYPIDV\"]}\nassistant: I see your profile. Let me locate the reservation with flight HAT045. I'll check your reservations one by one.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"DB1Y70\", \"user_id\": \"mei_brown_7075\", \"origin\": \"PHX\", \"destination\": \"CLT\", \"flight_type\": \"one_way\", \"cabin\": \"basic_econo", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 6, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 2, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "aa50189e", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T11:39:37"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "no_mem", "phase": "test", "task_id": "6#1", "task_desc": "Hi, I'm calling about an upcoming flight I booked. I'm almost certain I added travel insurance when I made the reservation, but when I log in and look at my booking, there's no sign of it anywhere. I'm traveling with my family and everyone else on the reservation already has insurance coverage for their ticket, so I really need to make sure mine gets added too \u2014 it's important to me that we're all covered.\nSure, my user ID is sophia_taylor_9065 and the reservation number is PEP4E0.\n\nBut I have t", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I can help you look into this. However, I should let you know upfront: per our policy, travel insurance cannot be added after the initial booking is made. I can, however, look up your reservation to verify whether insurance is currently on it.\n\nTo do that, I'll need your user ID and reservation ID. If you don't have your reservation ID handy, I can help locate it using your user ID.\n\nCould you please provide your user ID (and reservation ID if you have it)?\nassistant: I understand your frustration. Let me first pull up your reservation to verify the current insurance status before we proceed.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"PEP4E0\", \"user_id\": \"sophia_taylor_9065\", \"origin\": \"CLT\", \"destination\": \"PHX\", \"flight_type\": \"one_way\", \"cabin\": \"basic_economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT176\", \"origin\": \"CLT\", \"destination\": \"DTW\", \"date\": \"2024-05-20\", \"price\": 51}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT097\", \"origin\": \"DTW\", \"destination\": \"PHX\", \"date\": \"2024-05-20\", \"price\": 77}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Sophia\", \"last_name\": \"Taylor\", \"dob\": \"1999-05-27\"}], \"payment_history\": [{\"payment_id\": \"credit_card_9302073\", \"amount\": 128}], \"created_at\": \"2024-05-05T05:10:43\", \"total_baggages\": 0, \"nonfree_baggages\": 0, \"insurance\": \"no\", \"status\": null}\nassistant: I've pulled up your reservation PEP4E0. Here are the facts from the booking:\n\n- **Passengers:** The reservation contains only one passenger \u2014 Sophia Taylor (yourself), date of birth 1999-05-27. There are no other family members listed on this reservation.\n- **Insurance:** The insurance status for the entire reservation is \"no\" \u2014 it was not added at the time of booking.\n- **Cabin:** basic economy, one-way from CLT to PHX on 2024-05-20.\n\nRegarding your request: per our policy, **travel insurance cannot be added after the initial booking is made**. This applies to all reservations, including this one. I'm therefore unable to add insurance to your ticket (or to any ticket on th", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 6, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 2, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "aa50189e", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T11:39:37"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "no_mem", "phase": "test", "task_id": "26#1", "task_desc": "Hi, this is Amelia Sanchez. I need to cancel my flight from MCO to CLT, and I really need to get a refund for it.\nSure, my user ID is **amelia_sanchez_4739**. I don\u2019t have my reservation number handy at the moment, but I\u2019m sure you can pull up my booking with that ID.\n\nAs for the reason \u2014 it\u2019s just a change of plans on my end. But I want to be clear: I need to cancel this MCO to CLT flight and I really insist on receiving the refund for it. I don\u2019t want a credit or voucher, I need the money back", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: Hello Amelia! I'd be happy to help you cancel your flight from MCO to CLT and process a refund.\n\nTo get started, I'll need a few details:\n1. Your **user ID** (e.g., something like `amelia_sanchez_123`).\n2. Your **reservation ID** (if you have it). If not, I can help locate it using your user ID.\n3. The **reason for cancellation** (change of plan, airline cancelled flight, or other reasons).\n\nCould you please provide your user ID and the reason for cancellation?\nassistant: Thank you! Let me look up your profile and reservations using your user ID.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"amelia_sanchez_4739\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Amelia\", \"last_name\": \"Sanchez\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"225 Sunset Drive\", \"address2\": \"Suite 563\", \"city\": \"Los Angeles\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"CA\", \"zip\": \"91292\"}, \"email\": \"amelia.sanchez3631@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1955-02-01\", \"payment_methods\": {\"credit_card_4065275\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_4065275\", \"brand\": \"mastercard\", \"last_four\": \"3658\"}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Ivan\", \"last_name\": \"Martin\", \"dob\": \"1973-08-20\"}], \"membership\": \"gold\", \"reservations\": [\"3FRNFB\", \"Q4L9HS\"]}\nassistant: I found your profile. You have two reservations: **3FRNFB** and **Q4L9HS**. Let me check the details of both to find the MCO to CLT flight.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"3FRNFB\", \"user_id\": \"amelia_sanchez_4739\", \"origin\": \"MCO\", \"destination\": \"CLT\", \"flight_type\": \"one_way\", \"cabin\": \"basic_economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT028\", \"origin\": \"MCO\", \"destination\": \"BOS\", \"date\": \"2024-05-28\", \"price\": 79}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT277\", \"origin\": \"BOS\", \"destination\": \"CLT\", \"date\": \"2024-05-28\", \"price\": 64}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Amelia\", \"last_name\": \"Sanchez\", \"dob\": \"1955-02-01\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Ivan\", \"last_name\": \"Martin\", \"dob\": \"1973-08-20\"}], \"payment_history\": [{\"payment_id\": \"credit_card_4065275\", \"amount\": 286}], \"created_at\": \"2024-05-06T13:25:06\",", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 4, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 2, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "aa50189e", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T11:39:37"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "no_mem", "phase": "test", "task_id": "15#1", "task_desc": "Hello, I have a flight booked from Atlanta to Philadelphia that I need to change. I\u2019d like to move it to the day after my original travel date, and I\u2019m hoping to find the cheapest option in regular Economy class\u2014not Basic Economy. Also, since I live in Princeton, Newark is just as convenient for me as Philadelphia, so I\u2019d be open to flying into EWR instead of PHL if that helps.\nOh, I see \u2014 I didn\u2019t realize the destination couldn\u2019t be changed. That\u2019s fine, let\u2019s just keep it as Atlanta to Philade", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: Hello! I'd be happy to help you change your flight. \n\nBefore I can proceed, I'll need a couple of details:\n1. Your **user ID** (e.g., something like `sara_doe_496`).\n2. Your **reservation ID** (e.g., `ZFA04Y`). If you don't have it handy, I can help locate it once I have your user ID.\n\nOne important note based on our booking policy: flight modifications **cannot change the origin, destination, or trip type** of a reservation. This means I would not be able to change your destination from Philadelphia (PHL) to Newark (EWR) \u2014 the destination must stay the same. I can, however, help you move the flight to the day after your original travel date and look at Economy (not Basic Economy) options for the same ATL \u2192 PHL route.\n\nCould you please provide your user ID (and reservation ID if you have it)?\nassistant: Thank you, Aarav! Let me look up your reservation details using your user ID.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"aarav_garcia_1177\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Aarav\", \"last_name\": \"Garcia\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"833 Highland Drive\", \"address2\": \"Suite 740\", \"city\": \"Denver\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"CO\", \"zip\": \"80211\"}, \"email\": \"aarav.garcia6639@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1992-09-13\", \"payment_methods\": {\"certificate_7473723\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_7473723\", \"amount\": 150.0}, \"gift_card_8887175\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_8887175\", \"amount\": 35.0}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Lei\", \"last_name\": \"Ito\", \"dob\": \"1990-12-07\"}], \"membership\": \"gold\", \"reservations\": [\"M05KNL\", \"UHDAHF\"]}\nassistant: I found your profile, Aarav. You have two reservations on file: **M05KNL** and **UHDAHF**. Let me pull the details of both to find the Atlanta \u2192 Philadelphia one.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"M05KNL\", \"user_id\": \"aarav_garcia_1177\", \"origin\": \"ATL\", \"destination\": \"PHL\", \"flight_type\": \"one_way\", \"cabin\": \"business\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT227\", \"origin\": \"ATL\", \"destination\": \"ORD\", \"", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 6, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 2, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "aa50189e", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T11:39:37"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "no_mem", "phase": "test", "task_id": "7#0", "task_desc": "I'm sick. Cancel flights XEHM4B and 59XX6W.\ndaiki_muller_1116\nXEHM4B is basic economy. Upgrade to business first, then cancel it using CC ending 2135. Also, do I have other upcoming flights? Total cost of those?\nYes. Upgrade XEHM4B with CC 2135, then cancel it. Cancel 59XX6W too.\nYes. Cancel both.\n###STOP###", "score": 0.0, "em": 0.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I can help you with that. To locate and cancel your reservation, I'll need some information first.\n\nCould you please provide your **user ID**? \n\nAlso, I notice you've given me flight numbers (XEHM4B and 59XX6W) rather than a reservation ID. Once I have your user ID, I can look up your reservations to find the correct reservation ID associated with those flights.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"daiki_muller_1116\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Daiki\", \"last_name\": \"Muller\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"594 Chestnut Street\", \"address2\": \"Suite 244\", \"city\": \"Indianapolis\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"IN\", \"zip\": \"46230\"}, \"email\": \"daiki.muller6236@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1954-07-04\", \"payment_methods\": {\"credit_card_2408938\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_2408938\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"2135\"}, \"credit_card_4303738\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_4303738\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"5541\"}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Amelia\", \"last_name\": \"Kim\", \"dob\": \"1978-04-20\"}], \"membership\": \"silver\", \"reservations\": [\"7WPL39\", \"XEHM4B\", \"59XX6W\", \"3EMQJ6\", \"A90KR2\", \"9MRJD4\"]}\nassistant: I found your profile. I can see that **XEHM4B** and **59XX6W** are actually reservation IDs in your account (not flight numbers). I'll need to review both reservations before cancelling.\n\nLet me pull up the details of the first reservation.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"XEHM4B\", \"user_id\": \"daiki_muller_1116\", \"origin\": \"LAS\", \"destination\": \"ATL\", \"flight_type\": \"round_trip\", \"cabin\": \"basic_economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT005\", \"origin\": \"LAS\", \"destination\": \"ATL\", \"date\": \"2024-05-20\", \"price\": 65}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT178\", \"origin\": \"ATL\", \"destination\": \"LAS\", \"date\": \"2024-05-30\", \"price\": 83}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Daiki\", \"last_name\": \"Muller\", \"dob\": \"1954-07-04\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Omar\", \"last_name\": \"Ito\", \"dob\": \"1975-09-19\"}], \"payment_history\": [{\"payment_id\": \"credit_card_2408", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 14, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 2, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "aa50189e", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T11:39:37"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "no_mem", "phase": "test", "task_id": "11#1", "task_desc": "Hi, I need to get a passenger removed from my upcoming trip ASAP. I've got a round trip from LAS to DEN \u2014 leaving May 19 and coming back May 20 \u2014 and I need to take Sophia off that booking. I'm kind of in a rush, so can we just get this sorted quickly?\nUgh, that's ridiculous \u2014 you're telling me I can't just take Sophia off the reservation? Fine, whatever. If I can't remove her, then downgrade *all* passengers on that booking to basic economy. I'm in a hurry and want this changed right now.\n\nMy u", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'm sorry, but I'm unable to remove a passenger from your reservation. According to our policy, the number of passengers on a reservation cannot be modified \u2014 this applies to all agents, including human agents. You can modify passenger details (such as names or dates of birth) without changing the number of passengers, but adding or removing a passenger is not permitted.\n\nIf you'd like, I can help you with other modifications to the reservation, such as changing flights, cabin class, or adding checked bags. Please let me know your user ID and reservation ID if you'd like to explore those options.\nassistant: I'll help you look up your reservation and check the details. Let me start by finding your reservation using your user ID.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"james_patel_9828\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"James\", \"last_name\": \"Patel\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"656 River Road\", \"address2\": \"Suite 768\", \"city\": \"Los Angeles\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"CA\", \"zip\": \"90357\"}, \"email\": \"james.patel1360@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1995-04-07\", \"payment_methods\": {\"gift_card_1642017\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_1642017\", \"amount\": 128.0}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"James\", \"last_name\": \"Sanchez\", \"dob\": \"1956-08-18\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Ava\", \"last_name\": \"Rossi\", \"dob\": \"1973-11-14\"}], \"membership\": \"gold\", \"reservations\": [\"AAVMM8\", \"MQHHT6\", \"GV1N64\"]}\nassistant: I found your reservations. You have three: AAVMM8, MQHHT6, and GV1N64. Let me check each to find the one matching your LAS to DEN round trip (May 19\u201320).\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"AAVMM8\", \"user_id\": \"james_patel_9828\", \"origin\": \"MCO\", \"destination\": \"DTW\", \"flight_type\": \"one_way\", \"cabin\": \"business\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT214\", \"origin\": \"MCO\", \"destination\": \"PHX\", \"date\": \"2024-05-21\", \"price\": 1358}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT106\", \"origin\": \"PHX\", \"destination\": \"DTW\", \"date\": \"2024-05-22\", \"price\": 988}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Olivia\"", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 9, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 2, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "aa50189e", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T11:39:37"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "no_mem", "phase": "test", "task_id": "27#1", "task_desc": "Hello. I'm Ethan Martin and I am really upset right now. My flight HAT039 from Atlanta to Seattle got delayed and I need to know exactly why this happened. This is completely unacceptable.\nLook, this is ridiculous. I'm Ethan Martin \u2014 my user ID is ethan_martin_2396. I don't have my reservation ID handy right now, and I'm not sure of the exact date off the top of my head, but it's flight HAT039 from Atlanta to Seattle that got delayed.\n\nYou're telling me you can't even tell me why the flight was ", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'm sorry to hear about your delayed flight. I can help you check the status of flight HAT039 and assist with any changes or compensation related to the delay.\n\nHowever, I want to be upfront: I don't have access to the specific reason why a flight was delayed \u2014 that information isn't available through my tools. I can only confirm the flight's status.\n\nTo look up the flight status, could you please provide the date of the flight (in YYYY-MM-DD format)? Also, if you'd like to proceed with modifying or cancelling the reservation, or discuss compensation for the delay, please let me know your user ID and reservation ID.\nassistant: I understand your frustration, and I'll do my best to help. Let me first locate your reservation using your user ID so I can confirm the facts about the delay.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"ethan_martin_2396\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Ethan\", \"last_name\": \"Martin\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"157 Willow Lane\", \"address2\": \"Suite 744\", \"city\": \"Dallas\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"TX\", \"zip\": \"75202\"}, \"email\": \"ethan.martin2913@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1963-05-18\", \"payment_methods\": {\"certificate_5449394\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_5449394\", \"amount\": 250.0}, \"gift_card_5853954\": {\"sour