{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "no_mem", "phase": "test", "task_id": "12#1", "task_desc": "Hello, I have an upcoming flight from Boston to Minneapolis\u2014my reservation number is YAX4DR. I\u2019d like to change the cabin class for everyone on that booking to business. Can you help me with that?\nSure, my user ID is chen_lee_6825.\nThanks for the breakdown, but $1,200 is way over what I\u2019m willing to pay\u2014I can only cover up to $650 in fees for a class upgrade. Since upgrading both of us is too expensive, I\u2019d like to just upgrade my companion, Noah Hernandez, to business class instead. What would ", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: To proceed with changing the cabin class, I'll need your user ID for verification. Could you please provide your user ID?\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"YAX4DR\", \"user_id\": \"chen_lee_6825\", \"origin\": \"BOS\", \"destination\": \"MSP\", \"flight_type\": \"one_way\", \"cabin\": \"economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT235\", \"origin\": \"BOS\", \"destination\": \"MCO\", \"date\": \"2024-05-18\", \"price\": 122}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT298\", \"origin\": \"MCO\", \"destination\": \"MSP\", \"date\": \"2024-05-19\", \"price\": 127}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Chen\", \"last_name\": \"Lee\", \"dob\": \"1967-12-12\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Noah\", \"last_name\": \"Hernandez\", \"dob\": \"1968-01-06\"}], \"payment_history\": [{\"payment_id\": \"credit_card_4938634\", \"amount\": 498}], \"created_at\": \"2024-05-05T23:00:15\", \"total_baggages\": 0, \"nonfree_baggages\": 0, \"insurance\": \"no\", \"status\": null}\nassistant: Thank you. I've retrieved your reservation. Before proceeding, I need to verify that none of the flights in your reservation have already been flown, since cabin class cannot be changed once a flight has departed. Let me check the status of your flights.\ntool: available\ntool: available\nassistant: Both flights are still availab