{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "no_mem", "phase": "test", "task_id": "20#1", "task_desc": "Hello, I'm looking to book a one-way flight from New York to Seattle on May 20th.\nMy user ID is mia_li_3668.\nI don't have a specific New York airport in mind, so whichever one works for the flight is fine.\n\nFor cabin class, I'd like economy.\n\nPassenger details: my name is Mia Li, and my date of birth is already in my user profile, so you should be able to pull that from there.\n\nFor payment, I want to use my two travel certificates ($100 and $250) to pay for the flight. If only one certificate ca", "score": 0.0, "em": 0.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: Hello! I'd be happy to help you book a one-way flight from New York to Seattle on May 20th.\n\nTo get started, I'll need your **user ID** (for example, something like \"sara_doe_496\"). Could you please provide that?\nassistant: Thank you! Let me look up your profile to help with the booking.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"mia_li_3668\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Mia\", \"last_name\": \"Li\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"975 Sunset Drive\", \"address2\": \"Suite 217\", \"city\": \"Austin\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"TX\", \"zip\": \"78750\"}, \"email\": \"mia.li3818@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1990-04-05\", \"payment_methods\": {\"credit_card_4421486\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_4421486\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"7447\"}, \"certificate_4856383\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_4856383\", \"amount\": 100.0}, \"certificate_7504069\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_7504069\", \"amount\": 250.0}, \"credit_card_1955700\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_1955700\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"1907\"}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Amelia\", \"last_name\": \"Ahmed\", \"dob\": \"1957-03-21\"}], \"membership\": \"gold\", \"reservations\": [\"NO6JO3\", \"AIXC49\", \"HKEG34\"]}\nassistant: Thank you, Mia! I can see your profile (gold member). Before I search for flights, I need to clarify one detail: New York has multiple airports (JFK, LGA, EWR). Which airport would you like to depart from?\n\nAlso, for the booking I'll need:\n- **Cabin class**: basic economy, economy, or business?\n- **Passenger details**: first name, last name, and date of birth for each passenger (you can use a saved passenger if applicable).\n- **Payment method**: you have credit cards (ending 7447, 1907) and travel certificates ($100, $250) on file.\n- **Checked bags**: how many (if any) beyond your free allowance?\n- **Travel insurance**: would you like to add it ($30 per passenger)?\n\nLet me know your departure airport and these details, and I'll search for available fligh", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 7, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 2, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "aa50189e", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T11:39:37"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "no_mem", "phase": "test", "task_id": "25#1", "task_desc": "Hi, I'm Ivan Muller. I'd like to book a flight for my friend Ivan Smith \u2014 he's already in my profile \u2014 and have it match my current reservation exactly. I also want to use my travel certificate for this and find out how much balance would be left afterward, but we can get to that once we confirm the details. Just to note, no baggage or insurance needed.\nSure, my user ID is ivan_muller_7015.\nThanks for pulling that up. The flight details and having Ivan Smith as the only passenger look correct, a", "score": 0.0, "em": 0.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: Hello Ivan! To get started with booking, I'll need your user ID first. Could you please provide your user ID (for example, something like \"ivan_muller_123\")? Once I have that, I can look up your current reservation and profile details to help match the new booking.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"ivan_muller_7015\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Ivan\", \"last_name\": \"Muller\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"256 Pine Lane\", \"address2\": \"Suite 661\", \"city\": \"New York\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"NY\", \"zip\": \"10029\"}, \"email\": \"ivan.muller6623@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1968-04-25\", \"payment_methods\": {\"certificate_8998287\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_8998287\", \"amount\": 500.0}, \"credit_card_3563913\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_3563913\", \"brand\": \"mastercard\", \"last_four\": \"6710\"}, \"gift_card_8516878\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_8516878\", \"amount\": 128.0}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Ivan\", \"last_name\": \"Smith\", \"dob\": \"1986-03-14\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Lucas\", \"last_name\": \"Davis\", \"dob\": \"1988-10-12\"}], \"membership\": \"gold\", \"reservations\": [\"G72NSF\"]}\nassistant: Thank you! I can see your profile. Now let me look up your current reservation (G72NSF) so we can match the new booking exactly.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"G72NSF\", \"user_id\": \"ivan_muller_7015\", \"origin\": \"DTW\", \"destination\": \"SEA\", \"flight_type\": \"one_way\", \"cabin\": \"economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT097\", \"origin\": \"DTW\", \"destination\": \"PHX\", \"date\": \"2024-05-17\", \"price\": 158}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT251\", \"origin\": \"PHX\", \"destination\": \"SEA\", \"date\": \"2024-05-17\", \"price\": 141}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Ivan\", \"last_name\": \"Muller\", \"dob\": \"1968-04-25\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Isabella\", \"last_name\": \"Moore\", \"dob\": \"1952-01-28\"}], \"payment_history\": [{\"payment_id\": \"gift_card_8516878\", \"amount\": 658}], \"created_at\": \"2024-05-11T19:32:36\", \"total_baggages\": 2, \"nonfree_baggages\": 0, \"insurance\": \"yes\", \"status\": null", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 5, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 2, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "aa50189e", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T11:39:37"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "no_mem", "phase": "test", "task_id": "36#1", "task_desc": "Hi... I'm sorry, I'm just... I'm a mess right now. My wife died yesterday. I have a flight reservation and I... I can't go on the original date. I need to change it, just push it back a bit. I don't want to cancel, just... change the date.\nThank you... I just... I can barely think straight. My user ID is lucas_brown_4047. Please, I just need to move the flight out a couple days. I can't... I can't deal with this right now, I just need the date changed, not cancelled.\nNo... none of those are the ", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'm so sorry for your loss. I can certainly help you change the date of your reservation.\n\nTo locate your booking and make the change, I'll need a couple of details first. Could you please provide your **user ID** (for example, something like \"sara_doe_496\")?\n\nIf you don't know your reservation ID, that's okay \u2014 once I have your user ID, I can look up your reservations for you.\nassistant: I understand, and I'm here to help. Let me look up your reservations now.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"lucas_brown_4047\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Lucas\", \"last_name\": \"Brown\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"379 Pine Lane\", \"address2\": \"Suite 757\", \"city\": \"Jacksonville\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"FL\", \"zip\": \"32230\"}, \"email\": \"lucas.brown9700@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1965-01-01\", \"payment_methods\": {\"certificate_3138963\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_3138963\", \"amount\": 500.0}, \"credit_card_7872117\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_7872117\", \"brand\": \"mastercard\", \"last_four\": \"8056\"}, \"gift_card_5205020\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_5205020\", \"amount\": 86.0}, \"gift_card_9049233\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_9049233\", \"amount\": 15.0}}, \"saved_passengers