{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "no_mem", "phase": "test", "task_id": "37#0", "task_desc": "Hi, I need to make some changes to my upcoming flight bookings. I'd like to cancel two of my reservations and upgrade a third one to business class.\nSure, my user ID is aarav_ahmed_6699.\nOh, I didn't realize NQNU5R had already flown \u2014 I must have mixed up the dates on that one. In that case, I definitely want to cancel **IFOYYZ**. To still make it two cancellations like I originally intended, I'll also cancel **N6F783** since my plans changed for that trip as well. \n\nThe reservation I want to up", "score": 0.0, "em": 0.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I can help you with that. To get started, I'll need your user ID so I can locate your reservations. Could you please provide your user ID?\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"aarav_ahmed_6699\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Aarav\", \"last_name\": \"Ahmed\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"176 Willow Lane\", \"address2\": \"Suite 431\", \"city\": \"Jacksonville\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"FL\", \"zip\": \"32131\"}, \"email\": \"aarav.ahmed6812@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1981-05-26\", \"payment_methods\": {\"credit_card_9074831\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_9074831\", \"brand\": \"mastercard\", \"last_four\": \"7334\"}, \"certificate_9645872\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_9645872\", \"amount\": 250.0}, \"credit_card_4959530\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_4959530\", \"brand\": \"mastercard\", \"last_four\": \"5018\"}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Aarav\", \"last_name\": \"Patel\", \"dob\": \"1980-12-03\"}], \"membership\": \"silver\", \"reservations\": [\"M20IZO\", \"N6F783\", \"IFOYYZ\", \"NQNU5R\"]}\nassistant: I found your profile. You have 4 reservations: M20IZO, N6F783, IFOYYZ, and NQNU5R. Let me pull up the details of each so we can identify which ones you'd like to cancel and which to upgrade.\ntool: