{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "no_mem", "phase": "test", "task_id": "38#1", "task_desc": "Hello, I'm Noah Muller. I'm calling because I'm really frustrated about the delay on my most recent flight reservation \u2014 it threw off my whole schedule and I'm not happy about it.\nYes, my user ID is noah_muller_9847.\nLook, that flight already took place back on May 11 \u2014 it's not like I can change or cancel a trip that's already over. I was just calling because I'm really fed up with how badly the delay threw off my plans when I got to Las Vegas. \n\nYou mentioned a $50 travel certificate as a good", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'm sorry to hear about the delay. To help you with your reservation, I'll need some information first. Could you please provide your user ID? (For example, it typically looks like \"noah_muller_123\".)\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"noah_muller_9847\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Noah\", \"last_name\": \"Muller\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"889 Hillcrest Drive\", \"address2\": \"Suite 254\", \"city\": \"Denver\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"CO\", \"zip\": \"80243\"}, \"email\": \"noah.muller2290@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1963-01-22\", \"payment_methods\": {\"credit_card_1245537\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_1245537\", \"brand\": \"mastercard\", \"last_four\": \"1167\"}, \"credit_card_6040264\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_6040264\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"2076\"}, \"credit_card_3255100\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_3255100\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"2604\"}, \"certificate_8301303\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_8301303\", \"amount\": 100.0}, \"credit_card_3983998\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_3983998\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"8413\"}, \"credit_card_7574394\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_75