{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "no_mem", "phase": "test", "task_id": "10#1", "task_desc": "Hi, I have a flight booked from Houston to Seattle on May 23rd, and I\u2019d like to push it back to the 24th instead. Also, for that same flight, I want to upgrade to business class for all the passengers on my booking.\nSure, my user ID is liam_khan_2521. I don\u2019t have my reservation ID on hand right now, but maybe you can pull up the booking with that?\nHold on, I think there might be some confusion in the plan you laid out. I only asked to upgrade the outbound IAH to SEA flight to business class for", "score": 0.0, "em": 0.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: To help you modify your reservation, I'll need some information first. Could you please provide your **user ID** (for example, something like \"sara_doe_496\")?\n\nAlso, if you have your **reservation ID** handy, please share that as well. If you don't know it, I can help locate it once I have your user ID.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"liam_khan_2521\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Liam\", \"last_name\": \"Khan\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"626 Willow Lane\", \"address2\": \"Suite 707\", \"city\": \"New York\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"NY\", \"zip\": \"10148\"}, \"email\": \"liam.khan7273@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1979-09-27\", \"payment_methods\": {\"certificate_9254323\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_9254323\", \"amount\": 500.0}, \"gift_card_7194529\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_7194529\", \"amount\": 62.0}, \"credit_card_7434610\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_7434610\", \"brand\": \"mastercard\", \"last_four\": \"9448\"}, \"credit_card_7231150\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_7231150\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"3422\"}, \"certificate_1849235\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_1849235\", \"amount\": 250.0}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Fatima\", \"last_name\": \"Ito\", \"dob\": \"1983-03-27\"}], \"membership\": \"gold\", \"reservations\": [\"4NQLHD\", \"KHIK97\", \"NO6SVK\", \"AJVCTQ\", \"ZB7LBX\"]}\nassistant: I found your profile. You have several reservations. Let me locate the one from Houston to Seattle on May 23rd. I'll check your reservations one by one.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"4NQLHD\", \"user_id\": \"liam_khan_2521\", \"origin\": \"IAH\", \"destination\": \"SEA\", \"flight_type\": \"round_trip\", \"cabin\": \"economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT190\", \"origin\": \"IAH\", \"destination\": \"LAS\", \"date\": \"2024-05-23\", \"price\": 126}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT047\", \"origin\": \"LAS\", \"destination\": \"SEA\", \"date\": \"2024-05-23\", \"price\": 139}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT021\", \"origin\": \"SEA\", \"destination\": \"JFK\", \"date\": \"2024-05-26\", \"price\": 14", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 18, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 2, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "aa50189e", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T11:39:37"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "raw_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "13#0", "task_desc": "Hello, I need to make a change to my upcoming return flight. I currently have a one-stop flight from Atlanta to Los Angeles, and I'd like to change it to a nonstop flight from Atlanta to Las Vegas instead. I don't want to book a new flight\u2014just modify the existing reservation.\nI understand the policy you've described, but since you're telling me the change from my ATL\u2013LAX return to an ATL\u2013LAS nonstop isn't possible, I'd like to be transferred to someone who can assist me with this request or a s", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: Hello! I can help you look into modifying your reservation. However, I need to inform you about an important policy restriction first.\n\nPer our modification policy, flight changes **cannot alter the origin, destination, or trip type** of a reservation. This means I would not be able to change your existing Atlanta \u2192 Los Angeles flight into an Atlanta \u2192 Las Vegas flight, as that changes the destination.\n\nTo proceed with any modification that keeps the same origin and destination, I'll need some information from you:\n\n1. **Your user ID** (e.g., `sara_doe_496`)\n2. **Your reservation ID** (if you don't know it, I can help locate it using your user ID)\n\nCould you please provide your user ID? And if you'd like, I can help you find the reservation or discuss what modifications *are* possible (such as changing to a different date, a nonstop flight on the same Atlanta \u2192 Los Angeles route, or changing cabin class).", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 0, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 0, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "aa50189e", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T11:55:13"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "raw_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "3#0", "task_desc": "Hello, I'm feeling really overwhelmed because I have so much to pack for my trip. I need to find out exactly how many suitcases my reservation lets me take on the flight. I'm almost certain I have Gold status, and it's really important that I get this right. Can you look that up for me?\nYes, of course. My name is Anya Garcia, and my user ID is anya_garcia_5901. The confirmation number for my booking is JMO1MG. I really need to know the exact total number of suitcases I'm allowed to bring \u2014 this ", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I can help you look that up. To find your reservation and the baggage allowance, I'll need a couple of details first:\n\n1. Your **user ID** (for example, something like \"sara_doe_496\")\n2. Your **reservation ID** (for example, something like \"ZFA04Y\")\n\nIf you don't know your reservation ID, just let me know your user ID and I can help locate it.\nassistant: Let me look up your reservation and profile details.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"JMO1MG\", \"user_id\": \"anya_garcia_5901\", \"origin\": \"DEN\", \"destination\": \"MIA\", \"flight_type\": \"one_way\", \"cabin\": \"economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT255\", \"origin\": \"DEN\", \"destination\": \"MIA\", \"date\": \"2024-05-16\", \"price\": 149}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Anya\", \"last_name\": \"Garcia\", \"dob\": \"1992-11-12\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Raj\", \"last_name\": \"Jackson\", \"dob\": \"1956-03-09\"}], \"payment_history\": [{\"payment_id\": \"gift_card_2550356\", \"amount\": 358}], \"created_at\": \"2024-05-13T23:20:29\", \"total_baggages\": 1, \"nonfree_baggages\": 0, \"insurance\": \"yes\", \"status\": null}\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"anya_garcia_5901\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Anya\", \"last_name\": \"Garcia\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"555 Highland Drive\", \"address2\": \"Suite 243\", \"city\": \"San Antonio\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"TX\", \"zip\": \"78256\"}, \"email\": \"anya.garcia8816@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1992-11-12\", \"payment_methods\": {\"gift_card_2550356\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_2550356\", \"amount\": 149.0}, \"certificate_7583008\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_7583008\", \"amount\": 150.0}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Mei\", \"last_name\": \"Lee\", \"dob\": \"1989-12-13\"}], \"membership\": \"silver\", \"reservations\": [\"82K959\", \"790JYN\", \"BE2L57\", \"CXBB4L\", \"TAMSDK\", \"3RK2T9\", \"VAOW1B\", \"Q4MCUF\", \"JMO1MG\"]}\nassistant: I've looked up your reservation and profile. Here are the facts:\n\n**Membership status:** Your profile shows **Silver** membership (not Gold, as you mentioned).\n\n**Your reservation JMO1MG details", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 3, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 0, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "aa50189e", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T11:55:13"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "raw_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "29#0", "task_desc": "Hello, this is Raj Brown. I\u2019ve been dealing with a health problem and I had purchased trip insurance for my upcoming travel. Because of that insurance, I\u2019d like any change fees waived. I currently have a roundtrip reservation from Detroit (DTW) to LaGuardia (LGA) and back, but I need to change it to nonstop flights from Detroit to JFK and back, keeping the same travel dates. Can you help me get that sorted out?\nSure, no problem. My user ID is raj_brown_5782, and the reservation ID for the Detroi", "score": 0.0, "em": 0.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: Hello Raj, I\u2019d like to help with this. First, I\u2019ll need a couple of details to locate your reservation:\n\n1. Your **user ID** (e.g., something like `raj_brown_123`).\n2. Your **reservation ID** (if you have it). If you don\u2019t know it, I can look it up once I have your user ID.\n\nI also want to flag an important limitation before we proceed: per our modification policy, changing flights on an existing reservation **cannot change the origin, destination, or trip type**. Your current reservation is DTW \u2194 LGA, and you\u2019d like to change the destination to JFK. Since that changes the destination, it falls outside what I can do through a standard flight modification, and this would need to be handled by a human agent.\n\nOnce you provide your user ID (and reservation ID if available), I can pull up the details and then transfer you to a human agent who can assist with the destination change.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"VA5SGQ\", \"user_id\": \"raj_brown_5782\", \"origin\": \"DTW\", \"destination\": \"LGA\", \"flight_type\": \"round_trip\", \"cabin\": \"economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT035\", \"origin\": \"DTW\", \"destination\": \"PHX\", \"date\": \"2024-05-17\", \"price\": 163}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT066\", \"origin\": \"PHX\", \"destinatio