{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "raw_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "31#0", "task_desc": "Hello, I'm Daiki Lee. I have a flight booked out of JFK on May 17, but my cat is really sick and I need to get home sooner to take care of him. I was hoping I could change my booking to a nonstop flight instead.\nSure, my user ID is daiki_lee_6144. Unfortunately, I don't have my reservation ID with me\u2014I'm not sure what it is. Can you look up my booking with just the user ID?\nI see, that's really unfortunate. Since I don't want to buy a new flight and you're saying my current reservation can't be ", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: Hello Daiki Lee, I'm sorry to hear about your cat. I'd be happy to help you look into changing your booking.\n\nTo get started, I'll need your user ID (for example, a format like \"daiki_lee_123\"). Could you please provide that? Also, if you have your reservation ID handy, that would help me locate your booking faster\u2014but if not, I can help find it using your user ID.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"daiki_lee_6144\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Daiki\", \"last_name\": \"Lee\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"410 River Road\", \"address2\": \"Suite 380\", \"city\": \"Fort Worth\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"TX\", \"zip\": \"76173\"}, \"email\": \"daiki.lee6987@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1976-10-08\", \"payment_methods\": {\"credit_card_6198952\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_6198952\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"9734\"}, \"gift_card_3112961\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_3112961\", \"amount\": 51.0}, \"gift_card_5128346\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_5128346\", \"amount\": 262.0}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Raj\", \"last_name\": \"Muller\", \"dob\": \"1967-10-16\"}], \"membership\": \"regular\", \"reservations\": [\"DF89BM\", \"COVE6R\", \"IIHXDG\"]}\nassistant: I found your profile, Daiki. Yo