{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "raw_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "26#0", "task_desc": "Hi, I need to cancel my flight from MCO to CLT and I insist on getting a refund for it.\nSure, my user ID is amelia_sanchez_4739. As for the reason, I just need to cancel that MCO to CLT flight \u2014 you can mark it as other reasons or whatever, but the important thing is I insist on getting my refund.\nI understand what the policy says, but I really need to insist here \u2014 I want to cancel that MCO to CLT flight and I expect to get my refund. This isn't acceptable to me; I'm telling you I need it cance", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I can help you with that. First, I'll need some information to locate your reservation.\n\nCould you please provide your **user ID**? (For example, something like \"sara_doe_496\")\n\nAlso, I'll need to know the **reason for cancellation** (change of plan, airline cancelled flight, or other reasons).\n\nIf you don't know your reservation ID, I can help locate it once I have your user ID.\nassistant: Thank you. Let me look up your profile and reservations.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"amelia_sanchez_4739\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Amelia\", \"last_name\": \"Sanchez\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"225 Sunset Drive\", \"address2\": \"Suite 563\", \"city\": \"Los Angeles\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"CA\", \"zip\": \"91292\"}, \"email\": \"amelia.sanchez3631@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1955-02-01\", \"payment_methods\": {\"credit_card_4065275\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_4065275\", \"brand\": \"mastercard\", \"last_four\": \"3658\"}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Ivan\", \"last_name\": \"Martin\", \"dob\": \"1973-08-20\"}], \"membership\": \"gold\", \"reservations\": [\"3FRNFB\", \"Q4L9HS\"]}\nassistant: I found your profile. You have two reservations (3FRNFB and Q4L9HS). Let me check the details to find the MCO to CLT flight.\ntool: {\"r