{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "raw_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "0#0", "task_desc": "Hi there, I'm calling because I need to cancel a plane ticket I booked recently. Could you help me with that?\nSure, my name is Emma Kim and my user ID is emma_kim_9957.\nI'd like to cancel reservation EHGLP3. The reason is a change of plans \u2014 I was out of town right after I booked it and just got back, so it's been a little over 24 hours since the booking. I'm hoping that's still okay to cancel.\nHmm, wait \u2014 that doesn't seem right to me. When I made this booking, I was told I didn't need to purch", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'd be happy to help you cancel your reservation. To get started, I'll need your user ID. Could you please provide it?\nassistant: Thank you, Emma. Let me look up your reservations to find the one you'd like to cancel.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"emma_kim_9957\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Emma\", \"last_name\": \"Kim\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"109 Willow Lane\", \"address2\": \"Suite 171\", \"city\": \"Philadelphia\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"PA\", \"zip\": \"19151\"}, \"email\": \"emma.kim3947@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1977-09-23\", \"payment_methods\": {\"credit_card_5832574\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_5832574\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"5241\"}, \"gift_card_9562694\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_9562694\", \"amount\": 103.0}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Mason\", \"last_name\": \"Gonzalez\", \"dob\": \"1952-04-21\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Aarav\", \"last_name\": \"Taylor\", \"dob\": \"1983-05-15\"}], \"membership\": \"gold\", \"reservations\": [\"EHGLP3\", \"66EEUA\", \"MDCLVA\", \"H1QGCY\"]}\nassistant: I found your profile, Emma. You have 4 reservations: **EHGLP3**, **66EEUA**, **MDCLVA**, and **H1QGCY**. Let me pull up the details of each so we can identify the one you'd like to cancel.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"EHGLP3\", \"user_id\": \"emma_kim_9957\", \"origin\": \"PHX\", \"destination\": \"JFK\", \"flight_type\": \"one_way\", \"cabin\": \"basic_economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT156\", \"origin\": \"PHX\", \"destination\": \"SEA\", \"date\": \"2024-05-17\", \"price\": 50}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT021\", \"origin\": \"SEA\", \"destination\": \"JFK\", \"date\": \"2024-05-17\", \"price\": 54}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Evelyn\", \"last_name\": \"Taylor\", \"dob\": \"1965-01-16\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Anya\", \"last_name\": \"Silva\", \"dob\": \"1971-11-22\"}], \"payment_history\": [{\"payment_id\": \"credit_card_5832574\", \"amount\": 208}], \"created_at\": \"2024-05-04T23:12:06\", \"total_baggages\": 0, \"nonfree_baggages\": 0, \"insurance\": \"no\", \"status\": null}\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"66EEUA\", \"user_id\": \"emma_kim_", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 5, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 0, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "aa50189e", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T11:55:13"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "raw_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "27#0", "task_desc": "Hello. I'm Ethan Martin, and I'm calling because I'm extremely upset about my flight HAT039 from ATL to SEA being delayed. Can you tell me what's going on and why this flight was delayed in the first place?\nMy user ID is ethan_martin_2396. I don't have the exact flight date on hand right now \u2014 honestly, I'm so frustrated by this whole situation that I didn't think to write it down. Can you pull up my reservation with that ID and the flight number HAT039 from Atlanta to Seattle?\n\nI really need to", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'm sorry to hear about the delay with your flight. To look into this for you, I'll need a bit more information:\n\n1. Your user ID (so I can locate your reservation and profile).\n2. The date of the flight HAT039 you're referring to (in YYYY-MM-DD format).\n\nOnce I have these, I can check the flight status for you. Please note that I can confirm the flight status through our system, but I may not have details on the specific reason for the delay.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"ethan_martin_2396\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Ethan\", \"last_name\": \"Martin\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"157 Willow Lane\", \"address2\": \"Suite 744\", \"city\": \"Dallas\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"TX\", \"zip\": \"75202\"}, \"email\": \"ethan.martin2913@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1963-05-18\", \"payment_methods\": {\"certificate_5449394\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_5449394\", \"amount\": 250.0}, \"gift_card_5853954\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_5853954\", \"amount\": 71.0}, \"certificate_7365778\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_7365778\", \"amount\": 100.0}, \"certificate_2942955\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_2942955\", \"amount\": 100.0}, \"credit_card_5447957\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\":