{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "raw_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "3#1", "task_desc": "Hi, um, I'm really stressed out about my upcoming trip. I need to know exactly how many suitcases my reservation lets me take on the flight. I've got a ton of stuff I have to bring, so it's really important that I get the correct information. I'm pretty sure I'm a Gold member, by the way. Can you help me figure this out?\nOkay, yes, of course. My user ID is anya_garcia_5901. I'm really anxious about this because I have so much to pack and I need to be sure I get the right number. Like I said, I b", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'd be happy to help you figure out your checked baggage allowance. To look up your reservation and determine the exact number of suitcases allowed, I'll need some information first.\n\nCould you please provide your **user ID** (for example, something like \"sara_doe_496\")? Once I have that, I can locate your reservation(s) and check the cabin class and number of passengers to calculate your free checked bag allowance based on your Gold membership.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"anya_garcia_5901\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Anya\", \"last_name\": \"Garcia\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"555 Highland Drive\", \"address2\": \"Suite 243\", \"city\": \"San Antonio\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"TX\", \"zip\": \"78256\"}, \"email\": \"anya.garcia8816@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1992-11-12\", \"payment_methods\": {\"gift_card_2550356\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_2550356\", \"amount\": 149.0}, \"certificate_7583008\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_7583008\", \"amount\": 150.0}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Mei\", \"last_name\": \"Lee\", \"dob\": \"1989-12-13\"}], \"membership\": \"silver\", \"reservations\": [\"82K959\", \"790JYN\", \"BE2L57\", \"CXBB4L\", \"TAMSDK\", \"3RK2T9\", \"VAOW1B\", \"Q4MCUF\", \"JMO1MG\"]}\nassistant: I've pulle