{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "raw_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "13#1", "task_desc": "Hi, I need to make a change to my upcoming return flight. I currently have a one-stop flight booked from Atlanta to Los Angeles, and I'd like to switch it to a nonstop flight from Atlanta to Las Vegas instead. I'm not looking to book anything new, just modify my existing reservation.\nI understand that policy prevents changing the destination on the same reservation, but this change really is necessary for me. Since you're saying the change isn't possible, I'd like to be transferred to someone wh", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I understand you'd like to modify your reservation. However, per our policy, flight modifications cannot change the origin, destination, or trip type of a reservation. Since you'd like to change the destination from Los Angeles (LAX) to Las Vegas (LAS), I'm unable to make this particular change.\n\nIf you'd like to make a different modification that keeps the same origin, destination, and trip type (for example, changing the flight date or cabin class), please provide your user ID and reservation ID, and I'll be happy to assist you.\ntool: Transfer successful\nassistant: YOU ARE BEING TRANSFERRED TO A HUMAN AGENT. PLEASE HOLD ON.", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 1, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 0, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "aa50189e", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T11:55:13"}
