{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "raw_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "15#0", "task_desc": "Hi, I need to change my upcoming flight from Atlanta to Philadelphia. I\u2019d like to shift it to the day after my original travel date, and I\u2019m hoping to find the cheapest regular Economy fare\u2014not Basic Economy. Also, since I live in Princeton, Newark is just as easy for me to get to as Philadelphia, so I\u2019d like to consider flights into EWR as well as PHL. Can you help me look at options?\nSure, my user ID is aarav_garcia_1177. I don\u2019t have my reservation ID on hand right now\u2014hopefully you can pull ", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: To help you modify your flight, I'll need some information first. Could you please provide your **user ID**? \n\nAlso, if you have your **reservation ID** handy, please share that as well. If you don't know it, I can help locate it once I have your user ID.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"aarav_garcia_1177\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Aarav\", \"last_name\": \"Garcia\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"833 Highland Drive\", \"address2\": \"Suite 740\", \"city\": \"Denver\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"CO\", \"zip\": \"80211\"}, \"email\": \"aarav.garcia6639@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1992-09-13\", \"payment_methods\": {\"certificate_7473723\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_7473723\", \"amount\": 150.0}, \"gift_card_8887175\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_8887175\", \"amount\": 35.0}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Lei\", \"last_name\": \"Ito\", \"dob\": \"1990-12-07\"}], \"membership\": \"gold\", \"reservations\": [\"M05KNL\", \"UHDAHF\"]}\nassistant: I found your profile. You have two reservations: **M05KNL** and **UHDAHF**. Let me look at the details of both to find your Atlanta to Philadelphia flight.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"M05KNL\", \"user_id\": \"aarav_garcia_1177\", \"origin\": \"ATL\", \"destinati