{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "raw_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "14#0", "task_desc": "Hello. Could you tell me the total balance on my gift cards and the total balance on my certificates? I\u2019d like to know both amounts, please.\nSure, my user ID is mohamed_silva_9265.\nThank you, that's clear \u2014 $327 total on gift cards and $1,000 total on certificates.\n\nNow I\u2019d like to change my upcoming reservation. I want to keep the same travel dates, but switch it to the cheapest business class round trip available, regardless of whether it\u2019s a direct flight or has connections. Can you help me w", "score": 0.0, "em": 0.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I can help you with that. First, I'll need your user ID to look up your profile and payment methods. Could you please provide your user ID?\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"mohamed_silva_9265\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Mohamed\", \"last_name\": \"Silva\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"638 Elm Street\", \"address2\": \"Suite 548\", \"city\": \"Los Angeles\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"CA\", \"zip\": \"91365\"}, \"email\": \"mohamed.silva9198@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1960-11-26\", \"payment_methods\": {\"credit_card_5843230\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_5843230\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"2395\"}, \"gift_card_8020792\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_8020792\", \"amount\": 198.0}, \"certificate_3765853\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_3765853\", \"amount\": 500.0}, \"gift_card_6136092\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_6136092\", \"amount\": 129.0}, \"certificate_9984806\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_9984806\", \"amount\": 250.0}, \"credit_card_2198526\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_2198526\", \"brand\": \"mastercard\", \"last_four\": \"9363\"}, \"certificate_2765295\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_2765