{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "raw_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "37#0", "task_desc": "Hello, I need to make some changes to my travel plans. I have two upcoming reservations I'd like to cancel, and a third one I want to upgrade to business class.\nSure, my user ID is aarav_ahmed_6699.\nThanks for pulling those up. To confirm what I mentioned earlier: I'd like to cancel **IFOYYZ** and **NQNU5R**, and upgrade **M20IZO** to business class. The reason for the cancellations is just a change of plans on my end.\n\nThat said, I'm a bit confused \u2014 you noted that NQNU5R already departed on Ma", "score": 0.0, "em": 0.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: Hello! I'd be happy to help you with cancelling your reservations and upgrading the third one to business class.\n\nTo get started, I'll need your **user ID** so I can look up your reservations. Could you please provide that?\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"aarav_ahmed_6699\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Aarav\", \"last_name\": \"Ahmed\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"176 Willow Lane\", \"address2\": \"Suite 431\", \"city\": \"Jacksonville\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"FL\", \"zip\": \"32131\"}, \"email\": \"aarav.ahmed6812@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1981-05-26\", \"payment_methods\": {\"credit_card_9074831\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_9074831\", \"brand\": \"mastercard\", \"last_four\": \"7334\"}, \"certificate_9645872\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_9645872\", \"amount\": 250.0}, \"credit_card_4959530\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_4959530\", \"brand\": \"mastercard\", \"last_four\": \"5018\"}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Aarav\", \"last_name\": \"Patel\", \"dob\": \"1980-12-03\"}], \"membership\": \"silver\", \"reservations\": [\"M20IZO\", \"N6F783\", \"IFOYYZ\", \"NQNU5R\"]}\nassistant: Thank you, Aarav. I can see you have 4 reservations in your profile: **M20IZO, N6F783, IFOYYZ, and NQNU5R**