{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "raw_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "33#0", "task_desc": "Hello, I'm Yara Garcia. I have a reservation with the code HXDUBJ. I need to make some changes to my trip \u2014 I\u2019d like to switch my upcoming outgoing flight to a nonstop one, but depart a day later than originally planned. Also, I want to push my return flight from SFO back by one day. Can you help me with that?\nThanks for the options. I do have a time preference though \u2014 I only want flights departing after 8am and before 9pm. So the 7:00am outgoing flight is too early, and the 11:00pm return is t", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'll help you modify your reservation. Let me first look up the details of your reservation to understand your current trip.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"HXDUBJ\", \"user_id\": \"yara_garcia_1905\", \"origin\": \"IAH\", \"destination\": \"SFO\", \"flight_type\": \"round_trip\", \"cabin\": \"economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT085\", \"origin\": \"IAH\", \"destination\": \"JFK\", \"date\": \"2024-05-18\", \"price\": 177}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT023\", \"origin\": \"JFK\", \"destination\": \"SFO\", \"date\": \"2024-05-18\", \"price\": 146}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT278\", \"origin\": \"SFO\", \"destination\": \"IAH\", \"date\": \"2024-05-22\", \"price\": 180}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Yara\", \"last_name\": \"Garcia\", \"dob\": \"1974-08-15\"}], \"payment_history\": [{\"payment_id\": \"gift_card_6941833\", \"amount\": 533}], \"created_at\": \"2024-05-04T06:04:48\", \"total_baggages\": 0, \"nonfree_baggages\": 0, \"insurance\": \"yes\", \"status\": null}\nassistant: I've found your reservation. Let me confirm the details:\n- **User ID:** yara_garcia_1905\n- **Reservation:** HXDUBJ\n- **Trip:** Round trip, IAH \u2192 SFO (one-stop via JFK on 2024-05-18), return SFO \u2192 IAH on 2024-05-22\n- **Cabin:** Economy\n- **Insurance:** Yes\n\nNow let me sear