omy\n- **Flights:**\n  - HAT235: BOS \u2192 MCO on 2024-05-18\n  - HAT298: MCO \u2192 MSP on 2024-05-19\n- **Passengers:** 2 (Chen Lee, Noah Hernandez)\n- **Current total paid:** $498\n\nTo change the cabin to business, I need to check the business-class prices for these flights. Let me look those up.\ntool: [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT013\", \"origin\": \"BOS\", \"destination\": \"MCO\", \"status\": \"available\", \"scheduled_departure_time_est\": \"19:00:00\", \"scheduled_arrival_time_est\": \"22:30:00\", \"date\": null, \"available_seats\": {\"basic_economy\": 0, \"economy\": 5, \"business\": 14}, \"prices\": {\"basic_economy\": 65, \"economy\": 128, \"business\": 338}}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT145\", \"origin\": \"BOS\", \"destination\": \"MCO\", \"status\": \"available\", \"scheduled_departure_time_est\": \"16:00:00\", \"sched", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 5, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 0, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "aa50189e", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T11:55:13"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "raw_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "5#1", "task_desc": "Hello, I'm Mei Brown. I'm a valued Gold member with your airline, and I'm extremely upset right now. My flight HAT045 from Phoenix to Seattle has been delayed, and because of this I'm going to miss a very important meeting. I've been a loyal customer for years, and this kind of disruption is just not acceptable. I need to discuss compensation for the trouble this has caused me.\nMy user ID is mei_brown_7075. As for the exact date of the flight, I'm afraid I don't have that detail in front of me r", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'm sorry to hear about the disruption to your travel plans, Ms. Brown. I'd like to help you with this. Before I can confirm the details and discuss compensation, I need to verify some information.\n\nCould you please provide me with:\n1. Your user ID (e.g., the format like \"mei_brown_xxx\")\n2. The date of your flight HAT045 (Phoenix to Seattle)\n\nThis will allow me to look up your reservation and confirm the flight delay status. Also, just to clarify \u2014 would you like to change or cancel this reservation due to the delay, or are you only seeking compensation at this time?\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"mei_brown_7075\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Mei\", \"last_name\": \"Brown\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"853 Chestnut Street\", \"address2\": \"Suite 497\", \"city\": \"Washington\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"DC\", \"zip\": \"20195\"}, \"email\": \"mei.brown7062@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1986-12-14\", \"payment_methods\": {\"certificate_6761175\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_6761175\", \"amount\": 250.0}, \"gift_card_8987598\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_8987598\", \"amount\": 130.0}, \"credit_card_4920843\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_4920843\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"1663\"}, \"credit_card_181