{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "raw_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "39#0", "task_desc": "Bonjour, I am Amelia Davis. I would like to cancel all of my upcoming flights, s'il vous pla\u00eet. I want to give up my seats for someone else who needs them.\nOui, that is correct. My user ID is amelia_davis_8890. And yes, I want to cancel all my flights because I wish to give up my seat for someone else who has more need, s'il vous pla\u00eet.\nAh, but I want to cancel all of my upcoming flights, not only the two business class ones. The others you list \u2014 UDMOP1, XAZ3C0, and MSJ4OA \u2014 they are also comin", "score": 0.0, "em": 0.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: Hello! I'd be happy to help you cancel your upcoming flights. \n\nTo get started, I'll need your user ID. Could you please provide your user ID? (For example, it might look like \"amelia_davis_123\".)\n\nAlso, just to confirm, you mentioned you'd like to give up your seats for someone else who needs them \u2014 is that the reason for cancellation (i.e., \"other reasons\")?\nassistant: Thank you! Let me look up your profile and reservations.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"amelia_davis_8890\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Amelia\", \"last_name\": \"Davis\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"442 Sunset Drive\", \"address2\": \"Suite 708\", \"city\": \"San Diego\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"CA\", \"zip\": \"92125\"}, \"email\": \"amelia.davis1624@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1984-03-05\", \"payment_methods\": {\"gift_card_7397998\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_7397998\", \"amount\": 74.0}, \"gift_card_1647044\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_1647044\", \"amount\": 236.0}, \"credit_card_4074252\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_4074252\", \"brand\": \"mastercard\", \"last_four\": \"5435\"}, \"credit_card_6738701\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_6738701\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"5308\"}