{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "raw_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "15#1", "task_desc": "Hi, I need to make a change to a flight I have booked. I'm currently flying from Atlanta to Philadelphia, but I'd like to move it to the day after my original travel date. I'm looking for the lowest fare in regular Economy\u2014not Basic Economy. Also, just so you know, I live in Princeton, so Newark is just as easy for me to get to as Philadelphia, so it'd be great if we could consider flights to EWR as well.\nOh, I wasn't aware the destination couldn't be changed \u2014 that's totally fine, I'll stick wi", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: To help you modify your reservation, I'll need some information first.\n\nCould you please provide your **user ID**? \n\nAlso, I should note that per our modification policy, flight changes must keep the same **origin, destination, and trip type** \u2014 so changing the destination from Philadelphia (PHL) to Newark (EWR) would not be permitted. The date change you mentioned (to the day after your original travel date) is allowed, as long as the flight isn't Basic Economy.\n\nIf you'd like, please also share your **reservation ID**. If you don't have it handy, I can help locate it once I have your user ID.\nassistant: Thank you! Let me look up your profile and reservations using your user ID.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"aarav_garcia_1177\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Aarav\", \"last_name\": \"Garcia\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"833 Highland Drive\", \"address2\": \"Suite 740\", \"city\": \"Denver\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"CO\", \"zip\": \"80211\"}, \"email\": \"aarav.garcia6639@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1992-09-13\", \"payment_methods\": {\"certificate_7473723\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_7473723\", \"amount\": 150.0}, \"gift_card_8887175\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_8887175\", \"amount\": 35.0}}, \"saved_passengers\": [