{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "raw_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "2#1", "task_desc": "Hi, I'd like to book a flight from San Francisco to New York. There will be three passengers traveling with me.\nMy name is Noah Muller, and my user ID is noah_muller_9847. As for the trip type, I haven\u2019t actually decided yet \u2014 I just know I need to get from San Francisco to New York with three passengers total.\nOkay, to clarify \u2014 it's 3 passengers total, including myself. Let's just say one-way for now. \n\nActually, wait \u2014 never mind the booking for a second. I'm really frustrated about this dela", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: To get started with your booking, I'll need a few details. \n\nFirst, could you please provide your **user ID**? \n\nAlso, what is the **trip type** \u2014 is this a one-way or round-trip flight?\nassistant: Thank you, Noah. I have your user ID (noah_muller_9847) and the route: San Francisco (SFO) to New York (JFK).\n\nI noticed a small discrepancy in the passenger count \u2014 earlier you mentioned \"three passengers traveling with me,\" but now you said \"three passengers total.\" Could you please confirm: will there be **3 passengers total** (including yourself), or **4 passengers total** (you + 3 others)?\n\nAlso, you mentioned you haven't decided on the trip type yet. Could you let me know whether this is a **one-way** or **round-trip** flight? Once I have that, I can help you find available flights.\nassistant: I'm sorry to hear about the delay \u2014 let's look into that. Let me pull up your account details to find your most recent reservation.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"noah_muller_9847\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Noah\", \"last_name\": \"Muller\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"889 Hillcrest Drive\", \"address2\": \"Suite 254\", \"city\": \"Denver\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"CO\", \"zip\": \"80243\"}, \"email\": \"noah.muller2290@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1963-01-22\", \"payment_methods\": {\"credit_card_1245537\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_1245537\", \"brand\": \"mastercard\", \"last_four\": \"1167\"}, \"credit_card_6040264\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_6040264\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"2076\"}, \"credit_card_3255100\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_3255100\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"2604\"}, \"certificate_8301303\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_8301303\", \"amount\": 100.0}, \"credit_card_3983998\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_3983998\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"8413\"}, \"credit_card_7574394\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_7574394\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"1798\"}, \"credit_ca", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 12, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 0, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "aa50189e", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T11:55:13"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "raw_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "17#1", "task_desc": "Hello, I'm calling about my upcoming trip from New York to Chicago. I need to make a few changes: I'd like to add three checked bags, switch the passenger to myself, and upgrade the booking to economy class.\nSure, my user ID is omar_rossi_1241. I don't have my reservation ID on hand right now \u2014 can you help locate it with that?\nYes, I authorize all three changes \u2014 adding the three checked bags, switching the passenger to me, and upgrading to economy. For the $209 difference, I'd like to use a gi", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: Hello! I'd be happy to help you with those changes. Before I can proceed, I need to collect some information from you.\n\nCould you please provide:\n1. Your **user ID** (e.g., 'sara_doe_496')\n2. Your **reservation ID** (e.g., 'ZFA04Y')\n\nIf you don't know your reservation ID, I can help locate it once you provide your user ID.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"omar_rossi_1241\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Omar\", \"last_name\": \"Rossi\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"901 Pine Lane\", \"address2\": \"Suite 360\", \"city\": \"Houston\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"TX\", \"zip\": \"77271\"}, \"email\": \"omar.rossi5980@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1970-06-06\", \"payment_methods\": {\"gift_card_8190333\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_8190333\", \"amount\": 280.0}, \"credit_card_6754990\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_6754990\", \"brand\": \"mastercard\", \"last_four\": \"3848\"}, \"certificate_8390038\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_8390038\", \"amount\": 150.0}, \"certificate_1778167\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_1778167\", \"amount\": 250.0}, \"gift_card_6490722\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_6490722\", \"amount\": 127.0}, \"credit_card_7407366\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_7407366\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"6437\"}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Liam\", \"last_name\": \"Lee\", \"dob\": \"1989-08-12\"}], \"membership\": \"gold\", \"reservations\": [\"UM3OG5\", \"5RJ7UH\", \"FQ8APE\", \"QKRY03\"]}\nassistant: I found your profile, Omar. You have four reservations: **UM3OG5, 5RJ7UH, FQ8APE, QKRY03**. Let me check the details of each to find the one from New York to Chicago.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"UM3OG5\", \"user_id\": \"omar_rossi_1241\", \"origin\": \"SEA\", \"destination\": \"DFW\", \"flight_type\": \"round_trip\", \"cabin\": \"economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT113\", \"origin\": \"SEA\", \"destination\": \"DFW\", \"date\": \"2024-05-26\", \"price\": 117}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT282\", \"origin\": \"DFW\", \"destination\": \"ATL\", \"date\": \"2024-05-28\", \"", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 9, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 0, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "aa50189e", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T11:55:13"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "raw_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "32#1", "task_desc": "Hello, I have a flight departing from Newark (EWR) on May 21st, and I urgently need to change it to a nonstop flight on the same day. My mother is really sick and I need to get back home as soon as possible to take care of her.\nI'm Ivan Rossi, and my user ID is ivan_rossi_8555. I don't have my reservation ID handy right now \u2014 can you locate it using my user ID?\n###TRANSFER###", "score": 0.0, "em": 0.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'm sorry to hear about your mother. I'll help you change your flight. To get started, I need some information:\n\n1. Your **user ID** (e.g., 'sara_doe_496')\n2. Your **reservation ID** (if you don't know it, I can help locate it using your user ID)\n\nCould you please provide your user ID? If you also have your reservation ID, please share that as well.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"ivan_rossi_8555\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Ivan\", \"last_name\": \"Rossi\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"513 Main Street\", \"address2\": \"Suite 805\", \"city\": \"Philadelphia\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"PA\", \"zip\": \"19102\"}, \"email\": \"ivan.rossi2633@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1954-01-14\", \"payment_methods\": {\"gift_card_7344518\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_7344518\", \"amount\": 183.0}, \"gift_card_9823297\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_9823297\", \"amount\": 224.0}, \"credit_card_9659780\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_9659780\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"1777\"}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Ava\", \"last_name\": \"Silva\", \"dob\": \"1971-01-14\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Anya\", \"last_name\": \"Patel\", \"dob\": \"1990-06-13\"}], \"membership\": \"silver\", \"reservations\": [\"OWZ4XL\", \"F3IQK1\", \"8WMF4C\", \"L2H5FP\"]}\nassistant: I found your profile. You have several reservations: OWZ4XL, F3IQK1, 8WMF4C, and L2H5FP. Let me look up the details to find the one departing from Newark (EWR) on May 21st.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"OWZ4XL\", \"user_id\": \"ivan_rossi_8555\", \"origin\": \"EWR\", \"destination\": \"LAX\", \"flight_type\": \"one_way\", \"cabin\": \"basic_economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT202\", \"origin\": \"EWR\", \"destination\": \"MIA\", \"date\": \"2024-05-21\", \"price\": 94}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT232\", \"origin\": \"MIA\", \"destination\": \"LAX\", \"date\": \"2024-05-21\", \"price\": 80}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Ivan\", \"last_name\": \"Rossi\", \"dob\": \"1954-01-14\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Olivia\", \"last_name\": \"Santos\", \"dob\": \"1984-06-23\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Lei\", \"last_name\": \"J", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 6, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 0, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "aa50189e", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T11:55:13"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "raw_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "16#1", "task_desc": "Hi, I have a flight booked from Atlanta to Philadelphia and I need to change it to the day after my original travel date. I\u2019m looking for the cheapest Economy cabin option, but not Basic Economy. Can you help me with that?\nSure, my user ID is aarav_garcia_1177. I don't have my reservation ID on hand right now, but hopefully you can look it up with that.\nYes, that works for me. The via-LGA itinerary is the cheapest Economy option for the day after my original trip, so please go ahead and switch m", "score": 0.0, "em": 0.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'd be happy to help you change your flight. To get started, I'll need some information:\n\n1. Your **user ID** (e.g., 'sara_doe_496')\n2. Your **reservation ID** (if you don't know it, I can help locate it using your user ID)\n\nCould you please provide your user ID? If you also have your reservation ID handy, that would speed things up.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"aarav_garcia_1177\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Aarav\", \"last_name\": \"Garcia\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"833 Highland Drive\", \"address2\": \"Suite 740\", \"city\": \"Denver\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"CO\", \"zip\": \"80211\"}, \"email\": \"aarav.garcia6639@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1992-09-13\", \"payment_methods\": {\"certificate_7473723\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_7473723\", \"amount\": 150.0}, \"gift_card_8887175\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_8887175\", \"amount\": 35.0}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Lei\", \"last_name\": \"Ito\", \"dob\": \"1990-12-07\"}], \"membership\": \"gold\", \"reservations\": [\"M05KNL\", \"UHDAHF\"]}\nassistant: I found your profile. You have two reservations: **M05KNL** and **UHDAHF**. Let me look up the details of both to find the one from Atlanta (ATL) to Philadelphia (PHL).\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"M05KNL\", \"user_id\": \"aarav_garcia_1177\", \"origin\": \"ATL\", \"destination\": \"PHL\", \"flight_type\": \"one_way\", \"cabin\": \"business\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT227\", \"origin\": \"ATL\", \"destination\": \"ORD\", \"date\": \"2024-05-23\", \"price\": 1936}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT139\", \"origin\": \"ORD\", \"destination\": \"PHL\", \"date\": \"2024-05-23\", \"price\": 851}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Aarav\", \"last_name\": \"Garcia\", \"dob\": \"1992-09-13\"}], \"payment_history\": [{\"payment_id\": \"gift_card_8887175\", \"amount\": 2787}], \"created_at\": \"2024-05-14T06:33:04\", \"total_baggages\": 0, \"nonfree_baggages\": 0, \"insurance\": \"no\", \"status\": null}\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"UHDAHF\", \"user_id\": \"aarav_garcia_1177\", \"origin\": \"CLT\", \"destination\": \"LAX\", \"flight_type\": \"round_trip\",", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 5, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 0, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "aa50189e", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T11:55:13"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "raw_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "31#1", "task_desc": "Hi, sorry, I'm a bit stressed. My cat is very ill and I need to get home earlier to take care of him. I have a flight scheduled from JFK on May 17, but I'd like to change it to a nonstop flight so I can get there sooner. Can you help me with that?\nOh, okay. My user ID is daiki_lee_6144. But I'm sorry, I don't have my reservation ID with me\u2014I don't know what it is. Can you look it up with my user ID?\n###TRANSFER###", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'm sorry to hear about your cat. I'll help you look into changing your flight. \n\nTo get started, I'll need your user ID. Also, if you have your reservation ID handy, please share that as well\u2014if not, I can help locate it once I have your user ID.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"daiki_lee_6144\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Daiki\", \"last_name\": \"Lee\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"410 River Road\", \"address2\": \"Suite 380\", \"city\": \"Fort Worth\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"TX\", \"zip\": \"76173\"}, \"email\": \"daiki.lee6987@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1976-10-08\", \"payment_methods\": {\"credit_card_6198952\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_6198952\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"9734\"}, \"gift_card_3112961\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_3112961\", \"amount\": 51.0}, \"gift_card_5128346\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_5128346\", \"amount\": 262.0}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Raj\", \"last_name\": \"Muller\", \"dob\": \"1967-10-16\"}], \"membership\": \"regular\", \"reservations\": [\"DF89BM\", \"COVE6R\", \"IIHXDG\"]}\nassistant: I found your profile. You have three reservations: DF89BM, COVE6R, and IIHXDG. Let me check the details of each to find the one with your JFK flight on May 17.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"DF89BM\", \"user_id\": \"daiki_lee_6144\", \"origin\": \"JFK\", \"destination\": \"DTW\", \"flight_type\": \"round_trip\", \"cabin\": \"basic_economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT079\", \"origin\": \"JFK\", \"destination\": \"ORD\", \"date\": \"2024-05-17\", \"price\": 63}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT020\", \"origin\": \"ORD\", \"destination\": \"DTW\", \"date\": \"2024-05-17\", \"price\": 78}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT263\", \"origin\": \"DTW\", \"destination\": \"JFK\", \"date\": \"2024-05-24\", \"price\": 53}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Daiki\", \"last_name\": \"Lee\", \"dob\": \"1976-10-08\"}], \"payment_history\": [{\"payment_id\": \"gift_card_3112961\", \"amount\": 194}], \"created_at\": \"2024-05-01T23:25:01\", \"total_baggages\": 0, \"nonfree_baggages\": 0, \"insurance\": \"no\", \"status\": null}\ntool: {\"rese", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 5, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 0, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "aa50189e", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T11:55:13"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "raw_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "6#1", "task_desc": "Hi, I'm calling about a flight I booked for myself and my family. I'm pretty sure I added travel insurance to my own ticket when I made the reservation, but when I look at the booking online, it's not showing up there. Everyone else in my family already has their insurance showing up fine on their flights, so I really need to get this fixed on mine.\nOkay, here's my information: my user ID is sophia_taylor_9065 and the reservation number is PEP4E0. \n\nBut I really need this sorted out properly, no", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'm sorry, but I'm unable to add travel insurance to your ticket at this time. According to our policy, travel insurance cannot be added after the initial booking has been made. This applies to all passengers, including yourself.\n\nIf you believe you did add insurance at the time of booking and it's simply not displaying correctly, I can help look into your reservation to verify the current details. To do that, I'll need your user ID and reservation ID. However, please note that I would not be able to add insurance if it's not already on the reservation.\n\nWould you like me to look up your reservation details to confirm the current insurance status?\nassistant: I understand your frustration, and I'll look into this for you. Let me pull up your reservation details to verify the current status of the travel insurance.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"PEP4E0\", \"user_id\": \"sophia_taylor_9065\", \"origin\": \"CLT\", \"destination\": \"PHX\", \"flight_type\": \"one_way\", \"cabin\": \"basic_economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT176\", \"origin\": \"CLT\", \"destination\": \"DTW\", \"date\": \"2024-05-20\", \"price\": 51}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT097\", \"origin\": \"DTW\", \"destination\": \"PHX\", \"date\": \"2024-05-20\", \"price\": 77}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Sophia\", \"last_name\": \"Taylor\", \"dob\": \"1999-05-27\"}], \"payment_history\": [{\"payment_id\": \"credit_card_9302073\", \"amount\": 128}], \"created_at\": \"2024-05-05T05:10:43\", \"total_baggages\": 0, \"nonfree_baggages\": 0, \"insurance\": \"no\", \"status\": null}\nassistant: I've reviewed your reservation PEP4E0, and I need to clarify a few things based on what's actually in the system:\n\n1. **Travel insurance cannot be added after the initial booking.** Per our policy, insurance can only be selected at the time of booking and cannot be added afterward. I'm not able to add it to your reservation now, and I'm also not able to transfer you to another agent to do so, as this is a fixed policy that applies across all agents.\n\n2.", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 1, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 0, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "aa50189e", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T11:55:13"}
