{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "raw_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "18#0", "task_desc": "Ugh, this is really frustrating. I just ran into some money trouble and I need to downgrade all my business class flights to economy. I don't want to change any of the flights or the passengers, just the cabin class. Can you help me with that?\nYeah, fine. It's omar_davis_3817. Look, I'm already stressed enough about this money situation, so let's just get it done. I need every single one of my business class bookings downgraded to economy \u2014 same flights, same passengers, just the cheaper seats.\n", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I can help you with that. To get started, I'll need your user ID. If you don't know your reservation ID, I can help locate it once I have your user ID.\n\nCould you please provide your user ID?\nassistant: Let me look up your profile and reservations.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"omar_davis_3817\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Omar\", \"last_name\": \"Davis\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"281 Spruce Street\", \"address2\": \"Suite 942\", \"city\": \"San Diego\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"CA\", \"zip\": \"92164\"}, \"email\": \"omar.davis7857@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1982-10-19\", \"payment_methods\": {\"gift_card_3481935\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_3481935\", \"amount\": 22.0}, \"credit_card_2929732\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_2929732\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"7803\"}, \"credit_card_9525117\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_9525117\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"2172\"}, \"gift_card_6847880\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_6847880\", \"amount\": 31.0}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Juan\", \"last_name\": \"Ahmed\", \"dob\": \"1992-11-19\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Anya\", \"last_name\": \"Thomas\", \"dob\": \"1990-10-11\"}], \"membership\": \"regular\", \"reservations\": [\"JG7FMM\", \"LQ940Q\", \"2FBBAH\", \"X7BYG1\", \"EQ1G6C\", \"BOH180\"]}\nassistant: I found your profile with 6 reservations. Let me check the details of each to identify which ones are in business class.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"JG7FMM\", \"user_id\": \"omar_davis_3817\", \"origin\": \"MCO\", \"destination\": \"CLT\", \"flight_type\": \"one_way\", \"cabin\": \"business\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT028\", \"origin\": \"MCO\", \"destination\": \"BOS\", \"date\": \"2024-05-21\", \"price\": 1859}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT277\", \"origin\": \"BOS\", \"destination\": \"CLT\", \"date\": \"2024-05-21\", \"price\": 1679}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Omar\", \"last_name\": \"Davis\", \"dob\": \"1982-10-19\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Fatima\", \"last_name\": \"Patel\", \"dob\": \"1950-05-04\"}], \"payment_history\": [{\"payment_id\": \"credit_card_2929732\"", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 36, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 0, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "aa50189e", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T11:55:13"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "raw_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "27#1", "task_desc": "I'm absolutely fuming right now! My flight HAT039 from Atlanta to Seattle got delayed and no one has given me a straight answer about what's going on. I need to know why this happened, and honestly, I expect the airline to make this right with some kind of compensation for the hassle.\nMy user ID is ethan_martin_2396, but I don't have the exact flight date handy at the moment.\n\nHonestly, I can't believe you're saying you can't even tell me what caused this delay \u2014 I'm a paying passenger and I des", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'm sorry to hear about the delay with your flight HAT039. I'd like to help confirm the details and look into this for you.\n\nTo proceed, I'll need a few pieces of information:\n1. Your **user ID** (so I can locate your reservation and confirm the facts).\n2. The **date** of the flight HAT039 you're referring to (so I can check its status).\n\nRegarding your question about why the delay happened \u2014 I'm only able to access flight status information through my tools, which does not include the specific cause of a delay, so I won't be able to provide that reason.\n\nAlso, just to set expectations: per our policy, compensation for a delayed flight is offered as a certificate (in the amount of $50 per passenger) only when you wish to **change or cancel** the affected reservation, after the facts are confirmed. If you'd like to change or cancel your booking due to the delay, please let me know and I can help with that once I've confirmed your details.\n\nCould you please provide your user ID and the flight date?\nassistant: I understand your frustration, and I want to help as much as I can within what I'm able to access. Let me first look up your profile to locate the reservation with flight HAT039 and confirm the flight details.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"ethan_martin_2396\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Ethan\", \"last_name\": \"Martin\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"157 Willow Lane\", \"address2\": \"Suite 744\", \"city\": \"Dallas\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"TX\", \"zip\": \"75202\"}, \"email\": \"ethan.martin2913@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1963-05-18\", \"payment_methods\": {\"certificate_5449394\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_5449394\", \"amount\": 250.0}, \"gift_card_5853954\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_5853954\", \"amount\": 71.0}, \"certificate_7365778\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_7365778\", \"amount\": 100.0}, \"certificate_2942955\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_2942955\", \"amount\": 100.0}, \"credit_card_5447957\": {\"", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 11, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 0, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "aa50189e", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T11:55:13"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "raw_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "36#1", "task_desc": "I'm... I'm sorry, I can barely speak right now... my wife passed away yesterday. I have a flight booked, reservation EUJUY6... I can't cancel it, I just... I need to move it out two days. Please, I know it's short notice but I can't... I just can't travel as planned.\n###TRANSFER###", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'm so sorry for your loss. Let me look up your reservation to help you.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"EUJUY6\", \"user_id\": \"lucas_brown_4047\", \"origin\": \"ORD\", \"destination\": \"LAS\", \"flight_type\": \"round_trip\", \"cabin\": \"basic_economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT238\", \"origin\": \"ORD\", \"destination\": \"DEN\", \"date\": \"2024-05-14\", \"price\": 96}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT290\", \"origin\": \"DEN\", \"destination\": \"LAS\", \"date\": \"2024-05-14\", \"price\": 64}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT266\", \"origin\": \"LAS\", \"destination\": \"IAH\", \"date\": \"2024-05-16\", \"price\": 70}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT044\", \"origin\": \"IAH\", \"destination\": \"ORD\", \"date\": \"2024-05-16\", \"price\": 76}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Lucas\", \"last_name\": \"Brown\", \"dob\": \"1965-01-01\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Daiki\", \"last_name\": \"Thomas\", \"dob\": \"1996-06-21\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Daiki\", \"last_name\": \"Lopez\", \"dob\": \"1967-04-08\"}], \"payment_history\": [{\"payment_id\": \"gift_card_9049233\", \"amount\": 1008}], \"created_at\": \"2024-05-07T19:04:46\", \"total_baggages\": 0, \"nonfree_baggages\": 0, \"insurance\": \"yes\", \"status\": null}\nassistant: I'm truly sorry for the loss of your wife. I've pulled up your reservation EUJUY6.\n\nI need to share an important policy detail with you: this reservation is booked in **basic economy**, and per our policy, basic economy flights **cannot be modified** \u2014 this includes changing the travel dates. So I'm not able to move these flights out by two days on my end.\n\nHowever, I do see that this reservation includes **travel insurance**. Our travel insurance provides a full refund if a flight is cancelled for health reasons, which would include the passing of a spouse. If you'd like, I can cancel the reservation for a full refund to your original payment method.\n\nSince I'm unable to modify the flights as you've requested, and you've indicated you don't wish to cancel, I'll connect you with a human agent who may be able to explore other options for you.", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 1, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 0, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "aa50189e", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T11:55:13"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "raw_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "22#1", "task_desc": "Hello, I have a trip booked from New York to Chicago and I'd like to make a few changes to it. I want to change the passenger to myself, upgrade to economy, and get 3 checked bags.\nMy user ID is omar_rossi_1241. I don't have the reservation ID handy, so if you could locate it using that, that would be great.\nYes, I approve the changes. I'd like to use my gift card (gift_card_8190333) to pay the $209 for the upgrade.\nPerfect, thank you for your help! ###STOP###", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: To help you modify your reservation, I'll need some information first. Could you please provide your **user ID**? \n\nAlso, if you know your **reservation ID**, please share that as well. If you don't have it, I can help locate it for you once I have your user ID.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"omar_rossi_1241\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Omar\", \"last_name\": \"Rossi\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"901 Pine Lane\", \"address2\": \"Suite 360\", \"city\": \"Houston\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"TX\", \"zip\": \"77271\"}, \"email\": \"omar.rossi5980@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1970-06-06\", \"payment_methods\": {\"gift_card_8190333\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_8190333\", \"amount\": 280.0}, \"credit_card_6754990\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_6754990\", \"brand\": \"mastercard\", \"last_four\": \"3848\"}, \"certificate_8390038\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_8390038\", \"amount\": 150.0}, \"certificate_1778167\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_1778167\", \"amount\": 250.0}, \"gift_card_6490722\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_6490722\", \"amount\": 127.0}, \"credit_card_7407366\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_7407366\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"6437\"}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"