{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "raw_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "28#1", "task_desc": "Hi, I'd like to cancel the flights on my reservation SI5UKW and request a refund, please.\nSure, my user ID is amelia_rossi_1297.\nI understand what the policy says, but I really can't accept that as a final answer. I booked these flights expecting to travel, but my plans changed and I'm stuck with a basic economy fare that apparently has zero flexibility.\n\nI've been a loyal customer of this airline for years \u2014 I fly with you regularly \u2014 and it doesn't seem right that I should lose every penny of ", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'd be happy to help you cancel your reservation and request a refund. \n\nFirst, I need your user ID to proceed. Could you please provide your user ID?\nassistant: Thank you. Let me look up your reservation and user details.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"SI5UKW\", \"user_id\": \"amelia_rossi_1297\", \"origin\": \"MIA\", \"destination\": \"PHX\", \"flight_type\": \"one_way\", \"cabin\": \"basic_economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT062\", \"origin\": \"MIA\", \"destination\": \"LAS\", \"date\": \"2024-05-16\", \"price\": 67}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT284\", \"origin\": \"LAS\", \"destination\": \"PHX\", \"date\": \"2024-05-17\", \"price\": 57}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Amelia\", \"last_name\": \"Rossi\", \"dob\": \"1960-01-19\"}], \"payment_history\": [{\"payment_id\": \"credit_card_4579924\", \"amount\": 124}], \"created_at\": \"2024-05-11T00:08:57\", \"total_baggages\": 0, \"nonfree_baggages\": 0, \"insurance\": \"no\", \"status\": null}\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"amelia_rossi_1297\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Amelia\", \"last_name\": \"Rossi\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"747 Maple Drive\", \"address2\": \"Suite 422\", \"city\": \"Indianapolis\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"IN\", \"zip\": \"46256\"}, \"email\": \"amelia.rossi3096@example.com\