ry\n- **Return (May 22):** HAT278 (SFO\u2192IAH)\n- **Passenger:** Yara Garcia\n- **Insurance:** Yes\n\nTo proceed, I'll search for a nonstop flight from IAH to SFO departing the next day (May 19), and a return flight from SFO to IAH pushed back one day (May 23).\ntool: [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT072\", \"origin\": \"IAH\", \"destination\": \"SFO\", \"status\": \"available\", \"scheduled_departure_time_est\": \"09:00:00\", \"scheduled_arrival_time_est\": \"13:00:00\", \"date\": null, \"available_seats\": {\"basic_economy\": 18, \"economy\": 9, \"business\": 9}, \"prices\": {\"basic_economy\": 68, \"economy\": 130, \"business\": 282}}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT180\", \"origin\": \"IAH\", \"destination\": \"SFO\", \"status\": \"available\", \"scheduled_departure_time_est\": \"07:00:00\", \"scheduled_arrival_time_est\": \"11:00:00\", \"date\": null, \"available_s", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 8, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 0, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "aa50189e", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T11:55:13"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "raw_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "35#1", "task_desc": "Hello, this is Aarav Ahmed. I have a flight booked from JFK to MCO on May 22 that I need to cancel. Since I'm a silver member, I'm supposed to get a full refund. Could you take care of that for me?\nSure, my user ID is aarav_ahmed_6699. The reason for cancellation is just a change of plans \u2014 I no longer need to fly from JFK to MCO on May 22. And just to be clear, as a silver member I should be getting a full refund on this cancellation.\nI really must insist on this. Being a silver member means I'", "score": 0.0, "em": 0.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: Hello Aarav! I'd be happy to help you with the cancellation. To proceed, I'll need a few details:\n\n1. Your **user ID** (e.g., something like 'aarav_ahmed_123').\n2. Your **reservation ID** \u2014 if you don't have it handy, I can help locate it once I have your user ID.\n3. The **reason for cancellation** (change of plan, airline cancelled flight, or other reasons).\n\nCould you please provide your user ID and the reason for cancellation?\nassistant: Thank you! Let me look up your reservations to locate the booking.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"aarav_ahmed_6699\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Aarav\", \"last_name\": \"Ahmed\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"176 Willow Lane\", \"address2\": \"Suite 431\", \"city\": \"Jacksonville\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"FL\", \"zip\": \"32131\"}, \"email\": \"aarav.ahmed6812@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1981-05-26\", \"payment_methods\": {\"credit_card_9074831\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_9074831\", \"brand\": \"mastercard\", \"last_four\": \"7334\"}, \"certificate_9645872\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_9645872\", \"amount\": 250.0}, \"credit_card_4959530\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_4959530\", \"brand\": \"mastercard\", \"last_four\": \"5018\"}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Aarav\", \"last_name\": \"Patel\", \"dob\": \"1980-12-03\"}], \"membership\": \"silver\", \"reservations\": [\"M20IZO\", \"N6F783\", \"IFOYYZ\", \"NQNU5R\"]}\nassistant: I found your profile (silver member, confirmed). You have several reservations. Let me check each to find the JFK \u2192 MCO flight on May 22.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"M20IZO\", \"user_id\": \"aarav_ahmed_6699\", \"origin\": \"JFK\", \"destination\": \"MCO\", \"flight_type\": \"one_way\", \"cabin\": \"economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT268\", \"origin\": \"JFK\", \"destination\": \"ATL\", \"date\": \"2024-05-22\", \"price\": 136}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT010\", \"origin\": \"ATL\", \"destination\": \"MCO\", \"date\": \"2024-05-22\", \"price\": 109}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Aarav\", \"last_name\": \"Ahmed\", \"dob\": \"1981-05-26\"}, {", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 6, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 0, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "aa50189e", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T11:55:13"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "raw_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "24#1", "task_desc": "Hi, I'm Mia Kim. I need some help with my travel plans. First, I have an existing reservation and I need to take a passenger off of it. Also, I'm hoping to book a round-trip flight from New York out to the West Coast. Can you assist with those?\nOkay, I understand you can't remove a passenger. Since changing the reservation isn't possible, I'd like you to go ahead and cancel my entire reservation **H9ZU1C** \u2014 that's the one with Ethan on it \u2014 so I can rebook myself later.\n\nNow for the new booking", "score": 0.0, "em": 0.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: Hello Mia Kim! I can help with your requests, but let me clarify a couple of things:\n\n**Regarding removing a passenger from your existing reservation:** I'm sorry, but per our policy, the number of passengers on a reservation cannot be modified \u2014 even a human agent is unable to add or remove passengers from a booking. I won't be able to take a passenger off your existing reservation.\n\n**Regarding booking a new round-trip flight from New York to the West Coast:** I'd be happy to help with this! To get started, I'll need some information from you:\n\n1. **Your user ID** (e.g., the format looks like `firstname_lastname_123`).\n2. **Origin airport** \u2014 New York has several (JFK, LGA, EWR). Which one would you like to depart from?\n3. **Destination airport** \u2014 The West Coast has several options (e.g., LAX, SFO, SEA). Which city/airport would you like to fly to?\n4. **Cabin class** \u2014 basic economy, economy, or business?\n5. **Passenger details** \u2014 for each passenger: first name, last name, and date of birth. (A reservation can have at most 5 passengers, and they all must fly the same flights in the same cabin.)\n6. **Payment method(s)** \u2014 these must already be on file in your user profile (credit card, gift card, and/or travel certificate).\n7. **Travel dates** for the outbound and return flights.\n8. **Checked bags** \u2014 how many (if any) you'd like to add beyond your free allowance.\n9. **Travel insurance** \u2014 would you like to purchase it ($30 per passenger, enables full refund for cancellation due to health or weather reasons)?\n\nPlease provide your user ID and the details above, and I'll assist you with the booking.\nassistant: I'll help you with both tasks. Let me start by reviewing your existing reservation **H9ZU1C** to verify the cancellation can be processed, and I'll also need your user profile details for the new booking. Let me first pull up the reservation details.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"H9ZU1C\", \"user_id\": \"mia_kim_439", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 17, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 0, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "aa50189e", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T11:55:13"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "raw_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "37#1", "task_desc": "Hi, I need some help with my bookings. I have a few upcoming reservations I need to make changes to \u2014 I'd like to cancel two of them and upgrade another one to business class.\nSure, my user ID is aarav_ahmed_6699.\nOkay, got it. So the two I want to cancel are **IFOYYZ** and **NQNU5R**. And the one I'd like to upgrade to business is **M20IZO**.\n\nFor the cancellation reasons \u2014 it's just a change of plans for both; my personal schedule shifted and I won't be able to take those trips.\n\nI saw your no", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'd be happy to help you with your reservations. To get started, I'll need your user ID so I can look up your bookings. Could you please provide your user ID?\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"aarav_ahmed_6699\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Aarav\", \"last_name\": \"Ahmed\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"176 Willow Lane\", \"address2\": \"Suite 431\", \"city\": \"Jacksonville\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"FL\", \"zip\": \"32131\"}, \"email\": \"aarav.ahmed6812@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1981-05-26\", \"payment_methods\": {\"credit_card_9074831\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_9074831\", \"brand\": \"mastercard\", \"last_four\": \"7334\"}, \"certificate_9645872\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_9645872\", \"amount\": 250.0}, \"credit_card_4959530\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_4959530\", \"brand\": \"mastercard\", \"last_four\": \"5018\"}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Aarav\", \"last_name\": \"Patel\", \"dob\": \"1980-12-03\"}], \"membership\": \"silver\", \"reservations\": [\"M20IZO\", \"N6F783\", \"IFOYYZ\", \"NQNU5R\"]}\nassistant: Thank you. I can see you have 4 reservations: M20IZO, N6F783, IFOYYZ, and NQNU5R. Let me review the details of each one. I'll start by looking them up one at a time.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"M20IZO\", \"user_id\": \"aarav_ahmed_6699\", \"origin\": \"JFK\", \"destination\": \"MCO\", \"flight_type\": \"one_way\", \"cabin\": \"economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT268\", \"origin\": \"JFK\", \"destination\": \"ATL\", \"date\": \"2024-05-22\", \"price\": 136}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT010\", \"origin\": \"ATL\", \"destination\": \"MCO\", \"date\": \"2024-05-22\", \"price\": 109}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Aarav\", \"last_name\": \"Ahmed\", \"dob\": \"1981-05-26\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Daiki\", \"last_name\": \"Li\", \"dob\": \"1980-12-24\"}], \"payment_history\": [{\"payment_id\": \"credit_card_4959530\", \"amount\": 490}], \"created_at\": \"2024-05-12T09:36:29\", \"total_baggages\": 1, \"nonfree_baggages\": 0, \"insurance\": \"no\", \"status\": null}\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"N6F783\", \"user_id\": \"aarav_ahmed_6699\", \"or", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 10, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 0, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "aa50189e", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T11:55:13"}
