{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "raw_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "23#1", "task_desc": "Hello, this is Mohamed Silva. I have a couple of things I need help with today. First, I\u2019d like to know the total combined balance on all of my gift cards and also the sum of my travel certificate balances. Second, I need to change my recent reservation to the cheapest business class round trip available, but I want to keep the exact same travel dates. Could you help me with both of those?\nSure, my user ID is mohamed_silva_9265. Once you pull up my account, you should be able to see the gift car", "score": 0.0, "em": 0.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: Hello Mohamed! I'd be happy to help with both of those requests.\n\nTo get started, I'll need your **user ID** (for example, something like `mohamed_silva_123`). This will let me look up your profile to find your gift card and travel certificate balances, as well as locate your recent reservation.\n\nCould you please provide your user ID?\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"mohamed_silva_9265\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Mohamed\", \"last_name\": \"Silva\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"638 Elm Street\", \"address2\": \"Suite 548\", \"city\": \"Los Angeles\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"CA\", \"zip\": \"91365\"}, \"email\": \"mohamed.silva9198@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1960-11-26\", \"payment_methods\": {\"credit_card_5843230\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_5843230\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"2395\"}, \"gift_card_8020792\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_8020792\", \"amount\": 198.0}, \"certificate_3765853\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_3765853\", \"amount\": 500.0}, \"gift_card_6136092\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_6136092\", \"amount\": 129.0}, \"certificate_9984806\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_9984806\", \"amount\": 250.0}, \"credit_card_2198526\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_2198526\", \"brand\": \"mastercard\", \"last_four\": \"9363\"}, \"certificate_2765295\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_2765295\", \"amount\": 250.0}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Raj\", \"last_name\": \"Sanchez\", \"dob\": \"1986-09-12\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Liam\", \"last_name\": \"Wilson\", \"dob\": \"1980-03-27\"}], \"membership\": \"regular\", \"reservations\": [\"K1NW8N\"]}\nassistant: Thank you! I've pulled up your account. Let me calculate your balances and review your reservation.\ntool: 327.0\ntool: 1000.0\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"K1NW8N\", \"user_id\": \"mohamed_silva_9265\", \"origin\": \"JFK\", \"destination\": \"SFO\", \"flight_type\": \"round_trip\", \"cabin\": \"basic_economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT023\", \"origin\": \"JFK\", \"destination\": \"", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 17, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 0, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "aa50189e", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T11:55:13"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "raw_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "13#0", "task_desc": "Hello, I need to make a change to an existing flight reservation I have. I've got an upcoming trip from Atlanta to Los Angeles that has a stop, and I'd like to switch it to a nonstop flight from Atlanta to Las Vegas instead. I'm not looking to book anything new, just modify the flight I already have.\nI understand what you're saying about the policy, but I was specifically told I could change this reservation to a nonstop from ATL to LAS. Since you're saying that change isn't possible, I'd like t", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I can help you look into modifying your reservation. However, I need to let you know about an important policy limitation first:\n\nPer our modification policy, when changing flights, the **origin, destination, and trip type cannot be changed**. This means I would not be able to change your trip from Atlanta \u2192 Los Angeles to Atlanta \u2192 Las Vegas, since that changes the destination. I can only help you modify flights while keeping the same origin (Atlanta) and destination (Los Angeles), or change dates/times/cabin within that same route.\n\nTo proceed with any allowed modification, I'll need a few details from you:\n\n1. **Your user ID** (e.g., something like `sara_doe_496`)\n2. **Your reservation ID** (if you don't have it handy, I can help locate it once I have your user ID)\n\nWould you like me to help locate your reservation, or do you have the reservation ID available? And please note that if you'd like to fly to Las Vegas instead of Los Angeles, that would require canceling the current reservation and booking a new one (subject to cancellation eligibility rules).", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 0, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 1, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "aa50189e", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T12:11:06"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "raw_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "3#0", "task_desc": "Hi, I'm Anya. I've got an upcoming flight and honestly I'm pretty stressed out about it\u2014I have a ton of stuff I need to bring along. It's really important to me that I get the exact allowance right. Could you help me find out how many suitcases my reservation lets me take?\nSure, yes\u2014my user ID is anya_garcia_5901. I'm really stressed about this trip, so I appreciate you helping me get it right. I also have my confirmation number handy if you need it: JMO1MG. And just so you know, I'm pretty sure", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: Hi Anya! I'd be happy to help you figure out your baggage allowance. To look up your reservation, I'll need your user ID first. Could you please provide your user ID?\nassistant: Thank you, Anya! Let me look up your reservation and profile details.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"JMO1MG\", \"user_id\": \"anya_garcia_5901\", \"origin\": \"DEN\", \"destination\": \"MIA\", \"flight_type\": \"one_way\", \"cabin\": \"economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT255\", \"origin\": \"DEN\", \"destination\": \"MIA\", \"date\": \"2024-05-16\", \"price\": 149}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Anya\", \"last_name\": \"Garcia\", \"dob\": \"1992-11-12\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Raj\", \"last_name\": \"Jackson\", \"dob\": \"1956-03-09\"}], \"payment_history\": [{\"payment_id\": \"gift_card_2550356\", \"amount\": 358}], \"created_at\": \"2024-05-13T23:20:29\", \"total_baggages\": 1, \"nonfree_baggages\": 0, \"insurance\": \"yes\", \"status\": null}\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"anya_garcia_5901\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Anya\", \"last_name\": \"Garcia\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"555 Highland Drive\", \"address2\": \"Suite 243\", \"city\": \"San Antonio\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"TX\", \"zip\": \"78256\"}, \"email\": \"anya.garcia8816@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1992-11-12\", \"p