{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "raw_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "31#0", "task_desc": "Hi, I'm calling because I need to change my upcoming flight. My cat is really sick and I have to get back home sooner to take care of him. I have a flight out of JFK on May 17, and I'd like to change it to a nonstop flight if possible.\nOh, I'm Daiki Lee. My user ID is daiki_lee_6144. I'm sorry, but I don't have my reservation ID with me \u2014 I don't know what it is. Can you look that up for me?\n###TRANSFER###", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'm sorry to hear about your cat. I'll help you change your flight. \n\nTo get started, I'll need your user ID. Also, if you have your reservation ID handy, please share that as well. If you don't know your reservation ID, I can help locate it once I have your user ID.\nassistant: Let me look up your profile and reservations.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"daiki_lee_6144\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Daiki\", \"last_name\": \"Lee\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"410 River Road\", \"address2\": \"Suite 380\", \"city\": \"Fort Worth\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"TX\", \"zip\": \"76173\"}, \"email\": \"daiki.lee6987@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1976-10-08\", \"payment_methods\": {\"credit_card_6198952\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_6198952\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"9734\"}, \"gift_card_3112961\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_3112961\", \"amount\": 51.0}, \"gift_card_5128346\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_5128346\", \"amount\": 262.0}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Raj\", \"last_name\": \"Muller\", \"dob\": \"1967-10-16\"}], \"membership\": \"regular\", \"reservations\": [\"DF89BM\", \"COVE6R\", \"IIHXDG\"]}\nassistant: I found your profile. You have three reservations: DF89BM, COVE6R, and IIHXDG. Let me check the details of each to find the one with a flight out of JFK on May 17.\ntool: 