{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "raw_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "1#0", "task_desc": "Hello, my name is Raj Sanchez. I recently spoke with a customer support representative on the phone who told me that a service agent would be able to help me cancel my reservation. I\u2019d like to cancel my trip from Philadelphia to LaGuardia.\nSure, my user ID is raj_sanchez_7340.\nIt\u2019s just a change of plan on my end.\n###TRANSFER###", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: Hello Raj! I'd be happy to help you cancel your reservation from Philadelphia (PHL) to LaGuardia (LGA).\n\nTo get started, I'll need your user ID. Could you please provide it? If you don't know your reservation ID, I can help locate it once I have your user ID.\nassistant: Thank you! Let me look up your account details to locate your reservation.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"raj_sanchez_7340\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Raj\", \"last_name\": \"Sanchez\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"794 Sunset Drive\", \"address2\": \"Suite 598\", \"city\": \"Charlotte\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"NC\", \"zip\": \"28271\"}, \"email\": \"raj.sanchez1048@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1965-09-13\", \"payment_methods\": {\"credit_card_7891819\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_7891819\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"4388\"}, \"gift_card_4964153\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_4964153\", \"amount\": 163.0}, \"gift_card_3226531\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_3226531\", \"amount\": 50.0}, \"certificate_4594761\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_4594761\", \"amount\": 150.0}, \"gift_card_1591784\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_1591784\", \"amount\": 57.0}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Olivia\", \"last_name\": \"Taylor\", \"dob\": \"1976-06-27\"}], \"membership\": \"silver\", \"reservations\": [\"MZDDS4\", \"60RX9E\", \"S5IK51\", \"OUEA45\", \"Q69X3