{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "raw_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "16#0", "task_desc": "Hi, I have a reservation from Atlanta to Philadelphia that I need to change. I\u2019d like to move it to the day after my original flight date, and I\u2019m looking for the cheapest option in regular Economy cabin\u2014not Basic Economy.\nSure, my user ID is aarav_garcia_1177. I don\u2019t have my reservation ID in front of me right now, but hopefully you can pull up the booking with that.\nYes, that works perfectly for me. The $207 regular Economy option on the 24th is exactly what I was looking for, and I'm happy w", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: To help you modify your reservation, I'll need some information first. Could you please provide your **user ID**? \n\nAlso, if you know your **reservation ID**, please share that as well. If you don't have it handy, I can help locate it once I have your user ID.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"aarav_garcia_1177\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Aarav\", \"last_name\": \"Garcia\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"833 Highland Drive\", \"address2\": \"Suite 740\", \"city\": \"Denver\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"CO\", \"zip\": \"80211\"}, \"email\": \"aarav.garcia6639@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1992-09-13\", \"payment_methods\": {\"certificate_7473723\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_7473723\", \"amount\": 150.0}, \"gift_card_8887175\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_8887175\", \"amount\": 35.0}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Lei\", \"last_name\": \"Ito\", \"dob\": \"1990-12-07\"}], \"membership\": \"gold\", \"reservations\": [\"M05KNL\", \"UHDAHF\"]}\nassistant: I found your profile. You have two reservations: **M05KNL** and **UHDAHF**. Let me check the details of both to find the one from Atlanta (ATL) to Philadelphia (PHL).\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"M05KNL\", \"user_id\": \"aarav_garcia_1177\", \"origin\": \"ATL\", \"de