{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "raw_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "25#0", "task_desc": "Hello, I'd like to book a flight for my friend. It needs to be exactly the same as the reservation I already have with you. Also, I\u2019m hoping to use my travel certificate for this and wanted to check how much of its balance would be left after the booking.\nSure, my user ID is ivan_muller_7015.\nThanks for pulling that up. So for my friend:\n\n- His name is Ivan Smith, and he's already listed in my user profile, so you should be able to grab his date of birth from there \u2014 I don't have it memorized at", "score": 0.0, "em": 0.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: To help you book a flight that matches your existing reservation, I'll first need some information.\n\nCould you please provide your **user ID**? Once I have that, I can look up your existing reservation to see its details.\n\nAlso, please note that per our policy, all payment methods (including your travel certificate) must already be in your user profile, and I'll need to confirm the booking details with you before making any changes.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"ivan_muller_7015\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Ivan\", \"last_name\": \"Muller\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"256 Pine Lane\", \"address2\": \"Suite 661\", \"city\": \"New York\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"NY\", \"zip\": \"10029\"}, \"email\": \"ivan.muller6623@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1968-04-25\", \"payment_methods\": {\"certificate_8998287\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_8998287\", \"amount\": 500.0}, \"credit_card_3563913\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_3563913\", \"brand\": \"mastercard\", \"last_four\": \"6710\"}, \"gift_card_8516878\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_8516878\", \"amount\": 128.0}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Ivan\", \"last_name\": \"Smith\", \"dob\": \"1986-03-14\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Lucas\", \"last_name\":