{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "raw_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "5#0", "task_desc": "Hello, I'm Mei Brown. I'm a valued Gold member with your airline, and I'm calling about my delayed flight HAT045 from Phoenix to Seattle. I'm extremely upset because this delay is going to cause me to miss a very important meeting. I need to talk about what you're going to do for me.\nI can give you my user ID \u2014 it's mei_brown_7075. I'm sorry, I don't have my reservation ID handy right now, and I'm not sure of the exact date of the flight off the top of my head, but it's the HAT045 from Phoenix t", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'm sorry to hear about the delay with your flight. To assist you and verify the details, I'll need some information first.\n\nCould you please provide me with:\n1. Your user ID (e.g., the format like \"mei_brown_123\")\n2. Your reservation ID (if you have it)\n3. The date of flight HAT045\n\nThis will allow me to confirm your Gold membership, the flight delay status, and the reservation details before we discuss any options available to you.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"mei_brown_7075\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Mei\", \"last_name\": \"Brown\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"853 Chestnut Street\", \"address2\": \"Suite 497\", \"city\": \"Washington\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"DC\", \"zip\": \"20195\"}, \"email\": \"mei.brown7062@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1986-12-14\", \"payment_methods\": {\"certificate_6761175\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_6761175\", \"amount\": 250.0}, \"gift_card_8987598\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_8987598\", \"amount\": 130.0}, \"credit_card_4920843\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_4920843\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"1663\"}, \"credit_card_1815425\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_1815425\", \"brand\": \"mastercard\", \"last_four\": \"9812\"}, \"certifica