{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "raw_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "4#0", "task_desc": "I'm absolutely furious right now. I had a business flight earlier this month that got canceled on me, and because of that I ended up missing a really important meeting. This whole situation caused me a ton of inconvenience, and I expect to be compensated for it.\nThis is Sophia Silva, and my user ID is sophia_silva_7557. I already told you I had a business flight canceled earlier this month and missed a critical meeting because of it \u2014 I don't understand why this keeps happening to me. I want to ", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'm sorry to hear about the inconvenience caused by the canceled flight. To confirm the facts and assist you with compensation, I'll need to look up your reservation details.\n\nCould you please provide your user ID?\nassistant: Thank you, Sophia. Let me look up your profile and reservations to confirm the details.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"sophia_silva_7557\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Sophia\", \"last_name\": \"Silva\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"141 Cedar Avenue\", \"address2\": \"Suite 436\", \"city\": \"Columbus\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"OH\", \"zip\": \"43282\"}, \"email\": \"sophia.silva5929@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1957-10-05\", \"payment_methods\": {\"certificate_8045380\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_8045380\", \"amount\": 500.0}, \"certificate_3887113\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_3887113\", \"amount\": 150.0}, \"credit_card_4196779\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_4196779\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"7238\"}, \"gift_card_5094406\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_5094406\", \"amount\": 274.0}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Yara\", \"last_name\": \"Silva\", \"dob\": \"1972-06-16\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Isabella\", \"last_name\": \"Moore\", \"dob\": \