{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "raw_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "18#0", "task_desc": "Look, I'm dealing with some money troubles right now and I need to sort this out fast. I've got business class bookings that I can no longer afford \u2014 I want to downgrade all of them to economy. And just to be clear, I'm not changing any of the flights themselves or the passenger names, just the cabin class on every reservation I have. This is really frustrating but I'll work with you on it.\nYeah, fine. My user ID is omar_davis_3817. Look, I already told you I'm in a tight spot financially and I ", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I understand you'd like to downgrade all of your business class reservations to economy, keeping the flights and passenger details unchanged. \n\nTo help locate your reservations and proceed, I'll need your **user ID** first (for example, something like \"sara_doe_496\"). Could you please provide that?\nassistant: Thank you. Let me look up your profile and reservations.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"omar_davis_3817\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Omar\", \"last_name\": \"Davis\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"281 Spruce Street\", \"address2\": \"Suite 942\", \"city\": \"San Diego\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"CA\", \"zip\": \"92164\"}, \"email\": \"omar.davis7857@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1982-10-19\", \"payment_methods\": {\"gift_card_3481935\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_3481935\", \"amount\": 22.0}, \"credit_card_2929732\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_2929732\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"7803\"}, \"credit_card_9525117\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_9525117\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"2172\"}, \"gift_card_6847880\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_6847880\", \"amount\": 31.0}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Juan\", \"last_name\": \"Ahmed\", \"dob\": \"1992-11-19