{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "raw_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "4#1", "task_desc": "I'm absolutely furious right now. I had a business flight earlier this month that got canceled on me, and because of that I ended up missing a really important meeting. I expect to be compensated for the inconvenience and for that missed meeting \u2014 this is completely unacceptable.\nIt's sophia_silva_7557. But honestly, I don't see why I should have to jump through hoops here \u2014 your airline canceled my flight, I missed a critical business meeting because of it, and I want to be compensated for both", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'm sorry to hear about your experience. I'd like to help look into this and confirm the details. To do so, I'll need your user ID so I can locate your reservation and verify the facts.\n\nCould you please provide your user ID?\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"sophia_silva_7557\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Sophia\", \"last_name\": \"Silva\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"141 Cedar Avenue\", \"address2\": \"Suite 436\", \"city\": \"Columbus\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"OH\", \"zip\": \"43282\"}, \"email\": \"sophia.silva5929@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1957-10-05\", \"payment_methods\": {\"certificate_8045380\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_8045380\", \"amount\": 500.0}, \"certificate_3887113\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_3887113\", \"amount\": 150.0}, \"credit_card_4196779\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_4196779\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"7238\"}, \"gift_card_5094406\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_5094406\", \"amount\": 274.0}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Yara\", \"last_name\": \"Silva\", \"dob\": \"1972-06-16\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Isabella\", \"last_name\": \"Moore\", \"dob\": \"1988-06-04\"}], \"membership\": \"regular\", \"reservations\": [\"NM1VX1\", \"KC18K6\", \"S61CZX\", \"H8Q05L\", \"WUNA5K\"]}\nassistant: Thank you. I can see you're a regular member with several reservations. Let me look into your reservations to confirm the cancelled business flight. I'll check them one by one.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"NM1VX1\", \"user_id\": \"sophia_silva_7557\", \"origin\": \"MSP\", \"destination\": \"EWR\", \"flight_type\": \"round_trip\", \"cabin\": \"basic_economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT300\", \"origin\": \"MSP\", \"destination\": \"EWR\", \"date\": \"2024-05-25\", \"price\": 100}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT208\", \"origin\": \"EWR\", \"destination\": \"MSP\", \"date\": \"2024-05-27\", \"price\": 53}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Yara\", \"last_name\": \"Silva\", \"dob\": \"1972-06-16\"}], \"payment_history\": [{\"payment_id\": \"gift_card_5094406\", \"amount\": 183}], \"created_at\": \"2024-05-03T08", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 9, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 1, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "aa50189e", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T12:11:06"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "raw_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "13#1", "task_desc": "Hello, I'm James Lee. I have an existing reservation under the name James Lee, confirmation number XEWRD9. I need to make a change to my upcoming return flight \u2014 right now I have a one-stop flight from ATL to LAX, but I'd like to change it to a nonstop flight from ATL to LAS instead. I'm not looking to book a new ticket, just modify this existing reservation.\nThanks, my user ID is james_lee_6136. \n\nBut since you're saying this specific change \u2014 from my one-stop ATL to LAX return over to a nonsto", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: Hello James. Before I can assist with any modification, I need to obtain your user ID (the system ID associated with your profile, such as \"james_lee_123\").\n\nAdditionally, I need to inform you about a policy limitation regarding your requested change: per the airline's modification policy, a reservation can be modified **without changing the origin, destination, and trip type**. Since your request would change the destination from LAX to LAS, this specific change is not permitted under the modification rules.\n\nCould you please provide your user ID so I can look up your reservation and confirm the details? If you'd like, I can also help you explore other options that are within policy (for example, keeping the same ATL\u2192LAX route but changing to a nonstop flight, if available, or discussing cancellation and rebooking).\ntool: Transfer successful\nassistant: YOU ARE BEING TRANSFERRED TO A HUMAN AGENT. PLEASE HOLD ON.", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 1, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 1, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "aa50189e", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T12:11:06"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "raw_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "8#1", "task_desc": "Hello, I'd like to book a one-way flight from Chicago to Philadelphia on May 26. I actually flew that same route on May 10 and I want to book the exact same flight I was on back then.\nSure, my user ID is sophia_silva_7557. I flew from ORD to PHL on May 10 and I'd like to book that exact same flight again for May 26, just one-way.\nGreat, that flight works for me. \n\nFor passengers: I'm Sophia Silva (same as the original booking, and my date of birth is already in my user profile so I'd rather not ", "score": 0.0, "em": 0.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: To help you book this flight, I'll first need your user ID so I can look up your previous reservation from May 10. Could you please provide your user ID?\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"sophia_silva_7557\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Sophia\", \"last_name\": \"Silva\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"141 Cedar Avenue\", \"address2\": \"Suite 436\", \"city\": \"Columbus\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"OH\", \"zip\": \"43282\"}, \"email\": \"sophia.silva5929@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1957-10-05\", \"payment_methods\": {\"certificate_8045380\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_8045380\", \"amount\": 500.0}, \"certificate_3887113\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_3887113\", \"amount\": 150.0}, \"credit_card_4196779\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_4196779\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"7238\"}, \"gift_card_5094406\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_5094406\", \"amount\": 274.0}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Yara\", \"last_name\": \"Silva\", \"dob\": \"1972-06-16\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Isabella\", \"last_name\": \"Moore\", \"dob\": \"1988-06-04\"}], \"membership\": \"regular\", \"reservations\": [\"NM1VX1\", \"KC18K6\", \"S61CZX\", \"H8Q05L\", \"WUNA5K\"]}\nassistant: I found your profile. Now l