{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "raw_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "21#0", "task_desc": "Hi, I need to change the return flight for my Houston to Denver trip. This is urgent and I need to get it done ASAP.\nYes, my user ID is sofia_kim_7287.\nI need the return flight to be on May 27, same day as my departure. I want the fastest return trip possible including any stopover time. I'm not great with math or figuring out routes, so can you just pick the fastest routing for me? This is urgent, so please do it ASAP.\nYes, please go ahead and make that change to the fastest return option. For ", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I can help you with that. To get started, I'll need your user ID. If you don't know your reservation ID, I can help locate it once I have your user ID.\n\nCould you please provide your user ID?\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"sofia_kim_7287\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Sofia\", \"last_name\": \"Kim\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"825 Laurel Lane\", \"address2\": \"Suite 595\", \"city\": \"Houston\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"TX\", \"zip\": \"77243\"}, \"email\": \"sofia.kim1937@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1950-06-24\", \"payment_methods\": {\"certificate_8544743\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_8544743\", \"amount\": 250.0}, \"credit_card_9879898\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_9879898\", \"brand\": \"mastercard\", \"last_four\": \"9725\"}, \"gift_card_7091239\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_7091239\", \"amount\": 157.0}, \"gift_card_6276644\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_6276644\", \"amount\": 113.0}, \"gift_card_7480005\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_7480005\", \"amount\": 6.0}, \"certificate_9932251\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_9932251\", \"amount\": 250.0}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Mia\", \"last_name\": \"Jackson\", \"dob\": \"1986-05-05\"}], \"membership\": \"silver\", \"reservations\": [\"OI5L9G\", \"AQLBTL\", \"KA7I60\", \"I57WUD\", \"OBUT9V\", \"4BMN53\", \"Q0ZF0J\"]}\nassistant: I found your profile. You have several reservations. Let me locate the Houston to Denver trip by checking your reservations.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"OI5L9G\", \"user_id\": \"sofia_kim_7287\", \"origin\": \"MCO\", \"destination\": \"CLT\", \"flight_type\": \"one_way\", \"cabin\": \"business\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT017\", \"origin\": \"MCO\", \"destination\": \"BOS\", \"date\": \"2024-05-25\", \"price\": 523}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT277\", \"origin\": \"BOS\", \"destination\": \"CLT\", \"date\": \"2024-05-25\", \"price\": 501}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Sofia\", \"last_name\": \"Kim\", \"dob\": \"1950-06-24\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Mia\", \"last_name\": \"Jackson\", \"dob\": \"1986-05-05\"}], \"payment", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 12, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 1, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "aa50189e", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T12:11:06"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "raw_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "24#0", "task_desc": "Hi, I'm Mia Kim. I need some help with my booking \u2014 there's a passenger I need to remove from one of my reservations, and separately I'm looking to book a flight from New York out to the West Coast for some travel coming up. Can you assist with both of those?\nOkay, I understand \u2014 since you can't remove Ethan from reservation H9ZU1C, then please go ahead and cancel that whole reservation for me. I'll just rebook myself later as you suggested.\n\nNow for the new trip: my user ID is mia_kim_4397. I'm", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: Hello Mia! I can help with the booking, but I need to clarify one thing about the passenger removal first.\n\n**Regarding removing a passenger from your reservation:** Per airline policy, the number of passengers on a reservation cannot be modified \u2014 this applies to all agents, including human agents. I'm unable to remove a passenger from an existing reservation. If you'd like, I can help you modify passenger details (such as names or dates of birth) without changing the count, or you could look into canceling and rebooking if that fits your needs.\n\n**Regarding booking a new flight:** I'd be happy to help you book a flight from New York to the West Coast. To get started, I'll need a few details:\n\n1. **Your user ID** (e.g., something like `mia_kim_123`) \u2014 this is required before I can proceed with any booking.\n2. **Trip type** \u2014 is this a one-way or round-trip flight?\n3. **Specific airports** \u2014 New York has JFK, LGA, and EWR; the West Coast includes LAX, SFO, SEA, etc. Which origin and destination airports do you prefer?\n4. **Travel dates.**\n5. **Cabin class** \u2014 basic economy, economy, or business?\n6. **Passenger details** \u2014 first name, last name, and date of birth for each passenger (max 5).\n7. **Payment method** \u2014 which credit card, gift card, or travel certificate (already on your profile) would you like to use?\n8. **Checked bags** \u2014 how many you'll need (free allowance depends on your membership level and cabin).\n9. **Travel insurance** \u2014 would you like to add it ($30 per passenger, enables full refund for health/weather cancellations)?\n\nPlease provide your user ID and the booking details above, and I'll assist you further!\nassistant: I'll help you with both tasks. Let me start by pulling up your user profile to get your date of birth, membership level, and payment methods, and I'll also need to review the reservation you want to cancel.\n\nLet me first retrieve your user details.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"mia_kim_4397\", \"", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 16, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 1, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "aa50189e", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T12:11:06"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "raw_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "2#1", "task_desc": "Hello, I'd like to book a flight from San Francisco to New York. There will be three of us traveling.\nSure, my user ID is noah_muller_9847.\nActually, hold on \u2014 before we go any further with this booking, I need to bring up something else. I'm really frustrated about a delayed flight on my most recent reservation and I want to talk about that instead.\nOh, I guess I got mixed up \u2014 I thought it was my most recent booking but I must be misremembering. Yeah, that 4OG6T3 must be the one I'm talking ab", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: Hello! I'd be happy to help you book a flight from San Francisco (SFO) to New York (JFK) for three passengers.\n\nTo get started, I'll need your **user ID** (for example, something like \"sara_doe_496\"). Could you please provide that?\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"noah_muller_9847\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Noah\", \"last_name\": \"Muller\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"889 Hillcrest Drive\", \"address2\": \"Suite 254\", \"city\": \"Denver\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"CO\", \"zip\": \"80243\"}, \"email\": \"noah.muller2290@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1963-01-22\", \"payment_methods\": {\"credit_card_1245537\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_1245537\", \"brand\": \"mastercard\", \"last_four\": \"1167\"}, \"credit_card_6040264\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_6040264\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"2076\"}, \"credit_card_3255100\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_3255100\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"2604\"}, \"certificate_8301303\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_8301303\", \"amount\": 100.0}, \"credit_card_3983998\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_3983998\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"8413\"}, \"credit_card_7574394\": {\"source\": \"credi