{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "raw_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "1#1", "task_desc": "Hi, I was actually just on the phone with one of your support reps, and they told me that a service agent like yourself would be able to help me cancel a reservation. I need to cancel an upcoming flight I have booked.\nSure, my user ID is raj_sanchez_7340.\nThat would be the round trip one from Philadelphia to LaGuardia \u2014 I see it listed there as Q69X3R, the Economy class itinerary PHL \u2192 CLT \u2192 LGA \u2192 PHL. I'd like to cancel that reservation, please.\nI'll go with \"Other reasons\" \u2014 it doesn't really ", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I can help you with that. To get started, I'll need your user ID. If you don't know your reservation ID, I can help locate it once I have your user ID.\n\nCould you please provide your user ID?\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"raj_sanchez_7340\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Raj\", \"last_name\": \"Sanchez\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"794 Sunset Drive\", \"address2\": \"Suite 598\", \"city\": \"Charlotte\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"NC\", \"zip\": \"28271\"}, \"email\": \"raj.sanchez1048@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1965-09-13\", \"payment_methods\": {\"credit_card_7891819\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_7891819\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"4388\"}, \"gift_card_4964153\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_4964153\", \"amount\": 163.0}, \"gift_card_3226531\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_3226531\", \"amount\": 50.0}, \"certificate_4594761\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_4594761\", \"amount\": 150.0}, \"gift_card_1591784\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_1591784\", \"amount\": 57.0}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Olivia\", \"last_name\": \"Taylor\", \"dob\": \"1976-06-27\"}], \"membership\": \"silver\", \"reservations\": [\"MZDDS4\", \"60RX9E\", \"S5IK51\", \"OUEA45\", \"Q69X3R\"]}\nassistant: I found your profile. You have several reservations: MZDDS4, 60RX9E, S5IK51, OUEA45, and Q69X3R. Let me look up the details to find your upcoming flight.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"MZDDS4\", \"user_id\": \"raj_sanchez_7340\", \"origin\": \"MIA\", \"destination\": \"LAX\", \"flight_type\": \"round_trip\", \"cabin\": \"business\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT050\", \"origin\": \"MIA\", \"destination\": \"LAX\", \"date\": \"2024-05-17\", \"price\": 1305}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT228\", \"origin\": \"LAX\", \"destination\": \"EWR\", \"date\": \"2024-05-22\", \"price\": 1126}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT202\", \"origin\": \"EWR\", \"destination\": \"MIA\", \"date\": \"2024-05-23\", \"price\": 1746}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Raj\", \"last_name\": \"Sanchez\", \"dob\": \"1965-09-13\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Olivia\", \"last_name\": \"Taylor", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 6, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 1, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "aa50189e", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T12:11:06"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "raw_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "5#1", "task_desc": "Hello, I'm a valued Gold member with your airline, and I'm calling to complain about my delayed flight HAT045 from PHX to SEA. I'm extremely upset because this delay is going to make me miss a very important meeting. This is completely unacceptable!\nSure, my user ID is mei_brown_7075. I don't have my reservation ID handy at the moment, but hopefully you can locate my booking with that. And just to reiterate, I'm a Gold member and I'm really frustrated\u2014this delay on HAT045 from Phoenix to Seattle", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'm sorry to hear about the delay with flight HAT045. To confirm the details and assist you, I'll need some information first.\n\nCould you please provide your user ID? Also, if you have your reservation ID handy, that would help me locate your booking quickly. If you don't know your reservation ID, I can help find it once I have your user ID.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"mei_brown_7075\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Mei\", \"last_name\": \"Brown\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"853 Chestnut Street\", \"address2\": \"Suite 497\", \"city\": \"Washington\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"DC\", \"zip\": \"20195\"}, \"email\": \"mei.brown7062@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1986-12-14\", \"payment_methods\": {\"certificate_6761175\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_6761175\", \"amount\": 250.0}, \"gift_card_8987598\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_8987598\", \"amount\": 130.0}, \"credit_card_4920843\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_4920843\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"1663\"}, \"credit_card_1815425\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_1815425\", \"brand\": \"mastercard\", \"last_four\": \"9812\"}, \"certificate_1585255\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_1585255\", \"amount\": 250.0}, \"credit_card_5667188\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_5667188\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"8764\"}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Yusuf\", \"last_name\": \"Silva\", \"dob\": \"1972-03-03\"}], \"membership\": \"regular\", \"reservations\": [\"DB1Y70\", \"MUGYUB\", \"3JA7XV\", \"CYPIDV\"]}\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"DB1Y70\", \"user_id\": \"mei_brown_7075\", \"origin\": \"PHX\", \"destination\": \"CLT\", \"flight_type\": \"one_way\", \"cabin\": \"basic_economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT265\", \"origin\": \"PHX\", \"destination\": \"DTW\", \"date\": \"2024-05-21\", \"price\": 84}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT053\", \"origin\": \"DTW\", \"destination\": \"CLT\", \"date\": \"2024-05-21\", \"price\": 69}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Mei\", \"last_name\": \"Brown\", \"dob\": \"1986-12-14\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Evelyn\",", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 6, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 1, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "aa50189e", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T12:11:06"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "raw_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "29#0", "task_desc": "Hello. I'm calling because I've developed a health issue that means I need to adjust my travel plans, and since I purchased trip insurance I\u2019d like any change fees waived. I currently have a roundtrip booking from Detroit to LaGuardia, and I want to switch both legs to nonstop flights from Detroit to JFK instead, keeping the original travel dates. I\u2019m only interested in early morning flights that get in before 7am at the destination, and I need the least expensive regular Economy (not Basic Econ", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: Hello, I'm sorry to hear about your health issue. I'll do my best to help you with your reservation.\n\nBefore I can look into your booking, I need a few pieces of information:\n\n1. **Your user ID** (e.g., something like `sara_doe_496`).\n2. **Your reservation ID** \u2014 if you don't have it handy, I can help locate it once I have your user ID.\n\nOne important note based on our modification policy: flight modifications must keep the **same origin, destination, and trip type**. Since your current booking is to **LaGuardia (LGA)** and you'd like to change the destination to **JFK**, that would be a change of destination, which is not permitted through a modification. \n\nCould you please provide your user ID so I can pull up your reservation and review the details with you? Once I see the booking, I can explain your options (for example, whether a cancellation and rebooking would be appropriate given your travel insurance).\nassistant: Thank you. Let me pull up your user profile and reservation details.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"raj_brown_5782\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Raj\", \"last_name\": \"Brown\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"127 Chestnut Street\", \"address2\": \"Suite 411\", \"city\": \"San Jose\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"CA\", \"zip\": \"95153\"}, \"email\": \"raj.brown6519@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1967-03-12\", \"payment_methods\": {\"credit_card_7686643\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_7686643\", \"brand\": \"mastercard\", \"last_four\": \"2273\"}, \"gift_card_6468981\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_6468981\", \"amount\": 279.0}, \"credit_card_8003957\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_8003957\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"6521\"}, \"credit_card_8782472\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_8782472\", \"brand\": \"mastercard\", \"last_four\": \"1949\"}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Juan\", \"last_name\": \"Thomas\", \"dob\": \"1990-07-04\"}], \"membership\": \"regular\", \"reservations\": [\"VA5SGQ\", \"41WSQQ\", \"D9R9S0\", \"HTGCBX\", \"Q0K59Y", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 7, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 1, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "aa50189e", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T12:11:06"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "raw_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "38#0", "task_desc": "Hello. I'm calling because I'm really frustrated about my most recent flight\u2014it was delayed and it completely threw off my plans. I need to talk to someone about this.\nSure, my user ID is noah_muller_9847. As for the reservation, it's my most recent one\u2014my last booking\u2014but honestly I don't remember what the reservation ID was.\n###TRANSFER###", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'm sorry to hear your flight was delayed. I'd like to help you with this. To look into your reservation and the delayed flight, I'll need some information first.\n\nCould you please provide me with:\n- Your user ID (e.g., \"sara_doe_496\")\n- Your reservation ID (if you have it; if not, I can help locate it using your user ID)\n\nOnce I have these details, I can check the flight status and see what options are available to you, such as changing or cancelling the reservation, or discussing compensation.\nassistant: Let me look up your user profile to find your most recent reservation.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"noah_muller_9847\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Noah\", \"last_name\": \"Muller\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"889 Hillcrest Drive\", \"address2\": \"Suite 254\", \"city\": \"Denver\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"CO\", \"zip\": \"80243\"}, \"email\": \"noah.muller2290@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1963-01-22\", \"payment_methods\": {\"credit_card_1245537\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_1245537\", \"brand\": \"mastercard\", \"last_four\": \"1167\"}, \"credit_card_6040264\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_6040264\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"2076\"}, \"credit_card_3255100\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_3255100\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"2604\"}, \"certificate_8301303\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_8301303\", \"amount\": 100.0}, \"credit_card_3983998\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_3983998\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"8413\"}, \"credit_card_7574394\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_7574394\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"1798\"}, \"credit_card_6873705\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_6873705\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"2267\"}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Lei\", \"last_name\": \"Patel\", \"dob\": \"1959-11-15\"}], \"membership\": \"gold\", \"reservations\": [\"SDZQKO\", \"4OG6T3\"]}\nassistant: I found your profile. You have two reservations: **SDZQKO** and **4OG6T3**. Let me chec", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 12, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 1, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "aa50189e", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T12:11:06"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "raw_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "11#1", "task_desc": "I need to get a passenger removed from my flights, and I'm in a bit of a hurry. My name's James Patel. I've got a round trip booked from Las Vegas to Denver\u2014leaving May 19 and returning May 20. I want to take Sophia off that reservation. Can you just get this done fast?\nLook, I don't have time for this kind of runaround. If you can't take Sophia off the booking, then just downgrade everyone on that reservation to basic economy\u2014me and whoever else is on it. I need this done right now, I'm in a hu", "score": 0.0, "em": 0.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'm sorry, but I'm unable to remove a passenger from your reservation. According to our policy, the number of passengers on a reservation cannot be modified\u2014this applies to both automated agents and human agents. You can modify passenger details (such as names or dates of birth), but the total number of passengers must remain the same.\n\nIf you'd like, I can help you with other modifications, such as changing passenger details, flights, cabin class, or adding checked bags. Please let me know if you'd like to explore any of those options.\nassistant: I understand you're in a hurry. To proceed with the cabin downgrade, I'll need to first locate your reservation. Per our process, I need your **user ID** (for example, something like `james_patel_123`). \n\nCould you please provide your user ID? Once I have that, I can pull up your reservation details, check the flight status, and calculate the exact refund amount for downgrading the entire reservation to basic economy before making any changes.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"GV1N64\", \"user_id\": \"james_patel_9828\", \"origin\": \"LAS\", \"destination\": \"DEN\", \"flight_type\": \"round_trip\", \"cabin\": \"business\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT003\", \"origin\": \"LAS\", \"destination\": \"DEN\", \"date\": \"2024-05-19\", \"price\": 561}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT290\", \"origin\": \"DEN\", \"destination\": \"LAS\", \"date\": \"2024-05-20\", \"price\": 1339}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"James\", \"last_name\": \"Patel\", \"dob\": \"1995-04-07\"}, {\"first_name\": \"James\", \"last_name\": \"Sanchez\", \"dob\": \"1956-08-18\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Sophia\", \"last_name\": \"Johansson\", \"dob\": \"1993-07-11\"}], \"payment_history\": [{\"payment_id\": \"gift_card_1642017\", \"amount\": 5700}], \"created_at\": \"2024-05-03T05:35:00\", \"total_baggages\": 3, \"nonfree_baggages\": 0, \"insurance\": \"no\", \"status\": null}\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"james_patel_9828\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"James\", \"last_name\": \"Patel\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"656 River Road\", \"address2\": \"Suit", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 7, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 1, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "aa50189e", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T12:11:06"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "raw_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "6#1", "task_desc": "Hello. I'm looking at my upcoming flight booking and I believe I purchased travel insurance when I booked, but it's not showing up in my online account. I'm flying with my family and everyone else already has insurance on their tickets, so I really need to get this sorted out and have it added to mine as well.\nSure, my user ID is sophia_taylor_9065 and the reservation number is PEP4E0. \n\nBut I want to be clear \u2014 I'm certain I selected insurance when I booked this trip. It's showing for everyone ", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I understand you'd like to have travel insurance added to your ticket. Before I proceed, I need to look up your booking to verify the details.\n\nCould you please provide me with:\n1. Your user ID (e.g., \"sara_doe_496\")\n2. Your reservation ID (e.g., \"ZFA04Y\") \u2014 if you don't have it handy, I can help locate it once I have your user ID.\n\nOnce I have this information, I'll review your reservation to confirm the current insurance status. Please note that per our policy, travel insurance cannot be added after the initial booking, so I'll need to verify whether it was already included.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"PEP4E0\", \"user_id\": \"sophia_taylor_9065\", \"origin\": \"CLT\", \"destination\": \"PHX\", \"flight_type\": \"one_way\", \"cabin\": \"basic_economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT176\", \"origin\": \"CLT\", \"destination\": \"DTW\", \"date\": \"2024-05-20\", \"price\": 51}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT097\", \"origin\": \"DTW\", \"destination\": \"PHX\", \"date\": \"2024-05-20\", \"price\": 77}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Sophia\", \"last_name\": \"Taylor\", \"dob\": \"1999-05-27\"}], \"payment_history\": [{\"payment_id\": \"credit_card_9302073\", \"amount\": 128}], \"created_at\": \"2024-05-05T05:10:43\", \"total_baggages\": 0, \"nonfree_baggages\": 0, \"insurance\": \"no\", \"status\": null}\nassistant: I've reviewed your reservation PEP4E0. Here are the facts from the booking:\n\n- **Reservation PEP4E0** (user: sophia_taylor_9065)\n- **Trip:** One-way, CLT \u2192 PHX, basic economy\n- **Passengers:** Only one passenger is listed on this reservation \u2014 Sophia Taylor (DOB 1999-05-27). There are no other family members on this booking.\n- **Insurance:** Currently set to \"no\"\n- **Created:** 2024-05-05\n\nBased on these details, I'm unable to add travel insurance to your ticket. Per our policy, **travel insurance cannot be added after the initial booking** \u2014 this applies regardless of whether it was intended at the time of booking. The reservation record shows insurance was not included when it was create", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 1, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 1, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "aa50189e", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T12:11:06"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "raw_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "16#1", "task_desc": "Hi, I have a flight booked from Atlanta (ATL) to Philadelphia (PHL) that I need to change. I\u2019d like to move it to the day after my original travel date, and I\u2019m looking for the cheapest available flight in standard Economy \u2013 not Basic Economy. Can you help me with that?\nSure, my user ID is aarav_garcia_1177.\nYes, that works for me. The $207 Economy option through LGA on the 24th is exactly what I was looking for \u2014 cheapest standard Economy, not Basic. And I\u2019m perfectly fine with the refund going", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'd be happy to help you change your flight. To get started, I'll need your **user ID** so I can locate your reservation. \n\nCould you please provide your user ID? If you don't know your reservation ID, I can help find it once I have your user ID.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"aarav_garcia_1177\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Aarav\", \"last_name\": \"Garcia\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"833 Highland Drive\", \"address2\": \"Suite 740\", \"city\": \"Denver\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"CO\", \"zip\": \"80211\"}, \"email\": \"aarav.garcia6639@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1992-09-13\", \"payment_methods\": {\"certificate_7473723\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_7473723\", \"amount\": 150.0}, \"gift_card_8887175\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_8887175\", \"amount\": 35.0}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Lei\", \"last_name\": \"Ito\", \"dob\": \"1990-12-07\"}], \"membership\": \"gold\", \"reservations\": [\"M05KNL\", \"UHDAHF\"]}\nassistant: I found your profile. You have two reservations (M05KNL and UHDAHF). Let me check the details to find the one from ATL to PHL.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"M05KNL\", \"user_id\": \"aarav_garcia_1177\", \"origin\": \"ATL\", \"destination\": \"PHL\", \"flight_type\": \"one_way\", \"cabin\": \"business\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT227\", \"origin\": \"ATL\", \"destination\": \"ORD\", \"date\": \"2024-05-23\", \"price\": 1936}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT139\", \"origin\": \"ORD\", \"destination\": \"PHL\", \"date\": \"2024-05-23\", \"price\": 851}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Aarav\", \"last_name\": \"Garcia\", \"dob\": \"1992-09-13\"}], \"payment_history\": [{\"payment_id\": \"gift_card_8887175\", \"amount\": 2787}], \"created_at\": \"2024-05-14T06:33:04\", \"total_baggages\": 0, \"nonfree_baggages\": 0, \"insurance\": \"no\", \"status\": null}\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"UHDAHF\", \"user_id\": \"aarav_garcia_1177\", \"origin\": \"CLT\", \"destination\": \"LAX\", \"flight_type\": \"round_trip\", \"cabin\": \"basic_economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT015\", \"origin\": \"CLT\", \"destination\": \"EWR\", \"date\": \"2024-05-19\", \"pr", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 6, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 1, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "aa50189e", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T12:11:06"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "raw_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "0#1", "task_desc": "Hi, I'm Emma Kim. I'd like to cancel my flight reservation EHGLP3. Can you help me with that?\nSure, my user ID is emma_kim_9957.\nThe reason is just a change of plans on my end. I realize it\u2019s been more than 24 hours since I booked \u2014 I was actually out of town right after I made the reservation and couldn\u2019t deal with it sooner, but I was under the impression that would be okay.\nWait, that doesn't seem right to me. When I made this booking, I was told I didn't need to purchase insurance because my", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'd be happy to help you cancel your reservation EHGLP3. To proceed, I'll need your user ID for verification. Could you please provide your user ID?\nassistant: Thank you. Let me look up your reservation details to verify the information.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"EHGLP3\", \"user_id\": \"emma_kim_9957\", \"origin\": \"PHX\", \"destination\": \"JFK\", \"flight_type\": \"one_way\", \"cabin\": \"basic_economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT156\", \"origin\": \"PHX\", \"destination\": \"SEA\", \"date\": \"2024-05-17\", \"price\": 50}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT021\", \"origin\": \"SEA\", \"destination\": \"JFK\", \"date\": \"2024-05-17\", \"price\": 54}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Evelyn\", \"last_name\": \"Taylor\", \"dob\": \"1965-01-16\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Anya\", \"last_name\": \"Silva\", \"dob\": \"1971-11-22\"}], \"payment_history\": [{\"payment_id\": \"credit_card_5832574\", \"amount\": 208}], \"created_at\": \"2024-05-04T23:12:06\", \"total_baggages\": 0, \"nonfree_baggages\": 0, \"insurance\": \"no\", \"status\": null}\nassistant: I've retrieved your reservation. Before I can process the cancellation, I need to verify a few things. Let me check the flight status of your flights.\ntool: available\ntool: available\nassistant: I've checked the status of both flights on your itinerary (HAT156 PHX\u2192SEA and HAT021 SEA\u2192JFK, both on 2024-05-17), and both are currently **available** (not cancelled by the airline and not yet flown).\n\nTo process a cancellation, I also need to know the **reason for cancellation** (change of plan, airline cancelled flight, or other reasons). Could you please let me know the reason?\n\nFor your reference, based on my checks so far:\n- Your booking was created on 2024-05-04, which is more than 24 hours ago.\n- The flights are not cancelled by the airline.\n- This is a **basic economy** reservation (not business class).\n- There is **no travel insurance** on this reservation.\n\nPer our cancellation policy, a reservation can only be cancelled if one of these is true: the booking was made ", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 7, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 1, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "aa50189e", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T12:11:06"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "raw_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "23#0", "task_desc": "Hello. I'm Mohamed Silva, user ID mohamed_silva_9265. I have a couple of things I need assistance with today. First, I\u2019d like to find out the total combined balance on all of my gift cards and also the sum of my certificate balances. Second, I need to modify a recent reservation I made\u2014I want to switch it to the cheapest business class round trip available, but I have to keep the exact same travel dates. I\u2019m fine with either a direct flight or one with stops.\nThanks for those balances \u2014 so that\u2019", "score": 0.0, "em": 0.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'll help you with both requests. Let me start by pulling up your profile to see your payment methods and reservations.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"mohamed_silva_9265\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Mohamed\", \"last_name\": \"Silva\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"638 Elm Street\", \"address2\": \"Suite 548\", \"city\": \"Los Angeles\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"CA\", \"zip\": \"91365\"}, \"email\": \"mohamed.silva9198@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1960-11-26\", \"payment_methods\": {\"credit_card_5843230\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_5843230\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"2395\"}, \"gift_card_8020792\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_8020792\", \"amount\": 198.0}, \"certificate_3765853\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_3765853\", \"amount\": 500.0}, \"gift_card_6136092\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_6136092\", \"amount\": 129.0}, \"certificate_9984806\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_9984806\", \"amount\": 250.0}, \"credit_card_2198526\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_2198526\", \"brand\": \"mastercard\", \"last_four\": \"9363\"}, \"certificate_2765295\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_2765295\", \"amount\":