{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "raw_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "19#1", "task_desc": "Hello, I have a reservation for a quick half-day trip to Texas, but I can\u2019t seem to find my reservation ID. I need to change my return flight \u2014 it\u2019s currently scheduled to leave at 3pm on the 28th \u2014 to a later flight back to Newark that same day. If that\u2019s not possible, I\u2019d want the earliest flight the next day instead.\nSure, my user ID is olivia_gonzalez_2305.\nYes, please go ahead and cancel the trip using the travel insurance. I\u2019m not feeling well, so I\u2019d like to use that to cancel it. I\u2019ll bo", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: To help you locate your reservation and modify your return flight, I'll need your user ID first. Could you please provide your user ID?\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"olivia_gonzalez_2305\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Olivia\", \"last_name\": \"Gonzalez\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"334 Laurel Lane\", \"address2\": \"Suite 970\", \"city\": \"Los Angeles\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"CA\", \"zip\": \"90504\"}, \"email\": \"olivia.gonzalez4421@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1988-06-13\", \"payment_methods\": {\"gift_card_2200803\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_2200803\", \"amount\": 123.0}, \"credit_card_9969263\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_9969263\", \"brand\": \"mastercard\", \"last_four\": \"9475\"}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Mei\", \"last_name\": \"Johansson\", \"dob\": \"1981-09-25\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Yara\", \"last_name\": \"Lopez\", \"dob\": \"1975-09-15\"}], \"membership\": \"regular\", \"reservations\": [\"Z7GOZK\", \"K67C4W\", \"THY2DG\"]}\nassistant: I found your profile. You have three reservations (Z7GOZK, K67C4W, THY2DG). Let me check the details of each to find the one matching your Texas trip with a return flight from Texas to Newark on the 28th.\ntool: {\"reservatio