{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "raw_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "28#1", "task_desc": "Hello, I need to cancel the flights on my booking with reference SI5UKW and get a refund for them. Can you help me with that?\nSure, my user ID is amelia_rossi_1297. As for the reason, it\u2019s just a change of plan on my end \u2014 something came up and I won\u2019t be able to travel anymore. I\u2019d like to cancel the trips under SI5UKW and get my money back, please.\nI\u2019m sorry, but I really can\u2019t accept that as a final answer. I\u2019m a loyal customer of this airline and I\u2019ve never asked for anything like this befor", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I can help you with that. First, I'll need a few details:\n\n1. Your **user ID** (so I can verify the reservation belongs to you).\n2. The **reason for cancellation** (options: change of plan, airline cancelled flight, or other reasons).\n\nCould you please provide these?\nassistant: Thank you. Let me look up your reservation and profile details.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"SI5UKW\", \"user_id\": \"amelia_rossi_1297\", \"origin\": \"MIA\", \"destination\": \"PHX\", \"flight_type\": \"one_way\", \"cabin\": \"basic_economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT062\", \"origin\": \"MIA\", \"destination\": \"LAS\", \"date\": \"2024-05-16\", \"price\": 67}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT284\", \"origin\": \"LAS\", \"destination\": \"PHX\", \"date\": \"2024-05-17\", \"price\": 57}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Amelia\", \"last_name\": \"Rossi\", \"dob\": \"1960-01-19\"}], \"payment_history\": [{\"payment_id\": \"credit_card_4579924\", \"amount\": 124}], \"created_at\": \"2024-05-11T00:08:57\", \"total_baggages\": 0, \"nonfree_baggages\": 0, \"insurance\": \"no\", \"status\": null}\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"amelia_rossi_1297\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Amelia\", \"last_name\": \"Rossi\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"747 Maple Drive\", \"address2