{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "raw_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "37#0", "task_desc": "Hi, I'm Aarav Ahmed. I need to make some changes to my upcoming flight bookings. I'd like to cancel two of my reservations and upgrade a third one to business class. Can you help me with that?\nSure, my user ID is aarav_ahmed_6699. With that, you should be able to pull up my bookings. I need to cancel two of them \u2014 the confirmation codes are IFOYYZ and NQNU5R \u2014 and upgrade the third one, M20IZO, to business class.\nYes, please go ahead with the upgrade for M20IZO. I'd like to use my Mastercard end", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: Hello Aarav! I'd be happy to help you with cancelling two reservations and upgrading a third to business class.\n\nTo get started, I'll need your **user ID** (for example, something like `aarav_ahmed_123`). Could you please provide that? Once I have it, I can look up your reservations and assist with the changes.\nassistant: Thank you! Let me pull up your profile and the details of all three reservations.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"aarav_ahmed_6699\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Aarav\", \"last_name\": \"Ahmed\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"176 Willow Lane\", \"address2\": \"Suite 431\", \"city\": \"Jacksonville\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"FL\", \"zip\": \"32131\"}, \"email\": \"aarav.ahmed6812@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1981-05-26\", \"payment_methods\": {\"credit_card_9074831\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_9074831\", \"brand\": \"mastercard\", \"last_four\": \"7334\"}, \"certificate_9645872\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_9645872\", \"amount\": 250.0}, \"credit_card_4959530\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_4959530\", \"brand\": \"mastercard\", \"last_four\": \"5018\"}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Aarav\", \"last_name\": \"Patel\", \"dob\": \"1980-12-03\"}], \"membership\": \"silver\", \