{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "raw_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "17#1", "task_desc": "Hello, I'm Omar Rossi. I have a trip coming up from New York to Chicago, and I need to make a few changes: I'd like to add three checked bags, change the passenger to myself, and upgrade the booking to economy class.\nSure, my user ID is omar_rossi_1241. I don't have my reservation ID on hand right now \u2014 could you help locate it using my user ID?\nThanks for pulling that up. I'd prefer to pay with a gift card \u2014 the one with the $280 balance, gift_card_8190333, should cover the $209 difference. And", "score": 0.0, "em": 0.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: Hello Omar! I'd be happy to help you make those changes. Before I can proceed, I need to collect some information.\n\nFirst, I'll need your **user ID** (for example, something like \"omar_rossi_123\"). \n\nAlso, do you have your **reservation ID**? If you don't know it, I can help locate it once I have your user ID.\n\nOnce I have these details, I can assist with:\n- Adding three checked bags\n- Updating the passenger to yourself\n- Upgrading the cabin to economy\n\nPlease provide your user ID (and reservation ID if you have it).\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"omar_rossi_1241\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Omar\", \"last_name\": \"Rossi\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"901 Pine Lane\", \"address2\": \"Suite 360\", \"city\": \"Houston\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"TX\", \"zip\": \"77271\"}, \"email\": \"omar.rossi5980@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1970-06-06\", \"payment_methods\": {\"gift_card_8190333\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_8190333\", \"amount\": 280.0}, \"credit_card_6754990\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_6754990\", \"brand\": \"mastercard\", \"last_four\": \"3848\"}, \"certificate_8390038\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_8390038\", \"amount\": 150.0}, \"certificate_1778167\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \