{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "raw_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "36#1", "task_desc": "I'm... I'm sorry, I can barely get the words out. My wife... she passed away yesterday, tragically. I have a flight booked that I desperately need to move. I just need to push it out by two days. I don't want to cancel it, I just... I need the date changed. Please, can you help me with that?\nThank you... I appreciate that. I'm Lucas Brown. My user ID is lucas_brown_4047. The reservation is under EUJUY6. I just... I can't believe I'm having to do this. She's gone and I just need two more days bef", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'm so very sorry for your loss. I can't imagine how difficult this must be, and I'll do my best to help you change your flight date.\n\nTo get started, I'll need your user ID so I can locate your reservation. If you don't have your reservation ID handy, I can look it up for you once I have your user ID.\n\nCould you please provide your user ID?\nassistant: I'm truly sorry, Lucas. Let me pull up your reservation and account details so I can help you with this.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"EUJUY6\", \"user_id\": \"lucas_brown_4047\", \"origin\": \"ORD\", \"destination\": \"LAS\", \"flight_type\": \"round_trip\", \"cabin\": \"basic_economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT238\", \"origin\": \"ORD\", \"destination\": \"DEN\", \"date\": \"2024-05-14\", \"price\": 96}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT290\", \"origin\": \"DEN\", \"destination\": \"LAS\", \"date\": \"2024-05-14\", \"price\": 64}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT266\", \"origin\": \"LAS\", \"destination\": \"IAH\", \"date\": \"2024-05-16\", \"price\": 70}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT044\", \"origin\": \"IAH\", \"destination\": \"ORD\", \"date\": \"2024-05-16\", \"price\": 76}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Lucas\", \"last_name\": \"Brown\", \"dob\": \"1965-01-01\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Daiki\", \"last_name\": \"Thomas\", \"dob\": \