{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "raw_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "6#0", "task_desc": "Hi, I need some help with my upcoming flight. I'm pretty sure I added travel insurance when I booked, but when I log in to check my trip online, it's not showing up at all. I'm flying with my family, and everyone else on the booking already has insurance for their flight\u2014I'm the only one missing it, and I really need to get that fixed so we're all covered.\nWait, no! Please don't transfer me to another agent. I really need you to help me with this directly. I know I added travel insurance for my ", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\ntool: Transfer successful\nassistant: YOU ARE BEING TRANSFERRED TO A HUMAN AGENT. PLEASE HOLD ON.\nassistant: I understand you'd prefer to resolve this directly, and I'm happy to look into your booking to verify the details. However, I want to be upfront with you about one important policy limitation: **travel insurance cannot be added to a reservation after the initial booking is made.** This applies to all reservations, so even if we confirm the insurance is missing for you, I'm not able to add it through my tools.\n\nThat said, I can certainly look into your reservation to check the current recorded status of the insurance, which may help clarify what's happening (for example, whether it was recorded but isn't displaying correctly online).\n\nTo do that, I'll need a bit of information:\n- Your **user ID** (e.g., something like `sara_doe_496`)\n- Your **reservation ID** (if you have it \u2014 if not, I can help locate it using your user ID)\n\nCould you please provide your user ID, and your reservation ID if you have it? Once I have that, I'll pull up the reservation details and let you know exactly what's recorded.\nassistant: Thank you for providing those details. Let me pull up your reservation to verify exactly what's recorded.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"PEP4E0\", \"user_id\": \"sophia_taylor_9065\", \"origin\": \"CLT\", \"destination\": \"PHX\", \"flight_type\": \"one_way\", \"cabin\": \"basic_economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT176\", \"origin\": \"CLT\", \"destination\": \"DTW\", \"date\": \"2024-05-20\", \"price\": 51}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT097\", \"origin\": \"DTW\", \"destination\": \"PHX\", \"date\": \"2024-05-20\", \"price\": 77}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Sophia\", \"last_name\": \"Taylor\", \"dob\": \"1999-05-27\"}], \"payment_history\": [{\"payment_id\": \"credit_card_9302073\", \"amount\": 128}], \"created_at\": \"2024-05-05T05:10:43\", \"total_baggages\": 0, \"nonfree_baggages\": 0, \"insurance\": \"no\", \"status\": null}\nassistant: I've retrieved your reservation PEP4E0. Here is exactly", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 7, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 1, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "aa50189e", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T12:11:06"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "raw_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "35#0", "task_desc": "Hello, I'd like to cancel my upcoming flight from JFK to MCO on May 22. I'm a silver member, so I expect to receive a full refund for that cancellation.\nSure, my user ID is aarav_ahmed_6699. I don't have my reservation ID handy, so could you look that up for me? The reason for cancellation is just a change of plans. And as I said, I'm a silver member, so I expect a full refund for this flight.\nI'm sorry, but I have to insist here. I'm a silver member with your airline, and as a silver member I'm", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: To help you cancel your flight, I'll need a few details first:\n\n1. **Your user ID** (e.g., 'sara_doe_496')\n2. **Your reservation ID** (if you don't know it, I can help locate it using your user ID)\n3. **The reason for cancellation** (change of plan, airline cancelled flight, or other reasons)\n\nCould you please provide your user ID and the reason for cancellation? If you don't have your reservation ID handy, just let me know and I'll look it up for you.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"aarav_ahmed_6699\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Aarav\", \"last_name\": \"Ahmed\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"176 Willow Lane\", \"address2\": \"Suite 431\", \"city\": \"Jacksonville\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"FL\", \"zip\": \"32131\"}, \"email\": \"aarav.ahmed6812@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1981-05-26\", \"payment_methods\": {\"credit_card_9074831\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_9074831\", \"brand\": \"mastercard\", \"last_four\": \"7334\"}, \"certificate_9645872\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_9645872\", \"amount\": 250.0}, \"credit_card_4959530\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_4959530\", \"brand\": \"mastercard\", \"last_four\": \"5018\"}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Aarav\", \"last_name\": \"Patel\", \"dob\": \"1