{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "raw_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "32#0", "task_desc": "Hi, I'm Ivan Rossi. I have a flight booked out of Newark on May 21st, but my mother is really sick and I need to get back home sooner to take care of her. I was hoping I could change my booking to a nonstop flight on that same day instead. Can you help me with that?\nOf course, it's ivan_rossi_8555.\nOh, I see \u2014 I didn't realize it was booked as basic economy. But I'm willing to upgrade to regular economy if that's what it takes to be able to make the change. My mother really needs me home sooner,", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'm sorry to hear about your mother. I'd be happy to help you change your booking.\n\nTo locate your reservation, I'll need your user ID first. Could you please provide your user ID? (It typically looks something like \"ivan_rossi_123\".)\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"ivan_rossi_8555\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Ivan\", \"last_name\": \"Rossi\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"513 Main Street\", \"address2\": \"Suite 805\", \"city\": \"Philadelphia\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"PA\", \"zip\": \"19102\"}, \"email\": \"ivan.rossi2633@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1954-01-14\", \"payment_methods\": {\"gift_card_7344518\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_7344518\", \"amount\": 183.0}, \"gift_card_9823297\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_9823297\", \"amount\": 224.0}, \"credit_card_9659780\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_9659780\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"1777\"}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Ava\", \"last_name\": \"Silva\", \"dob\": \"1971-01-14\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Anya\", \"last_name\": \"Patel\", \"dob\": \"1990-06-13\"}], \"membership\": \"silver\", \"reservations\": [\"OWZ4XL\", \"F3IQK1\", \"8WMF4C\", \"L2H5FP\"]}\nassistant: I found your profile. You have several reservations. Let me check the details to find the one departing from Newark (EWR) on May 21st.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"OWZ4XL\", \"user_id\": \"ivan_rossi_8555\", \"origin\": \"EWR\", \"destination\": \"LAX\", \"flight_type\": \"one_way\", \"cabin\": \"basic_economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT202\", \"origin\": \"EWR\", \"destination\": \"MIA\", \"date\": \"2024-05-21\", \"price\": 94}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT232\", \"origin\": \"MIA\", \"destination\": \"LAX\", \"date\": \"2024-05-21\", \"price\": 80}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Ivan\", \"last_name\": \"Rossi\", \"dob\": \"1954-01-14\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Olivia\", \"last_name\": \"Santos\", \"dob\": \"1984-06-23\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Lei\", \"last_name\": \"Johansson\", \"dob\": \"1995-10-22\"}], \"payment_history\": [{\"payment_id\": \"gift_card_9823297\", \"amount\": 522}], \"created_at\": \"2024-05-09T13:43:03\", \"total_bagg", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 12, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 1, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "aa50189e", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T12:11:06"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "raw_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "39#0", "task_desc": "Bonjour, I mean hello. I would like to cancel all of my upcoming flights, s'il vous pla\u00eet. I need to cancel them all.\nAh, yes. My user id is amelia_davis_8890. I am Amelia Davis. I would like to cancel all of my flights, s'il vous pla\u00eet. The reason... I want to give up my seat for someone else who needs it, but we can discuss that when you find the reservations, d'accord?\nOui, yes, I confirm \u2014 please cancel both 8C8K4E and LU15PA. \n\nThe flown ones, I6M8JQ and 4XGCCM, they are already in the past", "score": 0.0, "em": 0.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: Hello! I'd be happy to help you cancel your upcoming flights. \n\nTo get started, I'll need your **user ID** (for example, something like 'sara_doe_496'). \n\nOnce I have that, I can look up your reservations and help you cancel them. Please note that I'll also need the reason for cancellation (change of plan, airline cancelled flight, or other reasons) for each reservation.\nassistant: Thank you, Amelia! Let me look up your profile and reservations.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"amelia_davis_8890\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Amelia\", \"last_name\": \"Davis\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"442 Sunset Drive\", \"address2\": \"Suite 708\", \"city\": \"San Diego\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"CA\", \"zip\": \"92125\"}, \"email\": \"amelia.davis1624@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1984-03-05\", \"payment_methods\": {\"gift_card_7397998\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_7397998\", \"amount\": 74.0}, \"gift_card_1647044\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_1647044\", \"amount\": 236.0}, \"credit_card_4074252\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_4074252\", \"brand\": \"mastercard\", \"last_four\": \"5435\"}, \"credit_card_6738701\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_6738701\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"