{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "raw_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "34#1", "task_desc": "Hello, I'm Yara Garcia. I have a reservation with the code HXDUBJ. I need to make some changes to my trip \u2014 I\u2019d like to change my upcoming outgoing flight to a nonstop one that departs the next day, and I also need to move my return from SFO back by one day.\nThanks, but I have a few requirements that aren't reflected in those options. \n\nFirst, I can only travel on flights that depart after 8:00 AM and before 9:00 PM, so the 7:00 AM outgoing and the 11:00 PM return won't work for me at all.\n\nMore", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'll help you modify your reservation. Let me first look up the details of your reservation.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"HXDUBJ\", \"user_id\": \"yara_garcia_1905\", \"origin\": \"IAH\", \"destination\": \"SFO\", \"flight_type\": \"round_trip\", \"cabin\": \"economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT085\", \"origin\": \"IAH\", \"destination\": \"JFK\", \"date\": \"2024-05-18\", \"price\": 177}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT023\", \"origin\": \"JFK\", \"destination\": \"SFO\", \"date\": \"2024-05-18\", \"price\": 146}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT278\", \"origin\": \"SFO\", \"destination\": \"IAH\", \"date\": \"2024-05-22\", \"price\": 180}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Yara\", \"last_name\": \"Garcia\", \"dob\": \"1974-08-15\"}], \"payment_history\": [{\"payment_id\": \"gift_card_6941833\", \"amount\": 533}], \"created_at\": \"2024-05-04T06:04:48\", \"total_baggages\": 0, \"nonfree_baggages\": 0, \"insurance\": \"yes\", \"status\": null}\nassistant: Thank you, Yara. I've retrieved your reservation. Here's a summary of your current booking:\n\n- **Reservation:** HXDUBJ (User ID: yara_garcia_1905)\n- **Trip type:** Round trip, IAH \u2194 SFO, Economy cabin\n- **Outgoing (2024-05-18):** IAH \u2192 JFK (HAT085) then JFK \u2192 SFO (HAT023) \u2014 this is a one-stop trip\n- **Return (2024-05-22):** SFO \u2192 IAH (HAT278) \u2014 nonstop\n- **Passenger:** Yara Garcia (DOB 1974-08-15)\n- **Insurance:** Yes\n\nTo make your requested changes, I'll search for:\n1. A **nonstop** IAH \u2192 SFO flight on **2024-05-19** (next day)\n2. A SFO \u2192 IAH flight on **2024-05-23** (return moved back one day)\n\nLet me look those up.\ntool: [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT072\", \"origin\": \"IAH\", \"destination\": \"SFO\", \"status\": \"available\", \"scheduled_departure_time_est\": \"09:00:00\", \"scheduled_arrival_time_est\": \"13:00:00\", \"date\": null, \"available_seats\": {\"basic_economy\": 18, \"economy\": 9, \"business\": 9}, \"prices\": {\"basic_economy\": 68, \"economy\": 130, \"business\": 282}}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT180\", \"origin\": \"IAH\", \"destination\": \"SFO\", \"status\": \"available\", \"scheduled_departure_time_est\": \"07:00:0", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 4, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 1, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "aa50189e", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T12:11:06"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "raw_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "29#1", "task_desc": "Hi, this is Raj. I\u2019m calling because I\u2019ve been dealing with a health problem and I had bought trip insurance for my booking, so I\u2019m hoping you can waive any change fees for me. I need to modify my upcoming roundtrip reservation \u2014 right now I\u2019m flying Detroit to LaGuardia and back, but I want to change to nonstop flights from Detroit to JFK and back on the same travel dates. I\u2019m only looking at early flights that get in before 7am at the destination, and I want the cheapest standard Economy (not ", "score": 0.0, "em": 0.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: Hi Raj, I\u2019d be happy to help you modify your reservation. To get started, I\u2019ll need a couple of details:\n\n1. Your **user ID** (e.g., something like `raj_patel_123`).\n2. Your **reservation ID** (if you have it). If you don\u2019t know it, I can look it up for you once I have your user ID.\n\nOnce I have your user ID, I can pull up your current roundtrip reservation (Detroit \u2194 LaGuardia) to confirm the travel dates, then search for the cheapest nonstop Economy flights from Detroit to JFK and back that arrive before 7am, and help you add one checked bag.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"VA5SGQ\", \"user_id\": \"raj_brown_5782\", \"origin\": \"DTW\", \"destination\": \"LGA\", \"flight_type\": \"round_trip\", \"cabin\": \"economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT035\", \"origin\": \"DTW\", \"destination\": \"PHX\", \"date\": \"2024-05-17\", \"price\": 163}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT066\", \"origin\": \"PHX\", \"destination\": \"LGA\", \"date\": \"2024-05-17\", \"price\": 184}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT002\", \"origin\": \"LGA\", \"destination\": \"PHX\", \"date\": \"2024-05-19\", \"price\": 174}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT106\", \"origin\": \"PHX\", \"destination\": \"DTW\", \"date\": \"2024-05-20\", \"price\": 135}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_