{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "raw_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "33#1", "task_desc": "Hi, I'm Yara Garcia. I have a reservation under the code HXDUBJ. I need to make some changes to my trips \u2014 I'd like to switch my upcoming outgoing flight to a nonstop one that leaves the next day instead, and also move my return flight from SFO back by one day. Can you help me with that?\nThanks for the options. I do have a time preference though \u2014 I only want flights departing after 8am and before 9pm. So the 7:00am outgoing flight is too early for me, and the 11:00pm return is too late. \n\nI'll ", "score": 0.0, "em": 0.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'll help you modify your reservation. Let me first look up the details of your reservation to understand the current flights.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"HXDUBJ\", \"user_id\": \"yara_garcia_1905\", \"origin\": \"IAH\", \"destination\": \"SFO\", \"flight_type\": \"round_trip\", \"cabin\": \"economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT085\", \"origin\": \"IAH\", \"destination\": \"JFK\", \"date\": \"2024-05-18\", \"price\": 177}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT023\", \"origin\": \"JFK\", \"destination\": \"SFO\", \"date\": \"2024-05-18\", \"price\": 146}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT278\", \"origin\": \"SFO\", \"destination\": \"IAH\", \"date\": \"2024-05-22\", \"price\": 180}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Yara\", \"last_name\": \"Garcia\", \"dob\": \"1974-08-15\"}], \"payment_history\": [{\"payment_id\": \"gift_card_6941833\", \"amount\": 533}], \"created_at\": \"2024-05-04T06:04:48\", \"total_baggages\": 0, \"nonfree_baggages\": 0, \"insurance\": \"yes\", \"status\": null}\nassistant: Thank you, Yara. I've located your reservation (HXDUBJ) under user ID **yara_garcia_1905**.\n\nHere's your current itinerary:\n- **Outgoing (2024-05-18):** IAH \u2192 JFK (HAT085) then JFK \u2192 SFO (HAT023) \u2014 this is a one-stop trip\n- **Return (2024-05-22):** SFO \u2192 IAH (HAT278