{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "raw_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "18#1", "task_desc": "Look, I'm dealing with some pretty stressful money problems right now and honestly I'm frustrated about having to do this, but I need to downgrade all of my business class flights to economy \u2014 every single one of them. I don't want to change any of the flights themselves or the passenger names, just the cabin class. My name is Omar Davis, if that helps.\nFine, here it is \u2014 my user ID is omar_davis_3817. Like I said, I need every business flight on my account downgraded to economy, no changes to t", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I understand this is a stressful time, and I'll do my best to help you downgrade your business class flights to economy. \n\nTo get started, I'll need your **user ID** (for example, something like `omar_davis_123`). I have your name as Omar Davis, but I'm unable to look up accounts by name alone with my available tools, so I'll need the specific user ID associated with your profile.\n\nCould you please provide your user ID? Once I have that, I can locate your reservations and review the cabin classes.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"omar_davis_3817\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Omar\", \"last_name\": \"Davis\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"281 Spruce Street\", \"address2\": \"Suite 942\", \"city\": \"San Diego\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"CA\", \"zip\": \"92164\"}, \"email\": \"omar.davis7857@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1982-10-19\", \"payment_methods\": {\"gift_card_3481935\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_3481935\", \"amount\": 22.0}, \"credit_card_2929732\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_2929732\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"7803\"}, \"credit_card_9525117\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_9525117\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"2172\"}, \"gift_card_6847880\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \