{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "raw_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "10#1", "task_desc": "Hi, I need to adjust my upcoming travel plans. I have a flight from Houston (IAH) to Seattle (SEA) booked on May 23, and I\u2019d like to push it back to May 24 instead. On top of that, I want to upgrade the cabin to business class for everyone on that reservation.\nSure, my user ID is liam_khan_2521. I don\u2019t have the reservation ID on hand right now, but you should be able to pull up my booking with that.\nThanks for pulling that up. To confirm your questions:\n\n1. **Date change:** Yes, I only want to ", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: To help you modify your reservation, I'll need a few details first. Could you please provide your **user ID**? \n\nAlso, if you have your **reservation ID** handy, please share that as well. If you don't know it, I can help locate it once I have your user ID.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"liam_khan_2521\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Liam\", \"last_name\": \"Khan\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"626 Willow Lane\", \"address2\": \"Suite 707\", \"city\": \"New York\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"NY\", \"zip\": \"10148\"}, \"email\": \"liam.khan7273@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1979-09-27\", \"payment_methods\": {\"certificate_9254323\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_9254323\", \"amount\": 500.0}, \"gift_card_7194529\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_7194529\", \"amount\": 62.0}, \"credit_card_7434610\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_7434610\", \"brand\": \"mastercard\", \"last_four\": \"9448\"}, \"credit_card_7231150\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_7231150\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"3422\"}, \"certificate_1849235\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_1849235\", \"amount\": 250.0}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Fatima\", \"last_name\": \"Ito\", \"dob\": \"