{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "raw_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "38#1", "task_desc": "Hi, this is Noah Muller. I'm calling because I'm pretty frustrated about my most recent flight \u2014 it got delayed and I really want to sort this out with someone.\nSure, my user ID is noah_muller_9847.\nThanks for pulling that up. Since you mentioned it as an option, I'd like to seek compensation for that delay \u2014 it really messed up my plans and I think that's the least the airline can do given the inconvenience.\nHold on, that calculation is off \u2014 there are 3 passengers on that reservation, not 1! S", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'm sorry to hear about the delay. I'd like to help you sort this out. To look up your reservation, I'll need your user ID (for example, something like \"noah_muller_123\"). Could you please provide that?\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"noah_muller_9847\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Noah\", \"last_name\": \"Muller\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"889 Hillcrest Drive\", \"address2\": \"Suite 254\", \"city\": \"Denver\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"CO\", \"zip\": \"80243\"}, \"email\": \"noah.muller2290@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1963-01-22\", \"payment_methods\": {\"credit_card_1245537\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_1245537\", \"brand\": \"mastercard\", \"last_four\": \"1167\"}, \"credit_card_6040264\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_6040264\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"2076\"}, \"credit_card_3255100\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_3255100\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"2604\"}, \"certificate_8301303\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_8301303\", \"amount\": 100.0}, \"credit_card_3983998\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_3983998\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"8413\"}, \"credit_card_7574394\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credi