{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "raw_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "24#1", "task_desc": "Hello, this is Mia Kim. I have a reservation under H9ZU1C and I need to take a passenger named Ethan off of that booking. On top of that, I\u2019m hoping to book a round-trip flight from New York out to the West Coast for some exploring. Could you help me with both of those things?\nThanks for clarifying the policy on passenger changes. Since removing Ethan from H9ZU1C isn't possible, I'd like to go ahead and cancel that entire reservation so I can rebook myself later.\n\nNow, for the new trip:\n- My use", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: Hello Mia! I can help with your requests, but I need to clarify a couple of things first.\n\n**Regarding removing Ethan from reservation H9ZU1C:**\nI'm sorry, but per our policy, the number of passengers on a reservation cannot be modified \u2014 a passenger cannot be added or removed. Even a human agent is not able to change the number of passengers on a booking. I can only help update passenger details (such as name or date of birth) for the existing passengers, but I cannot take Ethan off the reservation. If you'd like, I can look into other options, but removing a passenger is not something I'm able to do.\n\n**Regarding your new round-trip booking:**\nTo get started, I'll need a few details:\n1. **Your user ID** (e.g., the format like `mia_kim_123`) \u2014 this is required before I can look up your existing reservation or book a new one.\n2. **Specific origin airport** \u2014 New York has a few airports (JFK, LGA, EWR). Which one would you like to depart from?\n3. **Specific West Coast destination airport** \u2014 for example, LAX (Los Angeles), SFO (San Francisco), SEA (Seattle), etc.\n\nOnce I have your user ID and these flight details, I can assist with the booking. Please also let me know your preferred travel dates, cabin class, and passenger information when you're ready.\nassistant: I'll help you with both tasks. Let me start by looking up the details of reservation H9ZU1C to verify the cancellation eligibility, since I need to confirm a few things before cancelling (such as whether any flights have already been flown, the cabin class, and insurance status).\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"H9ZU1C\", \"user_id\": \"mia_kim_4397\", \"origin\": \"MIA\", \"destination\": \"IAH\", \"flight_type\": \"one_way\", \"cabin\": \"economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT192\", \"origin\": \"MIA\", \"destination\": \"EWR\", \"date\": \"2024-05-24\", \"price\": 174}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT166\", \"origin\": \"EWR\", \"destination\": \"IAH\", \"date\": \"2024-05-25\", \"price\": 125}], \"passengers\": [", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 21, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 1, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "aa50189e", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T12:11:06"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "raw_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "39#1", "task_desc": "Bonjour, hello. My name is Amelia Davis. I want to cancel all of my upcoming flights, s'il vous pla\u00eet. Can you help me with that?\nAh, oui, of course. My user ID is amelia_davis_8890. \n\nFor the reason, I think it is \"other\" \u2014 I want to cancel all my flights because I wish to give up my seat for someone else who needs it more, vous comprenez? I do not need the refund, I just want to free the places.\nOui, yes, please go ahead and cancel the 8C8K4E and LU15PA, merci beaucoup. \n\nBut... I see you say ", "score": 0.0, "em": 0.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: Hello! I'd be happy to help you cancel your upcoming flights. \n\nTo get started, I'll need a few details:\n1. Your **user ID** (this is required to locate your reservations).\n2. The **reason for cancellation** (options: change of plan, airline cancelled flight, or other reasons).\n\nIf you don't know your reservation IDs, I can help locate them once I have your user ID. Could you please provide your user ID?\nassistant: Thank you! Let me look up your profile to find your reservations.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"amelia_davis_8890\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Amelia\", \"last_name\": \"Davis\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"442 Sunset Drive\", \"address2\": \"Suite 708\", \"city\": \"San Diego\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"CA\", \"zip\": \"92125\"}, \"email\": \"amelia.davis1624@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1984-03-05\", \"payment_methods\": {\"gift_card_7397998\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_7397998\", \"amount\": 74.0}, \"gift_card_1647044\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_1647044\", \"amount\": 236.0}, \"credit_card_4074252\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_4074252\", \"brand\": \"mastercard\", \"last_four\": \"5435\"}, \"credit_card_6738701\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_6738701\", \"