{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "raw_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "13#0", "task_desc": "Hi, I need to change my upcoming return flight. It's currently a one-stop from Atlanta to Los Angeles, and I'd like to switch it to a nonstop flight from Atlanta to Las Vegas instead. I just want to modify my existing reservation, not book anything new.\nI understand, but changing the destination is exactly what I need to do \u2014 I want to go to Las Vegas instead of Los Angeles. Since you're saying the change isn't possible, I'd like to be transferred to someone who can help me with this.\n###TRANSFE", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'm sorry, but I cannot modify your reservation in this way. According to our policy, flight modifications must keep the same origin, destination, and trip type. Changing the destination from Los Angeles to Las Vegas is not permitted through a modification.\n\nIf you'd like to proceed with a different modification that keeps the same origin, destination, and trip type (for example, switching from a one-stop to a nonstop flight on the same Atlanta\u2013Los Angeles route), I can help with that. Please let me know, and I'll need your user ID and reservation ID to get started.\ntool: Transfer successful\nassistant: YOU ARE BEING TRANSFERRED TO A HUMAN AGENT. PLEASE HOLD ON.", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 1, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 2, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "aa50189e", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T12:28:05"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "raw_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "27#0", "task_desc": "Hi, I'm absolutely furious. My flight HAT039 from ATL to SEA has been delayed and no one has given me a straight answer. I need to know exactly why this flight is delayed!\nLook, I don't have my reservation ID handy, and honestly I'm not sure of the exact date in that YYYY-MM-DD format you're asking for \u2014 but my user ID is ethan_martin_2396. The flight is HAT039, Atlanta to Seattle.\n\nAnd I don't care if your system \"doesn't show the reason\" \u2014 I need a human being to tell me why I've been stuck wa", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I understand your frustration. I can look up the status of flight HAT039 for you, but I'll need the date of the flight to check it. Could you please provide:\n\n1. The date of your flight (in YYYY-MM-DD format)\n2. Your user ID\n3. Your reservation ID (if you have it)\n\nPlease note that my tools can confirm the flight status (such as delayed, on time, etc.), but they do not provide the specific reason for a delay. If you'd like, once I confirm the delay, I can also help you change or cancel the reservation and look into compensation options.\ntool: Transfer successful\nassistant: YOU ARE BEING TRANSFERRED TO A HUMAN AGENT. PLEASE HOLD ON.", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 1, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 2, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "aa50189e", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T12:28:05"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "raw_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "3#0", "task_desc": "Hi, I'm calling because I've got an upcoming flight and I really need to know exactly how many suitcases my reservation allows me to bring. I've got a lot of stuff to pack for this trip and I'm pretty stressed about making sure I get the right information. I'm pretty sure I'm a Gold member, by the way.\nSure, yes. My user ID is anya_garcia_5901. That's for my reservation with confirmation number JMO1MG, under the name Anya Garcia. I really need to get this bag allowance sorted out.\nWait, no \u2014 I'm", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'd be happy to help you find out how many checked bags your reservation allows. To look up your reservation details, I'll need your user ID first. Could you please provide your user ID?\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"JMO1MG\", \"user_id\": \"anya_garcia_5901\", \"origin\": \"DEN\", \"destination\": \"MIA\", \"flight_type\": \"one_way\", \"cabin\": \"economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT255\", \"origin\": \"DEN\", \"destination\": \"MIA\", \"date\": \"2024-05-16\", \"price\": 149}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Anya\", \"last_name\": \"Garcia\", \"dob\": \"1992-11-12\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Raj\", \"last_name\": \"Jackson\", \"dob\": \"1956-03-09\"}], \"payment_history\": [{\"payment_id\": \"gift_card_2550356\", \"amount\": 358}], \"created_at\": \"2024-05-13T23:20:29\", \"total_baggages\": 1, \"nonfree_baggages\": 0, \"insurance\": \"yes\", \"status\": null}\nassistant: Let me verify your membership level to determine your exact free bag allowance.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"anya_garcia_5901\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Anya\", \"last_name\": \"Garcia\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"555 Highland Drive\", \"address2\": \"Suite 243\", \"city\": \"San Antonio\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"TX\", \"zip\": \"78256\"}, \"email\": \"anya.garcia8816@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1992-11-12\", \"payment_methods\": {\"gift_card_2550356\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_2550356\", \"amount\": 149.0}, \"certificate_7583008\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_7583008\", \"amount\": 150.0}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Mei\", \"last_name\": \"Lee\", \"dob\": \"1989-12-13\"}], \"membership\": \"silver\", \"reservations\": [\"82K959\", \"790JYN\", \"BE2L57\", \"CXBB4L\", \"TAMSDK\", \"3RK2T9\", \"VAOW1B\", \"Q4MCUF\", \"JMO1MG\"]}\nassistant: I've looked up your reservation and profile. Here's the accurate information about your bag allowance:\n\n**Important correction:** Your profile shows you're actually a **Silver** member (not Gold, as you mentioned). This affects your free bag allowance.\n\n**Your reservation JMO1MG details:**\n- Trip: One-way, Denver (DEN) \u2192 Mia", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 3, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 2, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "aa50189e", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T12:28:05"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "raw_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "31#0", "task_desc": "Hi, yeah, I'm in a bit of a panic. My cat is really ill and I need to get back home as soon as possible to take care of him. I have a flight scheduled out of JFK on May 17, and I was wondering if I could change it to a nonstop flight that gets me home earlier. Can you help with that?\nOh, okay. My user ID is daiki_lee_6144. I'm sorry, but I don't have my reservation ID on me right now\u2014I didn't write it down and can't find the confirmation email. Can you look that up for me with my user ID?\nOh no,", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'm sorry to hear about your cat. I'll do my best to help you change your flight.\n\nTo get started, I'll need your user ID. Also, if you have your reservation ID handy, please share that as well\u2014otherwise, I can help locate it for you once I have your user ID.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"daiki_lee_6144\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Daiki\", \"last_name\": \"Lee\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"410 River Road\", \"address2\": \"Suite 380\", \"city\": \"Fort Worth\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"TX\", \"zip\": \"76173\"}, \"email\": \"daiki.lee6987@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1976-10-08\", \"payment_methods\": {\"credit_card_6198952\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_6198952\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"9734\"}, \"gift_card_3112961\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_3112961\", \"amount\": 51.0}, \"gift_card_5128346\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_5128346\", \"amount\": 262.0}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Raj\", \"last_name\": \"Muller\", \"dob\": \"1967-10-16\"}], \"membership\": \"regular\", \"reservations\": [\"DF89BM\", \"COVE6R\", \"IIHXDG\"]}\nassistant: I found your profile. You have three reservations: DF89BM, COVE6R, and IIHXDG. Let me check the details of each to find the one with a flight out of JFK on May 17.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"DF89BM\", \"user_id\": \"daiki_lee_6144\", \"origin\": \"JFK\", \"destination\": \"DTW\", \"flight_type\": \"round_trip\", \"cabin\": \"basic_economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT079\", \"origin\": \"JFK\", \"destination\": \"ORD\", \"date\": \"2024-05-17\", \"price\": 63}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT020\", \"origin\": \"ORD\", \"destination\": \"DTW\", \"date\": \"2024-05-17\", \"price\": 78}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT263\", \"origin\": \"DTW\", \"destination\": \"JFK\", \"date\": \"2024-05-24\", \"price\": 53}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Daiki\", \"last_name\": \"Lee\", \"dob\": \"1976-10-08\"}], \"payment_history\": [{\"payment_id\": \"gift_card_3112961\", \"amount\": 194}], \"created_at\": \"2024-05-01T23:25:01\", \"total_baggages\": 0, \"nonfree_baggages\": 0, \"insurance\": \"no\", \"status\": nu", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 4, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 2, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "aa50189e", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T12:28:05"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "raw_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "19#0", "task_desc": "Hi, I have a booking for a quick half-day trip to Texas, but I can't seem to find my reservation number. My return flight right now leaves at 3pm on the 28th, and I\u2019d like to change it to a later flight that same day back to Newark\u2014or if that\u2019s not available, the earliest flight the next day. Can you help me sort that out?\nSure, my user ID is olivia_gonzalez_2305.\nOkay, since it\u2019s basic economy and can\u2019t be changed, I\u2019d like to cancel the trip using the travel insurance. I\u2019m actually feeling unw", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: To help you locate your reservation and modify your flight, I'll need your user ID first. Could you please provide your user ID?\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"olivia_gonzalez_2305\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Olivia\", \"last_name\": \"Gonzalez\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"334 Laurel Lane\", \"address2\": \"Suite 970\", \"city\": \"Los Angeles\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"CA\", \"zip\": \"90504\"}, \"email\": \"olivia.gonzalez4421@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1988-06-13\", \"payment_methods\": {\"gift_card_2200803\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_2200803\", \"amount\": 123.0}, \"credit_card_9969263\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_9969263\", \"brand\": \"mastercard\", \"last_four\": \"9475\"}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Mei\", \"last_name\": \"Johansson\", \"dob\": \"1981-09-25\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Yara\", \"last_name\": \"Lopez\", \"dob\": \"1975-09-15\"}], \"membership\": \"regular\", \"reservations\": [\"Z7GOZK\", \"K67C4W\", \"THY2DG\"]}\nassistant: I found your profile. You have three reservations (Z7GOZK, K67C4W, THY2DG). Let me check the details of each to find the one matching your Texas trip with a return flight to Newark on the 28th.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"Z7GOZK\", \"user_id\": \"olivia_gonzalez_2305\", \"origin\": \"EWR\", \"destination\": \"IAH\", \"flight_type\": \"round_trip\", \"cabin\": \"basic_economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT188\", \"origin\": \"EWR\", \"destination\": \"IAH\", \"date\": \"2024-05-28\", \"price\": 52}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT207\", \"origin\": \"IAH\", \"destination\": \"EWR\", \"date\": \"2024-05-28\", \"price\": 87}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Olivia\", \"last_name\": \"Gonzalez\", \"dob\": \"1988-06-13\"}], \"payment_history\": [{\"payment_id\": \"gift_card_2200803\", \"amount\": 169}], \"created_at\": \"2024-05-13T19:41:32\", \"total_baggages\": 0, \"nonfree_baggages\": 0, \"insurance\": \"yes\", \"status\": null}\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"K67C4W\", \"user_id\": \"olivia_gonzalez_2305\", \"origin\": \"LAS\", \"destination\": \"MCO\", \"flight_type\": \"one_way\", \"cabin\": \"economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_numb", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 5, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 2, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "aa50189e", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T12:28:05"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "raw_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "32#0", "task_desc": "Hello, I need to change my flight that's scheduled out of Newark on May 21st. I'm looking to get on a nonstop flight that same day instead\u2014my mom is really sick and I have to get back home sooner to take care of her.\nI'm Ivan Rossi\u2014my user ID is ivan_rossi_8555. I don't have my reservation ID handy right now, but hopefully you can pull up my booking with that.\n###TRANSFER###", "score": 0.0, "em": 0.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'm sorry to hear about your mom. I'll help you change your flight. To get started, I'll need some information to locate your reservation.\n\nCould you please provide your **user ID**? (For example, something like \"sara_doe_496\".)\n\nAlso, if you know your **reservation ID**, please share that as well. If you don't have it handy, I can help locate it once I have your user ID.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"ivan_rossi_8555\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Ivan\", \"last_name\": \"Rossi\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"513 Main Street\", \"address2\": \"Suite 805\", \"city\": \"Philadelphia\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"PA\", \"zip\": \"19102\"}, \"email\": \"ivan.rossi2633@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1954-01-14\", \"payment_methods\": {\"gift_card_7344518\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_7344518\", \"amount\": 183.0}, \"gift_card_9823297\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_9823297\", \"amount\": 224.0}, \"credit_card_9659780\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_9659780\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"1777\"}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Ava\", \"last_name\": \"Silva\", \"dob\": \"1971-01-14\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Anya\", \"last_name\": \"Patel\", \"dob\": \"1990-06-13\"}], \"membership\": \"silver\", \"reservations\": [\"OWZ4XL\", \"F3IQK1\", \"8WMF4C\", \"L2H5FP\"]}\nassistant: I found your profile. You have several reservatio