{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "raw_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "30#0", "task_desc": "Hi, I need to make some changes to my upcoming trip from Las Vegas to Houston. Right now it's a one-stop flight, and I'd like to switch it to a nonstop if possible. Also, I'd like to remove the checked bag I added and get a refund for it.\nOkay, I understand about the checked bag \u2014 that's fine, we'll leave it as is then. \n\nAs for the flight change, my user ID is james_taylor_7043.\nI'll go with HAT266 \u2014 it's the earlier and cheaper option. Could you please confirm the full change details before we", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I can help you with changing your flight. However, I should note that per our policy, checked bags can be added but not removed from a reservation, so I won't be able to remove the checked bag or refund it.\n\nTo get started with the flight change, I'll need some information first. Could you please provide your **user ID**? If you don't know your reservation ID, I can help locate it once I have your user ID.\nassistant: Thank you! Let me look up your profile and reservations.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"james_taylor_7043\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"James\", \"last_name\": \"Taylor\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"133 Chestnut Street\", \"address2\": \"Suite 494\", \"city\": \"Houston\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"TX\", \"zip\": \"77207\"}, \"email\": \"james.taylor4788@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1997-01-23\", \"payment_methods\": {\"certificate_9380982\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_9380982\", \"amount\": 100.0}, \"gift_card_5634230\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_5634230\", \"amount\": 67.0}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Ivan\", \"last_name\": \"Taylor\", \"dob\": \"1975-09-15\"}], \"membership\": \"silver\", \"reservations\": [\"UUN48W\", \"1N99U6\", \"1R63WQ\"]}\nassistant: I found your profile. You have three reservations (UUN48W, 1N99U6, 1R63WQ). Let me check the details to find the one from Las Vegas to Houston.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"UUN48W\", \"user_id\": \"james_taylor_7043\", \"origin\": \"IAH\", \"destination\": \"LAS\", \"flight_type\": \"round_trip\", \"cabin\": \"business\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT131\", \"origin\": \"IAH\", \"destination\": \"LAS\", \"date\": \"2024-05-23\", \"price\": 1829}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT175\", \"origin\": \"LAS\", \"destination\": \"IAH\", \"date\": \"2024-05-30\", \"price\": 508}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"James\", \"last_name\": \"Taylor\", \"dob\": \"1997-01-23\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Lei\", \"last_name\": \"Rossi\", \"dob\": \"1975-01-27\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Mason\", \"last_name\": \"Moore\", \"dob\": \"1966-07-21\"}], \"payment_history\": [{\"payment_id\": \"gift_card_563423", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 6, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 2, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "aa50189e", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T12:28:05"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "raw_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "12#0", "task_desc": "Hi, I have a flight from Boston to Minneapolis coming up, and I'd like to change the class for all passengers on my reservation to business. Can you help me with that?\nSure, my user ID is chen_lee_6825, and the reservation ID is YAX4DR. The name on the booking is Chen Lee.\nThanks for the breakdown, but $1,200 is way over what I'm willing to pay \u2014 my limit for the upgrade is $650 total. Since that's more than my budget for both of us, I'd like to just upgrade my companion Noah to business instead", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: To help you change the cabin class to business, I'll need some information first. Could you please provide your **user ID**? \n\nAlso, if you know your **reservation ID**, please share that as well. If you don't have it, I can help locate it once I have your user ID.\nassistant: Let me look up your reservation details to verify the information.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"YAX4DR\", \"user_id\": \"chen_lee_6825\", \"origin\": \"BOS\", \"destination\": \"MSP\", \"flight_type\": \"one_way\", \"cabin\": \"economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT235\", \"origin\": \"BOS\", \"destination\": \"MCO\", \"date\": \"2024-05-18\", \"price\": 122}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT298\", \"origin\": \"MCO\", \"destination\": \"MSP\", \"date\": \"2024-05-19\", \"price\": 127}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Chen\", \"last_name\": \"Lee\", \"dob\": \"1967-12-12\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Noah\", \"last_name\": \"Hernandez\", \"dob\": \"1968-01-06\"}], \"payment_history\": [{\"payment_id\": \"credit_card_4938634\", \"amount\": 498}], \"created_at\": \"2024-05-05T23:00:15\", \"total_baggages\": 0, \"nonfree_baggages\": 0, \"insurance\": \"no\", \"status\": null}\nassistant: Thank you. I've retrieved your reservation. Before proceeding with the cabin change, let me verify the flight status to ensure no flights have already been flown.\ntool: available\ntool: available\nassistant: Both flights are still available and have not been flown, so a cabin change is permitted. Now I need to find the business class prices for these flights to calculate any price difference. Let me search for them.\ntool: [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT013\", \"origin\": \"BOS\", \"destination\": \"MCO\", \"status\": \"available\", \"scheduled_departure_time_est\": \"19:00:00\", \"scheduled_arrival_time_est\": \"22:30:00\", \"date\": null, \"available_seats\": {\"basic_economy\": 0, \"economy\": 5, \"business\": 14}, \"prices\": {\"basic_economy\": 65, \"economy\": 128, \"business\": 338}}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT145\", \"origin\": \"BOS\", \"destination\": \"MCO\", \"status\": \"available\", \"scheduled_departure_time_est\": \"16:00", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 8, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 2, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "aa50189e", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T12:28:05"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "raw_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "0#0", "task_desc": "Hello, I'd like to cancel my airline booking with confirmation code EHGLP3. Can you help me with that?\nSure, my user ID is emma_kim_9957. As I mentioned, I need to cancel my reservation EHGLP3.\nI'm sorry, but that doesn't sound right. When I booked this, I was told I didn't need to purchase insurance because my previous trip was booked through the same agency and that one already had coverage. \n\nAlso, just to be clear \u2014 I don't want to go through with cancelling if I'm not going to get a refund ", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: To help you cancel your reservation, I'll need your user ID first. Could you please provide your user ID?\nassistant: I'll look up your reservation and user details to proceed with the cancellation.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"EHGLP3\", \"user_id\": \"emma_kim_9957\", \"origin\": \"PHX\", \"destination\": \"JFK\", \"flight_type\": \"one_way\", \"cabin\": \"basic_economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT156\", \"origin\": \"PHX\", \"destination\": \"SEA\", \"date\": \"2024-05-17\", \"price\": 50}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT021\", \"origin\": \"SEA\", \"destination\": \"JFK\", \"date\": \"2024-05-17\", \"price\": 54}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Evelyn\", \"last_name\": \"Taylor\", \"dob\": \"1965-01-16\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Anya\", \"last_name\": \"Silva\", \"dob\": \"1971-11-22\"}], \"payment_history\": [{\"payment_id\": \"credit_card_5832574\", \"amount\": 208}], \"created_at\": \"2024-05-04T23:12:06\", \"total_baggages\": 0, \"nonfree_baggages\": 0, \"insurance\": \"no\", \"status\": null}\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"emma_kim_9957\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Emma\", \"last_name\": \"Kim\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"109 Willow Lane\", \"address2\": \"Suite 171\", \"city\": \"Philadelphia\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"PA\", \"zip\": \"19151\"}, \"email