{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "raw_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "3#1", "task_desc": "Hello, I'm Anya Garcia. I'm calling because I'm quite anxious about my next flight \u2013 I have so many belongings I must pack for this trip. Could you tell me how many suitcases my booking permits me to bring along? I believe I'm a Gold member, though I'm not completely certain, and it's really important that I get the exact allowance right because I have a lot to take with me.\nMy user ID is anya_garcia_5901. I'm really stressed about this because I have so many things I need to bring on this trip,", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: Hello Anya! I'd be happy to help you determine your baggage allowance. To look up your booking and membership details, I'll need your user ID. Could you please provide your user ID (for example, something like \"anya_garcia_123\")?\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"anya_garcia_5901\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Anya\", \"last_name\": \"Garcia\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"555 Highland Drive\", \"address2\": \"Suite 243\", \"city\": \"San Antonio\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"TX\", \"zip\": \"78256\"}, \"email\": \"anya.garcia8816@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1992-11-12\", \"payment_methods\": {\"gift_card_2550356\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_2550356\", \"amount\": 149.0}, \"certificate_7583008\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_7583008\", \"amount\": 150.0}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Mei\", \"last_name\": \"Lee\", \"dob\": \"1989-12-13\"}], \"membership\": \"silver\", \"reservations\": [\"82K959\", \"790JYN\", \"BE2L57\", \"CXBB4L\", \"TAMSDK\", \"3RK2T9\", \"VAOW1B\", \"Q4MCUF\", \"JMO1MG\"]}\nassistant: I've looked up your profile, and I have an important correction: your membership level is actually **Silver**, not Gold. This affects your baggage allowance.\n\nI can see you have several reservations on file: 82K959, 790JYN, BE2L57, CXBB4L, TAMSDK, 3RK2T9, VAOW1B, Q4MCUF, and JMO1MG.\n\nSince your baggage allowance depends on the specific reservation (cabin class and number of passengers), could you please tell me which reservation or trip you're asking about? If you're not sure of the reservation ID, let me know the destination or date of your upcoming flight and I'll help locate it.\ntool: Transfer successful\nassistant: YOU ARE BEING TRANSFERRED TO A HUMAN AGENT. PLEASE HOLD ON.", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 2, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 2, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "aa50189e", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T12:28:05"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "raw_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "28#0", "task_desc": "Hello, I'm Amelia Rossi. I need to cancel the flights on my reservation SI5UKW and get a refund. Something urgent came up and I won't be able to travel anymore. Can you help me with that?\nSure, my user ID is amelia_rossi_1297. Can you go ahead and cancel those flights now and process the refund for me?\nI'm sorry, but I really can't accept that as a final answer. I understand the policy you're citing, but I'm a loyal customer who has flown with you many times, and this is an emergency situation. ", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: Hello Amelia! I'd be happy to help you cancel your reservation SI5UKW. Before I proceed, I need to collect your user ID for verification purposes. Could you please provide your user ID?\nassistant: Thank you! Let me first look up your reservation and profile details to verify the information before proceeding.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"SI5UKW\", \"user_id\": \"amelia_rossi_1297\", \"origin\": \"MIA\", \"destination\": \"PHX\", \"flight_type\": \"one_way\", \"cabin\": \"basic_economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT062\", \"origin\": \"MIA\", \"destination\": \"LAS\", \"date\": \"2024-05-16\", \"price\": 67}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT284\", \"origin\": \"LAS\", \"destination\": \"PHX\", \"date\": \"2024-05-17\", \"price\": 57}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Amelia\", \"last_name\": \"Rossi\", \"dob\": \"1960-01-19\"}], \"payment_history\": [{\"payment_id\": \"credit_card_4579924\", \"amount\": 124}], \"created_at\": \"2024-05-11T00:08:57\", \"total_baggages\": 0, \"nonfree_baggages\": 0, \"insurance\": \"no\", \"status\": null}\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"amelia_rossi_1297\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Amelia\", \"last_name\": \"Rossi\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"747 Maple Drive\", \"address2\": \"Suite 422\", \"city\": \"Indianapolis\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\