{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "raw_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "11#0", "task_desc": "Hey, I'm James Patel and I need to get a passenger removed from my flights ASAP. I've got a round trip from LAS to DEN, leaving May 19 and coming back May 20. I need to take Sophia off that booking. I'm kind of in a rush, so can you just get this done quickly?\nLook, I'm really pressed for time here. You're saying I can't just drop Sophia from the reservation? That's a pain. Alright, then just downgrade everyone on that trip to basic economy instead. My user ID is james_patel_9828 \u2014 I can't recal", "score": 0.0, "em": 0.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'm sorry, but I'm unable to remove a passenger from your booking. According to our policy, the number of passengers on a reservation cannot be modified \u2014 this applies to both automated agents and human agents. You can modify passenger details (such as names or dates of birth), but the passenger count must remain the same.\n\nIf you'd like, I can help you with other modifications to your reservation, such as changing flights, cabin class, or adding baggage. To proceed with any of those, I'll need your user ID and reservation ID. Please let me know how you'd like to proceed.\nassistant: I'll help you with the cabin downgrade. First, let me locate your reservation using your user ID.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"james_patel_9828\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"James\", \"last_name\": \"Patel\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"656 River Road\", \"address2\": \"Suite 768\", \"city\": \"Los Angeles\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"CA\", \"zip\": \"90357\"}, \"email\": \"james.patel1360@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1995-04-07\", \"payment_methods\": {\"gift_card_1642017\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_1642017\", \"amount\": 128.0}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"James\", \"last_name\": \"Sanchez\", \"dob\": \"1956-08-18\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Ava\", \"last_name\": \"Rossi\", \"dob\": \"1973-11-14\"}], \"membership\": \"gold\", \"reservations\": [\"AAVMM8\", \"MQHHT6\", \"GV1N64\"]}\nassistant: I found your profile. You have three reservations (AAVMM8, MQHHT6, GV1N64). Let me check each to find the one matching your LAS\u2192DEN round trip (May 19\u201320).\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"AAVMM8\", \"user_id\": \"james_patel_9828\", \"origin\": \"MCO\", \"destination\": \"DTW\", \"flight_type\": \"one_way\", \"cabin\": \"business\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT214\", \"origin\": \"MCO\", \"destination\": \"PHX\", \"date\": \"2024-05-21\", \"price\": 1358}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT106\", \"origin\": \"PHX\", \"destination\": \"DTW\", \"date\": \"2024-05-22\", \"price\": 988}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Olivia\", \"last_name\": \"Johansson\", \"dob\": \"1992-10-18\"}", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 8, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 2, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "aa50189e", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T12:28:05"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "raw_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "4#1", "task_desc": "Hello. I'm absolutely furious right now. I had a business flight with you earlier this month that got canceled, and because of that I ended up missing a really important meeting. I need to be compensated for this whole mess and the inconvenience it caused me.\nThis is Sophia Silva, and my user ID is sophia_silva_7557. I already told you \u2014 your airline canceled my business flight earlier this month and I missed a critical meeting because of it. I expect proper compensation for that, not just some ", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'm sorry to hear about your experience. To confirm the facts and assist with compensation, I'll need some information first.\n\nCould you please provide your user ID? Once I have that, I can look up your reservation and verify the details of the cancelled business flight.\nassistant: Let me look up your profile and reservations to confirm the details.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"sophia_silva_7557\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Sophia\", \"last_name\": \"Silva\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"141 Cedar Avenue\", \"address2\": \"Suite 436\", \"city\": \"Columbus\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"OH\", \"zip\": \"43282\"}, \"email\": \"sophia.silva5929@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1957-10-05\", \"payment_methods\": {\"certificate_8045380\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_8045380\", \"amount\": 500.0}, \"certificate_3887113\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_3887113\", \"amount\": 150.0}, \"credit_card_4196779\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_4196779\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"7238\"}, \"gift_card_5094406\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_5094406\", \"amount\": 274.0}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Yara\", \"last_name\": \"Silva\", \"dob\": \"1972-06-16\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Isabella\"