{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "raw_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "17#0", "task_desc": "Hi, I'm calling about my upcoming flight from New York to Chicago. I need to add 3 checked bags, change the passenger to myself, and upgrade it to economy class.\nSure, my user ID is omar_rossi_1241. I don't have my reservation ID handy, but hopefully you can locate the booking with that.\nYes, I confirm all three changes \u2014 adding the 3 checked bags, changing the passenger to me, and upgrading to economy. For the price difference on the upgrade, I'd like to use a gift card; the one with ID gift_ca", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: To help you with these changes, I'll need some information first. Could you please provide your **user ID**? Also, do you have your **reservation ID**? If not, I can help locate it once I have your user ID.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"omar_rossi_1241\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Omar\", \"last_name\": \"Rossi\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"901 Pine Lane\", \"address2\": \"Suite 360\", \"city\": \"Houston\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"TX\", \"zip\": \"77271\"}, \"email\": \"omar.rossi5980@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1970-06-06\", \"payment_methods\": {\"gift_card_8190333\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_8190333\", \"amount\": 280.0}, \"credit_card_6754990\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_6754990\", \"brand\": \"mastercard\", \"last_four\": \"3848\"}, \"certificate_8390038\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_8390038\", \"amount\": 150.0}, \"certificate_1778167\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_1778167\", \"amount\": 250.0}, \"gift_card_6490722\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_6490722\", \"amount\": 127.0}, \"credit_card_7407366\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_7407366\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"6437\"}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Liam\", \"last_name\": \"Lee\", \"dob\": \"1989-08-12\"}], \"membership\": \"gold\", \"reservations\": [\"UM3OG5\", \"5RJ7UH\", \"FQ8APE\", \"QKRY03\"]}\nassistant: I found your profile. You have several reservations. Let me locate the one from New York to Chicago by checking your bookings.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"UM3OG5\", \"user_id\": \"omar_rossi_1241\", \"origin\": \"SEA\", \"destination\": \"DFW\", \"flight_type\": \"round_trip\", \"cabin\": \"economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT113\", \"origin\": \"SEA\", \"destination\": \"DFW\", \"date\": \"2024-05-26\", \"price\": 117}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT282\", \"origin\": \"DFW\", \"destination\": \"ATL\", \"date\": \"2024-05-28\", \"price\": 140}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT239\", \"origin\": \"ATL\", \"destination\": \"SEA\", \"date\": \"2024-05-28\", \"price\": 158}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Omar\", \"", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 8, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 2, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "aa50189e", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T12:28:05"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "raw_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "1#1", "task_desc": "Hello. I recently got off the phone with one of your customer support representatives, and they told me that a service agent like yourself would be able to help me cancel a reservation I have. I\u2019d like to get that sorted out.\nSure, my user ID is raj_sanchez_7340. I don\u2019t have the reservation ID in front of me right now, but hopefully you can pull up my trips with that.\nI don\u2019t have the reservation ID offhand, but the trip I need to cancel is the one from Philadelphia to LaGuardia. Could you chec", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: Hello! I'd be happy to help you cancel your reservation. \n\nTo get started, I'll need your user ID. Could you please provide that? If you also have your reservation ID handy, please share that as well\u2014but if not, I can help locate it once I have your user ID.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"raj_sanchez_7340\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Raj\", \"last_name\": \"Sanchez\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"794 Sunset Drive\", \"address2\": \"Suite 598\", \"city\": \"Charlotte\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"NC\", \"zip\": \"28271\"}, \"email\": \"raj.sanchez1048@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1965-09-13\", \"payment_methods\": {\"credit_card_7891819\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_7891819\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"4388\"}, \"gift_card_4964153\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_4964153\", \"amount\": 163.0}, \"gift_card_3226531\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_3226531\", \"amount\": 50.0}, \"certificate_4594761\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_4594761\", \"amount\": 150.0}, \"gift_card_1591784\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_1591784\", \"amount\": 57.0}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Olivia\", \"last_name\": \"Taylor\", \"dob\": \"1976-06-27\"}], \"membershi