{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "raw_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "36#0", "task_desc": "I'm... I'm sorry... I just... my wife passed away yesterday, it's so sudden and I can't... I have a flight booked and I need to move it, just push it back two days... I can't travel now, but I don't want to cancel...\n*voice trembling* Thank you... it's just... it's been the worst day... \n\nMy user ID is lucas_brown_4047. And the reservation... the reservation is EUJUY6. That's the one I need to move... two days later, please. I can't... I can't deal with canceling, I just need the date changed.\n*", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'm so sorry for your loss. I can help you modify your flight to push it back two days.\n\nTo locate and update your reservation, I'll need a few details first:\n- Your **user ID** (for example, something like \"sara_doe_496\")\n- Your **reservation ID**, if you have it handy. If not, I can help look it up once I have your user ID.\n\nPlease share your user ID whenever you're ready, and I'll assist you from there.\nassistant: I'm truly sorry. Let me pull up your reservation and profile so I can help you move the flight.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"EUJUY6\", \"user_id\": \"lucas_brown_4047\", \"origin\": \"ORD\", \"destination\": \"LAS\", \"flight_type\": \"round_trip\", \"cabin\": \"basic_economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT238\", \"origin\": \"ORD\", \"destination\": \"DEN\", \"date\": \"2024-05-14\", \"price\": 96}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT290\", \"origin\": \"DEN\", \"destination\": \"LAS\", \"date\": \"2024-05-14\", \"price\": 64}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT266\", \"origin\": \"LAS\", \"destination\": \"IAH\", \"date\": \"2024-05-16\", \"price\": 70}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT044\", \"origin\": \"IAH\", \"destination\": \"ORD\", \"date\": \"2024-05-16\", \"price\": 76}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Lucas\", \"last_name\": \"Brown\", \"dob\": \"1965-01-01\"}, {