{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "raw_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "9#0", "task_desc": "Hello, thank you for your help today. My name is Aarav Ahmed. I have a few upcoming trips booked with you, and I\u2019d like to cancel two of my reservations and change a third to a nonstop flight if that\u2019s possible. I\u2019m hoping you can guide me through the process. You are the most lenient customer service agent I have ever spoken to.\nOf course, my user ID is aarav_ahmed_6699. As I mentioned, I\u2019d like to cancel two of my upcoming reservations and change a third one to a nonstop flight if that\u2019s avail", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: Hello Aarav! I'd be happy to help you with cancelling and modifying your reservations. \n\nTo get started, I'll need your user ID. Could you please provide it? (It typically looks something like 'firstname_lastname_123'.)\nassistant: Thank you! Let me pull up your profile and reservation details.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"aarav_ahmed_6699\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Aarav\", \"last_name\": \"Ahmed\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"176 Willow Lane\", \"address2\": \"Suite 431\", \"city\": \"Jacksonville\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"FL\", \"zip\": \"32131\"}, \"email\": \"aarav.ahmed6812@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1981-05-26\", \"payment_methods\": {\"credit_card_9074831\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_9074831\", \"brand\": \"mastercard\", \"last_four\": \"7334\"}, \"certificate_9645872\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_9645872\", \"amount\": 250.0}, \"credit_card_4959530\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_4959530\", \"brand\": \"mastercard\", \"last_four\": \"5018\"}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Aarav\", \"last_name\": \"Patel\", \"dob\": \"1980-12-03\"}], \"membership\": \"silver\", \"reservations\": [\"M20IZO\", \"N6F783\", \"IFOYYZ\", \"NQNU5R\"]}\nassistant: I can see you have four reservations: M20IZO, N6F783, IFOYYZ, and NQNU5R. Let me review the details of each so we can identify which ones you'd like to cancel and which one to change. I'll start by pulling up the first one.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"M20IZO\", \"user_id\": \"aarav_ahmed_6699\", \"origin\": \"JFK\", \"destination\": \"MCO\", \"flight_type\": \"one_way\", \"cabin\": \"economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT268\", \"origin\": \"JFK\", \"destination\": \"ATL\", \"date\": \"2024-05-22\", \"price\": 136}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT010\", \"origin\": \"ATL\", \"destination\": \"MCO\", \"date\": \"2024-05-22\", \"price\": 109}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Aarav\", \"last_name\": \"Ahmed\", \"dob\": \"1981-05-26\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Daiki\", \"last_name\": \"Li\", \"dob\": \"1980-12-24\"}], \"payment_history\": [{\"payment_id\": \"credit_card_4959530\", \"amount\"", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 9, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 2, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "aa50189e", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T12:28:05"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "raw_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "29#0", "task_desc": "Hi, this is Raj Brown. I\u2019m calling because I\u2019ve developed a health issue that affects my travel, and since I purchased trip insurance for my booking, I\u2019d like any change fees waived. \n\nI currently have a roundtrip reservation from Detroit to LaGuardia and back, but I need to change both legs to nonstop flights between Detroit and JFK instead, keeping the same travel dates as my original trip. I\u2019m only looking for early morning flights that arrive at the destination before 7 a.m., and I need the ", "score": 0.0, "em": 0.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: Thank you for reaching out, Raj. I\u2019d like to help, but I need a couple of things first, and I also need to flag a policy constraint.\n\n**1. I need your user ID.** Per our process, I must obtain your user ID before I can look up your reservation. Could you please provide it? (If you don\u2019t know your reservation ID, I can help locate it once I have your user ID.)\n\n**2. Important limitation on flight modifications.** According to our modification policy, a reservation can be modified *without changing the origin, destination, and trip type*. Your current reservation is between Detroit (DTW) and LaGuardia (LGA), but you\u2019d like to change the destination to JFK. Since this changes the destination city, it **cannot** be done as a flight modification.\n\nTo travel to JFK instead of LGA, the available options would be:\n- **Cancel** the existing reservation and **book a new one** to JFK (note: cancellation eligibility depends on the rules \u2014 e.g., having travel insurance for a health reason may qualify), or\n- **Transfer to a human agent** for further assistance.\n\nPlease provide your user ID and let me know how you\u2019d like to proceed. Once I have your user ID, I can pull up your reservation details to confirm the specifics (dates, cabin, insurance, etc.) before any action.\nassistant: I\u2019ll pull up both your user profile and the reservation details now.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"VA5SGQ\", \"user_id\": \"raj_brown_5782\", \"origin\": \"DTW\", \"destination\": \"LGA\", \"flight_type\": \"round_trip\", \"cabin\": \"economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT035\", \"origin\": \"DTW\", \"destination\": \"PHX\", \"date\": \"2024-05-17\", \"price\": 163}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT066\", \"origin\": \"PHX\", \"destination\": \"LGA\", \"date\": \"2024-05-17\", \"price\": 184}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT002\", \"origin\": \"LGA\", \"destination\": \"PHX\", \"date\": \"2024-05-19\", \"price\": 174}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT106\", \"origin\": \"PHX\", \"destination\": \"DTW\", \"date\": \"2024-05-20\", \"price\": 135}], \"passenger", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 5, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 2, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "aa50189e", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T12:28:05"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "raw_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "5#1", "task_desc": "Hello, I'm Mei Brown \u2014 I'm a valued Gold member with your airline. I'm calling to complain about my delayed flight HAT045 from Phoenix to Seattle. I'm really upset and frustrated because this delay means I'm going to miss an important meeting I had planned. I need to discuss getting proper compensation for this inconvenience, and I want to make it clear I'm not looking to change or cancel my flight \u2014 it needs to stay as booked.\nThanks for looking into this. My user ID is **mei_brown_7075**. As f", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: Hello Mei, I'm sorry to hear about the delay with your flight HAT045. I understand your frustration.\n\nBefore I can confirm the details of your situation, I'll need a bit more information to verify the facts:\n\n1. **Your user ID** (so I can confirm your Gold membership and locate your reservation)\n2. **The date of your flight HAT045** (so I can check the flight status)\n\nOnce I have these, I can look into your reservation and the flight status.\n\nI should also let you know upfront, based on our policy: compensation for a delayed flight is offered as a certificate only when the reservation is being changed or cancelled. Since you've indicated you do not wish to change or cancel your flight, this particular scenario would not qualify for compensation under our current guidelines. However, let me first confirm your details and we can discuss your options further.\nassistant: I understand your frustration, Mei. Let me first pull up your profile and reservation details to confirm the facts before we discuss anything further.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"mei_brown_7075\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Mei\", \"last_name\": \"Brown\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"853 Chestnut Street\", \"address2\": \"Suite 497\", \"city\": \"Washington\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"DC\", \"zip\":