{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "raw_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "16#1", "task_desc": "Hello, I have a flight booked from Atlanta to Philadelphia that I need to change. I\u2019d like to move it to the day after my original travel date, and I\u2019m hoping to find the cheapest option in standard Economy class\u2014not Basic Economy.\nSure, my user ID is aarav_garcia_1177. I don\u2019t have my reservation ID handy, but hopefully you can look it up with that.\nYes, that sounds good to me. The HAT110 and HAT172 routing at $207 is the cheapest Economy option, and moving to the 24th is exactly what I wanted.", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: To help you modify your reservation, I'll need some information first. Could you please provide your **user ID**? \n\nAlso, if you have your **reservation ID** handy, please share that as well. If you don't know it, I can help locate it for you once I have your user ID.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"aarav_garcia_1177\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Aarav\", \"last_name\": \"Garcia\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"833 Highland Drive\", \"address2\": \"Suite 740\", \"city\": \"Denver\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"CO\", \"zip\": \"80211\"}, \"email\": \"aarav.garcia6639@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1992-09-13\", \"payment_methods\": {\"certificate_7473723\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_7473723\", \"amount\": 150.0}, \"gift_card_8887175\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_8887175\", \"amount\": 35.0}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Lei\", \"last_name\": \"Ito\", \"dob\": \"1990-12-07\"}], \"membership\": \"gold\", \"reservations\": [\"M05KNL\", \"UHDAHF\"]}\nassistant: I found your profile. You have two reservations: **M05KNL** and **UHDAHF**. Let me look up the details of both to find the Atlanta to Philadelphia flight.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"M05KNL\", \"user_id\": \"aarav_garcia_1177\", \"origin\": \"ATL\", \"destination\": \"PHL\", \"flight_type\": \"one_way\", \"cabin\": \"business\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT227\", \"origin\": \"ATL\", \"destination\": \"ORD\", \"date\": \"2024-05-23\", \"price\": 1936}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT139\", \"origin\": \"ORD\", \"destination\": \"PHL\", \"date\": \"2024-05-23\", \"price\": 851}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Aarav\", \"last_name\": \"Garcia\", \"dob\": \"1992-09-13\"}], \"payment_history\": [{\"payment_id\": \"gift_card_8887175\", \"amount\": 2787}], \"created_at\": \"2024-05-14T06:33:04\", \"total_baggages\": 0, \"nonfree_baggages\": 0, \"insurance\": \"no\", \"status\": null}\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"UHDAHF\", \"user_id\": \"aarav_garcia_1177\", \"origin\": \"CLT\", \"destination\": \"LAX\", \"flight_type\": \"round_trip\", \"cabin\": \"basic_economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT015\", \"origin\": \"CLT", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 6, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 2, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "aa50189e", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T12:28:05"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "raw_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "12#1", "task_desc": "Hi, I have an upcoming flight from Boston to Minneapolis and I need to make a few changes to my booking. I'm looking to upgrade our cabin class and also add some checked bags under my name.\nSure, my name is Chen Lee and my user ID is chen_lee_6825. The reservation ID for the trip is YAX4DR \u2014 that's the Boston to Minneapolis flight I mentioned.\nYes, I'd like to confirm the business class upgrade for both passengers \u2014 that's myself and my companion Noah \u2014 for the $600 total. That's within what I'm", "score": 0.0, "em": 0.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: To help you with modifying your reservation, I'll need some information first. Could you please provide your **user ID**? \n\nAlso, if you have your **reservation ID** handy, please share that as well. If you don't know your reservation ID, I can help locate it once I have your user ID.\nassistant: Let me look up your reservation details to assist you with the changes.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"YAX4DR\", \"user_id\": \"chen_lee_6825\", \"origin\": \"BOS\", \"destination\": \"MSP\", \"flight_type\": \"one_way\", \"cabin\": \"economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT235\", \"origin\": \"BOS\", \"destination\": \"MCO\", \"date\": \"2024-05-18\", \"price\": 122}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT298\", \"origin\": \"MCO\", \"destination\": \"MSP\", \"date\": \"2024-05-19\", \"price\": 127}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Chen\", \"last_name\": \"Lee\", \"dob\": \"1967-12-12\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Noah\", \"last_name\": \"Hernandez\", \"dob\": \"1968-01-06\"}], \"payment_history\": [{\"payment_id\": \"credit_card_4938634\", \"amount\": 498}], \"created_at\": \"2024-05-05T23:00:15\", \"total_baggages\": 0, \"nonfree_baggages\": 0, \"insurance\": \"no\", \"status\": null}\nassistant: Thank you, Chen. I've retrieved your reservation. Here's a summary of your current booking:\n\n- **Reservation:** YAX4DR\n- **Route:** Boston (BOS) \u2192 Minneapolis (MSP), one-way\n- **Current Cabin:** Economy\n- **Flights:**\n  - HAT235: BOS \u2192 MCO on 2024-05-18 ($122)\n  - HAT298: MCO \u2192 MSP on 2024-05-19 ($127)\n- **Passengers:** Chen Lee, Noah Hernandez\n- **Current baggage:** 0 checked bags\n\nTo proceed with the cabin upgrade and baggage addition, let me first pull up your profile details.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"chen_lee_6825\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Chen\", \"last_name\": \"Lee\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"355 Hillcrest Drive\", \"address2\": \"Suite 365\", \"city\": \"San Francisco\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"CA\", \"zip\": \"94178\"}, \"email\": \"chen.lee7831@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1967-12-12\", \"payment_methods\": {\"certificate_6730850\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"cer", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 4, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 2, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "aa50189e", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T12:28:05"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "raw_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "21#0", "task_desc": "Hi, I need to change the return flight for my upcoming Houston to Denver trip. It's really urgent, I need to get this sorted out ASAP.\nMy user ID is sofia_kim_7287. I'm sorry, I don't remember my reservation ID at all.\nI need to return on May 27 \u2014 that's the same day I'm flying out to Denver. For the routing, I just want whatever is the fastest overall trip back including any layover time, so connections are totally fine if that ends up being quickest. \n\nAnd for payment, please use my gift card ", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I can help you with that. To get started, I'll need your user ID. Also, if you have your reservation ID handy, please share that as well\u2014otherwise, I can help locate it using your user ID.\nassistant: Let me look up your profile to find your reservation.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"sofia_kim_7287\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Sofia\", \"last_name\": \"Kim\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"825 Laurel Lane\", \"address2\": \"Suite 595\", \"city\": \"Houston\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"TX\", \"zip\": \"77243\"}, \"email\": \"sofia.kim1937@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1950-06-24\", \"payment_methods\": {\"certificate_8544743\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_8544743\", \"amount\": 250.0}, \"credit_card_9879898\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_9879898\", \"brand\": \"mastercard\", \"last_four\": \"9725\"}, \"gift_card_7091239\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_7091239\", \"amount\": 157.0}, \"gift_card_6276644\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_6276644\", \"amount\": 113.0}, \"gift_card_7480005\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_7480005\", \"amount\": 6.0}, \"certificate_9932251\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_9932251\", \"amount\": 250.0}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\