{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "raw_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "18#1", "task_desc": "Look, I'm dealing with some money troubles right now and it's really frustrating. I need to downgrade all of my business class flights to economy \u2014 but I don't want to change any of the flights themselves or the passenger names, just the cabin class. Can you help me sort this out?\nYeah, fine. My name is Omar Davis and my user ID is omar_davis_3817. Just please get this done \u2014 I can't afford these business class tickets anymore and it's stressing me out.\nYes, go ahead and do all five. I'm already", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I can help you with changing the cabin class from business to economy. To get started, I'll need your user ID. Could you please provide it?\n\nIf you don't know your reservation ID, I can help locate it once I have your user ID.\nassistant: Thank you, Omar. Let me look up your profile and reservations.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"omar_davis_3817\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Omar\", \"last_name\": \"Davis\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"281 Spruce Street\", \"address2\": \"Suite 942\", \"city\": \"San Diego\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"CA\", \"zip\": \"92164\"}, \"email\": \"omar.davis7857@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1982-10-19\", \"payment_methods\": {\"gift_card_3481935\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_3481935\", \"amount\": 22.0}, \"credit_card_2929732\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_2929732\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"7803\"}, \"credit_card_9525117\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_9525117\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"2172\"}, \"gift_card_6847880\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_6847880\", \"amount\": 31.0}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Juan\", \"last_name\": \"Ahmed\", \"dob\": \"1992-11-19\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Anya\", \"last_name\": \"Thomas\", \"dob\": \"1990-10-11\"}], \"membership\": \"regular\", \"reservations\": [\"JG7FMM\", \"LQ940Q\", \"2FBBAH\", \"X7BYG1\", \"EQ1G6C\", \"BOH180\"]}\nassistant: I found your profile, Omar. You have several reservations: JG7FMM, LQ940Q, 2FBBAH, X7BYG1, EQ1G6C, and BOH180. Let me check each one to identify which are business class. I'll start by reviewing them one at a time.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"JG7FMM\", \"user_id\": \"omar_davis_3817\", \"origin\": \"MCO\", \"destination\": \"CLT\", \"flight_type\": \"one_way\", \"cabin\": \"business\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT028\", \"origin\": \"MCO\", \"destination\": \"BOS\", \"date\": \"2024-05-21\", \"price\": 1859}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT277\", \"origin\": \"BOS\", \"destination\": \"CLT\", \"date\": \"2024-05-21\", \"price\": 1679}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Omar\", \"last_name\": \"Davis\", \"d", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 13, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 2, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "aa50189e", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T12:28:05"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "raw_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "18#0", "task_desc": "Look, I'm having some serious money troubles right now and I need to deal with my bookings. I'm Omar Davis \u2014 my user ID is omar_davis_3817. I've got business class flights booked and I need to downgrade all of them to economy. I don't want to change any of the flights themselves or the passenger details, just the cabin class. This is really stressing me out, but I'll work with you to get it sorted.\nYes, fine \u2014 go ahead and process all of them. Honestly this whole thing is a nightmare, I wouldn't", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'm sorry to hear you're going through a stressful time. I'll help you downgrade your cabin class from business to economy. Let me first locate your reservation(s) by looking up your profile.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"omar_davis_3817\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Omar\", \"last_name\": \"Davis\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"281 Spruce Street\", \"address2\": \"Suite 942\", \"city\": \"San Diego\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"CA\", \"zip\": \"92164\"}, \"email\": \"omar.davis7857@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1982-10-19\", \"payment_methods\": {\"gift_card_3481935\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_3481935\", \"amount\": 22.0}, \"credit_card_2929732\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_2929732\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"7803\"}, \"credit_card_9525117\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_9525117\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"2172\"}, \"gift_card_6847880\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_6847880\", \"amount\": 31.0}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Juan\", \"last_name\": \"Ahmed\", \"dob\": \"1992-11-19\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Anya\", \"last_name\": \"Thomas\", \"dob\": \"1990-10-11\"}], \"membership\": \"regular\", \"reservations\": [\"JG7FMM\", \"LQ940Q\", \"2FBBAH\", \"X7BYG1\", \"EQ1G6C\", \"BOH180\"]}\nassistant: I found your profile. You have several reservations. Let me check each one to identify which are booked in business class. I'll start by reviewing them one at a time.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"JG7FMM\", \"user_id\": \"omar_davis_3817\", \"origin\": \"MCO\", \"destination\": \"CLT\", \"flight_type\": \"one_way\", \"cabin\": \"business\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT028\", \"origin\": \"MCO\", \"destination\": \"BOS\", \"date\": \"2024-05-21\", \"price\": 1859}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT277\", \"origin\": \"BOS\", \"destination\": \"CLT\", \"date\": \"2024-05-21\", \"price\": 1679}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Omar\", \"last_name\": \"Davis\", \"dob\": \"1982-10-19\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Fatima\", \"last_name\": \"Patel\", \"dob\": \"1950-05-04\"}], \"payment_history\": [{\"payment_id\": \"credit_card_2929732\", \"amount\":", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 14, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 2, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "aa50189e", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T12:28:05"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "raw_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "24#0", "task_desc": "Hi, I'm Mia Kim. I need some help with my booking \u2014 I'd like to remove a passenger from one of my existing reservations, and I'm also looking to book a new flight from New York out to the West Coast. Can you help me with both of those things?\nOkay, I get that you can't remove Ethan from my reservation. Since the change isn't possible, please go ahead and cancel my reservation H9ZU1C \u2014 I'll rebook myself later if I need to.\n\nNow for the new trip: my user ID is mia_kim_4397. I'm looking for the ch", "score": 0.0, "em": 0.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I can help with part of your request, but I need to clarify a couple of things:\n\n**Removing a passenger:** I'm sorry, but per our policy, the number of passengers on a reservation cannot be modified \u2014 this applies even to human agents. You can modify passenger details (such as name or date of birth), but you cannot add or remove passengers from an existing reservation. If you'd like, I can help you modify passenger information instead, or you could cancel the reservation and book a new one with the correct passenger count.\n\n**Booking a new flight:** I'd be happy to help you book a flight from New York (JFK) to the West Coast. To get started, I'll need a few details:\n\n1. **Your user ID** (the format is typically like `first_last_123`, e.g., `mia_kim_xxx`).\n2. **Trip type** \u2014 is this a one-way or round-trip flight?\n3. **Destination** \u2014 which West Coast city/airport are you flying to (e.g., LAX, SFO, SEA)?\n4. **Travel date(s)**.\n5. **Cabin class** \u2014 basic economy, economy, or business?\n6. **Passenger details** \u2014 first name, last name, and date of birth for each passenger (up to 5).\n7. **Payment method** \u2014 which saved payment method would you like to use?\n8. **Checked bags** \u2014 how many checked bags do you need?\n9. **Travel insurance** \u2014 would you like to add travel insurance ($30 per passenger)?\n\nPlease provide your user ID and the trip details above, and I'll assist you with the booking.\nassistant: I'll help you with both tasks. Let me start by reviewing your reservation H9ZU1C to verify the cancellation details and rules.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"H9ZU1C\", \"user_id\": \"mia_kim_4397\", \"origin\": \"MIA\", \"destination\": \"IAH\", \"flight_type\": \"one_way\", \"cabin\": \"economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT192\", \"origin\": \"MIA\", \"destination\": \"EWR\", \"date\": \"2024-05-24\", \"price\": 174}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT166\", \"origin\": \"EWR\", \"destination\": \"IAH\", \"date\": \"2024-05-25\", \"price\": 125}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Jam", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 21, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 2, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "aa50189e", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T12:28:05"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "raw_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "32#1", "task_desc": "Hello, I need to change my flight. I'm scheduled to fly out of Newark (EWR) on May 21, but my mother is really sick and I need to get back home sooner to take care of her. I'd like to switch to a nonstop flight on that same day if possible.\nI'm Ivan Rossi. My user ID is ivan_rossi_8555. I don't have my reservation ID handy right now, but hopefully you can locate it with that.\n###TRANSFER###", "score": 0.0, "em": 0.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'm sorry to hear about your mother. I'll help you change your flight. \n\nTo get started, I'll need your user ID. Also, if you have your reservation ID handy, please share that as well\u2014if not, I can help locate it once I have your user ID.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"ivan_rossi_8555\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Ivan\", \"last_name\": \"Rossi\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"513 Main Street\", \"address2\": \"Suite 805\", \"city\": \"Philadelphia\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"PA\", \"zip\": \"19102\"}, \"email\": \"ivan.rossi2633@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1954-01-14\", \"payment_methods\": {\"gift_card_7344518\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_7344518\", \"amount\": 183.0}, \"gift_card_9823297\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_9823297\", \"amount\": 224.0}, \"credit_card_9659780\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_9659780\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"1777\"}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Ava\", \"last_name\": \"Silva\", \"dob\": \"1971-01-14\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Anya\", \"last_name\": \"Patel\", \"dob\": \"1990-06-13\"}], \"membership\": \"silver\", \"reservations\": [\"OWZ4XL\", \"F3IQK1\", \"8WMF4C\", \"L2H5FP\"]}\nassistant: I found your profile. You have several reservations. Let me look at the details to find the one departing from Newark (EWR) on May 21.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"OWZ4XL\", \"u