{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "raw_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "17#1", "task_desc": "Hello, I have a flight booked from New York to Chicago coming up, and I need to make a few adjustments. I'd like to add three checked bags, change the passenger to myself, and upgrade the ticket to economy class.\nSure, my user ID is omar_rossi_1241. I don't have my reservation ID in front of me right now \u2014 can you look it up using that?\nYes, I confirm all three changes \u2014 adding the three checked bags, changing the passenger to myself, and upgrading to economy. For the $209 fare difference, I'd l", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: Hello! I'd be happy to help you make these adjustments to your reservation. \n\nBefore I can proceed, I need to collect some information:\n\n1. **Your user ID** (e.g., 'sara_doe_496')\n2. **Your reservation ID** (e.g., 'ZFA04Y') \u2014 if you don't have it handy, I can help locate it once I have your user ID.\n\nOnce I have your user ID and reservation details, I'll be able to review your booking and assist with:\n- Adding three checked bags\n- Updating the passenger information to yourself\n- Changing the cabin class to economy\n\nPlease provide your user ID (and reservation ID if available), and I'll look into this for you.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"omar_rossi_1241\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Omar\", \"last_name\": \"Rossi\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"901 Pine Lane\", \"address2\": \"Suite 360\", \"city\": \"Houston\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"TX\", \"zip\": \"77271\"}, \"email\": \"omar.rossi5980@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1970-06-06\", \"payment_methods\": {\"gift_card_8190333\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_8190333\", \"amount\": 280.0}, \"credit_card_6754990\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_6754990\", \"brand\": \"mastercard\", \"last_four\": \"3848\"}, \"certificate_8390038\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"c