{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "raw_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "31#1", "task_desc": "Hello, my name is Daiki Lee. I have an upcoming flight out of JFK on May 17, but my cat is very ill and I need to get home earlier to take care of him. I\u2019d like to change my booking to a nonstop flight if possible.\nThanks for understanding. My user ID is daiki_lee_6144. \n\nAs for the reservation ID, I\u2019m afraid I don\u2019t have that handy \u2014 I wasn\u2019t given it, so I don\u2019t know what it is. You mentioned you could help locate it with the user ID, so hopefully that works.\n###TRANSFER###", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: Hello Daiki Lee, I'm sorry to hear about your cat. I'd be happy to help you change your booking.\n\nTo get started, I'll need your **user ID** (for example, something like `daiki_lee_123`). Could you please provide that? \n\nAlso, if you don't know your **reservation ID**, I can help locate it once I have your user ID.\nassistant: Thank you! Let me look up your profile and reservations using your user ID.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"daiki_lee_6144\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Daiki\", \"last_name\": \"Lee\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"410 River Road\", \"address2\": \"Suite 380\", \"city\": \"Fort Worth\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"TX\", \"zip\": \"76173\"}, \"email\": \"daiki.lee6987@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1976-10-08\", \"payment_methods\": {\"credit_card_6198952\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_6198952\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"9734\"}, \"gift_card_3112961\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_3112961\", \"amount\": 51.0}, \"gift_card_5128346\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_5128346\", \"amount\": 262.0}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Raj\", \"last_name\": \"Muller\", \"dob\": \"1967-10-16\"}], \"membership\": \"regular\", \"reservations\": [\"DF89BM\", \"COVE6R\", \"IIHXDG\"]}\nassistant: I found your profile. You have three reservations: **DF89BM**, **COVE6R**, and **IIHXDG**. Let me check the details of each to find the one with a flight out of JFK on May 17.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"DF89BM\", \"user_id\": \"daiki_lee_6144\", \"origin\": \"JFK\", \"destination\": \"DTW\", \"flight_type\": \"round_trip\", \"cabin\": \"basic_economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT079\", \"origin\": \"JFK\", \"destination\": \"ORD\", \"date\": \"2024-05-17\", \"price\": 63}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT020\", \"origin\": \"ORD\", \"destination\": \"DTW\", \"date\": \"2024-05-17\", \"price\": 78}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT263\", \"origin\": \"DTW\", \"destination\": \"JFK\", \"date\": \"2024-05-24\", \"price\": 53}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Daiki\", \"last_name\": \"Lee\", \"dob\": \"1976-10-08\"}], \"payment_history\": [{\"payment", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 5, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 2, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "aa50189e", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T12:28:05"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "raw_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "30#1", "task_desc": "Hi, I have an upcoming flight from Las Vegas to Houston that currently has a stop, and I\u2019d like to change it to a nonstop flight. Also, I want to remove my checked bag and get a refund for the bag fee.\nOkay, I understand about the checked bag \u2014 that\u2019s fine, we can leave that as is. \n\nAs for the flight change, my user ID is james_taylor_7043.\nI\u2019ll go with Option 1 \u2014 the HAT266 flight departing at 13:00 and arriving at 16:00. That works better for my schedule.\nYes, that all looks correct \u2014 please ", "score": 0.0, "em": 0.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: Hello! I can help you with changing your flight from Las Vegas (LAS) to Houston (IAH/HOU) to a nonstop option.\n\nHowever, I need to inform you that per our policy, **checked bags can only be added, not removed** after booking. Therefore, I'm unable to remove your checked bag or refund the bag fee. I can only assist with the flight change portion of your request.\n\nTo proceed with the flight change, I'll need some information first:\n- Your **user ID** (e.g., 'sara_doe_496')\n- Your **reservation ID** (if you don't have it, I can help locate it using your user ID)\n\nCould you please provide your user ID?\nassistant: Thank you! Let me look up your profile and reservations to locate the booking.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"james_taylor_7043\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"James\", \"last_name\": \"Taylor\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"133 Chestnut Street\", \"address2\": \"Suite 494\", \"city\": \"Houston\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"TX\", \"zip\": \"77207\"}, \"email\": \"james.taylor4788@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1997-01-23\", \"payment_methods\": {\"certificate_9380982\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_9380982\", \"amount\": 100.0}, \"gift_card_5634230\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_5634230\", \"amount\": 6