{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "raw_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "36#1", "task_desc": "Hello... I... I don't even know where to start. My wife... she passed away yesterday. It's been a nightmare. I have a flight booked that I need to change. I can't go on the original date... I need to move it out by two days. I don't want to cancel it, just... just change the date. Please, I can't deal with much more right now.\nThank you... I appreciate that. My user ID is lucas_brown_4047. I just... I can't believe I'm having to do this. She's gone and now I have to figure out this flight... I j", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'm so sorry for your loss. I'll do my best to help you with changing your flight.\n\nTo locate your reservation, I'll need your user ID first. Could you please provide your user ID (for example, something like \"sara_doe_496\")?\nassistant: I'm truly sorry. Let me pull up your reservation and profile so I can help you change the flight.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"EUJUY6\", \"user_id\": \"lucas_brown_4047\", \"origin\": \"ORD\", \"destination\": \"LAS\", \"flight_type\": \"round_trip\", \"cabin\": \"basic_economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT238\", \"origin\": \"ORD\", \"destination\": \"DEN\", \"date\": \"2024-05-14\", \"price\": 96}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT290\", \"origin\": \"DEN\", \"destination\": \"LAS\", \"date\": \"2024-05-14\", \"price\": 64}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT266\", \"origin\": \"LAS\", \"destination\": \"IAH\", \"date\": \"2024-05-16\", \"price\": 70}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT044\", \"origin\": \"IAH\", \"destination\": \"ORD\", \"date\": \"2024-05-16\", \"price\": 76}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Lucas\", \"last_name\": \"Brown\", \"dob\": \"1965-01-01\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Daiki\", \"last_name\": \"Thomas\", \"dob\": \"1996-06-21\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Daiki\", \"last_name\": \"Lopez\", \"dob\": \"1967-04-08\"}], \"payment_history\": [{\"pay