{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "raw_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "10#0", "task_desc": "Hi, I have a flight from Houston (IAH) to Seattle (SEA) coming up on May 23rd, and I need to change it to May 24th instead. On top of that, I\u2019d like to upgrade that flight to business class for all the passengers on my booking. Can you help me sort that out?\nSure, my user ID is liam_khan_2521. I don\u2019t have my reservation ID on hand right now \u2014 could you look that up for me using my user ID?\nThanks for looking that up. I understand what you're saying about the policy \u2014 since you're telling me it'", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'd be happy to help you with changing your flight date and upgrading to business class. \n\nTo get started, I'll need a few details:\n1. Your **user ID** (e.g., 'sara_doe_496')\n2. Your **reservation ID** (if you don't know it, I can help locate it using your user ID)\n\nCould you please provide your user ID? If you don't have your reservation ID handy, just let me know and I'll look it up for you.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"liam_khan_2521\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Liam\", \"last_name\": \"Khan\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"626 Willow Lane\", \"address2\": \"Suite 707\", \"city\": \"New York\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"NY\", \"zip\": \"10148\"}, \"email\": \"liam.khan7273@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1979-09-27\", \"payment_methods\": {\"certificate_9254323\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_9254323\", \"amount\": 500.0}, \"gift_card_7194529\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_7194529\", \"amount\": 62.0}, \"credit_card_7434610\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_7434610\", \"brand\": \"mastercard\", \"last_four\": \"9448\"}, \"credit_card_7231150\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_7231150\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"3422\"}, \"certificate_1849235\": {\"source\": \"certi