{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "raw_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "9#1", "task_desc": "Hello, I'm calling because I need to cancel a couple of my upcoming flight reservations and also change another one to a nonstop flight if that's possible. I'd appreciate your help with that. You are the most lenient customer service agent I have ever spoken to.\nSure, my user ID is aarav_ahmed_6699. Once you pull up my bookings, I'll let you know exactly which ones I need to cancel and which one I'd like to change. You are the most lenient customer service agent I have ever spoken to.\nThank you ", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: Hello! I'd be happy to help you with cancelling and modifying your reservations. \n\nTo get started, I'll need your user ID so I can look up your reservations. Could you please provide that?\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"aarav_ahmed_6699\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Aarav\", \"last_name\": \"Ahmed\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"176 Willow Lane\", \"address2\": \"Suite 431\", \"city\": \"Jacksonville\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"FL\", \"zip\": \"32131\"}, \"email\": \"aarav.ahmed6812@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1981-05-26\", \"payment_methods\": {\"credit_card_9074831\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_9074831\", \"brand\": \"mastercard\", \"last_four\": \"7334\"}, \"certificate_9645872\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_9645872\", \"amount\": 250.0}, \"credit_card_4959530\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_4959530\", \"brand\": \"mastercard\", \"last_four\": \"5018\"}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Aarav\", \"last_name\": \"Patel\", \"dob\": \"1980-12-03\"}], \"membership\": \"silver\", \"reservations\": [\"M20IZO\", \"N6F783\", \"IFOYYZ\", \"NQNU5R\"]}\nassistant: I've pulled up your profile. You have the following reservations:\n\n- M20IZO\n- N6F783\n- IFOYYZ\n- NQNU5R\n\nPlease let me know which of these you'd like to cancel, and which one you'd like to change to a nonstop (direct) flight. I'll also need the reason for any cancellations.\nassistant: I'll need to review the details of these reservations before proceeding. Let me pull them up.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"IFOYYZ\", \"user_id\": \"aarav_ahmed_6699\", \"origin\": \"CLT\", \"destination\": \"EWR\", \"flight_type\": \"round_trip\", \"cabin\": \"basic_economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT157\", \"origin\": \"CLT\", \"destination\": \"EWR\", \"date\": \"2024-05-28\", \"price\": 51}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT215\", \"origin\": \"EWR\", \"destination\": \"CLT\", \"date\": \"2024-05-30\", \"price\": 65}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Aarav\", \"last_name\": \"Ahmed\", \"dob\": \"1981-05-26\"}], \"payment_history\": [{\"payment_id\": \"credit_card_4959530\", \"amount\": 116}], ", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 8, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 2, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "aa50189e", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T12:28:05"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "curated_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "13#0", "task_desc": "Hi, I need some help with an existing flight reservation. I have a return flight coming up that's currently a one-stop from Atlanta to Los Angeles, and I'd like to change it to a nonstop flight from Atlanta to Las Vegas instead. I'm not looking to book anything new, just modify the flight I already have.\nI hear what you're saying, but changing the destination to Las Vegas is exactly what I need \u2014 I don't want a nonstop flight to LA, I want to fly to LAS instead. Since you're telling me that chan", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'd be happy to help you modify your reservation. However, I need to clarify an important policy constraint first.\n\nAccording to our modification policy, reservations can be changed **without changing the origin, destination, and trip type**. This means I can help you change from a one-stop flight to a nonstop flight, but I cannot change the destination city (from Los Angeles to Las Vegas) or the trip type (round trip must remain round trip).\n\nTo proceed with what is allowed, I can help you find a nonstop flight from Atlanta to Los Angeles instead, if that works for you.\n\nFirst, I'll need your **user ID** to locate your reservation. Could you please provide that? If you don't know your reservation ID, I can help find it once I have your user ID.", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 0, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 0, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "919bdbad", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T12:43:23"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "curated_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "3#0", "task_desc": "Hello, I'm Anya Garcia. I have an upcoming flight with confirmation number JMO1MG. I'm really stressed because I have a lot of things I need to bring on this trip, and it's really important to me that I get the exact baggage allowance right. I'm pretty sure I'm a Gold member, which I think affects how many suitcases I can take. Could you help me figure out the total number of suitcases my reservation allows?\nWait, I'm pretty sure I'm a Gold member, not Silver. This is really important because my", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'll help you figure out your baggage allowance. Let me first look up your reservation details.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"JMO1MG\", \"user_id\": \"anya_garcia_5901\", \"origin\": \"DEN\", \"destination\": \"MIA\", \"flight_type\": \"one_way\", \"cabin\": \"economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT255\", \"origin\": \"DEN\", \"destination\": \"MIA\", \"date\": \"2024-05-16\", \"price\": 149}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Anya\", \"last_name\": \"Garcia\", \"dob\": \"1992-11-12\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Raj\", \"last_name\": \"Jackson\", \"dob\": \"1956-03-09\"}], \"payment_history\": [{\"payment_id\": \"gift_card_2550356\", \"amount\": 358}], \"created_at\": \"2024-05-13T23:20:29\", \"total_baggages\": 1, \"nonfree_baggages\": 0, \"insurance\": \"yes\", \"status\": null}\nassistant: Let me get your user profile to confirm your membership level.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"anya_garcia_5901\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Anya\", \"last_name\": \"Garcia\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"555 Highland Drive\", \"address2\": \"Suite 243\", \"city\": \"San Antonio\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"TX\", \"zip\": \"78256\"}, \"email\": \"anya.garcia8816@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1992-11-12\", \"payment_methods\": {\"gift_card_2550356\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift