{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "curated_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "31#0", "task_desc": "Hi, my name is Daiki Lee. I have a flight scheduled out of JFK on May 17, but my cat is really sick and I need to get back home sooner to take care of him. I\u2019d like to change my booking to a nonstop flight if that\u2019s possible.\nSure, my user ID is daiki_lee_6144. I don\u2019t have my reservation ID handy, but hopefully you can pull up my booking with that.\nI appreciate you looking that up, but I specifically don\u2019t want to buy a new flight \u2014 I was only hoping to change my existing reservation to a nonst", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'm sorry to hear about your cat. I'll help you look into changing your booking. \n\nTo get started, I'll need your user ID. If you don't know your reservation ID, I can help locate it once I have your user ID. Could you please provide your user ID?\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"daiki_lee_6144\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Daiki\", \"last_name\": \"Lee\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"410 River Road\", \"address2\": \"Suite 380\", \"city\": \"Fort Worth\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"TX\", \"zip\": \"76173\"}, \"email\": \"daiki.lee6987@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1976-10-08\", \"payment_methods\": {\"credit_card_6198952\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_6198952\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"9734\"}, \"gift_card_3112961\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_3112961\", \"amount\": 51.0}, \"gift_card_5128346\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_5128346\", \"amount\": 262.0}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Raj\", \"last_name\": \"Muller\", \"dob\": \"1967-10-16\"}], \"membership\": \"regular\", \"reservations\": [\"DF89BM\", \"COVE6R\", \"IIHXDG\"]}\nassistant: I found your profile. You have three reservations: DF89BM, COVE6R, and IIHXDG. Let me check the details to find the one with a flight 