{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "curated_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "11#0", "task_desc": "I need to remove a passenger named Sophia from my round trip flights from LAS to DEN, departing May 19 and returning May 20. I\u2019m in a hurry, so please get this done quickly.\nLook, I don't have time for this back-and-forth. Since you're telling me I can't just take Sophia off the booking, then fine \u2014 downgrade all passengers on the reservation to basic economy instead. \n\nMy user ID is james_patel_9828. I don't have the reservation ID in front of me right this second, but I need this done fast. Ca", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'm sorry, but I'm unable to remove a passenger from your reservation. According to our policy, the number of passengers on a reservation cannot be modified \u2014 you may update passenger details (such as name or date of birth), but you cannot add or remove passengers. This restriction applies even when transferring to a human agent.\n\nHere are the options that are available to you:\n- **Modify passenger details** (e.g., correct a name or date of birth) without changing the number of passengers.\n- **Cancel the entire reservation** (if it qualifies for cancellation) and book a new one with the desired passengers.\n\nIf you'd like to pursue either of these options, please provide your **user ID** and **reservation ID** so I can assist you further.\nassistant: I'll help you locate the reservation first. Let me look up your account details.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"james_patel_9828\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"James\", \"last_name\": \"Patel\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"656 River Road\", \"address2\": \"Suite 768\", \"city\": \"Los Angeles\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"CA\", \"zip\": \"90357\"}, \"email\": \"james.patel1360@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1995-04-07\", \"payment_methods\": {\"gift_card_1642017\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_1642017\", \"amount\": 128.0}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"James\", \"last_name\": \"Sanchez\", \"dob\": \"1956-08-18\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Ava\", \"last_name\": \"Rossi\", \"dob\": \"1973-11-14\"}], \"membership\": \"gold\", \"reservations\": [\"AAVMM8\", \"MQHHT6\", \"GV1N64\"]}\nassistant: Let me check your reservations to find the one matching your LAS to DEN round trip.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"AAVMM8\", \"user_id\": \"james_patel_9828\", \"origin\": \"MCO\", \"destination\": \"DTW\", \"flight_type\": \"one_way\", \"cabin\": \"business\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT214\", \"origin\": \"MCO\", \"destination\": \"PHX\", \"date\": \"2024-05-21\", \"price\": 1358}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT106\", \"origin\": \"PHX\", \"destination\": \"DTW\", \"date\": \"2024-05-22\", \"price\": 988}], \"passe", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 7, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 0, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "919bdbad", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T12:43:23"}
