{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "curated_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "5#0", "task_desc": "I'm a loyal Gold tier member with your airline, and I need to voice my frustration about flight HAT045 from Phoenix to Seattle being delayed. This is completely unacceptable because I'm now going to miss a crucial business meeting I had planned!\nMy user ID is mei_brown_7075. I'm afraid I don't have the exact flight date handy right at the moment. \n\nAnd just to be clear \u2014 I do **not** want to cancel or change my flight. HAT045 must stay exactly as it is. I just want to be properly compensated for", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'm sorry to hear about the delay with flight HAT045. To confirm the details and assist you properly, I'll need a bit more information:\n\n1. Your user ID\n2. The date of the flight HAT045 you're referring to\n\nOnce I have these, I can look into the flight status and your reservation. Please also let me know if you'd like to change or cancel this reservation, as that will affect what options are available to you.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"mei_brown_7075\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Mei\", \"last_name\": \"Brown\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"853 Chestnut Street\", \"address2\": \"Suite 497\", \"city\": \"Washington\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"DC\", \"zip\": \"20195\"}, \"email\": \"mei.brown7062@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1986-12-14\", \"payment_methods\": {\"certificate_6761175\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_6761175\", \"amount\": 250.0}, \"gift_card_8987598\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_8987598\", \"amount\": 130.0}, \"credit_card_4920843\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_4920843\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"1663\"}, \"credit_card_1815425\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_1815425\", \"brand\": \"mastercard\", \"last_four\": \"9812\"}, \"certificate_1585255\": {\"source