{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "curated_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "6#0", "task_desc": "Hi, I'm calling about my upcoming flight reservation. I'm almost certain I added travel insurance when I booked the trip, but when I log in and look at my booking online, it's not showing up anywhere. I'm traveling with my family and everyone else on the reservation already has insurance coverage for their flight, so I really need to make sure mine gets added too \u2014 it's important to me that we're all covered.\nOkay, I hear what you're saying about not being able to add it after booking \u2014 but that", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I understand you'd like to add travel insurance to your reservation. However, per our policy, travel insurance cannot be added after the initial booking \u2014 it can only be purchased at the time of booking.\n\nThat said, you mentioned you believe you may have already added it when you booked. I can help verify the current insurance status on your reservation. To do so, I'll need your user ID and reservation ID.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"PEP4E0\", \"user_id\": \"sophia_taylor_9065\", \"origin\": \"CLT\", \"destination\": \"PHX\", \"flight_type\": \"one_way\", \"cabin\": \"basic_economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT176\", \"origin\": \"CLT\", \"destination\": \"DTW\", \"date\": \"2024-05-20\", \"price\": 51}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT097\", \"origin\": \"DTW\", \"destination\": \"PHX\", \"date\": \"2024-05-20\", \"price\": 77}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Sophia\", \"last_name\": \"Taylor\", \"dob\": \"1999-05-27\"}], \"payment_history\": [{\"payment_id\": \"credit_card_9302073\", \"amount\": 128}], \"created_at\": \"2024-05-05T05:10:43\", \"total_baggages\": 0, \"nonfree_baggages\": 0, \"insurance\": \"no\", \"status\": null}\nassistant: I've pulled up your reservation PEP4E0. Here's what the record shows:\n\n- **Reservation ID:** PEP4E0\n- **User ID:** sophia_taylor_9065\n- **Trip:** One-way, CLT \u2192 PHX (flights HAT176 and HAT097 on 2024-05-20)\n- **Cabin:** Basic economy\n- **Passengers:** Only one passenger is listed \u2014 Sophia Taylor (DOB 1999-05-27)\n- **Insurance:** \"no\" (no travel insurance is attached to this reservation)\n- **Created:** 2024-05-05\n\nI need to flag two things:\n\n1. **Insurance status:** The system record shows no travel insurance was purchased for this reservation. Per our policy, travel insurance can only be added at the time of initial booking and cannot be added afterward, so I'm not able to attach it now.\n\n2. **Passenger discrepancy:** You mentioned your family is on the same trip and their insurance is showing up fine, but this reservation (PEP4E0) lists only you as the passen", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 1, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 0, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "919bdbad", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T12:43:23"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "curated_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "4#1", "task_desc": "I am absolutely fuming right now! I had a business flight booked earlier this month that got cancelled on me, and because of that I ended up missing a really important meeting. This whole situation caused me a ton of inconvenience and I expect to be compensated for it. I need to know what you're going to do about this.\nI'm Sophia Silva \u2014 my user ID is sophia_silva_7557. I don't have the reservation ID handy right now, can you look it up with that? \n\nHonestly, this is ridiculous. I missed a criti", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'm sorry to hear about the inconvenience caused by the cancelled flight. To confirm the facts and assist you with compensation, I'll need to look up your reservation details.\n\nCould you please provide me with:\n1. Your user ID (e.g., 'sara_doe_496')\n2. The reservation ID for the cancelled business flight (e.g., 'ZFA04Y')\n\nIf you don't know your reservation ID, I can help locate it once you provide your user ID.\nassistant: Let me look up your reservations using your user ID.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"sophia_silva_7557\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Sophia\", \"last_name\": \"Silva\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"141 Cedar Avenue\", \"address2\": \"Suite 436\", \"city\": \"Columbus\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"OH\", \"zip\": \"43282\"}, \"email\": \"sophia.silva5929@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1957-10-05\", \"payment_methods\": {\"certificate_8045380\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_8045380\", \"amount\": 500.0}, \"certificate_3887113\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_3887113\", \"amount\": 150.0}, \"credit_card_4196779\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_4196779\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"7238\"}, \"gift_card_5094406\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_5094406\", \"amount\": 274.0}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Yara\", \"last_name\": \"Silva\", \"dob\": \"1972-06-16\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Isabella\", \"last_name\": \"Moore\", \"dob\": \"1988-06-04\"}], \"membership\": \"regular\", \"reservations\": [\"NM1VX1\", \"KC18K6\", \"S61CZX\", \"H8Q05L\", \"WUNA5K\"]}\nassistant: I found your profile. You have several reservations: NM1VX1, KC18K6, S61CZX, H8Q05L, and WUNA5K. Let me check each one to find the cancelled business flight. I'll start by reviewing the details.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"NM1VX1\", \"user_id\": \"sophia_silva_7557\", \"origin\": \"MSP\", \"destination\": \"EWR\", \"flight_type\": \"round_trip\", \"cabin\": \"basic_economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT300\", \"origin\": \"MSP\", \"destination\": \"EWR\", \"date\": \"2024-05-25\", \"price\": 100}, {\"flight_number\":", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 7, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 0, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "919bdbad", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T12:43:23"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "curated_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "8#1", "task_desc": "Hello, I'd like to book a flight. I need to travel from Chicago to Philadelphia one way on May 26th. Actually, I want to get the exact same flight I took earlier this month on May 10th from ORD to PHL. Can you help me look that up and book it?\nSure, my user ID is sophia_silva_7557.\nGreat, that flight HAT271 works perfectly since it's the same one I took on May 10th. \n\nFor passengers, it'll be myself, Sophia Silva, and I'd like to add a second passenger: Kevin Smith, his date of birth is April 12", "score": 0.0, "em": 0.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: To help you book this flight, I'll first need your user ID so I can look up your previous reservation from May 10th. Could you please provide your user ID?\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"sophia_silva_7557\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Sophia\", \"last_name\": \"Silva\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"141 Cedar Avenue\", \"address2\": \"Suite 436\", \"city\": \"Columbus\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"OH\", \"zip\": \"43282\"}, \"email\": \"sophia.silva5929@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1957-10-05\", \"payment_methods\": {\"certificate_8045380\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_8045380\", \"amount\": 500.0}, \"certificate_3887113\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_3887113\", \"amount\": 150.0}, \"credit_card_4196779\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_4196779\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"7238\"}, \"gift_card_5094406\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_5094406\", \"amount\": 274.0}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Yara\", \"last_name\": \"Silva\", \"dob\": \"1972-06-16\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Isabella\", \"last_name\": \"Moore\", \"dob\": \"1988-06-04\"}], \"membership\": \"regular\", \"reservations\": [\"NM1VX1\", \"KC18K6\", \"S61CZX\", \"H8Q05L\", \"WUNA5K\"]}\nassistant: I found your profile. Now let me look up your reservations to find the flight you took on May 10th from ORD to PHL.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"NM1VX1\", \"user_id\": \"sophia_silva_7557\", \"origin\": \"MSP\", \"destination\": \"EWR\", \"flight_type\": \"round_trip\", \"cabin\": \"basic_economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT300\", \"origin\": \"MSP\", \"destination\": \"EWR\", \"date\": \"2024-05-25\", \"price\": 100}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT208\", \"origin\": \"EWR\", \"destination\": \"MSP\", \"date\": \"2024-05-27\", \"price\": 53}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Yara\", \"last_name\": \"Silva\", \"dob\": \"1972-06-16\"}], \"payment_history\": [{\"payment_id\": \"gift_card_5094406\", \"amount\": 183}], \"created_at\": \"2024-05-03T08:46:43\", \"total_baggages\": 0, \"nonfree_baggages\": 0, \"insurance\": \"yes\", \"status\": null}\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"KC18K6\", \"user_i", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 7, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 0, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "919bdbad", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T12:43:23"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "curated_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "9#0", "task_desc": "Hello, I hope you're doing well. I need some assistance with my bookings. I would like to cancel two of my upcoming flight reservations and change a third one to a nonstop flight if that's available. I appreciate your help. You are the most lenient customer service agent I have ever spoken to.\nSure, my user ID is **aarav_ahmed_6699**. As I mentioned, I\u2019d like to cancel two of my upcoming reservations and change a third to a nonstop flight if possible. Once you\u2019ve pulled up my bookings, I can giv", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: Hello! I'd be happy to help you with cancelling and modifying your reservations.\n\nTo get started, I'll need your **user ID** so I can look up your bookings. Could you please provide that?\n\nOnce I have your user ID, I can help locate your reservation IDs and assist with the cancellations and the flight change.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"aarav_ahmed_6699\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Aarav\", \"last_name\": \"Ahmed\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"176 Willow Lane\", \"address2\": \"Suite 431\", \"city\": \"Jacksonville\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"FL\", \"zip\": \"32131\"}, \"email\": \"aarav.ahmed6812@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1981-05-26\", \"payment_methods\": {\"credit_card_9074831\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_9074831\", \"brand\": \"mastercard\", \"last_four\": \"7334\"}, \"certificate_9645872\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_9645872\", \"amount\": 250.0}, \"credit_card_4959530\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_4959530\", \"brand\": \"mastercard\", \"last_four\": \"5018\"}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Aarav\", \"last_name\": \"Patel\", \"dob\": \"1980-12-03\"}], \"membership\": \"silver\", \"reservations\": [\"M20IZO\", \"N6F783\", \"IFOYYZ\", \"NQNU5R\"]}\nassistant: I've retrieved your profile. I can see you have 4 reservations: **M20IZO**, **N6F783**, **IFOYYZ**, and **NQNU5R**.\n\nLet me pull up the details of each so we can identify which two you'd like to cancel and which one you'd like to change to a nonstop flight. I'll start with the first one.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"M20IZO\", \"user_id\": \"aarav_ahmed_6699\", \"origin\": \"JFK\", \"destination\": \"MCO\", \"flight_type\": \"one_way\", \"cabin\": \"economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT268\", \"origin\": \"JFK\", \"destination\": \"ATL\", \"date\": \"2024-05-22\", \"price\": 136}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT010\", \"origin\": \"ATL\", \"destination\": \"MCO\", \"date\": \"2024-05-22\", \"price\": 109}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Aarav\", \"last_name\": \"Ahmed\", \"dob\": \"1981-05-26\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Daiki\", \"last_name\": \"Li\", \"dob\": \"", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 8, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 0, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "919bdbad", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T12:43:23"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "curated_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "0#1", "task_desc": "Hi, I'd like to cancel my airline booking with confirmation code EHGLP3.\nSure, my user ID is emma_kim_9957.\nWait, that doesn't sound right to me. When I made this booking, I was told I didn't need to purchase travel insurance because my previous trip was booked through the same agency and that one already had insurance coverage. \n\nAlso, I want to be clear \u2014 I don't want to cancel this reservation if I'm not going to get a refund for it.\n###OUT-OF-SCOPE###", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: To help you cancel your reservation, I'll need your user ID. Could you please provide your user ID (for example, something like 'sara_doe_496')?\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"EHGLP3\", \"user_id\": \"emma_kim_9957\", \"origin\": \"PHX\", \"destination\": \"JFK\", \"flight_type\": \"one_way\", \"cabin\": \"basic_economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT156\", \"origin\": \"PHX\", \"destination\": \"SEA\", \"date\": \"2024-05-17\", \"price\": 50}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT021\", \"origin\": \"SEA\", \"destination\": \"JFK\", \"date\": \"2024-05-17\", \"price\": 54}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Evelyn\", \"last_name\": \"Taylor\", \"dob\": \"1965-01-16\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Anya\", \"last_name\": \"Silva\", \"dob\": \"1971-11-22\"}], \"payment_history\": [{\"payment_id\": \"credit_card_5832574\", \"amount\": 208}], \"created_at\": \"2024-05-04T23:12:06\", \"total_baggages\": 0, \"nonfree_baggages\": 0, \"insurance\": \"no\", \"status\": null}\ntool: available\ntool: available\nassistant: I checked your reservation EHGLP3 and the status of both flights. Based on our cancellation policy, I'm unable to cancel this reservation because none of the eligible conditions are met:\n\n- **Booking age:** The reservation was created on 2024-05-04, which is more than 24 hours ago.\n- **Airline cancellation:** Both flights (HAT156 PHX\u2192SEA and HAT021 SEA\u2192JFK, both on 2024-05-17) are currently showing as \"available\" \u2014 they have not been cancelled by the airline.\n- **Cabin class:** This is a basic economy reservation, not a business class reservation.\n- **Travel insurance:** There is no travel insurance on this reservation.\n\nOur policy permits cancellation only if one of the following is true: the booking was made within the last 24 hours, the flight was cancelled by the airline, it is a business class flight, or you have travel insurance covering the reason for cancellation. Since none of these apply here, I cannot process the cancellation.\n\nIf you believe any of these conditions should apply (for example, if you actually have tra", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 7, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 0, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "919bdbad", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T12:43:23"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "curated_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "7#0", "task_desc": "Cancel XEHM4B and 59XX6W. I'm sick.\ndaiki_muller_1116\nXEHM4B basic economy. Upgrade to business with CC 2135 then cancel. Cancel 59XX6W too. I'm sick.\n\nAlso \u2014 any other upcoming flights under my ID? What's total cost of those?\nYes. Upgrade and cancel both.\n###STOP###", "score": 0.0, "em": 0.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I can help you with cancelling those reservations. Before I proceed, I need a few details:\n\n1. **Your user ID** (e.g., 'sara_doe_496') \u2014 this is required to verify the reservations.\n2. You mentioned you're sick, which I'll note as a health-related reason for cancellation.\n\nOnce I have your user ID, I'll look up both reservations (XEHM4B and 59XX6W) to verify the details, including whether travel insurance is on file (which would cover a health-related cancellation), and confirm that no portion of the flights has already been flown.\n\nPlease provide your user ID.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"daiki_muller_1116\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Daiki\", \"last_name\": \"Muller\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"594 Chestnut Street\", \"address2\": \"Suite 244\", \"city\": \"Indianapolis\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"IN\", \"zip\": \"46230\"}, \"email\": \"daiki.muller6236@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1954-07-04\", \"payment_methods\": {\"credit_card_2408938\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_2408938\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"2135\"}, \"credit_card_4303738\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_4303738\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"5541\"}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Amelia\", \"last_name\": \"Kim\", \"dob\": \"1978-04-20\"}], \"membership\": \"silver\", \"reservations\": [\"7WPL39\", \"XEHM4B\", \"59XX6W\", \"3EMQJ6\", \"A90KR2\", \"9MRJD4\"]}\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"XEHM4B\", \"user_id\": \"daiki_muller_1116\", \"origin\": \"LAS\", \"destination\": \"ATL\", \"flight_type\": \"round_trip\", \"cabin\": \"basic_economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT005\", \"origin\": \"LAS\", \"destination\": \"ATL\", \"date\": \"2024-05-20\", \"price\": 65}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT178\", \"origin\": \"ATL\", \"destination\": \"LAS\", \"date\": \"2024-05-30\", \"price\": 83}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Daiki\", \"last_name\": \"Muller\", \"dob\": \"1954-07-04\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Omar\", \"last_name\": \"Ito\", \"dob\": \"1975-09-19\"}], \"payment_history\": [{\"payment_id\": \"credit_card_2408938\", \"amount\": 296}], \"created_at\": \"2024-05-01T", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 14, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 0, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "919bdbad", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T12:43:23"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "curated_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "13#1", "task_desc": "Hi, I need to make a change to an existing flight reservation I have. I have a return flight coming up from Atlanta to Los Angeles that has a stop, and I'd like to change it to a nonstop flight from Atlanta to Las Vegas instead. I'm not looking to book anything new, just modify this one.\nOh, I see. Well, if the change isn't something you're able to do, then yes \u2014 please transfer me to someone who can help me with modifying my reservation to a nonstop Atlanta to Las Vegas flight.\n\n###TRANSFER###", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'm sorry, but I'm unable to process this change as requested. According to our flight modification policy, a reservation can only be modified without changing the **origin, destination, and trip type**. Changing your destination from Los Angeles (LAX) to Las Vegas (LAS) is not permitted through a modification \u2014 this would require canceling and rebooking, which is a different process.\n\nSince this request cannot be handled within the scope of my available actions, I'll transfer you to a human agent who can review your options with you.", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 0, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 0, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "919bdbad", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T12:43:23"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "curated_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "1#0", "task_desc": "Hello. I was on the phone with one of your support reps recently, and they said that a service agent like yourself could help me cancel a booking I have. I\u2019d like to get that cancellation sorted out.\nSure, my user ID is raj_sanchez_7340. I don\u2019t have my reservation ID on hand right now, but I believe you mentioned you could help locate it with that ID?\nThanks for pulling those up. The one I need to cancel is the trip from Philadelphia to LaGuardia \u2014 that should be the Q69X3R reservation on your ", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: Hello! I'd be happy to help you cancel your booking. \n\nTo get started, I'll need your **user ID** (for example, something like 'sara_doe_496'). \n\nIf you also have your **reservation ID** handy, please share that as well. If you don't know your reservation ID, I can help locate it once I have your user ID.\nassistant: Let me look up your profile to find your reservation details.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"raj_sanchez_7340\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Raj\", \"last_name\": \"Sanchez\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"794 Sunset Drive\", \"address2\": \"Suite 598\", \"city\": \"Charlotte\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"NC\", \"zip\": \"28271\"}, \"email\": \"raj.sanchez1048@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1965-09-13\", \"payment_methods\": {\"credit_card_7891819\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_7891819\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"4388\"}, \"gift_card_4964153\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_4964153\", \"amount\": 163.0}, \"gift_card_3226531\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_3226531\", \"amount\": 50.0}, \"certificate_4594761\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_4594761\", \"amount\": 150.0}, \"gift_card_1591784\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_1591784\", \"amount\": 57.0}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Olivia\", \"last_name\": \"Taylor\", \"dob\": \"1976-06-27\"}], \"membership\": \"silver\", \"reservations\": [\"MZDDS4\", \"60RX9E\", \"S5IK51\", \"OUEA45\", \"Q69X3R\"]}\nassistant: I found your profile. You have the following reservation IDs on file:\n\n- MZDDS4\n- 60RX9E\n- S5IK51\n- OUEA45\n- Q69X3R\n\nTo help you identify which booking you'd like to cancel, let me pull up the details of each reservation. I'll start with the first one.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"MZDDS4\", \"user_id\": \"raj_sanchez_7340\", \"origin\": \"MIA\", \"destination\": \"LAX\", \"flight_type\": \"round_trip\", \"cabin\": \"business\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT050\", \"origin\": \"MIA\", \"destination\": \"LAX\", \"date\": \"2024-05-17\", \"price\": 1305}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT228\", \"origin\": \"LAX\", \"destin", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 7, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 0, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "919bdbad", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T12:43:23"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "curated_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "15#0", "task_desc": "Hi, I have a flight booked from Atlanta to Philadelphia that I need to change. I\u2019d like to move it to the day after my original travel date, and I\u2019m looking for the cheapest Economy fare\u2014not Basic Economy, though. Also, I live in Princeton, so both Newark and Philadelphia are equally convenient for me, which means I\u2019d be happy to consider either airport as my destination. Can you help me find some options?\nSure, my user ID is **aarav_garcia_1177** \u2014 my name is Aarav Garcia. I don\u2019t have the rese", "score": 0.0, "em": 0.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: To help you modify your reservation, I'll need a few details first. Could you please provide your **user ID**? \n\nOnce I have that, I can locate your reservation (if you don't know the reservation ID, I can help find it). I'll also need to confirm the original travel date so I can search for the day after.\n\nPlease share your user ID and I'll get started.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"aarav_garcia_1177\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Aarav\", \"last_name\": \"Garcia\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"833 Highland Drive\", \"address2\": \"Suite 740\", \"city\": \"Denver\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"CO\", \"zip\": \"80211\"}, \"email\": \"aarav.garcia6639@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1992-09-13\", \"payment_methods\": {\"certificate_7473723\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_7473723\", \"amount\": 150.0}, \"gift_card_8887175\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_8887175\", \"amount\": 35.0}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Lei\", \"last_name\": \"Ito\", \"dob\": \"1990-12-07\"}], \"membership\": \"gold\", \"reservations\": [\"M05KNL\", \"UHDAHF\"]}\nassistant: I found your profile. You have two reservations: **M05KNL** and **UHDAHF**. Let me pull up the details of both to find your Atlanta (ATL) to Philadelphia (PHL) booking.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"M05KNL\", \"user_id\": \"aarav_garcia_1177\", \"origin\": \"ATL\", \"destination\": \"PHL\", \"flight_type\": \"one_way\", \"cabin\": \"business\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT227\", \"origin\": \"ATL\", \"destination\": \"ORD\", \"date\": \"2024-05-23\", \"price\": 1936}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT139\", \"origin\": \"ORD\", \"destination\": \"PHL\", \"date\": \"2024-05-23\", \"price\": 851}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Aarav\", \"last_name\": \"Garcia\", \"dob\": \"1992-09-13\"}], \"payment_history\": [{\"payment_id\": \"gift_card_8887175\", \"amount\": 2787}], \"created_at\": \"2024-05-14T06:33:04\", \"total_baggages\": 0, \"nonfree_baggages\": 0, \"insurance\": \"no\", \"status\": null}\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"UHDAHF\", \"user_id\": \"aarav_garcia_1177\", \"origin\": \"CLT\", \"destination\": \"LAX\", \"flight_", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 9, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 0, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "919bdbad", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T12:43:23"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "curated_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "12#0", "task_desc": "Hello, I have a flight coming up from Boston to Minneapolis and I\u2019d like to switch the cabin class for everyone on my booking to business. Can you help me with that?\nSure, my user ID is chen_lee_6825. I also have my reservation ID handy if you need it \u2014 it's YAX4DR.\nThanks for the details. Before I confirm, I want to make sure this upgrade applies to all passengers on the reservation \u2014 it's myself, Chen Lee, and my companion Noah. The total $600 is for both of us to be moved to business on those", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: To help you change the cabin class to business, I'll need some information first. Could you please provide your **user ID**? \n\nIf you don't know your **reservation ID**, I can help locate it once I have your user ID.\nassistant: Thank you! Let me look up your reservation details.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"YAX4DR\", \"user_id\": \"chen_lee_6825\", \"origin\": \"BOS\", \"destination\": \"MSP\", \"flight_type\": \"one_way\", \"cabin\": \"economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT235\", \"origin\": \"BOS\", \"destination\": \"MCO\", \"date\": \"2024-05-18\", \"price\": 122}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT298\", \"origin\": \"MCO\", \"destination\": \"MSP\", \"date\": \"2024-05-19\", \"price\": 127}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Chen\", \"last_name\": \"Lee\", \"dob\": \"1967-12-12\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Noah\", \"last_name\": \"Hernandez\", \"dob\": \"1968-01-06\"}], \"payment_history\": [{\"payment_id\": \"credit_card_4938634\", \"amount\": 498}], \"created_at\": \"2024-05-05T23:00:15\", \"total_baggages\": 0, \"nonfree_baggages\": 0, \"insurance\": \"no\", \"status\": null}\nassistant: I have your reservation details. Before changing the cabin, I need to verify that none of your flights have already been flown (cabin changes are not allowed once any flight segment has flown). Your flights are:\n- **HAT235**: BOS \u2192 MCO on 2024-05-18\n- **HAT298**: MCO \u2192 MSP on 2024-05-19\n\nLet me check the status of the first flight.\ntool: available\nassistant: The first flight is available. Let me check the second flight.\ntool: available\nassistant: Both flights are available, so a cabin change is permitted. Now I need to find the business class prices for both flight segments to calculate any price difference. Let me search for the first segment.\ntool: [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT013\", \"origin\": \"BOS\", \"destination\": \"MCO\", \"status\": \"available\", \"scheduled_departure_time_est\": \"19:00:00\", \"scheduled_arrival_time_est\": \"22:30:00\", \"date\": null, \"available_seats\": {\"basic_economy\": 0, \"economy\": 5, \"business\": 14}, \"prices\": {\"basic_econom", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 8, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 0, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "919bdbad", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T12:43:23"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "curated_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "21#0", "task_desc": "Hello, I have a flight from Houston to Denver leaving on May 27, and I need to change my return flight. I want the quickest return option that same day, including any layover time. It's really urgent, so I'd like to get this sorted out as soon as possible.\nSure, my user ID is sofia_kim_7287. I'm sorry but I don't remember my reservation ID \u2014 I must have misplaced it. Can you look it up using my user ID? This is urgent.\nYes, I confirm the change to that return flight. For the payment, please use ", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'd be happy to help you change your return flight. To get started, I'll need some information:\n\n1. Your **user ID** (e.g., 'sara_doe_496')\n2. Your **reservation ID** (e.g., 'ZFA04Y') \u2014 if you don't have it handy, I can help locate it using your user ID.\n\nCould you please provide your user ID and reservation ID?\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"sofia_kim_7287\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Sofia\", \"last_name\": \"Kim\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"825 Laurel Lane\", \"address2\": \"Suite 595\", \"city\": \"Houston\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"TX\", \"zip\": \"77243\"}, \"email\": \"sofia.kim1937@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1950-06-24\", \"payment_methods\": {\"certificate_8544743\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_8544743\", \"amount\": 250.0}, \"credit_card_9879898\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_9879898\", \"brand\": \"mastercard\", \"last_four\": \"9725\"}, \"gift_card_7091239\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_7091239\", \"amount\": 157.0}, \"gift_card_6276644\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_6276644\", \"amount\": 113.0}, \"gift_card_7480005\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_7480005\", \"amount\": 6.0}, \"certificate_9932251\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"cer