{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "curated_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "19#1", "task_desc": "Hello, I have a booking for a short half-day trip to Texas, but I can't seem to find my reservation ID. I want to change my return flight back to Newark to a later time on the same day if possible, or else the earliest flight the next day. Right now I'm scheduled to fly back at 3pm on the 28th. Can you help me with that?\nSure, my user ID is olivia_gonzalez_2305.\n###TRANSFER###", "score": 0.0, "em": 0.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'd be happy to help you modify your return flight. To locate your reservation, I'll need your user ID first. Could you please provide your user ID?\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"olivia_gonzalez_2305\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Olivia\", \"last_name\": \"Gonzalez\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"334 Laurel Lane\", \"address2\": \"Suite 970\", \"city\": \"Los Angeles\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"CA\", \"zip\": \"90504\"}, \"email\": \"olivia.gonzalez4421@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1988-06-13\", \"payment_methods\": {\"gift_card_2200803\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_2200803\", \"amount\": 123.0}, \"credit_card_9969263\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_9969263\", \"brand\": \"mastercard\", \"last_four\": \"9475\"}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Mei\", \"last_name\": \"Johansson\", \"dob\": \"1981-09-25\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Yara\", \"last_name\": \"Lopez\", \"dob\": \"1975-09-15\"}], \"membership\": \"regular\", \"reservations\": [\"Z7GOZK\", \"K67C4W\", \"THY2DG\"]}\nassistant: I found your profile. You have three reservations (Z7GOZK, K67C4W, THY2DG). Let me check the details to find the one matching your Texas trip with a return to Newark on the 28th.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"Z7GOZK\", \"user_id\": \"olivia_gonzalez_2305\", \"origin\": \"EWR\", \"destination\": \"IAH\", \"flight_type\": \"round_trip\", \"cabin\": \"basic_economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT188\", \"origin\": \"EWR\", \"destination\": \"IAH\", \"date\": \"2024-05-28\", \"price\": 52}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT207\", \"origin\": \"IAH\", \"destination\": \"EWR\", \"date\": \"2024-05-28\", \"price\": 87}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Olivia\", \"last_name\": \"Gonzalez\", \"dob\": \"1988-06-13\"}], \"payment_history\": [{\"payment_id\": \"gift_card_2200803\", \"amount\": 169}], \"created_at\": \"2024-05-13T19:41:32\", \"total_baggages\": 0, \"nonfree_baggages\": 0, \"insurance\": \"yes\", \"status\": null}\nassistant: I found your reservation. It's **Z7GOZK**: a round-trip from Newark (EWR) to Houston, TX (IAH) on 2024-05-28, with the return flight HAT207 from IAH to EWR on the s", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 3, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 0, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "919bdbad", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T12:43:23"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "curated_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "24#0", "task_desc": "Hello, this is Mia Kim. I need a bit of help with my travel plans. First, I have a reservation that currently includes another person, Ethan, and I need to get him taken off of it. Also, separately, I\u2019m looking to book a flight from New York to somewhere on the West Coast for an upcoming trip. Could we start with removing Ethan from my booking?\nThanks for letting me know about the policy. Since removing Ethan from reservation H9ZU1C isn't possible, then please go ahead and cancel that entire res", "score": 0.0, "em": 0.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I can help with your requests, but I need to clarify a few things first.\n\nRegarding removing Ethan from your existing reservation: I'm sorry, but per our policy, the number of passengers on a reservation cannot be modified \u2014 this applies to all agents, including human agents. You can modify passenger details (such as names or dates of birth) as long as the number of passengers stays the same, but removing a passenger entirely is not permitted. If you'd like, I can help you modify passenger information without changing the count, or you may want to consider other options.\n\nNow, for booking a new flight from New York to the West Coast, I'll be happy to assist! To get started, I'll need your **user ID** (for example, a format like `mia_kim_123`). Could you please provide that?\n\nOnce I have your user ID, I'll also need a few more details for the new booking:\n- Trip type (one way or round trip)\n- Your preferred departure date\n- Origin airport in New York (e.g., JFK, LGA, or EWR) and destination on the West Coast (e.g., LAX, SFO, SEA)\n- Cabin class (basic economy, economy, or business)\n- Passenger details (first name, last name, date of birth) for everyone traveling\n- Whether you'd like to add travel insurance ($30 per passenger)\n\nPlease share your user ID and any of the above details you have ready.\nassistant: I'll help you with both tasks. Let me start by reviewing your reservation H9ZU1C to verify the cancellation details.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"H9ZU1C\", \"user_id\": \"mia_kim_4397\", \"origin\": \"MIA\", \"destination\": \"IAH\", \"flight_type\": \"one_way\", \"cabin\": \"economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT192\", \"origin\": \"MIA\", \"destination\": \"EWR\", \"date\": \"2024-05-24\", \"price\": 174}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT166\", \"origin\": \"EWR\", \"destination\": \"IAH\", \"date\": \"2024-05-25\", \"price\": 125}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"James\", \"last_name\": \"Moore\", \"dob\": \"1977-02-03\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Ethan\", \"last_name\": \"Lopez\", \"dob\": ", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 16, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 0, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "919bdbad", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T12:43:23"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "curated_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "2#0", "task_desc": "Hi, I'd like to book a flight from San Francisco to New York. There will be three passengers traveling with me.\nSure, my user ID is noah_muller_9847.\n\nAnd just to confirm, it's a one-way trip from SF to NY for me and three other passengers \u2014 but I'll wait for you to walk me through the rest of the details you need.\nActually, hold on \u2014 never mind all those booking details for a second. I'm really frustrated about the delayed flight in my most recent reservation and I need to talk about that inste", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: To get started with your booking, I'll need some information. First, could you please provide your **user ID**?\n\nAlso, for your reference, I'll need to collect the following details to complete the booking:\n- **Trip type** (one way or round trip)\n- **Travel date(s)**\n- **Cabin class** (basic economy, economy, or business)\n- **First name, last name, and date of birth** for each of the 4 passengers (you + 3 others)\n- **Payment method(s)** (must already be in your profile)\n- Whether you'd like to add **travel insurance** ($30 per passenger)\n\nPlease provide your user ID to begin.\nassistant: Thank you! Let me look up your profile to confirm your details and available payment methods.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"noah_muller_9847\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Noah\", \"last_name\": \"Muller\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"889 Hillcrest Drive\", \"address2\": \"Suite 254\", \"city\": \"Denver\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"CO\", \"zip\": \"80243\"}, \"email\": \"noah.muller2290@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1963-01-22\", \"payment_methods\": {\"credit_card_1245537\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_1245537\", \"brand\": \"mastercard\", \"last_four\": \"1167\"}, \"credit_card_6040264\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_6040264\", \"