{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "curated_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "1#1", "task_desc": "Hi, I'm calling because I spoke with a customer support rep on the phone recently about canceling a trip, and they told me a service agent would be able to help me with that. I'd like to get my reservation canceled.\nSure, my name is Raj Sanchez and my user ID is raj_sanchez_7340.\nI'm not sure which of those reservation IDs is the right one, but the trip I need to cancel is from Philadelphia to LaGuardia. Could you check the details to see which one matches that route?\nIt's a change of plan on my", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I can help you with canceling your reservation. To get started, I'll need your user ID. Could you please provide it? If you don't know your reservation ID, I can help locate it once I have your user ID.\nassistant: Thank you. Let me look up your profile to find your reservation.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"raj_sanchez_7340\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Raj\", \"last_name\": \"Sanchez\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"794 Sunset Drive\", \"address2\": \"Suite 598\", \"city\": \"Charlotte\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"NC\", \"zip\": \"28271\"}, \"email\": \"raj.sanchez1048@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1965-09-13\", \"payment_methods\": {\"credit_card_7891819\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_7891819\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"4388\"}, \"gift_card_4964153\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_4964153\", \"amount\": 163.0}, \"gift_card_3226531\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_3226531\", \"amount\": 50.0}, \"certificate_4594761\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_4594761\", \"amount\": 150.0}, \"gift_card_1591784\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_1591784\", \"amount\": 57.0}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Olivia\", \"last_name\": \"Taylor\", \"dob\": \"1976-06-27\"}], \"membe