{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "curated_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "10#0", "task_desc": "Hello, I have a flight from IAH to SEA coming up on May 23rd, and I'd like to push it back to May 24th. Also, I want to upgrade the cabin to business class for all passengers on that flight.\nSure, my user ID is liam_khan_2521. I don't have my reservation ID handy, but hopefully you can look it up with that.\nThanks for pulling that up, though I see you had to upgrade the return flights to business as well since the cabin has to be uniform \u2014 I get that it's not possible to just do the outbound onl", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: To help you modify your reservation, I'll need some information first. Could you please provide:\n\n1. Your **user ID** (e.g., 'sara_doe_496')\n2. Your **reservation ID** (e.g., 'ZFA04Y')\n\nIf you don't know your reservation ID, I can help locate it once you provide your user ID.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"liam_khan_2521\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Liam\", \"last_name\": \"Khan\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"626 Willow Lane\", \"address2\": \"Suite 707\", \"city\": \"New York\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"NY\", \"zip\": \"10148\"}, \"email\": \"liam.khan7273@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1979-09-27\", \"payment_methods\": {\"certificate_9254323\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_9254323\", \"amount\": 500.0}, \"gift_card_7194529\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_7194529\", \"amount\": 62.0}, \"credit_card_7434610\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_7434610\", \"brand\": \"mastercard\", \"last_four\": \"9448\"}, \"credit_card_7231150\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_7231150\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"3422\"}, \"certificate_1849235\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_1849235\", \"amount\": 250.0}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Fatima\", \"last_name\": \"Ito\", \"dob\": \"1983-03-27\"}], \"membership\": \"gold\", \"reservations\": [\"4NQLHD\", \"KHIK97\", \"NO6SVK\", \"AJVCTQ\", \"ZB7LBX\"]}\nassistant: I found your profile. You have several reservations. Let me look up the details to find the one matching your IAH to SEA flight on May 23rd.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"4NQLHD\", \"user_id\": \"liam_khan_2521\", \"origin\": \"IAH\", \"destination\": \"SEA\", \"flight_type\": \"round_trip\", \"cabin\": \"economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT190\", \"origin\": \"IAH\", \"destination\": \"LAS\", \"date\": \"2024-05-23\", \"price\": 126}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT047\", \"origin\": \"LAS\", \"destination\": \"SEA\", \"date\": \"2024-05-23\", \"price\": 139}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT021\", \"origin\": \"SEA\", \"destination\": \"JFK\", \"date\": \"2024-05-26\", \"price\": 148}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT279\", \"origin\"", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 9, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 0, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "919bdbad", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T12:43:23"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "curated_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "11#1", "task_desc": "Hi, I'm James Patel. I've got a round trip from Las Vegas to Denver \u2014 leaving May 19 and returning May 20. I need to remove a passenger named Sophia from that booking, and I'm in a rush, so can you get that done quickly?\nUgh, this is ridiculous \u2014 I'm in a hurry here! If you can't remove Sophia from the booking, then just downgrade all passengers on that reservation to basic economy. And how much of a refund would that downgrade give me? I need whatever refund there is processed back to my origin", "score": 0.0, "em": 0.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'm sorry, but I'm unable to process this request. According to our policy, the number of passengers on a reservation cannot be modified \u2014 you cannot add or remove passengers from a booking. This applies even if transferred to a human agent.\n\nIf you'd like, I can help you with other modifications to the reservation, such as changing flight details, cabin class, or adding checked bags (but not removing them), or I can assist with cancelling the entire reservation if that works for your situation. Please let me know how you'd like to proceed.\nassistant: I understand you're in a hurry, and I'll do my best to help efficiently. To proceed with the cabin downgrade, I first need your user ID (for example, a format like \"james_patel_123\"). \n\nCould you please provide your user ID? Once I have that, I can locate your reservation and check the details needed for the downgrade and refund calculation.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"james_patel_9828\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"James\", \"last_name\": \"Patel\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"656 River Road\", \"address2\": \"Suite 768\", \"city\": \"Los Angeles\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"CA\", \"zip\": \"90357\"}, \"email\": \"james.patel1360@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1995-04-07\", \"payment_methods\": {\"gift_card_164201