{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "curated_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "35#0", "task_desc": "Hi, this is Aarav Ahmed. I need to cancel my upcoming flight from JFK to MCO on May 22. Since I\u2019m a silver member, I should get a full refund for that cancellation.\nSure, my user ID is aarav_ahmed_6699. And just to be clear, as a silver member I\u2019m entitled to a full refund on this cancellation \u2014 I\u2019d like to make sure that goes through.\nThe reason is change of plan \u2014 I need to cancel that May 22 JFK to MCO trip. But I have to insist on this: I\u2019m a silver member, so I\u2019m entitled to a full refund r", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: Hello Aarav! I'd be happy to help you cancel your flight. To get started, I'll need your user ID to locate your reservation. Could you please provide your user ID?\nassistant: Thank you! Let me look up your profile and reservations.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"aarav_ahmed_6699\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Aarav\", \"last_name\": \"Ahmed\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"176 Willow Lane\", \"address2\": \"Suite 431\", \"city\": \"Jacksonville\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"FL\", \"zip\": \"32131\"}, \"email\": \"aarav.ahmed6812@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1981-05-26\", \"payment_methods\": {\"credit_card_9074831\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_9074831\", \"brand\": \"mastercard\", \"last_four\": \"7334\"}, \"certificate_9645872\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_9645872\", \"amount\": 250.0}, \"credit_card_4959530\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_4959530\", \"brand\": \"mastercard\", \"last_four\": \"5018\"}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Aarav\", \"last_name\": \"Patel\", \"dob\": \"1980-12-03\"}], \"membership\": \"silver\", \"reservations\": [\"M20IZO\", \"N6F783\", \"IFOYYZ\", \"NQNU5R\"]}\nassistant: I found your profile (silver member). Now let me locate the specific reservation for your JFK to MCO flight on May 22 by checking your reservations.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"M20IZO\", \"user_id\": \"aarav_ahmed_6699\", \"origin\": \"JFK\", \"destination\": \"MCO\", \"flight_type\": \"one_way\", \"cabin\": \"economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT268\", \"origin\": \"JFK\", \"destination\": \"ATL\", \"date\": \"2024-05-22\", \"price\": 136}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT010\", \"origin\": \"ATL\", \"destination\": \"MCO\", \"date\": \"2024-05-22\", \"price\": 109}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Aarav\", \"last_name\": \"Ahmed\", \"dob\": \"1981-05-26\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Daiki\", \"last_name\": \"Li\", \"dob\": \"1980-12-24\"}], \"payment_history\": [{\"payment_id\": \"credit_card_4959530\", \"amount\": 490}], \"created_at\": \"2024-05-12T09:36:29\", \"total_baggages\": 1, \"nonfree_baggages\": 0, \"insurance\": \"no\", \"status\": null}\ntool: {\"reser", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 10, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 0, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "919bdbad", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T12:43:23"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "curated_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "15#1", "task_desc": "Hi, I need to change my upcoming flight from Atlanta to Philadelphia. I\u2019d like to move it to the day after my original travel date and find the lowest\u2011priced Economy fare\u2014not Basic Economy. Also, I live in Princeton, so Newark is just as easy for me to get to as Philly, so I\u2019d like to look at options into EWR as well. Can you help me with that?\nSure, my user ID is **aarav_garcia_1177**. I don\u2019t have my reservation ID in front of me, so could you look it up using that?\n\nAnd thanks for explaining ", "score": 0.0, "em": 0.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: To help you modify your flight, I'll need a few details first.\n\nCould you please provide:\n1. Your **user ID** (e.g., `sara_doe_496`)\n2. Your **reservation ID** (if you don't know it, I can look it up for you using your user ID)\n\nAlso, I should let you know about one important policy constraint: flight modifications **cannot change the origin, destination, or trip type** of an existing reservation. This means I can help you move your flight to the day after your original travel date and find the lowest-priced Economy fare, but I **cannot change the destination from Philadelphia (PHL) to Newark (EWR)**. If you'd like to fly into Newark instead, that would require a new booking (and potentially cancelling the existing one, subject to cancellation rules).\n\nPlease share your user ID and reservation ID so I can pull up your booking and assist further.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"aarav_garcia_1177\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Aarav\", \"last_name\": \"Garcia\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"833 Highland Drive\", \"address2\": \"Suite 740\", \"city\": \"Denver\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"CO\", \"zip\": \"80211\"}, \"email\": \"aarav.garcia6639@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1992-09-13\", \"payment_methods\": {\"certificate_7473723\": {\"source\": \"certifi