{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "curated_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "5#1", "task_desc": "Hello, I'm Mei Brown. I'm a valued Gold member with your airline, and I'm calling about my flight HAT045 from Phoenix to Seattle. The flight is delayed and because of that I'm going to miss a very important meeting. I'm extremely upset about this!\nMy user ID is mei_brown_7075. I don't have my reservation ID handy right now, but hopefully you can pull it up with that.\n\nAnd just to be clear \u2014 I'm not looking to change or cancel my flight HAT045. The flight needs to stay as is. I just want to talk ", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'm sorry to hear about the delay and that you'll miss your important meeting. I'd like to help you with this. To look up your reservation and confirm the flight details, I'll need a bit more information.\n\nCould you please provide:\n1. Your user ID (e.g., the format like `mei_brown_123`)\n2. Your reservation ID (if you have it; if not, I can help locate it using your user ID)\n\nOnce I have these, I can confirm the flight status and discuss your options for changing or cancelling the reservation.\nassistant: Thank you for providing your user ID. Let me look up your profile and reservation details.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"mei_brown_7075\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Mei\", \"last_name\": \"Brown\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"853 Chestnut Street\", \"address2\": \"Suite 497\", \"city\": \"Washington\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"DC\", \"zip\": \"20195\"}, \"email\": \"mei.brown7062@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1986-12-14\", \"payment_methods\": {\"certificate_6761175\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_6761175\", \"amount\": 250.0}, \"gift_card_8987598\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_8987598\", \"amount\": 130.0}, \"credit_card_4920843\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_4920843\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\