{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "curated_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "31#1", "task_desc": "Hello, I'm Daiki Lee. I have a flight scheduled from JFK on May 17, but my cat is very sick and I need to return home earlier to take care of him. I was hoping I could change my booking to a nonstop flight that gets me there sooner.\nMy user ID is daiki_lee_6144. Unfortunately, I don't have my reservation ID with me \u2014 I'm not sure what it is. Can you look it up using my user ID?\nOh, that's really unfortunate. I was specifically hoping to just change the existing reservation to a nonstop flight, a", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: Hello Daiki Lee, I'm sorry to hear about your cat. I'll help you look into changing your booking.\n\nTo get started, I'll need your **user ID** (for example, something like `daiki_lee_123`). \n\nAlso, do you have your **reservation ID** handy? If not, I can help locate it once I have your user ID.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"daiki_lee_6144\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Daiki\", \"last_name\": \"Lee\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"410 River Road\", \"address2\": \"Suite 380\", \"city\": \"Fort Worth\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"TX\", \"zip\": \"76173\"}, \"email\": \"daiki.lee6987@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1976-10-08\", \"payment_methods\": {\"credit_card_6198952\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_6198952\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"9734\"}, \"gift_card_3112961\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_3112961\", \"amount\": 51.0}, \"gift_card_5128346\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_5128346\", \"amount\": 262.0}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Raj\", \"last_name\": \"Muller\", \"dob\": \"1967-10-16\"}], \"membership\": \"regular\", \"reservations\": [\"DF89BM\", \"COVE6R\", \"IIHXDG\"]}\nassistant: I found your user profile. You have three reservations: **DF89BM**, **COVE6R**, and **IIHXDG**. Let me check the details of each to find the one with your JFK flight on May 17.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"DF89BM\", \"user_id\": \"daiki_lee_6144\", \"origin\": \"JFK\", \"destination\": \"DTW\", \"flight_type\": \"round_trip\", \"cabin\": \"basic_economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT079\", \"origin\": \"JFK\", \"destination\": \"ORD\", \"date\": \"2024-05-17\", \"price\": 63}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT020\", \"origin\": \"ORD\", \"destination\": \"DTW\", \"date\": \"2024-05-17\", \"price\": 78}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT263\", \"origin\": \"DTW\", \"destination\": \"JFK\", \"date\": \"2024-05-24\", \"price\": 53}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Daiki\", \"last_name\": \"Lee\", \"dob\": \"1976-10-08\"}], \"payment_history\": [{\"payment_id\": \"gift_card_3112961\", \"amount\": 194}], \"created_at\": \"2024-05-01T23:25:01\", \"total_baggages\": 0, \"nonfr", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 4, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 0, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "919bdbad", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T12:43:23"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "curated_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "20#1", "task_desc": "Hello, I'm looking to book a one-way flight from New York to Seattle on May 20th.\nSure, my user ID is mia_li_3668.\nActually, both of those flights depart before 11am EST, and I don't want to fly that early \u2014 do you have any options leaving after 11am? \n\nAs for the passenger details, I'm Mia Li (that's me, not Amelia Ahmed). My date of birth is already in my user profile, so I'd rather not provide it. And for cabin, I'd want Economy.\nI'll go with Option A since it's the lower fare at $255.\n\nFor p", "score": 0.0, "em": 0.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: Hello! I'd be happy to help you book a one-way flight from New York to Seattle on May 20th.\n\nTo get started, I'll need your **user ID** (for example, something like 'sara_doe_496'). Could you please provide that?\nassistant: Thank you! Let me look up your profile to assist with the booking.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"mia_li_3668\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Mia\", \"last_name\": \"Li\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"975 Sunset Drive\", \"address2\": \"Suite 217\", \"city\": \"Austin\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"TX\", \"zip\": \"78750\"}, \"email\": \"mia.li3818@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1990-04-05\", \"payment_methods\": {\"credit_card_4421486\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_4421486\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"7447\"}, \"certificate_4856383\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_4856383\", \"amount\": 100.0}, \"certificate_7504069\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_7504069\", \"amount\": 250.0}, \"credit_card_1955700\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_1955700\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"1907\"}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Amelia\", \"last_name\": \"Ahmed\", \"dob\": \"1957-03-21\"}], \"membership\": \"gold\", \"reservations\": [\"NO6JO3\", \"AIXC49\", \"HKEG34\"]}\nassistant: Thank you, Mia! I can see you're a **gold member**. I'll search for available flights from New York (JFK) to Seattle (SEA) on May 20th, 2024.\ntool: [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT069\", \"origin\": \"JFK\", \"destination\": \"SEA\", \"status\": \"available\", \"scheduled_departure_time_est\": \"06:00:00\", \"scheduled_arrival_time_est\": \"12:00:00\", \"date\": null, \"available_seats\": {\"basic_economy\": 17, \"economy\": 12, \"business\": 3}, \"prices\": {\"basic_economy\": 51, \"economy\": 121, \"business\": 239}}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT083\", \"origin\": \"JFK\", \"destination\": \"SEA\", \"status\": \"available\", \"scheduled_departure_time_est\": \"01:00:00\", \"scheduled_arrival_time_est\": \"07:00:00\", \"date\": null, \"available_seats\": {\"basic_economy\": 16, \"economy\": 7, \"business\": 3}, \"prices\": {\"basic_econo", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 5, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 0, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "919bdbad", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T12:43:23"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "curated_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "39#0", "task_desc": "Bonjour... I mean, hello. I am Amelia Davis. I would like to cancel all of my upcoming flights, s'il vous pla\u00eet. I need to give up my seats for someone else who may need them.\nOui, my user ID is amelia_davis_8890. I do not know the reservation IDs, but you said you can find them with this, non? And the reason... I want to cancel so I can give up my seat for someone else who needs it more, c'est \u00e7a.\nAttendez... but I want to cancel *all* of my upcoming flights, not just the two business ones. The", "score": 0.0, "em": 0.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: Hello! I'd be happy to help you cancel your upcoming flights. \n\nTo get started, I'll need a few details:\n1. Your **user ID** (this is typically in a format like 'sara_doe_496').\n2. Your **reservation ID(s)** \u2014 if you don't know them, I can help locate them once I have your user ID.\n3. The **reason for cancellation** (options: change of plan, airline cancelled flight, or other reasons).\n\nCould you please provide your user ID so I can look up your reservations?\nassistant: Thank you! Let me look up your profile and reservations.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"amelia_davis_8890\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Amelia\", \"last_name\": \"Davis\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"442 Sunset Drive\", \"address2\": \"Suite 708\", \"city\": \"San Diego\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"CA\", \"zip\": \"92125\"}, \"email\": \"amelia.davis1624@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1984-03-05\", \"payment_methods\": {\"gift_card_7397998\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_7397998\", \"amount\": 74.0}, \"gift_card_1647044\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_1647044\", \"amount\": 236.0}, \"credit_card_4074252\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_4074252\", \"brand\": \"mastercard\", \"last_four\": \"5435\"}, \"credit_card_6738701\": {\"source\": \