{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "curated_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "37#0", "task_desc": "Hello, I'm Aarav. I need to cancel a couple of my upcoming flight reservations and upgrade another one to business class. Could you help me with that?\nSure, my user ID is aarav_ahmed_6699.\nOkay, to clarify my requests: I'd like to cancel reservations **IFOYYZ** and **NQNU5R**. And I want to upgrade **M20IZO** to business class.\n\nAs for the reason for the cancellations, I just need to adjust my travel plans, but I'm perfectly willing to comply with the airline's policies for these changes.\nYes, I", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: Hello Aarav! I'd be happy to help you with cancelling your reservations and upgrading another to business class.\n\nTo get started, I'll need your **user ID** (for example, something like \"aarav_patel_123\"). Could you please provide that?\n\nOnce I have your user ID, I can look up your reservations and help you with the cancellations and the cabin upgrade.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"aarav_ahmed_6699\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Aarav\", \"last_name\": \"Ahmed\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"176 Willow Lane\", \"address2\": \"Suite 431\", \"city\": \"Jacksonville\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"FL\", \"zip\": \"32131\"}, \"email\": \"aarav.ahmed6812@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1981-05-26\", \"payment_methods\": {\"credit_card_9074831\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_9074831\", \"brand\": \"mastercard\", \"last_four\": \"7334\"}, \"certificate_9645872\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_9645872\", \"amount\": 250.0}, \"credit_card_4959530\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_4959530\", \"brand\": \"mastercard\", \"last_four\": \"5018\"}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Aarav\", \"last_name\": \"Patel\", \"dob\": \"1980-12-03\"}], \"membership\": \"silver\", \"reservations\": [\"M20IZO\", \"N6F783\", \"IFOYYZ\