{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "curated_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "22#1", "task_desc": "Hi, I have an upcoming trip from New York to Chicago and I need to make some changes to my booking. I'd like to change the passenger to myself, upgrade it to economy class, and have 3 checked bags.\nMy user ID is omar_rossi_1241. I don't have my reservation ID handy, but you mentioned you could help locate it with that.\nYes, please proceed with all three changes as described. For the $209 upgrade difference, I'd like to use the gift card \u2014 gift_card_8190333.\nGreat, that's everything I needed. Tha", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: To help you modify your reservation, I'll need some information first. Could you please provide your **user ID** and **reservation ID**?\n\nIf you don't know your reservation ID, I can help locate it once you provide your user ID.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"omar_rossi_1241\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Omar\", \"last_name\": \"Rossi\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"901 Pine Lane\", \"address2\": \"Suite 360\", \"city\": \"Houston\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"TX\", \"zip\": \"77271\"}, \"email\": \"omar.rossi5980@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1970-06-06\", \"payment_methods\": {\"gift_card_8190333\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_8190333\", \"amount\": 280.0}, \"credit_card_6754990\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_6754990\", \"brand\": \"mastercard\", \"last_four\": \"3848\"}, \"certificate_8390038\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_8390038\", \"amount\": 150.0}, \"certificate_1778167\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_1778167\", \"amount\": 250.0}, \"gift_card_6490722\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_6490722\", \"amount\": 127.0}, \"credit_card_7407366\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_7407366\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"6437\"}}, \"saved_passeng