{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "curated_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "36#1", "task_desc": "I... I need to change a flight reservation. My wife... she passed away yesterday. I can't... I can't go as planned. I need to move the flight out a couple of days, just change the date, not cancel.\n*loud sigh* ... Lucas. Lucas Brown. My user ID is lucas_brown_4047. Please... I just need to move the flight. Two days later. I can't... I can't deal with this right now.\nIt's EUJUY6. That's the one... the one I need to move. My wife just died yesterday, I told you... I can't get on that flight as sch", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'm so sorry for your loss. I'll help you change the flight date.\n\nTo get started, I'll need your user ID. If you don't know your reservation ID, I can help locate it once I have your user ID. Could you please provide your user ID?\nassistant: I understand. Let me look up your reservations to find the one you need to change.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"lucas_brown_4047\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Lucas\", \"last_name\": \"Brown\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"379 Pine Lane\", \"address2\": \"Suite 757\", \"city\": \"Jacksonville\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"FL\", \"zip\": \"32230\"}, \"email\": \"lucas.brown9700@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1965-01-01\", \"payment_methods\": {\"certificate_3138963\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_3138963\", \"amount\": 500.0}, \"credit_card_7872117\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_7872117\", \"brand\": \"mastercard\", \"last_four\": \"8056\"}, \"gift_card_5205020\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_5205020\", \"amount\": 86.0}, \"gift_card_9049233\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_9049233\", \"amount\": 15.0}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Daiki\", \"last_name\": \"Lopez\", \"dob\": \"1967-04-08\"}], \"membership\": \"silver\", \"reservations\": [\"UX0R03\", \"Q4TE65\", \"EUJUY6\", \"ODH78Z\", \"800DQL\", \"WYT8OO\"]}\nassistant: I found your account. You have several reservations on file: UX0R03, Q4TE65, EUJUY6, ODH78Z, 800DQL, and WYT8OO.\n\nTo make sure I change the right one, could you tell me which reservation this is? You can either give me the reservation ID, or describe the trip (where you were flying to and the original date). I'll then pull up the details.\nassistant: I'm sorry, and I understand. Let me pull up the details of reservation EUJUY6.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"EUJUY6\", \"user_id\": \"lucas_brown_4047\", \"origin\": \"ORD\", \"destination\": \"LAS\", \"flight_type\": \"round_trip\", \"cabin\": \"basic_economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT238\", \"origin\": \"ORD\", \"destination\": \"DEN\", \"date\": \"2024-05-14\", \"price\": 96}, {", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 5, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 0, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "919bdbad", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T12:43:23"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "curated_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "30#1", "task_desc": "Hi, I need to make some changes to my reservation. I have a flight from LAS to IAH that currently has a layover, and I\u2019d like to switch it to a nonstop flight. Also, I want to remove my checked bag and get a refund for that bag fee.\nAlright, I understand about the checked bag \u2014 we'll just leave that as is and move on.\n\nMy name is James Taylor. My user ID is james_taylor_7043 and my reservation ID is 1N99U6.\n\nI'd like to change my upcoming one-stop flight from LAS to IAH to a nonstop flight. Can ", "score": 0.0, "em": 0.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I can help you with modifying your reservation. However, I need to clarify a few things first:\n\n1. **User ID and Reservation ID**: To make any changes, I need your user ID and reservation ID. If you don't know your reservation ID, I can help locate it once you provide your user ID.\n\n2. **Removing checked bags**: Per our policy, passengers can add checked bags but cannot remove them from an existing reservation. Therefore, I'm unable to remove your checked bag or refund the bag fee. I apologize for the inconvenience.\n\n3. **Changing to a nonstop flight**: I can help you change from a one-stop to a nonstop flight (keeping the same origin, destination, and trip type), provided the current reservation is not a basic economy fare. This would require a payment/refund method already on file in your profile.\n\nPlease provide your user ID (and reservation ID if you have it), and I'll look into the flight change for you.\nassistant: Let me look up your reservation and profile details.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"1N99U6\", \"user_id\": \"james_taylor_7043\", \"origin\": \"LAS\", \"destination\": \"IAH\", \"flight_type\": \"round_trip\", \"cabin\": \"economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT284\", \"origin\": \"LAS\", \"destination\": \"PHX\", \"date\": \"2024-05-19\", \"price\": 161}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT152\", \"origin\": \"PHX\", \"destination\": \"IAH\", \"date\": \"2024-05-19\", \"price\": 192}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT112\", \"origin\": \"IAH\", \"destination\": \"LAS\", \"date\": \"2024-05-27\", \"price\": 184}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"James\", \"last_name\": \"Taylor\", \"dob\": \"1997-01-23\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Ivan\", \"last_name\": \"Taylor\", \"dob\": \"1975-09-15\"}], \"payment_history\": [{\"payment_id\": \"gift_card_5634230\", \"amount\": 1134}], \"created_at\": \"2024-05-08T11:37:17\", \"total_baggages\": 1, \"nonfree_baggages\": 0, \"insurance\": \"yes\", \"status\": null}\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"james_taylor_7043\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"James\", \"last_name\": \"Taylor\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"133 Chestnut Stre", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 3, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 0, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "919bdbad", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T12:43:23"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "curated_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "26#1", "task_desc": "Hello, I need to cancel my flight from MCO to CLT, and I want to make sure I get a refund for it.\nMy user ID is amelia_sanchez_4739. I don't have my reservation ID in front of me right now, but I really need to cancel this flight from MCO to CLT and get my refund \u2014 that's the main thing I want to make sure happens.\nI understand what you're telling me about the policy, but I really must insist \u2014 I need you to cancel this flight from MCO to CLT and process my refund. I don't accept that I just los", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: To help you cancel your flight and process a refund, I'll need some information first.\n\nCould you please provide your **user ID**? \n\nAlso, if you have your **reservation ID** handy, please share that as well. If you don't know your reservation ID, I can help locate it once I have your user ID.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"amelia_sanchez_4739\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Amelia\", \"last_name\": \"Sanchez\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"225 Sunset Drive\", \"address2\": \"Suite 563\", \"city\": \"Los Angeles\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"CA\", \"zip\": \"91292\"}, \"email\": \"amelia.sanchez3631@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1955-02-01\", \"payment_methods\": {\"credit_card_4065275\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_4065275\", \"brand\": \"mastercard\", \"last_four\": \"3658\"}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Ivan\", \"last_name\": \"Martin\", \"dob\": \"1973-08-20\"}], \"membership\": \"gold\", \"reservations\": [\"3FRNFB\", \"Q4L9HS\"]}\nassistant: I found your profile. You have two reservations: **3FRNFB** and **Q4L9HS**. Let me check the details of both to find the one from MCO to CLT.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"3FRNFB\", \"user_id\": \"amelia_sanchez_4739\", \"origin\": \"MCO\", \"destination\": \"CLT\", \"flight_type\": \"one_way\", \"cabin\": \"basic_economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT028\", \"origin\": \"MCO\", \"destination\": \"BOS\", \"date\": \"2024-05-28\", \"price\": 79}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT277\", \"origin\": \"BOS\", \"destination\": \"CLT\", \"date\": \"2024-05-28\", \"price\": 64}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Amelia\", \"last_name\": \"Sanchez\", \"dob\": \"1955-02-01\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Ivan\", \"last_name\": \"Martin\", \"dob\": \"1973-08-20\"}], \"payment_history\": [{\"payment_id\": \"credit_card_4065275\", \"amount\": 286}], \"created_at\": \"2024-05-06T13:25:06\", \"total_baggages\": 0, \"nonfree_baggages\": 0, \"insurance\": \"no\", \"status\": null}\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"Q4L9HS\", \"user_id\": \"amelia_sanchez_4739\", \"origin\": \"EWR\", \"destination\": \"SEA\", \"flight_type\": \"one_way\", \"cabin\": \"business\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 6, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 0, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "919bdbad", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T12:43:23"}
