{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "curated_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "32#0", "task_desc": "Hello, I need to change my flight that's scheduled out of Newark (EWR) on May 21. I\u2019m hoping to switch to a nonstop flight on that same day instead. My mom is very sick and I need to get home sooner to take care of her.\nOf course. My user ID is ivan_rossi_8555.\nI understand the policy on basic economy, but I was prepared for that. I'm willing to upgrade this ticket from basic economy to regular economy so that I can make the change \u2014 I don't want to buy a whole new ticket, just upgrade the exist", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'm sorry to hear about your mom. I'll help you look into changing your flight. \n\nTo get started, I'll need your user ID so I can locate your reservation. Could you please provide your user ID?\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"ivan_rossi_8555\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Ivan\", \"last_name\": \"Rossi\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"513 Main Street\", \"address2\": \"Suite 805\", \"city\": \"Philadelphia\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"PA\", \"zip\": \"19102\"}, \"email\": \"ivan.rossi2633@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1954-01-14\", \"payment_methods\": {\"gift_card_7344518\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_7344518\", \"amount\": 183.0}, \"gift_card_9823297\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_9823297\", \"amount\": 224.0}, \"credit_card_9659780\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_9659780\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"1777\"}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Ava\", \"last_name\": \"Silva\", \"dob\": \"1971-01-14\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Anya\", \"last_name\": \"Patel\", \"dob\": \"1990-06-13\"}], \"membership\": \"silver\", \"reservations\": [\"OWZ4XL\", \"F3IQK1\", \"8WMF4C\", \"L2H5FP\"]}\nassistant: I found your profile. You have several reservations. Let me check them to find the one with a flight out of