{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "curated_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "37#1", "task_desc": "Hello, I need to make some changes to my travel plans. I have a couple of upcoming flight reservations I'd like to cancel, and another one I want to upgrade to business class. Can you help me with that?\nSure, my user ID is aarav_ahmed_6699.\nThanks for laying that out. I must have mixed up the dates \u2014 I thought NQNU5R was still coming up, but if those flights already happened earlier this month, then obviously I can't cancel that one.\n\nSo, to adjust: I'd like to go ahead and cancel **IFOYYZ** (th", "score": 0.0, "em": 0.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'd be happy to help you with cancelling reservations and upgrading one to business class. \n\nTo get started, I'll need your **user ID** so I can look up your reservations. Could you please provide that?\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"aarav_ahmed_6699\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Aarav\", \"last_name\": \"Ahmed\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"176 Willow Lane\", \"address2\": \"Suite 431\", \"city\": \"Jacksonville\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"FL\", \"zip\": \"32131\"}, \"email\": \"aarav.ahmed6812@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1981-05-26\", \"payment_methods\": {\"credit_card_9074831\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_9074831\", \"brand\": \"mastercard\", \"last_four\": \"7334\"}, \"certificate_9645872\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_9645872\", \"amount\": 250.0}, \"credit_card_4959530\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_4959530\", \"brand\": \"mastercard\", \"last_four\": \"5018\"}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Aarav\", \"last_name\": \"Patel\", \"dob\": \"1980-12-03\"}], \"membership\": \"silver\", \"reservations\": [\"M20IZO\", \"N6F783\", \"IFOYYZ\", \"NQNU5R\"]}\nassistant: Thank you, Aarav. I can see you have 4 reservations: **M20IZO, N6F783, IFOYYZ, and NQNU5R**. Let me review the details of each to help you with the cancellations and the upgrade. I'll start by pulling up the first reservation.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"M20IZO\", \"user_id\": \"aarav_ahmed_6699\", \"origin\": \"JFK\", \"destination\": \"MCO\", \"flight_type\": \"one_way\", \"cabin\": \"economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT268\", \"origin\": \"JFK\", \"destination\": \"ATL\", \"date\": \"2024-05-22\", \"price\": 136}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT010\", \"origin\": \"ATL\", \"destination\": \"MCO\", \"date\": \"2024-05-22\", \"price\": 109}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Aarav\", \"last_name\": \"Ahmed\", \"dob\": \"1981-05-26\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Daiki\", \"last_name\": \"Li\", \"dob\": \"1980-12-24\"}], \"payment_history\": [{\"payment_id\": \"credit_card_4959530\", \"amount\": 490}], \"created_at\": \"2024-05-12T09:36:29\", \"total_baggages\": 1, \"nonfree_baggages\": 0,", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 7, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 0, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "919bdbad", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T12:43:23"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "curated_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "33#1", "task_desc": "Hi, I'm Yara Garcia. I have a booking under reservation code HXDUBJ. I\u2019d like to change my upcoming outgoing flight to a nonstop one leaving the next day instead \u2014 so basically delay it by one day. I also need to push my return flight from SFO back by one day. Oh, and I only want flight options that depart after 8am and before 9pm. Can you help me with that?\nYes, those flights work for me \u2014 HAT072 for the outgoing on the 19th at 9am is perfect since it's nonstop and within my time window, and HA", "score": 0.0, "em": 0.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'll help you modify your reservation. Let me first look up the details of your reservation to understand your current booking.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"HXDUBJ\", \"user_id\": \"yara_garcia_1905\", \"origin\": \"IAH\", \"destination\": \"SFO\", \"flight_type\": \"round_trip\", \"cabin\": \"economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT085\", \"origin\": \"IAH\", \"destination\": \"JFK\", \"date\": \"2024-05-18\", \"price\": 177}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT023\", \"origin\": \"JFK\", \"destination\": \"SFO\", \"date\": \"2024-05-18\", \"price\": 146}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT278\", \"origin\": \"SFO\", \"destination\": \"IAH\", \"date\": \"2024-05-22\", \"price\": 180}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Yara\", \"last_name\": \"Garcia\", \"dob\": \"1974-08-15\"}], \"payment_history\": [{\"payment_id\": \"gift_card_6941833\", \"amount\": 533}], \"created_at\": \"2024-05-04T06:04:48\", \"total_baggages\": 0, \"nonfree_baggages\": 0, \"insurance\": \"yes\", \"status\": null}\nassistant: Thank you for providing the reservation code. I've retrieved your reservation details.\n\nYour current booking (HXDUBJ) for Yara Garcia:\n- **Outgoing (one-stop):** IAH \u2192 JFK (HAT085) \u2192 SFO (HAT023) on 2024-05-18, Economy\n- **Return (direct):** SFO \u2192 IAH (HAT278) on 2024-05-22, Economy\n- Cabin: Economy, Insurance: Yes\n\nTo change your outgoing flight to a nonstop (direct) IAH \u2192 SFO flight on 2024-05-19, let me search for available direct flights on that date.\ntool: [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT072\", \"origin\": \"IAH\", \"destination\": \"SFO\", \"status\": \"available\", \"scheduled_departure_time_est\": \"09:00:00\", \"scheduled_arrival_time_est\": \"13:00:00\", \"date\": null, \"available_seats\": {\"basic_economy\": 18, \"economy\": 9, \"business\": 9}, \"prices\": {\"basic_economy\": 68, \"economy\": 130, \"business\": 282}}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT180\", \"origin\": \"IAH\", \"destination\": \"SFO\", \"status\": \"available\", \"scheduled_departure_time_est\": \"07:00:00\", \"scheduled_arrival_time_est\": \"11:00:00\", \"date\": null, \"available_seats\": {\"basic_economy\": 4, \"economy\": 17, \"business\": 15},", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 5, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 0, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "919bdbad", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T12:43:23"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "curated_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "24#1", "task_desc": "Hello, I'm Mia Kim. I need some help with my travel plans. First, I have a reservation that I need to remove a passenger from. Also, I\u2019m looking to book a flight from New York to explore the West Coast. Can you assist me with both of those things?\nOkay, I understand you can't remove Ethan from my reservation. Since the change isn't possible, I'd like you to go ahead and cancel that reservation \u2014 it's H9ZU1C \u2014 so I can rebook myself later.\n\nNow for the new trip: My user ID is mia_kim_4397. I'm lo", "score": 0.0, "em": 0.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: Hello Mia Kim! I can help with your booking, but I need to clarify a couple of things first.\n\n**Regarding removing a passenger from your reservation:** Per airline policy, the number of passengers on a reservation cannot be modified\u2014this applies to both adding and removing passengers, and even a human agent cannot change the passenger count. I'm sorry, but I won't be able to remove a passenger from your existing reservation.\n\n**Regarding booking a new flight from New York to the West Coast:** I'd be happy to help with this! To get started, I'll need a few details:\n\n1. **Your user ID** (e.g., something like `mia_kim_123`) \u2014 this is required before I can proceed with any booking.\n2. **Specific destination city** on the West Coast (e.g., LAX for Los Angeles, SFO for San Francisco, SEA for Seattle, etc.) \u2014 \"West Coast\" covers several airports, so I'll need the exact one.\n3. **Trip type** \u2014 is this a one-way or round-trip flight?\n4. **Cabin class** \u2014 basic economy, economy, or business?\n5. **Passenger details** \u2014 first name, last name, and date of birth for each passenger (maximum 5 per reservation).\n6. **Travel dates.**\n7. **Payment method** \u2014 which credit card, gift card, or travel certificate (already on your profile) you'd like to use.\n8. **Checked bags** \u2014 how many you'll need (free allowance depends on your membership level and cabin).\n9. **Travel insurance** \u2014 would you like to add it ($30 per passenger, allows full refund for health/weather cancellations)?\n\nPlease provide your user ID and the destination/trip type to begin, and I'll guide you through the rest!\nassistant: I'll help you with both tasks. Let me start by looking up the details of reservation H9ZU1C to verify the cancellation rules before proceeding.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"H9ZU1C\", \"user_id\": \"mia_kim_4397\", \"origin\": \"MIA\", \"destination\": \"IAH\", \"flight_type\": \"one_way\", \"cabin\": \"economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT192\", \"origin\": \"MIA\",", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 14, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 0, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "919bdbad", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T12:43:23"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "curated_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "35#1", "task_desc": "Hello, I need to cancel my upcoming flight from JFK to MCO on May 22. I'm a silver member, so I should be eligible for a full refund.\nSure, my user ID is **aarav_ahmed_6699**. I don\u2019t have my reservation ID on hand at the moment, but you should be able to pull up my booking with that ID. The reason for the cancellation is just a change of plans on my end.\n\nAnd I want to stress \u2014 I\u2019m a **silver member** with your airline, so I should definitely be getting a **full refund** for this cancellation.\n", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: To help you cancel your flight, I'll need some information first. Could you please provide your **user ID**? \n\nAlso, if you know your **reservation ID**, please share that as well. If you don't have it, I can help locate it once I have your user ID.\n\nFinally, could you let me know the **reason for cancellation** (change of plan, airline cancelled flight, or other reasons)?\nassistant: Thank you. Let me look up your profile and reservations.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"aarav_ahmed_6699\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Aarav\", \"last_name\": \"Ahmed\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"176 Willow Lane\", \"address2\": \"Suite 431\", \"city\": \"Jacksonville\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"FL\", \"zip\": \"32131\"}, \"email\": \"aarav.ahmed6812@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1981-05-26\", \"payment_methods\": {\"credit_card_9074831\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_9074831\", \"brand\": \"mastercard\", \"last_four\": \"7334\"}, \"certificate_9645872\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_9645872\", \"amount\": 250.0}, \"credit_card_4959530\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_4959530\", \"brand\": \"mastercard\", \"last_four\": \"5018\"}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Aarav\", \"last_name\": \"Patel\", \"dob\": \"1980-12-03\"}], \"membership\": \"silver\", \"reservations\": [\"M20IZO\", \"N6F783\", \"IFOYYZ\", \"NQNU5R\"]}\nassistant: I found your profile. You have several reservations. Let me check the details of each to find the one from JFK to MCO on May 22.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"M20IZO\", \"user_id\": \"aarav_ahmed_6699\", \"origin\": \"JFK\", \"destination\": \"MCO\", \"flight_type\": \"one_way\", \"cabin\": \"economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT268\", \"origin\": \"JFK\", \"destination\": \"ATL\", \"date\": \"2024-05-22\", \"price\": 136}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT010\", \"origin\": \"ATL\", \"destination\": \"MCO\", \"date\": \"2024-05-22\", \"price\": 109}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Aarav\", \"last_name\": \"Ahmed\", \"dob\": \"1981-05-26\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Daiki\", \"last_name\": \"Li\", \"dob\": \"1980-12-24\"}], \"payment_his", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 10, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 0, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "919bdbad", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T12:43:23"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "curated_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "18#1", "task_desc": "Ugh, this is so aggravating. I just ran into some money trouble and I need to downgrade every single one of my business class bookings to economy. I don't want to change the flights themselves or the passenger names or anything\u2014just the cabin. Can you help me get this sorted out?\nYeah, fine. It's omar_davis_3817. Name's Omar Davis. Look, I'm frustrated about this whole situation but I just need to get these downgrades done. All my business flights need to go to economy\u2014don't touch the flight det", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I can help you downgrade your business class bookings to economy. To get started, I'll need your user ID so I can locate your reservations. Could you please provide your user ID?\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"omar_davis_3817\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Omar\", \"last_name\": \"Davis\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"281 Spruce Street\", \"address2\": \"Suite 942\", \"city\": \"San Diego\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"CA\", \"zip\": \"92164\"}, \"email\": \"omar.davis7857@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1982-10-19\", \"payment_methods\": {\"gift_card_3481935\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_3481935\", \"amount\": 22.0}, \"credit_card_2929732\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_2929732\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"7803\"}, \"credit_card_9525117\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_9525117\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"2172\"}, \"gift_card_6847880\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_6847880\", \"amount\": 31.0}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Juan\", \"last_name\": \"Ahmed\", \"dob\": \"1992-11-19\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Anya\", \"last_name\": \"Thomas\", \"dob\": \"1990-10-11\"}], \"membership\": \"regular\", \"reservations\": [\"JG7FMM\", \"LQ940Q\", \"2FBBAH\", \"X7BYG1\", \"EQ1G6C\", \"BOH180\"]}\nassistant: I found your profile, Omar. You have 6 reservations: JG7FMM, LQ940Q, 2FBBAH, X7BYG1, EQ1G6C, and BOH180. Let me check each one to identify which are business class bookings. I'll start by reviewing the first reservation.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"JG7FMM\", \"user_id\": \"omar_davis_3817\", \"origin\": \"MCO\", \"destination\": \"CLT\", \"flight_type\": \"one_way\", \"cabin\": \"business\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT028\", \"origin\": \"MCO\", \"destination\": \"BOS\", \"date\": \"2024-05-21\", \"price\": 1859}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT277\", \"origin\": \"BOS\", \"destination\": \"CLT\", \"date\": \"2024-05-21\", \"price\": 1679}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Omar\", \"last_name\": \"Davis\", \"dob\": \"1982-10-19\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Fatima\", \"last_name\": \"Patel\", \"dob\": \"1950-05-04\"}], \"payment_history\": [{\"paym", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 24, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 0, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "919bdbad", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T12:43:23"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "curated_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "39#1", "task_desc": "Bonjour, I am Amelia Davis. I would like to cancel all of my upcoming flights, s'il vous pla\u00eet. I'm afraid I don't have the reservation numbers with me at the moment.\nOui, of course. My user ID is amelia_davis_8890. I am Amelia Davis, as I said.\nAh, I see the list. My reason for cancellation is change of plan, vous voyez \u2014 I have decided not to travel anymore. \n\nBut I notice you say you cannot cancel the XAZ3C0 and UDMOP1 ones. I want to cancel those also, s'il vous pla\u00eet. Even if I will not rec", "score": 0.0, "em": 0.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: Hello! I'd be happy to help you cancel your upcoming flights. To locate your reservations, I'll need your user ID. Could you please provide your user ID (for example, a format like \"amelia_davis_123\")?\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"amelia_davis_8890\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Amelia\", \"last_name\": \"Davis\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"442 Sunset Drive\", \"address2\": \"Suite 708\", \"city\": \"San Diego\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"CA\", \"zip\": \"92125\"}, \"email\": \"amelia.davis1624@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1984-03-05\", \"payment_methods\": {\"gift_card_7397998\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_7397998\", \"amount\": 74.0}, \"gift_card_1647044\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_1647044\", \"amount\": 236.0}, \"credit_card_4074252\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_4074252\", \"brand\": \"mastercard\", \"last_four\": \"5435\"}, \"credit_card_6738701\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_6738701\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"5308\"}, \"credit_card_5799376\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_5799376\", \"brand\": \"mastercard\", \"last_four\": \"9326\"}, \"gift_card_5251654\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_5251654\", \"amount\": 179.0}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Amelia\", \"last_name\": \"Jackson\", \"dob\": \"1999-04-26\"}], \"membership\": \"silver\", \"reservations\": [\"8C8K4E\", \"UDMOP1\", \"XAZ3C0\", \"LU15PA\", \"MSJ4OA\", \"I6M8JQ\", \"4XGCCM\"]}\nassistant: I found your profile, Amelia. You have 7 reservations. Let me review each one to determine which are upcoming flights that can be cancelled. I'll start by checking the details of your reservations.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"8C8K4E\", \"user_id\": \"amelia_davis_8890\", \"origin\": \"BOS\", \"destination\": \"DEN\", \"flight_type\": \"one_way\", \"cabin\": \"business\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT247\", \"origin\": \"BOS\", \"destination\": \"MIA\", \"date\": \"2024-05-24\", \"price\": 904}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT193\", \"origin\": \"MIA\", \"destination\": \"DEN\", \"date\": \"2024-05-24\", \"price\": 1906}], \"passen", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 13, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 0, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "919bdbad", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T12:43:23"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "curated_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "23#1", "task_desc": "Hello, I'd like to check the combined balance on my gift cards and also the total value of my travel certificates. On top of that, I need to change my recent reservation to the lowest\u2011priced business class round trip, but I want to keep the same dates I already have.\nSure, my user ID is mohamed_silva_9265. I don't have my reservation ID in front of me right now \u2014 would you be able to locate it using my user ID?\nThank you for pulling up those balances \u2014 so my gift cards total $327 and the travel ", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: To help you with both checking your gift card and travel certificate balances and modifying your reservation, I'll need some information first.\n\nCould you please provide:\n1. Your **user ID** (e.g., 'sara_doe_496')\n2. Your **reservation ID** for the booking you'd like to change (if you don't know it, I can help locate it once I have your user ID)\n\nOnce I have your user ID, I can look up your payment methods to calculate the combined gift card balance and total travel certificate value, and assist with the reservation modification.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"mohamed_silva_9265\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Mohamed\", \"last_name\": \"Silva\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"638 Elm Street\", \"address2\": \"Suite 548\", \"city\": \"Los Angeles\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"CA\", \"zip\": \"91365\"}, \"email\": \"mohamed.silva9198@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1960-11-26\", \"payment_methods\": {\"credit_card_5843230\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_5843230\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"2395\"}, \"gift_card_8020792\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_8020792\", \"amount\": 198.0}, \"certificate_3765853\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_3765853\", \"amount\": 500.0}, \"gift_card_6136092\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_6136092\", \"amount\": 129.0}, \"certificate_9984806\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_9984806\", \"amount\": 250.0}, \"credit_card_2198526\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_2198526\", \"brand\": \"mastercard\", \"last_four\": \"9363\"}, \"certificate_2765295\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_2765295\", \"amount\": 250.0}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Raj\", \"last_name\": \"Sanchez\", \"dob\": \"1986-09-12\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Liam\", \"last_name\": \"Wilson\", \"dob\": \"1980-03-27\"}], \"membership\": \"regular\", \"reservations\": [\"K1NW8N\"]}\nassistant: I found your reservation. Your only reservation on file is **K1NW8N**.\n\nLet me calculate your gift card balance first.\ntool: 327.0\nassistant: Now let me calculat", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 14, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 0, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "919bdbad", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T12:43:23"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "mem0", "phase": "test", "task_id": "13#0", "task_desc": "Hello, I have an existing reservation for a return flight from Atlanta to Los Angeles that has a layover, and I\u2019d like to change it to a nonstop flight from Atlanta to Las Vegas instead. I\u2019m not looking to book a new ticket\u2014just modify my current booking.\nI see what you\u2019re saying, but I was specifically told I could change my existing reservation to a different destination. Since you\u2019re telling me the change isn\u2019t possible through you, I\u2019d like to be transferred to someone who can assist with th", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I\u2019m sorry, but I\u2019m unable to make this change. According to the modification policy, a reservation can be modified without changing the **origin, destination, and trip type**. Since your request changes the destination from Los Angeles (LAX) to Las Vegas (LAS), this is not permitted as a modification.\n\nIf you would like to travel to Las Vegas instead, that would require booking a new reservation (which you\u2019ve indicated you don\u2019t want), or you could cancel the current booking and rebook. Alternatively, I can help you modify your existing Atlanta\u2013Los Angeles reservation in other allowed ways (for example, changing to a nonstop Atlanta\u2013LAX flight, changing cabin class, adding baggage, or updating passenger details), provided the origin, destination, and trip type remain the same.\n\nPlease let me know how you\u2019d like to proceed. If you\u2019d like to pursue an allowed modification, please provide your **user ID** and **reservation ID** so I can look up the details.", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 0, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 0, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "919bdbad", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T16:47:31"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "mem0", "phase": "test", "task_id": "3#0", "task_desc": "Hi, this is Anya Garcia. I\u2019m calling about my upcoming flight with confirmation number JMO1MG. I\u2019m really stressed out because I have a ton of stuff I need to bring on this trip, and it\u2019s really important to me that I get the exact luggage allowance right. I think I\u2019m a Gold member, which should help. Could you tell me the total number of suitcases my reservation lets me take?\nWait, no \u2014 I\u2019m pretty sure I\u2019m a Gold member, not Silver. This is really important because I have so much to pack and th", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'll look up your reservation details to determine your luggage allowance.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"JMO1MG\", \"user_id\": \"anya_garcia_5901\", \"origin\": \"DEN\", \"destination\": \"MIA\", \"flight_type\": \"one_way\", \"cabin\": \"economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT255\", \"origin\": \"DEN\", \"destination\": \"MIA\", \"date\": \"2024-05-16\", \"price\": 149}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Anya\", \"last_name\": \"Garcia\", \"dob\": \"1992-11-12\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Raj\", \"last_name\": \"Jackson\", \"dob\": \"1956-03-09\"}], \"payment_history\": [{\"payment_id\": \"gift_card_2550356\", \"amount\": 358}], \"created_at\": \"2024-05-13T23:20:29\", \"total_baggages\": 1, \"nonfree_baggages\": 0, \"insurance\": \"yes\", \"status\": null}\nassistant: Let me verify your membership level to determine the correct baggage allowance.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"anya_garcia_5901\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Anya\", \"last_name\": \"Garcia\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"555 Highland Drive\", \"address2\": \"Suite 243\", \"city\": \"San Antonio\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"TX\", \"zip\": \"78256\"}, \"email\": \"anya.garcia8816@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1992-11-12\", \"payment_methods\": {\"gift_card_2550356\": {\"source\": \"gift_