{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "mem0", "phase": "test", "task_id": "29#0", "task_desc": "Hello, this is Raj Brown. I'm calling because I need to modify my reservation due to a health issue I've been dealing with. I did purchase travel insurance for this trip, so I'm hoping the change fees can be waived. My current booking is VA5SGQ \u2014 it's a roundtrip from Detroit to LaGuardia. I'd like to change both legs to nonstop flights from Detroit to JFK instead, keeping the same travel dates. Can you help me with that?\n###TRANSFER###", "score": 0.0, "em": 0.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'll help you modify your reservation. Let me first look up the details of your booking.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"VA5SGQ\", \"user_id\": \"raj_brown_5782\", \"origin\": \"DTW\", \"destination\": \"LGA\", \"flight_type\": \"round_trip\", \"cabin\": \"economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT035\", \"origin\": \"DTW\", \"destination\": \"PHX\", \"date\": \"2024-05-17\", \"price\": 163}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT066\", \"origin\": \"PHX\", \"destination\": \"LGA\", \"date\": \"2024-05-17\", \"price\": 184}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT002\", \"origin\": \"LGA\", \"destination\": \"PHX\", \"date\": \"2024-05-19\", \"price\": 174}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT106\", \"origin\": \"PHX\", \"destination\": \"DTW\", \"date\": \"2024-05-20\", \"price\": 135}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Raj\", \"last_name\": \"Brown\", \"dob\": \"1967-03-12\"}], \"payment_history\": [{\"payment_id\": \"credit_card_8003957\", \"amount\": 686}], \"created_at\": \"2024-05-08T18:28:13\", \"total_baggages\": 0, \"nonfree_baggages\": 0, \"insurance\": \"yes\", \"status\": null}\nassistant: I've reviewed your reservation VA5SGQ. I see it's a round-trip booking for Raj Brown (user ID: raj_brown_5782) from Detroit (DTW) to LaGuardia (LGA) in economy class, with travel insurance included.\n\nI need to let you know that per our modification policy, flight changes must keep the same origin, destination, and trip type. Your request to change the destination from LaGuardia (LGA) to JFK is not something I'm able to process through a standard modification. This type of change requires assistance from a human agent.\n\nLet me transfer you to a human agent who can help with this.\ntool: Transfer successful\nassistant: YOU ARE BEING TRANSFERRED TO A HUMAN AGENT. PLEASE HOLD ON.", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 2, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 0, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "919bdbad", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T16:47:31"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "mem0", "phase": "test", "task_id": "26#0", "task_desc": "Hi, I'd like to cancel my flight from MCO to CLT. I need to get a refund for it.\nSure, my user ID is amelia_sanchez_4739. I don't have my reservation ID handy, but maybe you can look it up with that? I really need to cancel that MCO to CLT flight and get my refund.\nI understand what the policy says, but I really need to insist on cancelling this flight and getting my refund. I'm Amelia Sanchez and I booked this trip planning to go, but my plans have changed and I can't use it. I don't care about", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: To help you cancel your flight and process a refund, I'll need some information first.\n\nCould you please provide your **user ID**? \n\nAlso, if you know your **reservation ID**, please share that as well. If you don't have it, I can help locate it once I have your user ID.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"amelia_sanchez_4739\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Amelia\", \"last_name\": \"Sanchez\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"225 Sunset Drive\", \"address2\": \"Suite 563\", \"city\": \"Los Angeles\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"CA\", \"zip\": \"91292\"}, \"email\": \"amelia.sanchez3631@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1955-02-01\", \"payment_methods\": {\"credit_card_4065275\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_4065275\", \"brand\": \"mastercard\", \"last_four\": \"3658\"}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Ivan\", \"last_name\": \"Martin\", \"dob\": \"1973-08-20\"}], \"membership\": \"gold\", \"reservations\": [\"3FRNFB\", \"Q4L9HS\"]}\nassistant: I found your profile. You have two reservations: **3FRNFB** and **Q4L9HS**. Let me check the details of both to find the MCO to CLT flight.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"3FRNFB\", \"user_id\": \"amelia_sanchez_4739\", \"origin\": \"MCO\", \"destination\": \"CLT\", \"flight_type\": \"one_way\", \"cabin\": \"basic_economy\", \"flights\