{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "mem0", "phase": "test", "task_id": "4#0", "task_desc": "I am absolutely furious right now! I had a business flight booked earlier this month that your airline canceled, and because of that cancellation I ended up missing a critically important meeting. This whole situation caused me a ton of inconvenience and honestly some real damage. I insist that I be given proper compensation for both the missed meeting and the hassle your company put me through.\nLook, I already told you I had a canceled business flight earlier this month and missed a huge meetin", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'm sorry to hear about the inconvenience you experienced. I'd like to help, but first I need to confirm the facts of your situation before any compensation can be considered.\n\nTo verify the cancelled flight and your reservation details, I'll need some information from you:\n\n1. Your **user ID** (for example, something like \"sara_doe_496\").\n2. Your **reservation ID** (for example, \"ZFA04Y\"). If you don't have it handy, I can help locate it once I have your user ID.\n\nPlease provide your user ID so I can look up your reservation and confirm the cancellation.\nassistant: I understand your frustration. Let me look up your profile to locate the reservation in question.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"sophia_silva_7557\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Sophia\", \"last_name\": \"Silva\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"141 Cedar Avenue\", \"address2\": \"Suite 436\", \"city\": \"Columbus\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"OH\", \"zip\": \"43282\"}, \"email\": \"sophia.silva5929@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1957-10-05\", \"payment_methods\": {\"certificate_8045380\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_8045380\", \"amount\": 500.0}, \"certificate_3887113\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_3887113\", \"amount\": 150.0}, \"credit_card_4196779\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_4196779\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"7238\"}, \"gift_card_5094406\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_5094406\", \"amount\": 274.0}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Yara\", \"last_name\": \"Silva\", \"dob\": \"1972-06-16\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Isabella\", \"last_name\": \"Moore\", \"dob\": \"1988-06-04\"}], \"membership\": \"regular\", \"reservations\": [\"NM1VX1\", \"KC18K6\", \"S61CZX\", \"H8Q05L\", \"WUNA5K\"]}\nassistant: I found your profile. You have several reservations. Let me check each one to locate the cancelled business flight from earlier this month.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"NM1VX1\", \"user_id\": \"sophia_silva_7557\", \"origin\": \"MSP\", \"destination\": \"EWR\", \"flight_type\": \"round_trip\", \"cabin\": \"basic_econom", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 8, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 0, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "919bdbad", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T16:47:31"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "mem0", "phase": "test", "task_id": "20#0", "task_desc": "Hello, I'm looking to book a one-way flight from New York to Seattle on May 20th.\nMy user ID is mia_li_3668.\nJFK works for me as the departure airport.\n\nFor cabin class, I'd like economy.\n\nThe passenger is myself, Mia Li \u2014 my date of birth should already be in my profile, so I won't need to provide that.\n\nFor payment, I'd like to use both of my travel certificates.\n\nI need 3 checked bags.\n\nAnd no, I don't want to add travel insurance.\nActually, I don't want to fly before 11am EST. Both of these ", "score": 0.0, "em": 0.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: Hello! I'd be happy to help you book a one-way flight from New York to Seattle on May 20th.\n\nTo get started, I'll need your **user ID** (for example, something like \"sara_doe_496\"). Could you please provide that?\nassistant: Thank you! Let me look up your profile to get the details I'll need for booking.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"mia_li_3668\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Mia\", \"last_name\": \"Li\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"975 Sunset Drive\", \"address2\": \"Suite 217\", \"city\": \"Austin\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"TX\", \"zip\": \"78750\"}, \"email\": \"mia.li3818@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1990-04-05\", \"payment_methods\": {\"credit_card_4421486\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_4421486\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"7447\"}, \"certificate_4856383\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_4856383\", \"amount\": 100.0}, \"certificate_7504069\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_7504069\", \"amount\": 250.0}, \"credit_card_1955700\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_1955700\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"1907\"}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Amelia\", \"last_name\": \"Ahmed\", \"dob\": \"1957-03-21\"}], \"membership\": \"gold\", \"reservations\": [\"NO6JO3\", \"AIXC49\", \"HKEG34\"]}\nassistant: Thank you, Mia! I can see your profile. I notice \"New York\" has a few airports (JFK, LGA, EWR). Which departure airport would you prefer?\n\nAlso, to continue with the booking, I'll need a few more details:\n- **Cabin class**: basic economy, economy, or business?\n- **Passenger(s)**: name(s) and date(s) of birth for each passenger (up to 5). I see you have a saved passenger, Amelia Ahmed (DOB 1957-03-21) \u2014 would you like to use that, or add someone else?\n- **Payment method**: you have credit cards (ending 7447 and 1907) and travel certificates ($100 and $250) on file. Which would you like to use?\n- **Checked bags**: how many checked bags do you need? (As a gold member, you get 2 free checked bags per basic economy passenger, 3 per economy pas", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 3, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 0, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "919bdbad", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T16:47:31"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "mem0", "phase": "test", "task_id": "27#0", "task_desc": "Hello, I'm Ethan Martin and I am really upset right now. I'm calling about my flight HAT039 from Atlanta to Seattle that got delayed \u2014 this is completely unacceptable and I need to know what on earth is going on with it.\nLook, I don't have the exact flight date memorized in that format right now, but my user ID is ethan_martin_2396 \u2014 can you pull up my reservation with that? \n\nI'm absolutely fuming about this. Flight HAT039 from Atlanta to Seattle was delayed and I need to know *why* this happen", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'm sorry to hear about the delay. To look into this for you, I'll need a bit more information. Could you please provide:\n\n1. The date of your flight HAT039 (in YYYY-MM-DD format)\n2. Your user ID (so I can locate your reservation)\n\nOnce I have these, I can check the flight status and your reservation details.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"ethan_martin_2396\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Ethan\", \"last_name\": \"Martin\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"157 Willow Lane\", \"address2\": \"Suite 744\", \"city\": \"Dallas\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"TX\", \"zip\": \"75202\"}, \"email\": \"ethan.martin2913@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1963-05-18\", \"payment_methods\": {\"certificate_5449394\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_5449394\", \"amount\": 250.0}, \"gift_card_5853954\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_5853954\", \"amount\": 71.0}, \"certificate_7365778\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_7365778\", \"amount\": 100.0}, \"certificate_2942955\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_2942955\", \"amount\": 100.0}, \"credit_card_5447957\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_5447957\", \"brand\": \"mastercard\", \"last_four\": \"8023\"}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Liam\", \"last_