{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "mem0", "phase": "test", "task_id": "1#0", "task_desc": "Hello. I was hoping you could help me cancel a flight reservation. I spoke with a customer support representative on the phone recently, and they said a service agent would be able to assist me with the cancellation.\nSure, my user ID is raj_sanchez_7340. I don't have the reservation ID on hand, but hopefully you can locate it with that.\nI'm not sure which of those is the right one. The trip I need to cancel is the one flying from Philadelphia to LaGuardia. Could you check which of those reservat", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: Hello! I'd be happy to help you cancel your flight reservation. \n\nTo get started, I'll need your **user ID** (for example, something like 'sara_doe_496'). \n\nIf you also have your **reservation ID** handy, please share that as well. If you don't know your reservation ID, I can help locate it once I have your user ID.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"raj_sanchez_7340\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Raj\", \"last_name\": \"Sanchez\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"794 Sunset Drive\", \"address2\": \"Suite 598\", \"city\": \"Charlotte\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"NC\", \"zip\": \"28271\"}, \"email\": \"raj.sanchez1048@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1965-09-13\", \"payment_methods\": {\"credit_card_7891819\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_7891819\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"4388\"}, \"gift_card_4964153\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_4964153\", \"amount\": 163.0}, \"gift_card_3226531\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_3226531\", \"amount\": 50.0}, \"certificate_4594761\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_4594761\", \"amount\": 150.0}, \"gift_card_1591784\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_1591784\", \"amount\": 57.0}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Olivia\", \"last_name\": \"Taylor\", \"dob\": \"1976-06-27\"}], \"membership\": \"silver\", \"reservations\": [\"MZDDS4\", \"60RX9E\", \"S5IK51\", \"OUEA45\", \"Q69X3R\"]}\nassistant: I found your profile, Raj. You have the following reservations:\n\n- **MZDDS4**\n- **60RX9E**\n- **S5IK51**\n- **OUEA45**\n- **Q69X3R**\n\nWhich reservation would you like to cancel? If you're not sure which one, let me know and I can pull up the details of each so you can identify the right one.\nassistant: I'll pull up the details of each reservation to find the one flying from Philadelphia (PHL) to LaGuardia (LGA).\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"MZDDS4\", \"user_id\": \"raj_sanchez_7340\", \"origin\": \"MIA\", \"destination\": \"LAX\", \"flight_type\": \"round_trip\", \"cabin\": \"business\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT050\", \"origin\": \"MIA\", \"destination\":", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 10, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 0, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "919bdbad", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T16:47:31"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "mem0", "phase": "test", "task_id": "16#0", "task_desc": "Hi, I need to change my flight from Atlanta to Philadelphia. I\u2019d like to move it to the day after my original reservation, and I\u2019m looking for the cheapest flight in regular Economy class\u2014not Basic Economy.\nSure, my user ID is **aarav_garcia_1177**. I don\u2019t have my reservation ID in front of me, but hopefully you can pull up my booking with that. My name is Aarav Garcia, by the way.\nYes, please go ahead and make that change. I\u2019m happy with the refund being issued back to my original gift card pa", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: To help you modify your reservation, I'll need some information first. Could you please provide your **user ID**? \n\nAlso, if you know your **reservation ID**, please share that as well. If you don't have it, I can help locate it once I have your user ID.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"aarav_garcia_1177\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Aarav\", \"last_name\": \"Garcia\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"833 Highland Drive\", \"address2\": \"Suite 740\", \"city\": \"Denver\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"CO\", \"zip\": \"80211\"}, \"email\": \"aarav.garcia6639@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1992-09-13\", \"payment_methods\": {\"certificate_7473723\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_7473723\", \"amount\": 150.0}, \"gift_card_8887175\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_8887175\", \"amount\": 35.0}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Lei\", \"last_name\": \"Ito\", \"dob\": \"1990-12-07\"}], \"membership\": \"gold\", \"reservations\": [\"M05KNL\", \"UHDAHF\"]}\nassistant: I found your profile. You have two reservations: **M05KNL** and **UHDAHF**. Let me check the details of both to find the one from Atlanta (ATL) to Philadelphia (PHL).\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"M05KNL\", \"user_id\": \"aarav_garcia_1177\", \"origin\": \"ATL\", \"destinat