{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "mem0", "phase": "test", "task_id": "12#0", "task_desc": "Hi, I have a flight coming up from Boston to Minneapolis and I need to make some changes to my booking. I'd like to upgrade the cabin class for all the passengers on my reservation to business, and I also want to add a couple of checked bags under my name since I have Gold membership.\nSure, my user ID is chen_lee_6825 and the reservation ID is YAX4DR.\nThanks for the breakdown. I see the total to upgrade both passengers to business would be $1,200, but I'm only willing to pay up to $650 in upgrad", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: To help you modify your reservation, I'll need some information first. Could you please provide:\n\n1. Your **user ID** (e.g., 'sara_doe_496')\n2. Your **reservation ID** (e.g., 'ZFA04Y') \u2014 if you don't know it, I can help locate it using your user ID.\n\nOnce I have these, I'll look up your reservation details to confirm the changes you'd like to make.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"YAX4DR\", \"user_id\": \"chen_lee_6825\", \"origin\": \"BOS\", \"destination\": \"MSP\", \"flight_type\": \"one_way\", \"cabin\": \"economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT235\", \"origin\": \"BOS\", \"destination\": \"MCO\", \"date\": \"2024-05-18\", \"price\": 122}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT298\", \"origin\": \"MCO\", \"destination\": \"MSP\", \"date\": \"2024-05-19\", \"price\": 127}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Chen\", \"last_name\": \"Lee\", \"dob\": \"1967-12-12\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Noah\", \"last_name\": \"Hernandez\", \"dob\": \"1968-01-06\"}], \"payment_history\": [{\"payment_id\": \"credit_card_4938634\", \"amount\": 498}], \"created_at\": \"2024-05-05T23:00:15\", \"total_baggages\": 0, \"nonfree_baggages\": 0, \"insurance\": \"no\", \"status\": null}\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"chen_lee_6825\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Chen\", \"last_name\": \"Lee\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \