{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "mem0", "phase": "test", "task_id": "17#0", "task_desc": "Hello, I have a flight booked from New York to Chicago coming up, and I need to add 3 checked bags, change the passenger to myself, and upgrade the booking to economy class.\nSure, my user ID is omar_rossi_1241. I don't have my reservation ID handy, but hopefully you can locate the booking with that.\nGreat, I'd like to use my gift card with the $280 balance (gift_card_8190333) to cover the $209 upgrade cost. And yes, please go ahead and confirm all three changes \u2014 adding the 3 checked bags, switc", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: To help you modify your reservation, I'll need some information first. Could you please provide your **user ID** (for example, something like \"sara_doe_496\")? \n\nAlso, do you know your **reservation ID**? If not, I can help locate it once I have your user ID.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"omar_rossi_1241\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Omar\", \"last_name\": \"Rossi\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"901 Pine Lane\", \"address2\": \"Suite 360\", \"city\": \"Houston\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"TX\", \"zip\": \"77271\"}, \"email\": \"omar.rossi5980@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1970-06-06\", \"payment_methods\": {\"gift_card_8190333\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_8190333\", \"amount\": 280.0}, \"credit_card_6754990\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_6754990\", \"brand\": \"mastercard\", \"last_four\": \"3848\"}, \"certificate_8390038\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_8390038\", \"amount\": 150.0}, \"certificate_1778167\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_1778167\", \"amount\": 250.0}, \"gift_card_6490722\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_6490722\", \"amount\": 127.0}, \"credit_card_7407366\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_7407366\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"643