{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "mem0", "phase": "test", "task_id": "3#1", "task_desc": "Hi, I'm calling because I'm quite stressed about my upcoming trip. I have a lot to pack and it's crucial I know exactly how many suitcases my booking permits. I believe I'm a Gold member, so I should have some allowance. Can you help me find out the total number of bags I'm allowed?\nSure, my user ID is anya_garcia_5901. I'm really stressed about this trip because I have so much to bring, and I need to be certain about the baggage allowance.\nI'm sorry, but I really think there's a mistake \u2014 I'm p", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'd be happy to help you find out your baggage allowance. To look up your booking, I'll need your user ID first. Could you please provide your user ID?\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"anya_garcia_5901\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Anya\", \"last_name\": \"Garcia\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"555 Highland Drive\", \"address2\": \"Suite 243\", \"city\": \"San Antonio\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"TX\", \"zip\": \"78256\"}, \"email\": \"anya.garcia8816@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1992-11-12\", \"payment_methods\": {\"gift_card_2550356\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_2550356\", \"amount\": 149.0}, \"certificate_7583008\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_7583008\", \"amount\": 150.0}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Mei\", \"last_name\": \"Lee\", \"dob\": \"1989-12-13\"}], \"membership\": \"silver\", \"reservations\": [\"82K959\", \"790JYN\", \"BE2L57\", \"CXBB4L\", \"TAMSDK\", \"3RK2T9\", \"VAOW1B\", \"Q4MCUF\", \"JMO1MG\"]}\nassistant: I've pulled up your profile. I notice that your membership level is actually **silver**, not gold as you mentioned \u2014 this does affect your baggage allowance, so I wanted to clarify that.\n\nI also see you have several reservations on file (reservation IDs: 82K959, 790JYN, BE2L57, CXBB4L, TAMSDK, 3RK2T9, VAOW1B, Q4MCUF, JMO1MG). \n\nTo tell you exactly how many bags your booking permits, I need to know which reservation you're referring to. Could you let me know the specific reservation ID for the trip you're packing for? If you're not sure which one it is, let me know the destination or dates and I can help locate it.\ntool: Transfer successful\nassistant: YOU ARE BEING TRANSFERRED TO A HUMAN AGENT. PLEASE HOLD ON.", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 2, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 0, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "919bdbad", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T16:47:31"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "mem0", "phase": "test", "task_id": "5#0", "task_desc": "Hello, this is Mei Brown. I'm a valued Gold member with your airline, and I'm calling about my delayed flight HAT045 from Phoenix to Seattle. I'm extremely upset because this delay means I'm going to miss a very important meeting I had planned. I need to discuss this with you.\nSure, my user ID is mei_brown_7075. As for the exact date of the flight, I don't have that in front of me right now \u2014 I'm just calling right after hearing about the delay and I'm pretty frazzled. But you should be able to ", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: Hello Mei Brown, I'm sorry to hear about the delay with your flight HAT045 from Phoenix (PHX) to Seattle (SEA). I'd like to help you with this.\n\nTo look up your reservation and confirm the flight details, I'll need a couple of pieces of information:\n\n1. Your user ID (e.g., something like \"mei_brown_123\").\n2. The date of the flight HAT045 you were scheduled to take.\n\nCould you please provide those so I can verify the situation?\nassistant: Thank you, Mei. Let me look up your account to find the reservation for flight HAT045.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"mei_brown_7075\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Mei\", \"last_name\": \"Brown\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"853 Chestnut Street\", \"address2\": \"Suite 497\", \"city\": \"Washington\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"DC\", \"zip\": \"20195\"}, \"email\": \"mei.brown7062@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1986-12-14\", \"payment_methods\": {\"certificate_6761175\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_6761175\", \"amount\": 250.0}, \"gift_card_8987598\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_8987598\", \"amount\": 130.0}, \"credit_card_4920843\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_4920843\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"1663\"}, \"credit_card_1815425\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"