{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "mem0", "phase": "test", "task_id": "36#0", "task_desc": "Hello... I... I don't even know where to start. My wife... she passed away just yesterday. It's been a nightmare. I have a flight booked with you and I... I need to move it, just push it out a couple of days. I don't want to cancel it, I just can't fly tomorrow like we planned. I'm sorry, I'm just so distraught right now.\nThank you... I appreciate that. I'm just... it's hard to think straight. \n\nMy user ID is lucas_brown_4047. And the reservation I need to change is EUJUY6. That's the one... the", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'm so sorry for your loss. I can certainly help you modify your flight to a later date. To get started, I'll need a couple of details from you:\n\n1. Your **user ID** (for example, something like \"sara_doe_496\").\n2. Your **reservation ID** (for example, something like \"ZFA04Y\").\n\nIf you don't have your reservation ID handy, just let me know your user ID and I can look up your reservations for you. Take your time.\nassistant: I'm truly sorry. Let me pull up your reservation details so I can help you move the flight.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"EUJUY6\", \"user_id\": \"lucas_brown_4047\", \"origin\": \"ORD\", \"destination\": \"LAS\", \"flight_type\": \"round_trip\", \"cabin\": \"basic_economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT238\", \"origin\": \"ORD\", \"destination\": \"DEN\", \"date\": \"2024-05-14\", \"price\": 96}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT290\", \"origin\": \"DEN\", \"destination\": \"LAS\", \"date\": \"2024-05-14\", \"price\": 64}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT266\", \"origin\": \"LAS\", \"destination\": \"IAH\", \"date\": \"2024-05-16\", \"price\": 70}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT044\", \"origin\": \"IAH\", \"destination\": \"ORD\", \"date\": \"2024-05-16\", \"price\": 76}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Lucas\", \"last_name\": \"Brown\", \"dob\": \"1965-01-01\"}, {\"f