{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "mem0", "phase": "test", "task_id": "13#1", "task_desc": "Hello, I'd like to change my return flight. I currently have a one-stop flight booked from Atlanta to Los Angeles, and I want to change it to a nonstop flight from Atlanta to Las Vegas instead.\nI see. But I don't want to cancel and rebook a new flight, and I don't want to keep the LAX route either\u2014I only want to modify my existing reservation to a nonstop flight to Las Vegas. Since you're saying that change isn't possible through you, I'd like to be transferred to someone who can assist me with ", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'm sorry, but I'm unable to make this change. According to our modification policy, flight changes must keep the same **origin, destination, and trip type**. Since you'd like to change the destination from Los Angeles (LAX) to Las Vegas (LAS), this modification cannot be processed.\n\nHere are your options:\n- **Cancel and rebook**: If your reservation is eligible for cancellation, you could cancel it and book a new reservation from Atlanta to Las Vegas.\n- **Change flights while keeping the same route**: I can help you change to a different (e.g., nonstop) flight from Atlanta to Los Angeles, as long as the origin, destination, and trip type remain the same.\n\nIf you'd like to pursue either of these, please provide your **user ID** and **reservation ID** so I can look up your booking and assist further.", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 0, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 0, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "919bdbad", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T16:47:31"}
