{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "mem0", "phase": "test", "task_id": "2#0", "task_desc": "Hi, I'm looking to book a flight from San Francisco to New York. There will be three of us traveling together.\nSure, my user ID is noah_muller_9847. And it's a one-way trip from SF to NY.\nActually, wait \u2014 before we go any further with this, I need to talk about something else. I'm really frustrated right now about a delayed flight on my most recent reservation. This is just unacceptable and I want to address it.\nHold on \u2014 I'm not ready to be transferred just yet. The point is, I had a flight tha", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: Hello! I'd be happy to help you book a flight from San Francisco (SFO) to New York (NYC) for three passengers.\n\nTo get started, I'll need a few details:\n1. **Your user ID** (e.g., something like 'sara_doe_496')\n2. **Trip type** \u2014 is this a one-way or round-trip flight?\n\nOnce I have those, I can look up available flights and gather the passenger details.\nassistant: Thank you! Let me pull up your profile to confirm your details and available payment methods.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"noah_muller_9847\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Noah\", \"last_name\": \"Muller\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"889 Hillcrest Drive\", \"address2\": \"Suite 254\", \"city\": \"Denver\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"CO\", \"zip\": \"80243\"}, \"email\": \"noah.muller2290@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1963-01-22\", \"payment_methods\": {\"credit_card_1245537\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_1245537\", \"brand\": \"mastercard\", \"last_four\": \"1167\"}, \"credit_card_6040264\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_6040264\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"2076\"}, \"credit_card_3255100\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_3255100\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"2604\"}, \"certificate_8301303\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \