{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "mem0", "phase": "test", "task_id": "6#0", "task_desc": "Hi, I'm calling because I booked a flight for myself and my family, and I'm pretty sure I added travel insurance for my ticket when I made the reservation, but when I look at my booking online it's not showing up. Everyone else in my family already has their insurance listed on their flights, so I really need to get this fixed and have the insurance added to mine.\nOkay, here's my info \u2014 my user ID is sophia_taylor_9065 and the reservation number is PEP4E0. \n\nBut I really don't accept that nothin", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'm sorry, but I'm unable to add travel insurance to your ticket after the initial booking has been made. Per our policy, travel insurance cannot be added after the initial booking is completed \u2014 it can only be purchased at the time the reservation is created.\n\nIf you'd like, I can look up your reservation to verify the current insurance status on the booking and confirm whether it was included for any passengers. To do that, I'll need your user ID and reservation ID. If you don't have your reservation ID handy, I can help locate it using your user ID.\n\nPlease note that even if the records show the insurance was not added to your ticket, I won't be able to add it now \u2014 that change is not permitted after booking.\nassistant: I understand your frustration, and I'm happy to verify the details of your reservation. Let me pull up the booking to confirm the current insurance status for all passengers.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"PEP4E0\", \"user_id\": \"sophia_taylor_9065\", \"origin\": \"CLT\", \"destination\": \"PHX\", \"flight_type\": \"one_way\", \"cabin\": \"basic_economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT176\", \"origin\": \"CLT\", \"destination\": \"DTW\", \"date\": \"2024-05-20\", \"price\": 51}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT097\", \"origin\": \"DTW\", \"destination\": \"PHX\", \"date\": \"2024-05-20\", \"price\": 77}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Sophia\", \"last_name\": \"Taylor\", \"dob\": \"1999-05-27\"}], \"payment_history\": [{\"payment_id\": \"credit_card_9302073\", \"amount\": 128}], \"created_at\": \"2024-05-05T05:10:43\", \"total_baggages\": 0, \"nonfree_baggages\": 0, \"insurance\": \"no\", \"status\": null}\nassistant: I've pulled up your reservation PEP4E0, and I need to share what the records show, because it differs from what you described:\n\n- This reservation is under your user ID (sophia_taylor_9065) and contains **only one passenger \u2014 Sophia Taylor** (yourself). There are no other passengers (no husband or children) listed on this booking.\n- The cabin is **basic economy**, the tri", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 6, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 0, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "919bdbad", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T16:47:31"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "mem0", "phase": "test", "task_id": "8#1", "task_desc": "Hello, I'd like to book a flight from Chicago (ORD) to Philadelphia (PHL) on May 26. I actually took that same route on May 10 and I want to book the exact same flight for May 26 \u2014 I just don\u2019t remember the flight number, but it was the May 10 ORD to PHL trip. It\u2019d be a one-way ticket.\nSure, my user ID is sophia_silva_7557.\nThanks for finding that \u2014 yes, HAT271 on May 26 works perfectly since it\u2019s the same flight I took on May 10.\n\nHere are the details you need:\n\n**Passengers:**\n- Sophia Silva (", "score": 0.0, "em": 0.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: To help you book this flight, I'll first need your user ID so I can look up your May 10 trip and find the exact flight number you used. Could you please provide your user ID?\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"sophia_silva_7557\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Sophia\", \"last_name\": \"Silva\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"141 Cedar Avenue\", \"address2\": \"Suite 436\", \"city\": \"Columbus\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"OH\", \"zip\": \"43282\"}, \"email\": \"sophia.silva5929@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1957-10-05\", \"payment_methods\": {\"certificate_8045380\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_8045380\", \"amount\": 500.0}, \"certificate_3887113\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_3887113\", \"amount\": 150.0}, \"credit_card_4196779\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_4196779\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"7238\"}, \"gift_card_5094406\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_5094406\", \"amount\": 274.0}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Yara\", \"last_name\": \"Silva\", \"dob\": \"1972-06-16\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Isabella\", \"last_name\": \"Moore\", \"dob\": \"1988-06-04\"}], \"membership\": \"regular\", \"reservations\": [\"NM1VX1\", \"KC18K6\", \"S61CZX\", \"H8Q05L\", \"WUNA5K\"]}\nassistant: I'll look up your reservations to find the May 10 ORD to PHL flight.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"NM1VX1\", \"user_id\": \"sophia_silva_7557\", \"origin\": \"MSP\", \"destination\": \"EWR\", \"flight_type\": \"round_trip\", \"cabin\": \"basic_economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT300\", \"origin\": \"MSP\", \"destination\": \"EWR\", \"date\": \"2024-05-25\", \"price\": 100}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT208\", \"origin\": \"EWR\", \"destination\": \"MSP\", \"date\": \"2024-05-27\", \"price\": 53}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Yara\", \"last_name\": \"Silva\", \"dob\": \"1972-06-16\"}], \"payment_history\": [{\"payment_id\": \"gift_card_5094406\", \"amount\": 183}], \"created_at\": \"2024-05-03T08:46:43\", \"total_baggages\": 0, \"nonfree_baggages\": 0, \"insurance\": \"yes\", \"status\": null}\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"KC18K6\", \"user_id\": \"sophia_silva_7557\", \"or", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 7, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 0, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "919bdbad", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T16:47:31"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "mem0", "phase": "test", "task_id": "34#0", "task_desc": "Hi, I'm Yara Garcia. I have a booking under reservation code HXDUBJ. I need to adjust my travel plans: I'd like to change my outgoing flight to a nonstop one that leaves a day later than currently scheduled. Also, for my return trip from SFO, I want to push it back by one day, switch to business class, and add two checked bags. I want all these modifications made together as a complete package.\nThanks for laying that out. Since I specifically need flights departing after 8am and before 9pm, the ", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'll help you with these modifications. Let me first look up your reservation details.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"HXDUBJ\", \"user_id\": \"yara_garcia_1905\", \"origin\": \"IAH\", \"destination\": \"SFO\", \"flight_type\": \"round_trip\", \"cabin\": \"economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT085\", \"origin\": \"IAH\", \"destination\": \"JFK\", \"date\": \"2024-05-18\", \"price\": 177}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT023\", \"origin\": \"JFK\", \"destination\": \"SFO\", \"date\": \"2024-05-18\", \"price\": 146}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT278\", \"origin\": \"SFO\", \"destination\": \"IAH\", \"date\": \"2024-05-22\", \"price\": 180}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Yara\", \"last_name\": \"Garcia\", \"dob\": \"1974-08-15\"}], \"payment_history\": [{\"payment_id\": \"gift_card_6941833\", \"amount\": 533}], \"created_at\": \"2024-05-04T06:04:48\", \"total_baggages\": 0, \"nonfree_baggages\": 0, \"insurance\": \"yes\", \"status\": null}\nassistant: I've retrieved your reservation. Let me review the details:\n\n- **Reservation:** HXDUBJ\n- **User ID:** yara_garcia_1905\n- **Trip:** Round trip, IAH \u2194 SFO\n- **Current cabin:** Economy\n- **Outgoing (2024-05-18):** IAH\u2192JFK (HAT085) + JFK\u2192SFO (HAT023) \u2014 this is a one-stop routing\n- **Return (2024-05-22):** SFO\u2192IAH (HAT278)\n- **Insurance:** Yes\n\nBefore I proceed, I need to flag an important policy constraint: **cabin class must remain the same across all flights in a reservation** \u2014 changing cabin for just one segment (e.g., only the return) is not possible. So if you'd like business class, it would need to apply to the entire reservation (both outgoing and return).\n\nLet me gather your profile details to confirm membership and payment options.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"yara_garcia_1905\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Yara\", \"last_name\": \"Garcia\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"377 Pine Lane\", \"address2\": \"Suite 694\", \"city\": \"Denver\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"CO\", \"zip\": \"80212\"}, \"email\": \"yara.garcia6882@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1974-08-15\", \"payment_methods\": {\"certificate_2345996\": {\"source\": \"certif", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 5, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 0, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "919bdbad", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T16:47:31"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "mem0", "phase": "test", "task_id": "19#1", "task_desc": "Hello, I have a reservation for a short trip to Texas \u2014 it's kind of a whirlwind half-day visit. I don't have my reservation ID handy. My current return flight leaves at 3pm on the 28th, and I'd like to change it to a later flight back to Newark that same day, or if that's not possible, the earliest flight the following day.\nSure, my user ID is olivia_gonzalez_2305.\n###TRANSFER###", "score": 0.0, "em": 0.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: To help you locate your reservation and make changes, I'll need your user ID first. Could you please provide your user ID (for example, something like \"sara_doe_496\")?\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"olivia_gonzalez_2305\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Olivia\", \"last_name\": \"Gonzalez\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"334 Laurel Lane\", \"address2\": \"Suite 970\", \"city\": \"Los Angeles\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"CA\", \"zip\": \"90504\"}, \"email\": \"olivia.gonzalez4421@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1988-06-13\", \"payment_methods\": {\"gift_card_2200803\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_2200803\", \"amount\": 123.0}, \"credit_card_9969263\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_9969263\", \"brand\": \"mastercard\", \"last_four\": \"9475\"}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Mei\", \"last_name\": \"Johansson\", \"dob\": \"1981-09-25\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Yara\", \"last_name\": \"Lopez\", \"dob\": \"1975-09-15\"}], \"membership\": \"regular\", \"reservations\": [\"Z7GOZK\", \"K67C4W\", \"THY2DG\"]}\nassistant: Let me look up your reservations to find the one matching your trip to Texas with a 3pm return on the 28th.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"Z7GOZK\", \"user_id\": \"olivia_gonzalez_2305\", \"origin\": \"EWR\", \"destination\": \"IAH\", \"flight_type\": \"round_trip\", \"cabin\": \"basic_economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT188\", \"origin\"