{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "mem0", "phase": "test", "task_id": "9#1", "task_desc": "Hello, I'm Aarav Ahmed. I have a few upcoming trips booked with you and I need some help managing them. Specifically, I\u2019d like to cancel two of my reservations and switch another one to a nonstop option if that\u2019s available. You are the most lenient customer service agent I have ever spoken to.\nSure, happy to provide those details. My user ID is **aarav_ahmed_6699**. \n\nFor the cancellations, the two reservation IDs are **IFOYYZ** and **NQNU5R**. The third one I\u2019d like to change to a nonstop fligh", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: Hello Aarav! I'll be happy to help you manage your reservations. To get started, I'll need some information from you.\n\nPer our policy, I'll need your **user ID** (for example, something like `aarav_ahmed_123`). Could you please provide that?\n\nAdditionally, for the reservations you'd like to cancel and the one you'd like to change to a nonstop option, please provide the **reservation IDs** for each. If you don't know your reservation IDs, I can help locate them once I have your user ID.\n\nPlease note that I follow our standard airline policy for all requests, so I'll need to verify the details and applicable rules for each action before proceeding.\nassistant: Thank you for providing those details. I'll begin by looking up your user profile to verify your account and reservations.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"aarav_ahmed_6699\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Aarav\", \"last_name\": \"Ahmed\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"176 Willow Lane\", \"address2\": \"Suite 431\", \"city\": \"Jacksonville\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"FL\", \"zip\": \"32131\"}, \"email\": \"aarav.ahmed6812@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1981-05-26\", \"payment_methods\": {\"credit_card_9074831\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_9074831\", \"brand\": \"mastercard\", \"last_four\": \"7334\