{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "mem0", "phase": "test", "task_id": "32#1", "task_desc": "Hi, I really need some help with my flight. I have a trip booked out of Newark on May 21, but my mother has taken a turn for the worse and I need to get back home as soon as possible to take care of her. I was hoping I could change my booking to a nonstop flight on that same day instead.\nOf course, I understand. My user ID is ivan_rossi_8555. I don't have my reservation number right in front of me, but hopefully you can pull up my booking with that.\n###TRANSFER###", "score": 0.0, "em": 0.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'm sorry to hear about your mother. I'll do my best to help you change your booking.\n\nTo get started, I'll need your user ID. Could you please provide it? If you also have your reservation ID handy, that would help, but if not, I can look it up for you once I have your user ID.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"ivan_rossi_8555\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Ivan\", \"last_name\": \"Rossi\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"513 Main Street\", \"address2\": \"Suite 805\", \"city\": \"Philadelphia\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"PA\", \"zip\": \"19102\"}, \"email\": \"ivan.rossi2633@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1954-01-14\", \"payment_methods\": {\"gift_card_7344518\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_7344518\", \"amount\": 183.0}, \"gift_card_9823297\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_9823297\", \"amount\": 224.0}, \"credit_card_9659780\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_9659780\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"1777\"}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Ava\", \"last_name\": \"Silva\", \"dob\": \"1971-01-14\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Anya\", \"last_name\": \"Patel\", \"dob\": \"1990-06-13\"}], \"membership\": \"silver\", \"reservations\": [\"OWZ4XL\", \"F3IQK1\", \"8WMF4C\", \"L2H5FP\"]}\nassistant: I found your profile. You have several reservations. Let me look up the details to find the one departing from Newark (EWR) on May 21.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"OWZ4XL\", \"user_id\": \"ivan_rossi_8555\", \"origin\": \"EWR\", \"destination\": \"LAX\", \"flight_type\": \"one_way\", \"cabin\": \"basic_economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT202\", \"origin\": \"EWR\", \"destination\": \"MIA\", \"date\": \"2024-05-21\", \"price\": 94}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT232\", \"origin\": \"MIA\", \"destination\": \"LAX\", \"date\": \"2024-05-21\", \"price\": 80}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Ivan\", \"last_name\": \"Rossi\", \"dob\": \"1954-01-14\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Olivia\", \"last_name\": \"Santos\", \"dob\": \"1984-06-23\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Lei\", \"last_name\": \"Johansson\", \"dob\": \"1995-10-22\"}], \"payment_history\": [{\"payment_id\": \"gift_card_9823297\", \"amount\": 522}], \"cr", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 6, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 0, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "919bdbad", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T16:47:31"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "mem0", "phase": "test", "task_id": "6#1", "task_desc": "Hi, I'm calling about my upcoming flight. I'm almost certain I added travel insurance when I booked it, but when I log in to check my reservation online, there's no sign of any insurance on my booking. I'm flying with my family, and everyone else in my group already has insurance coverage for their tickets\u2014so I really need to make sure mine gets added too. It's frustrating that it's not showing up.\nMy user ID is sophia_taylor_9065 and the reservation number is PEP4E0. \n\nBut I have to be honest, ", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I understand your concern, but I'm afraid I'm unable to add travel insurance to your reservation at this time. According to our policy, **travel insurance cannot be added after the initial booking** has been made. This is a firm rule, and even a human agent would not be able to add insurance to an existing reservation.\n\nWhat I can do is help you verify the current status of your reservation to confirm whether insurance is already on file. To do that, I'll need:\n- Your **user ID** (e.g., `sara_doe_496`)\n- Your **reservation ID** (if you don't have it, I can help locate it using your user ID)\n\nWould you like me to look up your reservation to check the insurance status? Please provide your user ID and reservation ID (or just your user ID if you don't know the reservation ID).\nassistant: Let me look up your reservation to verify the current details, including the insurance status.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"PEP4E0\", \"user_id\": \"sophia_taylor_9065\", \"origin\": \"CLT\", \"destination\": \"PHX\", \"flight_type\": \"one_way\", \"cabin\": \"basic_economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT176\", \"origin\": \"CLT\", \"destination\": \"DTW\", \"date\": \"2024-05-20\", \"price\": 51}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT097\", \"origin\": \"DTW\", \"destination\": \"PHX\", \"date\": \"2024-05-20\", \"price\": 77}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Sophia\", \"last_name\": \"Taylor\", \"dob\": \"1999-05-27\"}], \"payment_history\": [{\"payment_id\": \"credit_card_9302073\", \"amount\": 128}], \"created_at\": \"2024-05-05T05:10:43\", \"total_baggages\": 0, \"nonfree_baggages\": 0, \"insurance\": \"no\", \"status\": null}\nassistant: I've pulled up your reservation **PEP4E0** and verified the details. Here is what the record shows:\n\n- **Passenger:** Sophia Taylor (only one passenger on this reservation)\n- **Cabin:** Basic Economy\n- **Insurance:** No\n- **Created:** 2024-05-05\n- **Trip:** One-way, CLT \u2192 PHX (via DTW)\n\nA few important points based on this:\n\n1. **This reservation only contains your name as the passenger.**", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 2, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 0, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "919bdbad", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T16:47:31"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "mem0", "phase": "test", "task_id": "2#1", "task_desc": "Hi, I'm looking to book a flight from San Francisco to New York. There will be three of us traveling.\nSure, my user ID is noah_muller_9847.\nActually, hold on \u2014 before we keep going with this booking, I need to talk about something else. I'm really frustrated about my most recent reservation. The flight was delayed and it's been a total headache. I'd rather deal with that right now.\nI'm sorry, but this is really frustrating. I thought that delayed flight was from my most recent booking, but regar", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: To get started with your booking, I'll need some information. First, could you please provide your **user ID**?\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"noah_muller_9847\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Noah\", \"last_name\": \"Muller\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"889 Hillcrest Drive\", \"address2\": \"Suite 254\", \"city\": \"Denver\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"CO\", \"zip\": \"80243\"}, \"email\": \"noah.muller2290@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1963-01-22\", \"payment_methods\": {\"credit_card_1245537\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_1245537\", \"brand\": \"mastercard\", \"last_four\": \"1167\"}, \"credit_card_6040264\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_6040264\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"2076\"}, \"credit_card_3255100\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_3255100\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"2604\"}, \"certificate_8301303\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_8301303\", \"amount\": 100.0}, \"credit_card_3983998\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_3983998\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"8413\"}, \"credit_card_7574394\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_7574394\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"1798\"}, \"credit_card_6873705\": {\"source\": \"cred