{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "mem0", "phase": "test", "task_id": "20#1", "task_desc": "Hello, I need to book a one-way flight from New York to Seattle for May 20th.\nMy user ID is mia_li_3668. As for the New York airport, I don't have a specific preference \u2014 any of the New York airports would be fine for me.\nThanks for the options, but both of those flights depart before 11am EST, and I don't want to fly that early. Are there any flights leaving after 11am, perhaps from LGA or EWR, or maybe with one stopover?\n\nTo answer your other questions: the passenger will be me, Mia Li (my dat", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: Hello! I'd be happy to help you book a one-way flight from New York to Seattle for May 20th.\n\nTo get started, I'll need a few details:\n\n1. **Your user ID** (e.g., 'sara_doe_496') \u2014 this is required to look up your profile and payment methods.\n2. **Specific airports**: New York has multiple airports (e.g., JFK, LGA, EWR) and Seattle is typically SEA. Could you confirm which New York airport you'd like to depart from?\n\nOnce I have your user ID, I can look up your profile and help with the rest of the booking details (cabin class, passenger information, payment, and baggage).\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"mia_li_3668\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Mia\", \"last_name\": \"Li\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"975 Sunset Drive\", \"address2\": \"Suite 217\", \"city\": \"Austin\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"TX\", \"zip\": \"78750\"}, \"email\": \"mia.li3818@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1990-04-05\", \"payment_methods\": {\"credit_card_4421486\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_4421486\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"7447\"}, \"certificate_4856383\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_4856383\", \"amount\": 100.0}, \"certificate_7504069\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_7504069\", \"amount\": 250.0}, \"credit_card_1955700\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_1955700\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"1907\"}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Amelia\", \"last_name\": \"Ahmed\", \"dob\": \"1957-03-21\"}], \"membership\": \"gold\", \"reservations\": [\"NO6JO3\", \"AIXC49\", \"HKEG34\"]}\nassistant: Thank you, Mia! I've retrieved your profile. I can see you're a **gold member** with the following payment methods on file:\n- Credit card (Visa, ending 7447)\n- Credit card (Visa, ending 1907)\n- Travel certificate ($100)\n- Travel certificate ($250)\n\nYou also have a saved passenger: Amelia Ahmed (DOB 1957-03-21).\n\nNow let me search for available flights from New York to Seattle on May 20th. I'll start with JFK.\ntool: [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT069\", \"origin\": \"JFK\", \"destina", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 8, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 0, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "919bdbad", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T16:47:31"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "mem0", "phase": "test", "task_id": "18#1", "task_desc": "Ugh, this is so frustrating! I just ran into some serious money problems and I need to downgrade all of my business class flights to economy. I can't afford this right now. I don't want to change any of the flights or the passengers, just the cabin class. Can you help me with that?\nLook, I'm really stressed about this whole thing, but fine \u2014 my user ID is omar_davis_3817. I don't have the reservation numbers in front of me right now, but you should be able to pull up my bookings with that, right", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'm sorry to hear about your situation. I can help you downgrade the cabin class from business to economy, as long as no flights in the reservation have already been flown.\n\nTo get started, I'll need your user ID. Could you please provide it? If you also have your reservation ID handy, that would help speed things up, but if not, I can help locate it once I have your user ID.\nassistant: Let me pull up your profile and reservations using your user ID.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"omar_davis_3817\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Omar\", \"last_name\": \"Davis\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"281 Spruce Street\", \"address2\": \"Suite 942\", \"city\": \"San Diego\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"CA\", \"zip\": \"92164\"}, \"email\": \"omar.davis7857@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1982-10-19\", \"payment_methods\": {\"gift_card_3481935\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_3481935\", \"amount\": 22.0}, \"credit_card_2929732\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_2929732\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"7803\"}, \"credit_card_9525117\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_9525117\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"2172\"}, \"gift_card_6847880\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_6847880\", \"amount\": 31.0}}, \"saved_passenger