{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "mem0", "phase": "test", "task_id": "36#1", "task_desc": "I'm sorry... I'm just a mess right now. My wife... she passed away yesterday. I have a flight booked and I need to change the date, just push it back a couple of days. I don't want to cancel it, I just... I can't fly on the original day.\nMy user ID is lucas_brown_4047... and the reservation is EUJUY6. I'm sorry, I'm just... I can barely think straight. She was everything to me and now I just need to move that flight out two days, that's all. Please.\n###TRANSFER###", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'm sorry for your loss. I'll do my best to help you change your flight date.\n\nTo locate your reservation and proceed, I'll need some information first. Could you please provide your **user ID**? (This is typically something like \"sara_doe_496\".)\n\nIf you also have your **reservation ID** handy, please share that as well \u2014 but if you don't know it, I can help look it up once I have your user ID.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"EUJUY6\", \"user_id\": \"lucas_brown_4047\", \"origin\": \"ORD\", \"destination\": \"LAS\", \"flight_type\": \"round_trip\", \"cabin\": \"basic_economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT238\", \"origin\": \"ORD\", \"destination\": \"DEN\", \"date\": \"2024-05-14\", \"price\": 96}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT290\", \"origin\": \"DEN\", \"destination\": \"LAS\", \"date\": \"2024-05-14\", \"price\": 64}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT266\", \"origin\": \"LAS\", \"destination\": \"IAH\", \"date\": \"2024-05-16\", \"price\": 70}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT044\", \"origin\": \"IAH\", \"destination\": \"ORD\", \"date\": \"2024-05-16\", \"price\": 76}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Lucas\", \"last_name\": \"Brown\", \"dob\": \"1965-01-01\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Daiki\", \"last_name\": \"Thomas\", \"dob\": \"1996-06-21\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Daiki\", \"last_name\": \"Lopez\", \"dob\": \"1967-04-08\