{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "mem0", "phase": "test", "task_id": "35#1", "task_desc": "Hi, I need to cancel my upcoming flight from JFK to MCO on May 22. Just so you know, I'm a silver member, so I should be getting a full refund for that cancellation.\nSure, my user ID is aarav_ahmed_6699. You should be able to pull up my booking with that since I don't have the reservation ID handy. \n\nThe reason for cancelling is just a change of plans \u2014 I need to travel elsewhere instead. And just to be clear, I'm a silver member with your airline, so I expect a full refund on this cancellation.", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: To help you cancel your flight, I'll need some information first. Could you please provide your **user ID**? \n\nAlso, if you don't know your **reservation ID**, I can help locate it once I have your user ID.\n\nFinally, could you let me know the **reason for cancellation** (change of plan, airline cancelled flight, or other reasons)?\nassistant: Let me look up your profile and reservations.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"aarav_ahmed_6699\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Aarav\", \"last_name\": \"Ahmed\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"176 Willow Lane\", \"address2\": \"Suite 431\", \"city\": \"Jacksonville\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"FL\", \"zip\": \"32131\"}, \"email\": \"aarav.ahmed6812@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1981-05-26\", \"payment_methods\": {\"credit_card_9074831\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_9074831\", \"brand\": \"mastercard\", \"last_four\": \"7334\"}, \"certificate_9645872\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_9645872\", \"amount\": 250.0}, \"credit_card_4959530\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_4959530\", \"brand\": \"mastercard\", \"last_four\": \"5018\"}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Aarav\", \"last_name\": \"Patel\", \"dob\": \"1980-12-03\"}], \"membership\": \"silver\", \"reservations\": [\"M20IZO\", \"N6F783\", \"IFOYYZ\", \"NQNU5R\"]}\nassistant: I found your profile (silver member, confirmed). You have several reservations. Let me locate the one from JFK to MCO on May 22.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"M20IZO\", \"user_id\": \"aarav_ahmed_6699\", \"origin\": \"JFK\", \"destination\": \"MCO\", \"flight_type\": \"one_way\", \"cabin\": \"economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT268\", \"origin\": \"JFK\", \"destination\": \"ATL\", \"date\": \"2024-05-22\", \"price\": 136}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT010\", \"origin\": \"ATL\", \"destination\": \"MCO\", \"date\": \"2024-05-22\", \"price\": 109}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Aarav\", \"last_name\": \"Ahmed\", \"dob\": \"1981-05-26\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Daiki\", \"last_name\": \"Li\", \"dob\": \"1980-12-24\"}], \"payment_history\": [{\"payment_id\": \"credit_card_4959530\", \"amount\"", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 7, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 0, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "919bdbad", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T16:47:31"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "mem0", "phase": "test", "task_id": "15#0", "task_desc": "Hello. I have a flight booked from Atlanta to Philadelphia that I need to change. I\u2019d like to move it to the day after my original travel date, and I\u2019m looking for the cheapest standard Economy fare\u2014not Basic Economy. Also, since I live in Princeton, Newark is just as easy for me to get to as Philly, so I\u2019d like to consider flights to either airport. Can you help me with that?\nSure, my name is Aarav Garcia and my user ID is aarav_garcia_1177.\n\nI understand what you\u2019re saying about the destinatio", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: Hello! I'd be happy to help you with changing your flight. \n\nBefore I can proceed, I need to collect some information:\n\n1. **Your user ID** (e.g., something like `sara_doe_496`)\n2. **Your reservation ID** (if you don't know it, I can help locate it once I have your user ID)\n\nAlso, I should note an important policy constraint: when modifying a reservation, the **origin, destination, and trip type cannot be changed**. This means I would not be able to change your destination from Philadelphia (PHL) to Newark (EWR) as part of a modification. If you'd like to fly into Newark instead, that would require a different process (such as cancelling and rebooking, subject to cancellation rules).\n\nPlease provide your user ID so I can look up your reservation details and assist you further.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"aarav_garcia_1177\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Aarav\", \"last_name\": \"Garcia\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"833 Highland Drive\", \"address2\": \"Suite 740\", \"city\": \"Denver\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"CO\", \"zip\": \"80211\"}, \"email\": \"aarav.garcia6639@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1992-09-13\", \"payment_methods\": {\"certificate_7473723\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_7473723\", \"amount\": 150.0}, \"gift_card_8887175\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_8887175\", \"amount\": 35.0}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Lei\", \"last_name\": \"Ito\", \"dob\": \"1990-12-07\"}], \"membership\": \"gold\", \"reservations\": [\"M05KNL\", \"UHDAHF\"]}\nassistant: I found your profile. You have two reservations: **M05KNL** and **UHDAHF**. Let me look up the details of each to find your Atlanta-to-Philadelphia trip.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"M05KNL\", \"user_id\": \"aarav_garcia_1177\", \"origin\": \"ATL\", \"destination\": \"PHL\", \"flight_type\": \"one_way\", \"cabin\": \"business\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT227\", \"origin\": \"ATL\", \"destination\": \"ORD\", \"date\": \"2024-05-23\", \"price\": 1936}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT139\", \"origin\": \"ORD\", \"destination\": \"PHL\", \"date\": \"2", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 8, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 0, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "919bdbad", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T16:47:31"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "mem0", "phase": "test", "task_id": "25#1", "task_desc": "Hello, I'm Ivan Muller \u2014 my user ID is ivan_muller_7015. I\u2019d like to book a flight for my friend Ivan Smith (he\u2019s already listed in my profile) that matches my current reservation exactly, with just him as the passenger. Also, I want to apply my certificate to this booking and find out how much certificate balance would remain after the purchase.\nThanks for pulling that up. To answer your questions: I don\u2019t want any travel insurance added for Ivan Smith, and he won\u2019t need any checked bags \u2014 so z", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'll help you book a flight for Ivan Smith that matches your current reservation. Let me first look up your profile and current reservation details.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"ivan_muller_7015\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Ivan\", \"last_name\": \"Muller\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"256 Pine Lane\", \"address2\": \"Suite 661\", \"city\": \"New York\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"NY\", \"zip\": \"10029\"}, \"email\": \"ivan.muller6623@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1968-04-25\", \"payment_methods\": {\"certificate_8998287\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_8998287\", \"amount\": 500.0}, \"credit_card_3563913\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_3563913\", \"brand\": \"mastercard\", \"last_four\": \"6710\"}, \"gift_card_8516878\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_8516878\", \"amount\": 128.0}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Ivan\", \"last_name\": \"Smith\", \"dob\": \"1986-03-14\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Lucas\", \"last_name\": \"Davis\", \"dob\": \"1988-10-12\"}], \"membership\": \"gold\", \"reservations\": [\"G72NSF\"]}\nassistant: I found your profile. You have a certificate (certificate_8998287) with a balance of $500.00, and your current reservation is G72NSF. Let me get the details of that reservation so I can match the flight exactly.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"G72NSF\", \"user_id\": \"ivan_muller_7015\", \"origin\": \"DTW\", \"destination\": \"SEA\", \"flight_type\": \"one_way\", \"cabin\": \"economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT097\", \"origin\": \"DTW\", \"destination\": \"PHX\", \"date\": \"2024-05-17\", \"price\": 158}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT251\", \"origin\": \"PHX\", \"destination\": \"SEA\", \"date\": \"2024-05-17\", \"price\": 141}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Ivan\", \"last_name\": \"Muller\", \"dob\": \"1968-04-25\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Isabella\", \"last_name\": \"Moore\", \"dob\": \"1952-01-28\"}], \"payment_history\": [{\"payment_id\": \"gift_card_8516878\", \"amount\": 658}], \"created_at\": \"2024-05-11T19:32:36\", \"total_baggages\": 2, \"nonfree_baggages\": 0, \"insurance\": \"yes\", \"status\": null}\nassistant: I have your current r", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 4, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 0, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "919bdbad", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T16:47:31"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "mem0", "phase": "test", "task_id": "23#1", "task_desc": "Hi, I'm Mohamed Silva. I need some assistance with my account. I'd like to find out the combined balance of all my gift cards and also the combined balance of any certificates I have. Additionally, I have a recent booking that I want to change to the cheapest business round trip available without altering the travel dates. I'm fine with either a direct flight or one with layovers.\nSure, my user ID is mohamed_silva_9265.\nSince you mentioned that basic economy can't be changed to a different itine", "score": 0.0, "em": 0.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: Hello Mohamed! To help you with your account and booking, I'll need your user ID first. Could you please provide your user ID (for example, something like \"mohamed_silva_123\")?\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"mohamed_silva_9265\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Mohamed\", \"last_name\": \"Silva\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"638 Elm Street\", \"address2\": \"Suite 548\", \"city\": \"Los Angeles\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"CA\", \"zip\": \"91365\"}, \"email\": \"mohamed.silva9198@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1960-11-26\", \"payment_methods\": {\"credit_card_5843230\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_5843230\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"2395\"}, \"gift_card_8020792\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_8020792\", \"amount\": 198.0}, \"certificate_3765853\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_3765853\", \"amount\": 500.0}, \"gift_card_6136092\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_6136092\", \"amount\": 129.0}, \"certificate_9984806\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_9984806\", \"amount\": 250.0}, \"credit_card_2198526\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_2198526\", \"brand\": \"mastercard\", \"last_four\": \"9363\"}, \"certificate_2765295\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_2765295\", \"amount\": 250.0}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Raj\", \"last_name\": \"Sanchez\", \"dob\": \"1986-09-12\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Liam\", \"last_name\": \"Wilson\", \"dob\": \"1980-03-27\"}], \"membership\": \"regular\", \"reservations\": [\"K1NW8N\"]}\nassistant: Let me calculate your gift card and certificate balances, and also look up your recent booking.\ntool: 327.0\ntool: 1000.0\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"K1NW8N\", \"user_id\": \"mohamed_silva_9265\", \"origin\": \"JFK\", \"destination\": \"SFO\", \"flight_type\": \"round_trip\", \"cabin\": \"basic_economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT023\", \"origin\": \"JFK\", \"destination\": \"SFO\", \"date\": \"2024-05-26\", \"price\": 53}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT204\", \"origin\": \"SFO\", \"destination\": \"SEA\", \"date\": \"2024-05-28\", \"price\": 71}, {\"flight_number\": \"", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 9, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 0, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "919bdbad", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T16:47:31"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "mem0", "phase": "test", "task_id": "13#0", "task_desc": "Hi, I need to make a change to my upcoming return flight. I currently have a one-stop flight booked from Atlanta to Los Angeles, and I\u2019d like to switch it to a nonstop flight from Atlanta to Las Vegas instead.\nI understand that policy, but I was specifically hoping to change this to a nonstop from ATL to LAS. Since you're saying the change isn't possible through your normal modification process, I'd like to be transferred to someone who can help me with this or look at other options. Can you tra", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'm sorry, but I'm unable to make this change. According to our flight modification policy, reservations can be modified without changing the **origin, destination, and trip type**. \n\nYour request would change the destination from Los Angeles (LAX) to Las Vegas (LAS), which is not permitted through flight modification.\n\nHere's what I *can* help you with instead, if you'd like:\n- Change the **date** of your existing Atlanta (ATL) \u2192 Los Angeles (LAX) flight (keeping the same origin, destination, and trip type)\n- Change the **cabin class** of your existing reservation\n- Add checked bags (cannot be removed)\n- Modify passenger details (without changing the number of passengers)\n\nIf you'd like to fly to Las Vegas instead, that would require canceling your current reservation (if eligible) and booking a new one. Please let me know if you'd like to explore any of the allowed options, and I'll need your user ID and reservation ID to proceed.", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 0, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 1, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "919bdbad", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T18:03:35"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "mem0", "phase": "test", "task_id": "19#0", "task_desc": "Hi, I have a reservation for a quick half-day trip to Texas, but I don\u2019t have my reservation ID with me right now. I need to change my return flight \u2014 it\u2019s currently set for 3pm on the 28th \u2014 to a later flight back to Newark that same day, or if that\u2019s not possible, the earliest flight the next day. Can you help me look that up?\nSure, my user ID is olivia_gonzalez_2305.\n###TRANSFER###", "score": 0.0, "em": 0.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I can help you look that up. First, I'll need your user ID to locate your reservation. Could you please provide your user ID?\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"olivia_gonzalez_2305\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Olivia\", \"last_name\": \"Gonzalez\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"334 Laurel Lane\", \"address2\": \"Suite 970\", \"city\": \"Los Angeles\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"CA\", \"zip\": \"90504\"}, \"email\": \"olivia.gonzalez4421@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1988-06-13\", \"payment_methods\": {\"gift_card_2200803\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_2200803\", \"amount\": 123.0}, \"credit_card_9969263\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_9969263\", \"brand\": \"mastercard\", \"last_four\": \"9475\"}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Mei\", \"last_name\": \"Johansson\", \"dob\": \"1981-09-25\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Yara\", \"last_name\": \"Lopez\", \"dob\": \"1975-09-15\"}], \"membership\": \"regular\", \"reservations\": [\"Z7GOZK\", \"K67C4W\", \"THY2DG\"]}\nassistant: I found your profile. You have three reservations (Z7GOZK, K67C4W, THY2DG). Let me check the details to find the one matching your Texas trip with a return flight on the 28th.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"Z7GOZK\", \"user_id\": \"olivia_gonzalez_2305\", \"origin\": \"EWR\", \"destination\": \"IAH\", \"flight_type\": \"round_trip\", \"cabin\": \"basic_economy\", \"flight