{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "mem0", "phase": "test", "task_id": "3#0", "task_desc": "Hi, this is Anya Garcia. I'm calling because I have an upcoming flight and I need to figure out the total number of suitcases my reservation allows me to bring. I've got a lot of things I need to pack for this trip and I'm pretty stressed about it, so it's really important that the information is correct. I'm pretty sure I'm a Gold member.\nSure, my user ID is anya_garcia_5901. And just to remind you, I'm really stressed about this trip and need to be sure about the baggage count \u2014 I believe I'm ", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: Hello Anya, I'd be happy to help you figure out your checked baggage allowance. To look up your reservation and membership details, I'll need your user ID first. Could you please provide your user ID?\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"anya_garcia_5901\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Anya\", \"last_name\": \"Garcia\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"555 Highland Drive\", \"address2\": \"Suite 243\", \"city\": \"San Antonio\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"TX\", \"zip\": \"78256\"}, \"email\": \"anya.garcia8816@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1992-11-12\", \"payment_methods\": {\"gift_card_2550356\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_2550356\", \"amount\": 149.0}, \"certificate_7583008\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_7583008\", \"amount\": 150.0}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Mei\", \"last_name\": \"Lee\", \"dob\": \"1989-12-13\"}], \"membership\": \"silver\", \"reservations\": [\"82K959\", \"790JYN\", \"BE2L57\", \"CXBB4L\", \"TAMSDK\", \"3RK2T9\", \"VAOW1B\", \"Q4MCUF\", \"JMO1MG\"]}\nassistant: I've located your profile, Anya. I want to make sure we get this exactly right, so let me clarify a couple of things:\n\n1. **Membership level:** According to your profile, your membership is actually **silver**, not gold. This matters because the free checked-bag allowance differs by membership level.\n\n2. **Which reservation?** You currently have several reservations on file (IDs: 82K959, 790JYN, BE2L57, CXBB4L, TAMSDK, 3RK2T9, VAOW1B, Q4MCUF, JMO1MG). To tell you the exact number of suitcases your reservation allows, I need to know which specific upcoming flight you're referring to.\n\nCould you please tell me:\n- The **reservation ID** for the trip you're packing for (if you have it), or\n- The **origin, destination, and date** of the flight so I can locate the correct reservation?\n\nOnce I have that, I'll pull up the reservation details (cabin class and number of passengers) and calculate your exact free checked-baggage allowance based on your silver membership.\ntool: Transfer successful\nassistant: YO", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 2, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 1, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "919bdbad", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T18:03:35"}
