{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "mem0", "phase": "test", "task_id": "6#0", "task_desc": "Hello. I'm checking my flight booking on your website and I'm pretty sure I opted for travel insurance when I booked, but it's not showing up in the details. I'm going on this trip with my family, and everyone else in my group already has insurance coverage for their flights. I really need to have insurance on mine as well, so I want to get this sorted out.\nMy user ID is sophia_taylor_9065. \n\nBut I really need to stress this \u2014 I'm not just looking for a verification, I need the insurance actuall", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'm sorry, but I'm unable to help with adding travel insurance to an existing reservation. According to our policy, travel insurance cannot be added after the initial booking is made. This is a restriction I'm not able to override.\n\nIf you believe you selected insurance at the time of booking but it's not appearing in your reservation details, I can help you look up your reservation to verify the current status. To do that, I'll need your user ID. Could you please provide it?\nassistant: I understand your concern, but I must follow our policy, which clearly states that travel insurance cannot be added after the initial booking is made. I'm not able to add it to an existing reservation.\n\nHowever, I can look up your booking to verify the current status of your reservation and confirm whether insurance is already included. Let me check your details.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"sophia_taylor_9065\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Sophia\", \"last_name\": \"Taylor\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"831 Elm Street\", \"address2\": \"Suite 304\", \"city\": \"Washington\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"DC\", \"zip\": \"20417\"}, \"email\": \"sophia.taylor4639@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1999-05-27\", \"payment_methods\": {\"credit_card_5237144\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_