{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "mem0", "phase": "test", "task_id": "13#1", "task_desc": "Hello, I need to make a change to an existing flight reservation I have. I've got a return trip from Atlanta to Los Angeles that currently has a stop, and I'd like to switch it to a nonstop flight from Atlanta to Las Vegas instead. I'm not looking to book anything new, just modify the flight I already have.\nI understand what you're explaining about the policy, but the key thing is I need to fly to Las Vegas, not Los Angeles. You're saying you can't change the destination from LAX to LAS, which m", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: To help you modify your reservation, I'll need your **user ID** and **reservation ID** first.\n\nHowever, I should let you know about an important policy constraint: per our modification rules, I can only modify flights while keeping the **same origin, destination, and trip type**. This means I cannot change your destination from Los Angeles (LAX) to Las Vegas (LAS), nor can I change the trip type (e.g., from round trip to one way). I *can* help you find a nonstop flight from Atlanta to Los Angeles instead, if that works for you.\n\nPlease provide your user ID and reservation ID so I can look up your booking. If you don't know your reservation ID, I can help locate it once I have your user ID.", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 0, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 1, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "919bdbad", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T18:03:35"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "mem0", "phase": "test", "task_id": "34#0", "task_desc": "Hi, I'm Yara Garcia. I have a booking with confirmation code HXDUBJ. I need to adjust my travel plans: I'd like to switch my outgoing flight to a nonstop one leaving the day after my original date, push my return from SFO back by a day as well, change the ticket to business class, and add a couple of checked bags. Can you help me with these changes?\nThanks for laying that out. I do want to flag that I have travel insurance \u2014 I read on your website that change fees should be waived when you have ", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'll help you with these changes. Let me first look up your reservation details to understand your current booking.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"HXDUBJ\", \"user_id\": \"yara_garcia_1905\", \"origin\": \"IAH\", \"destination\": \"SFO\", \"flight_type\": \"round_trip\", \"cabin\": \"economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT085\", \"origin\": \"IAH\", \"destination\": \"JFK\", \"date\": \"2024-05-18\", \"price\": 177}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT023\", \"origin\": \"JFK\", \"destination\": \"SFO\", \"date\": \"2024-05-18\", \"price\": 146}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT278\", \"origin\": \"SFO\", \"destination\": \"IAH\", \"date\": \"2024-05-22\", \"price\": 180}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Yara\", \"last_name\": \"Garcia\", \"dob\": \"1974-08-15\"}], \"payment_history\": [{\"payment_id\": \"gift_card_6941833\", \"amount\": 533}], \"created_at\": \"2024-05-04T06:04:48\", \"total_baggages\": 0, \"nonfree_baggages\": 0, \"insurance\": \"yes\", \"status\": null}\nassistant: Thank you. I've found your reservation. Let me review the details:\n\n- **Reservation:** HXDUBJ\n- **User ID:** yara_garcia_1905\n- **Trip:** Round trip, IAH \u2192 SFO (one-stop via JFK on 2024-05-18), return SFO \u2192 IAH on 2024-05-22\n- **Current cabin:** Economy\n- **Insurance:** Yes\n\nTo proceed with your requested changes, I need to find the new flights and confirm the current flights haven't been flown yet. Let me search for the options.\ntool: [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT072\", \"origin\": \"IAH\", \"destination\": \"SFO\", \"status\": \"available\", \"scheduled_departure_time_est\": \"09:00:00\", \"scheduled_arrival_time_est\": \"13:00:00\", \"date\": null, \"available_seats\": {\"basic_economy\": 18, \"economy\": 9, \"business\": 9}, \"prices\": {\"basic_economy\": 68, \"economy\": 130, \"business\": 282}}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT180\", \"origin\": \"IAH\", \"destination\": \"SFO\", \"status\": \"available\", \"scheduled_departure_time_est\": \"07:00:00\", \"scheduled_arrival_time_est\": \"11:00:00\", \"date\": null, \"available_seats\": {\"basic_economy\": 4, \"economy\": 17, \"business\": 15}, \"prices\": {\"basic_economy\": 65, \"econ", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 7, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 1, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "919bdbad", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T18:03:35"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "mem0", "phase": "test", "task_id": "15#0", "task_desc": "Hi, I have a flight booked from Atlanta to Philadelphia that I need to change. I\u2019d like to move it to the day after my original reservation, and I\u2019m hoping to find the cheapest Economy ticket that isn\u2019t Basic Economy. Also, since I live in Princeton, Newark is just as easy for me to get to as Philadelphia\u2014could you check options arriving at both PHL and EWR?\nSure, my user ID is aarav_garcia_1177.\nHmm, I'm a little confused here. When I first reached out, I specifically mentioned that I live in P", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'd be happy to help you change your flight. To get started, I'll need your **user ID** so I can locate your reservation. \n\nCould you please provide your user ID? (If you don't know your reservation ID, I can help find it once I have your user ID.)\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"aarav_garcia_1177\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Aarav\", \"last_name\": \"Garcia\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"833 Highland Drive\", \"address2\": \"Suite 740\", \"city\": \"Denver\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"CO\", \"zip\": \"80211\"}, \"email\": \"aarav.garcia6639@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1992-09-13\", \"payment_methods\": {\"certificate_7473723\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_7473723\", \"amount\": 150.0}, \"gift_card_8887175\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_8887175\", \"amount\": 35.0}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Lei\", \"last_name\": \"Ito\", \"dob\": \"1990-12-07\"}], \"membership\": \"gold\", \"reservations\": [\"M05KNL\", \"UHDAHF\"]}\nassistant: I found your profile. You have two reservations (M05KNL and UHDAHF). Let me check the details to find the Atlanta to Philadelphia flight.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"M05KNL\", \"user_id\": \"aarav_garcia_1177\", \"origin\": \"ATL\", \"destination\": \"PHL\", \"flight_type\": \"one_way\", \"cabin\": \"business\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT227\", \"origin\": \"ATL\", \"destination\": \"ORD\", \"date\": \"2024-05-23\", \"price\": 1936}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT139\", \"origin\": \"ORD\", \"destination\": \"PHL\", \"date\": \"2024-05-23\", \"price\": 851}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Aarav\", \"last_name\": \"Garcia\", \"dob\": \"1992-09-13\"}], \"payment_history\": [{\"payment_id\": \"gift_card_8887175\", \"amount\": 2787}], \"created_at\": \"2024-05-14T06:33:04\", \"total_baggages\": 0, \"nonfree_baggages\": 0, \"insurance\": \"no\", \"status\": null}\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"UHDAHF\", \"user_id\": \"aarav_garcia_1177\", \"origin\": \"CLT\", \"destination\": \"LAX\", \"flight_type\": \"round_trip\", \"cabin\": \"basic_economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT015\", \"origin\": \"CLT\", \"destination\": \"EWR\", \"date\": \"202", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 6, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 1, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "919bdbad", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T18:03:35"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "mem0", "phase": "test", "task_id": "29#0", "task_desc": "Hello, this is Raj Brown. I\u2019m dealing with a health issue at the moment, and because I bought trip insurance for my travel, I\u2019d like any change fees waived. I have a reservation under VA5SGQ \u2014 it\u2019s a roundtrip from Detroit to LaGuardia, and I need to switch it to nonstop flights from Detroit to JFK and back, keeping the exact same travel dates. I\u2019m only interested in early flights that land before 7\u202fAM at the destination, and I want the cheapest regular Economy (not Basic Economy) fares that fit", "score": 0.0, "em": 0.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'll help you look into this. First, let me pull up your reservation details to confirm the information and your user ID.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"VA5SGQ\", \"user_id\": \"raj_brown_5782\", \"origin\": \"DTW\", \"destination\": \"LGA\", \"flight_type\": \"round_trip\", \"cabin\": \"economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT035\", \"origin\": \"DTW\", \"destination\": \"PHX\", \"date\": \"2024-05-17\", \"price\": 163}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT066\", \"origin\": \"PHX\", \"destination\": \"LGA\", \"date\": \"2024-05-17\", \"price\": 184}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT002\", \"origin\": \"LGA\", \"destination\": \"PHX\", \"date\": \"2024-05-19\", \"price\": 174}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT106\", \"origin\": \"PHX\", \"destination\": \"DTW\", \"date\": \"2024-05-20\", \"price\": 135}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Raj\", \"last_name\": \"Brown\", \"dob\": \"1967-03-12\"}], \"payment_history\": [{\"payment_id\": \"credit_card_8003957\", \"amount\": 686}], \"created_at\": \"2024-05-08T18:28:13\", \"total_baggages\": 0, \"nonfree_baggages\": 0, \"insurance\": \"yes\", \"status\": null}\nassistant: I've pulled up your reservation **VA5SGQ**. Here's what I found:\n\n- **User ID:** raj_brown_5782\n- **Trip type:** Round trip, **Economy** (not Basic Economy) \u2