{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "mem0", "phase": "test", "task_id": "19#1", "task_desc": "Hi, I have a trip booked to Texas for a crazy half-day visit, but I don't have my reservation ID handy. I need to change my return flight back to Newark. Currently I'm on a 3pm departure on the 28th, and I'd like to switch to a later flight that same day, or if that's not possible, the earliest flight the next day.\nSure, my user ID is olivia_gonzalez_2305.\n###TRANSFER###", "score": 0.0, "em": 0.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'd be happy to help you modify your return flight. To locate your reservation, I'll need your user ID first. Could you please provide your user ID?\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"olivia_gonzalez_2305\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Olivia\", \"last_name\": \"Gonzalez\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"334 Laurel Lane\", \"address2\": \"Suite 970\", \"city\": \"Los Angeles\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"CA\", \"zip\": \"90504\"}, \"email\": \"olivia.gonzalez4421@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1988-06-13\", \"payment_methods\": {\"gift_card_2200803\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_2200803\", \"amount\": 123.0}, \"credit_card_9969263\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_9969263\", \"brand\": \"mastercard\", \"last_four\": \"9475\"}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Mei\", \"last_name\": \"Johansson\", \"dob\": \"1981-09-25\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Yara\", \"last_name\": \"Lopez\", \"dob\": \"1975-09-15\"}], \"membership\": \"regular\", \"reservations\": [\"Z7GOZK\", \"K67C4W\", \"THY2DG\"]}\nassistant: Let me look up your reservations to find the one matching your trip.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"Z7GOZK\", \"user_id\": \"olivia_gonzalez_2305\", \"origin\": \"EWR\", \"destination\": \"IAH\", \"flight_type\": \"round_trip\", \"cabin\": \"basic_economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT188\", \"origin\": \"EWR\", \"destination\": \"IAH\", \"date\": \"2024-05-28\", \"price\": 52}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT207\", \"origin\": \"IAH\", \"destination\": \"EWR\", \"date\": \"2024-05-28\", \"price\": 87}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Olivia\", \"last_name\": \"Gonzalez\", \"dob\": \"1988-06-13\"}], \"payment_history\": [{\"payment_id\": \"gift_card_2200803\", \"amount\": 169}], \"created_at\": \"2024-05-13T19:41:32\", \"total_baggages\": 0, \"nonfree_baggages\": 0, \"insurance\": \"yes\", \"status\": null}\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"K67C4W\", \"user_id\": \"olivia_gonzalez_2305\", \"origin\": \"LAS\", \"destination\": \"MCO\", \"flight_type\": \"one_way\", \"cabin\": \"economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT137\", \"origin\": \"LAS\", \"destination\": \"MCO\", \"date\": \"2024-05-17\", \"price\": 114}], \"passengers\":", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 5, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 1, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "919bdbad", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T18:03:35"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "mem0", "phase": "test", "task_id": "11#1", "task_desc": "Hi, I'm James Patel and I'm in a hurry. I need to remove a passenger named Sophia from my round trip flights from Las Vegas to Denver \u2014 departure May 19, return May 20. I want her taken off that booking and the full amount refunded to my original payment method. How much would that refund be? Just get it done quickly, please.\n###TRANSFER###", "score": 0.0, "em": 0.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'm sorry, but I'm unable to process this request. According to our policy, the number of passengers on a reservation cannot be modified \u2014 this restriction applies to both automated agents and human agents. Removing Sophia would reduce the passenger count, which is not permitted under any circumstances.\n\nBecause of this, I also cannot calculate or issue the refund you're asking about, since that refund is tied to removing a passenger.\n\nSince I cannot handle this request within my scope, I'll transfer you to a human agent who can discuss possible alternatives with you \u2014 for example, canceling the entire reservation and rebooking with the desired passenger count. Please hold on.", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 0, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 1, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "919bdbad", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T18:03:35"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "mem0", "phase": "test", "task_id": "8#1", "task_desc": "Hello, I need to book a one-way trip from Chicago to Philadelphia on May 26. I actually flew the same route on May 10 and I\u2019d like to book that exact same flight again \u2014 not a different one, just the identical flight I took then.\nSure, my user ID is sophia_silva_7557. I\u2019m hoping you can pull up the flight I took from ORD to PHL on May 10 using that, since I don\u2019t have the flight number handy.\nGreat, HAT271 on May 26 is exactly the flight I took on May 10, so let\u2019s go with that.\n\nFor passengers: ", "score": 0.0, "em": 0.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: To help you book this trip, I'll first need your user ID so I can look up the flight you took on May 10. Could you please provide your user ID?\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"sophia_silva_7557\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Sophia\", \"last_name\": \"Silva\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"141 Cedar Avenue\", \"address2\": \"Suite 436\", \"city\": \"Columbus\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"OH\", \"zip\": \"43282\"}, \"email\": \"sophia.silva5929@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1957-10-05\", \"payment_methods\": {\"certificate_8045380\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_8045380\", \"amount\": 500.0}, \"certificate_3887113\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_3887113\", \"amount\": 150.0}, \"credit_card_4196779\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_4196779\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"7238\"}, \"gift_card_5094406\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_5094406\", \"amount\": 274.0}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Yara\", \"last_name\": \"Silva\", \"dob\": \"1972-06-16\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Isabella\", \"last_name\": \"Moore\", \"dob\": \"1988-06-04\"}], \"membership\": \"regular\", \"reservations\": [\"NM1VX1\", \"KC18K6\", \"S61CZX\", \"H8Q05L\", \"WUNA5K\"]}\nassistant: I found your prof