{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "mem0", "phase": "test", "task_id": "6#1", "task_desc": "Hi, I'm looking at my upcoming flight booking online and I thought I had added travel insurance to it when I booked, but I don't see it listed anywhere in my trip details. Everyone else in my family already has insurance on their flights, so I really need to make sure mine gets covered too.\nWait, no \u2014 I'm not trying to add it after the fact. I'm *sure* I selected the insurance option right when I booked the flight, it just isn't showing up in my online trip details now. My user ID is sophia_tayl", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I understand your concern about the travel insurance. However, I need to let you know that per our policy, **travel insurance cannot be added after the initial booking** \u2014 it can only be purchased at the time the reservation is created. So unfortunately, I'm not able to add insurance to your existing reservation.\n\nThat said, I can help you verify the current status of your reservation to confirm whether insurance is already included. To do that, I'll need a couple of details:\n\n1. Your **user ID** (e.g., something like `sara_doe_496`)\n2. Your **reservation ID** (e.g., `ZFA04Y`) \u2014 if you don't have it handy, I can help locate it once I have your user ID.\n\nCould you please provide your user ID (and reservation ID if you have it)? I'll then look up the details so we can confirm whether insurance is already on your trip.\nassistant: Let me look up your reservation details to verify the current status of the insurance.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"PEP4E0\", \"user_id\": \"sophia_taylor_9065\", \"origin\": \"CLT\", \"destination\": \"PHX\", \"flight_type\": \"one_way\", \"cabin\": \"basic_economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT176\", \"origin\": \"CLT\", \"destination\": \"DTW\", \"date\": \"2024-05-20\", \"price\": 51}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT097\", \"origin\": \"DTW\", \"destination\": \"PHX\", \"date\": \"2024-05-20\", \"price\": 77}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Sophia\", \"last_name\": \"Taylor\", \"dob\": \"1999-05-27\"}], \"payment_history\": [{\"payment_id\": \"credit_card_9302073\", \"amount\": 128}], \"created_at\": \"2024-05-05T05:10:43\", \"total_baggages\": 0, \"nonfree_baggages\": 0, \"insurance\": \"no\", \"status\": null}\nassistant: I've pulled up your reservation **PEP4E0** (Sophia Taylor, CLT \u2192 PHX, one-way, basic economy, created on 2024-05-05). The system record shows:\n\n- **Insurance: \"no\"**\n- Cabin: basic economy\n- Payment: $128 via credit card\n\nI understand you're confident you selected the insurance option at the time of booking, and I can see that the record currently reflec", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 2, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 1, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "919bdbad", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T18:03:35"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "mem0", "phase": "test", "task_id": "21#0", "task_desc": "I need to change the return flight for my Houston to Denver trip. The departure is May 27, and I want to change the return to the fastest possible option that same day. It's urgent\u2014I need to get this done ASAP.\nMy user ID is sofia_kim_7287. I don't remember my reservation ID, sorry.\nYes, please go ahead and make that change \u2014 it's urgent so I need it done ASAP. For the payment, I want you to use my gift card with the smallest balance, the one with $6 on it (gift_card_7480005).\nOh, I see \u2014 I didn", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'll help you change the return flight for your Houston to Denver trip. First, I need some information to locate your reservation.\n\nCould you please provide your **user ID**? Also, if you have your **reservation ID** handy, please share that as well. If you don't know the reservation ID, I can help locate it once I have your user ID.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"sofia_kim_7287\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Sofia\", \"last_name\": \"Kim\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"825 Laurel Lane\", \"address2\": \"Suite 595\", \"city\": \"Houston\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"TX\", \"zip\": \"77243\"}, \"email\": \"sofia.kim1937@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1950-06-24\", \"payment_methods\": {\"certificate_8544743\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_8544743\", \"amount\": 250.0}, \"credit_card_9879898\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_9879898\", \"brand\": \"mastercard\", \"last_four\": \"9725\"}, \"gift_card_7091239\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_7091239\", \"amount\": 157.0}, \"gift_card_6276644\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_6276644\", \"amount\": 113.0}, \"gift_card_7480005\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_7480005\", \"amount\": 6.0}, \"certificate_9932251\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_9932251\", \"amount\": 250.0}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Mia\", \"last_name\": \"Jackson\", \"dob\": \"1986-05-05\"}], \"membership\": \"silver\", \"reservations\": [\"OI5L9G\", \"AQLBTL\", \"KA7I60\", \"I57WUD\", \"OBUT9V\", \"4BMN53\", \"Q0ZF0J\"]}\nassistant: I found your profile. You have several reservations. Let me locate the Houston to Denver round trip with a May 27 departure by checking your reservations.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"OI5L9G\", \"user_id\": \"sofia_kim_7287\", \"origin\": \"MCO\", \"destination\": \"CLT\", \"flight_type\": \"one_way\", \"cabin\": \"business\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT017\", \"origin\": \"MCO\", \"destination\": \"BOS\", \"date\": \"2024-05-25\", \"price\": 523}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT277\", \"origin\": \"BOS\", \"destination\": \"CLT\", \"date\": \"2024-05-25\", ", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 12, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 1, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "919bdbad", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T18:03:35"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "mem0", "phase": "test", "task_id": "33#0", "task_desc": "Hello, I'm Yara Garcia. I have a reservation under the code HXDUBJ. I need to make some changes to my trip \u2014 I\u2019d like to switch my upcoming outgoing flight to a nonstop one that leaves the day after my original date, and I also want to push my return flight from SFO back by one day. Can you help me with that?\nThanks for pulling those up. I notice the first outgoing option, HAT180, leaves at 7:00am \u2014 that\u2019s too early for me. I\u2019m only looking at flights that depart after 8am and before 9pm, so I\u2019d", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'll help you modify your reservation. Let me first look up the details of your reservation to understand your current trip.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"HXDUBJ\", \"user_id\": \"yara_garcia_1905\", \"origin\": \"IAH\", \"destination\": \"SFO\", \"flight_type\": \"round_trip\", \"cabin\": \"economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT085\", \"origin\": \"IAH\", \"destination\": \"JFK\", \"date\": \"2024-05-18\", \"price\": 177}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT023\", \"origin\": \"JFK\", \"destination\": \"SFO\", \"date\": \"2024-05-18\", \"price\": 146}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT278\", \"origin\": \"SFO\", \"destination\": \"IAH\", \"date\": \"2024-05-22\", \"price\": 180}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Yara\", \"last_name\": \"Garcia\", \"dob\": \"1974-08-15\"}], \"payment_history\": [{\"payment_id\": \"gift_card_6941833\", \"amount\": 533}], \"created_at\": \"2024-05-04T06:04:48\", \"total_baggages\": 0, \"nonfree_baggages\": 0, \"insurance\": \"yes\", \"status\": null}\nassistant: Thank you, Yara. I've located your reservation (HXDUBJ) under user ID **yara_garcia_1905**.\n\nHere's your current trip:\n- **Outgoing (one-stop):** IAH \u2192 JFK (HAT085) \u2192 SFO (HAT023) on 2024-05-18\n- **Return:** SFO \u2192 IAH (HAT278) on 2024-05-22\n- Cabin: Economy\n\nTo make your requested changes, I need to find:\n1. A **nonstop** flight from IAH to SFO on **2024-05-19** (day after original outgoing date)\n2. A return flight from SFO to IAH on **2024-05-23** (one day later than original)\n\nLet me search for available flights.\ntool: [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT072\", \"origin\": \"IAH\", \"destination\": \"SFO\", \"status\": \"available\", \"scheduled_departure_time_est\": \"09:00:00\", \"scheduled_arrival_time_est\": \"13:00:00\", \"date\": null, \"available_seats\": {\"basic_economy\": 18, \"economy\": 9, \"business\": 9}, \"prices\": {\"basic_economy\": 68, \"economy\": 130, \"business\": 282}}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT180\", \"origin\": \"IAH\", \"destination\": \"SFO\", \"status\": \"available\", \"scheduled_departure_time_est\": \"07:00:00\", \"scheduled_arrival_time_est\": \"11:00:00\", \"date\": null, \"available_se", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 8, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 1, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "919bdbad", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T18:03:35"}
