{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "mem0", "phase": "test", "task_id": "31#1", "task_desc": "Hello, I'm calling because I need to change my upcoming flight. I'm supposed to fly out of JFK on May 17, but my cat is very sick and I need to get home sooner. I'd like to switch to a nonstop flight if possible.\nOf course. My user ID is daiki_lee_6144. I'm not sure what my reservation ID is, but hopefully you can find it with that.\nI see. That's really unfortunate because my cat is sick and I urgently need to get home sooner. But if that flight can't be changed at all due to the basic economy r", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'm sorry to hear about your cat. I'd be happy to help you change your flight. \n\nTo get started, I'll need your user ID. Could you please provide that? If you don't know your reservation ID, I can help locate it once I have your user ID.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"daiki_lee_6144\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Daiki\", \"last_name\": \"Lee\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"410 River Road\", \"address2\": \"Suite 380\", \"city\": \"Fort Worth\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"TX\", \"zip\": \"76173\"}, \"email\": \"daiki.lee6987@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1976-10-08\", \"payment_methods\": {\"credit_card_6198952\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_6198952\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"9734\"}, \"gift_card_3112961\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_3112961\", \"amount\": 51.0}, \"gift_card_5128346\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_5128346\", \"amount\": 262.0}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Raj\", \"last_name\": \"Muller\", \"dob\": \"1967-10-16\"}], \"membership\": \"regular\", \"reservations\": [\"DF89BM\", \"COVE6R\", \"IIHXDG\"]}\nassistant: I found your profile. You have three reservations: DF89BM, COVE6R, and IIHXDG. Let me look up the details to find the one with your JFK flight on May 17.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"DF89BM\", \"user_id\": \"daiki_lee_6144\", \"origin\": \"JFK\", \"destination\": \"DTW\", \"flight_type\": \"round_trip\", \"cabin\": \"basic_economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT079\", \"origin\": \"JFK\", \"destination\": \"ORD\", \"date\": \"2024-05-17\", \"price\": 63}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT020\", \"origin\": \"ORD\", \"destination\": \"DTW\", \"date\": \"2024-05-17\", \"price\": 78}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT263\", \"origin\": \"DTW\", \"destination\": \"JFK\", \"date\": \"2024-05-24\", \"price\": 53}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Daiki\", \"last_name\": \"Lee\", \"dob\": \"1976-10-08\"}], \"payment_history\": [{\"payment_id\": \"gift_card_3112961\", \"amount\": 194}], \"created_at\": \"2024-05-01T23:25:01\", \"total_baggages\": 0, \"nonfree_baggages\": 0, \"insurance\": \"no\", \"status\": null}\nassistant: This reservation ", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 4, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 1, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "919bdbad", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T18:03:35"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "mem0", "phase": "test", "task_id": "29#1", "task_desc": "Hi, this is Raj Brown. I'm calling because I've been having a health problem, and I did purchase trip insurance for my upcoming travel\u2014so I'd like any change fees waived under that coverage. I need to modify my current roundtrip flights from Detroit to LaGuardia to nonstop flights from Detroit to JFK and back, keeping the same travel dates. I'm only interested in early morning flights that arrive at the destination before 7am, and I want the cheapest regular Economy (not Basic Economy) options t", "score": 0.0, "em": 0.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: Thank you for reaching out, Raj. Before I can look up your reservation, I'll need your **user ID** (and your **reservation ID** if you have it \u2014 if not, I can help locate it once I have your user ID).\n\nI also need to flag an important policy limitation regarding your request:\n\nPer our flight modification policy, when changing flights on an existing reservation, the **origin, destination, and trip type must remain unchanged**. Your current reservation is a roundtrip between **Detroit (DTW) and LaGuardia (LGA)**, but you're requesting a change to **JFK** as the destination. Since LGA and JFK are different airports, this would be changing the destination, which is **not permitted** through modification.\n\nWhat I *can* help you with under a modification (once I have your details):\n- Change to different flight times on the **same DTW \u2194 LGA route** (e.g., early-morning Economy flights arriving before 7am, if available)\n- Change cabin class (if eligible)\n- Add a checked bag\n- Update passenger details (without changing the number of passengers)\n\nRegarding your travel insurance and health situation: I can confirm the insurance coverage details once I review your reservation, and it may allow a full refund if you instead choose to **cancel** the trip (rather than modify to a different destination).\n\nPlease provide your **user ID** so I can pull up your reservation and help you with the options that are available.", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 0, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 1, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "919bdbad", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T18:03:35"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "mem0", "phase": "test", "task_id": "12#1", "task_desc": "Hello. I have an upcoming trip from Boston to Minneapolis and I need to make some changes to my booking. I\u2019d like to change the cabin class for all passengers on the reservation to business. Also, I want to add two checked bags under my name using my Gold membership, even if the upgrade can\u2019t be done. Can you help me with that?\nSure, my user ID is chen_lee_6825 and the reservation ID is YAX4DR. That's for my flight from Boston to Minneapolis.\nWait, the total difference of $1,200 is way more than", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: Hello! I'd be happy to help you with changing the cabin class and adding checked bags to your reservation.\n\nTo get started, I'll need a few details:\n1. Your **user ID** (e.g., 'sara_doe_496')\n2. Your **reservation ID** (e.g., 'ZFA04Y') \u2014 if you don't know it, I can help locate it using your user ID.\n\nOnce I have these, I'll look up your reservation to verify the details before making any changes. Please provide your user ID and reservation ID.\nassistant: Thank you! Let me look up your reservation and user profile to verify the details.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"YAX4DR\", \"user_id\": \"chen_lee_6825\", \"origin\": \"BOS\", \"destination\": \"MSP\", \"flight_type\": \"one_way\", \"cabin\": \"economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT235\", \"origin\": \"BOS\", \"destination\": \"MCO\", \"date\": \"2024-05-18\", \"price\": 122}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT298\", \"origin\": \"MCO\", \"destination\": \"MSP\", \"date\": \"2024-05-19\", \"price\": 127}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Chen\", \"last_name\": \"Lee\", \"dob\": \"1967-12-12\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Noah\", \"last_name\": \"Hernandez\", \"dob\": \"1968-01-06\"}], \"payment_history\": [{\"payment_id\": \"credit_card_4938634\", \"amount\": 498}], \"created_at\": \"2024-05-05T23:00:15\", \"total_baggages\