). Under our policy, **basic economy flights cannot be modified** \u2014 this includes changing flight dates. Additionally, the outbound portion of your trip was scheduled for May 14, which has already taken place (today is May 15).\n\nBecause I'm unable to change the flight dates for this reservation within my system, I'll connect you with a human agent who can review your circumstances and explore what options may be available to you.\ntool: Transfer successful\nassistant: YOU ARE BEING TRANSFERRED TO A HUMAN AGENT. PLEASE HOLD ON.", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 2, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 1, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "919bdbad", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T18:03:35"}
