{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "mem0", "phase": "test", "task_id": "35#1", "task_desc": "Hello, my name is Aarav Ahmed. I have a flight booked from JFK to MCO on May 22 that I need to cancel. Since I'm a silver member, I understand I'm entitled to a full refund.\nSure, my user ID is aarav_ahmed_6699. And just to be clear, I'm a silver member, so I should be getting a full refund for this cancellation \u2014 that's the policy for my tier.\nI'm sorry, but I have to push back on that. As a silver member, I've always understood that I'm entitled to a full refund when I cancel \u2014 that's one of t", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: Hello! I'd be happy to help you with the cancellation. To proceed, I'll need your user ID first. Could you please provide your user ID? (It usually looks something like 'firstname_lastname_123'.)\nassistant: Let me look up your account details to verify your membership and locate the reservation.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"aarav_ahmed_6699\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Aarav\", \"last_name\": \"Ahmed\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"176 Willow Lane\", \"address2\": \"Suite 431\", \"city\": \"Jacksonville\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"FL\", \"zip\": \"32131\"}, \"email\": \"aarav.ahmed6812@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1981-05-26\", \"payment_methods\": {\"credit_card_9074831\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_9074831\", \"brand\": \"mastercard\", \"last_four\": \"7334\"}, \"certificate_9645872\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_9645872\", \"amount\": 250.0}, \"credit_card_4959530\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_4959530\", \"brand\": \"mastercard\", \"last_four\": \"5018\"}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Aarav\", \"last_name\": \"Patel\", \"dob\": \"1980-12-03\"}], \"membership\": \"silver\", \"reservations\": [\"M20IZO\", \"N6F783\", \"IFOYYZ\", \"NQNU5R\"]}\nassistant: Thank you for confirming. I can see you're a silver member. Now let me locate the specific reservation for your JFK to MCO flight on May 22 by checking your reservations.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"M20IZO\", \"user_id\": \"aarav_ahmed_6699\", \"origin\": \"JFK\", \"destination\": \"MCO\", \"flight_type\": \"one_way\", \"cabin\": \"economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT268\", \"origin\": \"JFK\", \"destination\": \"ATL\", \"date\": \"2024-05-22\", \"price\": 136}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT010\", \"origin\": \"ATL\", \"destination\": \"MCO\", \"date\": \"2024-05-22\", \"price\": 109}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Aarav\", \"last_name\": \"Ahmed\", \"dob\": \"1981-05-26\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Daiki\", \"last_name\": \"Li\", \"dob\": \"1980-12-24\"}], \"payment_history\": [{\"payment_id\": \"credit_card_4959530\", \"amount\": 490}], \"created_at\": \"2024-05-12T09:36:29\", \"tota", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 10, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 1, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "919bdbad", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T18:03:35"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "mem0", "phase": "test", "task_id": "18#1", "task_desc": "Look, I've run into some money troubles and I need to downgrade every business class flight I have booked to economy. I don't want to change any of the flights or the passenger details\u2014just the cabin class. I know I might sound a bit frustrated, but I'm willing to work with you to get this sorted out.\nYeah, fine. My user ID is omar_davis_3817. Like I said, I need all my business flights dropped down to economy\u2014no changes to the flights themselves or who's flying. This whole money situation has m", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I understand, and I'm happy to help you downgrade your business class reservations to economy. \n\nTo get started, I'll need your **user ID** so I can locate all of your reservations. Once I have that, I can identify which ones are in business class and help you change the cabin.\n\nCould you please provide your user ID?\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"omar_davis_3817\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Omar\", \"last_name\": \"Davis\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"281 Spruce Street\", \"address2\": \"Suite 942\", \"city\": \"San Diego\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"CA\", \"zip\": \"92164\"}, \"email\": \"omar.davis7857@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1982-10-19\", \"payment_methods\": {\"gift_card_3481935\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_3481935\", \"amount\": 22.0}, \"credit_card_2929732\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_2929732\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"7803\"}, \"credit_card_9525117\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_9525117\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"2172\"}, \"gift_card_6847880\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_6847880\", \"amount\": 31.0}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Juan\", \"last_name\": \"Ahmed\", \"dob\": \"1992-11-19\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Anya\", \"last_name\": \"T