{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "mem0", "phase": "test", "task_id": "23#1", "task_desc": "Hello, I'm Mohamed Silva. I'd like to check the combined balance on my gift cards and also the total value of my certificates. On top of that, I have a recent booking I want to change to the cheapest business class round trip available, but I need to keep the same travel dates. Could you help me with both of those things?\nSure, my user ID is mohamed_silva_9265. Once you pull that up, I'd like to know the total of my gift card balances and the total of my certificate balances, and then I'll need ", "score": 0.0, "em": 0.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: Hello Mohamed! I'd be happy to help with both of those requests.\n\nTo get started, I'll need your **user ID** (for example, something like `mohamed_silva_123`). This will let me look up your gift card balances, certificate values, and your recent booking. Could you please provide that?\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"mohamed_silva_9265\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Mohamed\", \"last_name\": \"Silva\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"638 Elm Street\", \"address2\": \"Suite 548\", \"city\": \"Los Angeles\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"CA\", \"zip\": \"91365\"}, \"email\": \"mohamed.silva9198@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1960-11-26\", \"payment_methods\": {\"credit_card_5843230\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_5843230\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"2395\"}, \"gift_card_8020792\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_8020792\", \"amount\": 198.0}, \"certificate_3765853\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_3765853\", \"amount\": 500.0}, \"gift_card_6136092\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_6136092\", \"amount\": 129.0}, \"certificate_9984806\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_9984806\", \"amount\": 250.0}, \"credit_card_2198526\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_2198526\", \"brand\": \"m