{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "amem", "phase": "test", "task_id": "3#0", "task_desc": "Hi, I'm feeling a bit overwhelmed about an upcoming trip. I need to find out exactly how many suitcases my reservation lets me take on the flight\u2014I\u2019ve got a lot of things I have to bring and it\u2019s really important that I get the right information. I\u2019m pretty sure I\u2019m a Gold member, if that makes a difference.\nSure, yes. I\u2019m Anya Garcia\u2014my user ID is anya_garcia_5901. And the confirmation number for my trip is JMO1MG. \n\nLike I said, I\u2019m really stressed about this because I have a lot to pack and i", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I can help you with that. To look up your reservation and the baggage allowance, I'll need a couple of details first:\n\n1. Your **user ID** (for example, something like \"sara_doe_496\").\n2. Your **reservation ID** (for example, \"ZFA04Y\"). If you don't have the reservation ID handy, I can help locate it once I have your user ID.\n\nCould you please provide your user ID? And if you have the reservation ID, please share that as well.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"JMO1MG\", \"user_id\": \"anya_garcia_5901\", \"origin\": \"DEN\", \"destination\": \"MIA\", \"flight_type\": \"one_way\", \"cabin\": \"economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT255\", \"origin\": \"DEN\", \"destination\": \"MIA\", \"date\": \"2024-05-16\", \"price\": 149}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Anya\", \"last_name\": \"Garcia\", \"dob\": \"1992-11-12\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Raj\", \"last_name\": \"Jackson\", \"dob\": \"1956-03-09\"}], \"payment_history\": [{\"payment_id\": \"gift_card_2550356\", \"amount\": 358}], \"created_at\": \"2024-05-13T23:20:29\", \"total_baggages\": 1, \"nonfree_baggages\": 0, \"insurance\": \"yes\", \"status\": null}\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"anya_garcia_5901\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Anya\", \"last_name\": \"Garcia\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"555 Highland Drive\", \"address2\": \"Suite 243\", \"city\": \"San Antonio\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"TX\", \"zip\": \"78256\"}, \"email\": \"anya.garcia8816@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1992-11-12\", \"payment_methods\": {\"gift_card_2550356\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_2550356\", \"amount\": 149.0}, \"certificate_7583008\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_7583008\", \"amount\": 150.0}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Mei\", \"last_name\": \"Lee\", \"dob\": \"1989-12-13\"}], \"membership\": \"silver\", \"reservations\": [\"82K959\", \"790JYN\", \"BE2L57\", \"CXBB4L\", \"TAMSDK\", \"3RK2T9\", \"VAOW1B\", \"Q4MCUF\", \"JMO1MG\"]}\nassistant: I've looked up your reservation and profile. Here are the exact details:\n\n**Your membership:** You are actually a **Silver** member (not Gold, as you thought).\n\n**Your reser", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 2, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 0, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "919bdbad", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T19:15:42"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "amem", "phase": "test", "task_id": "32#0", "task_desc": "Hello. I have a flight departing from Newark (EWR) on May 21, and I urgently need to change it to a nonstop flight on the same day. My mom is very ill and I have to get back home as soon as possible to care for her.\nI'm Ivan Rossi. My user ID is ivan_rossi_8555.\n###TRANSFER###", "score": 0.0, "em": 0.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'm sorry to hear about your mother. I'll help you change your flight. To get started, I need your user ID. If you don't know your reservation ID, I can help locate it once I have your user ID.\n\nCould you please provide your user ID?\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"ivan_rossi_8555\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Ivan\", \"last_name\": \"Rossi\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"513 Main Street\", \"address2\": \"Suite 805\", \"city\": \"Philadelphia\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"PA\", \"zip\": \"19102\"}, \"email\": \"ivan.rossi2633@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1954-01-14\", \"payment_methods\": {\"gift_card_7344518\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_7344518\", \"amount\": 183.0}, \"gift_card_9823297\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_9823297\", \"amount\": 224.0}, \"credit_card_9659780\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_9659780\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"1777\"}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Ava\", \"last_name\": \"Silva\", \"dob\": \"1971-01-14\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Anya\", \"last_name\": \"Patel\", \"dob\": \"1990-06-13\"}], \"membership\": \"silver\", \"reservations\": [\"OWZ4XL\", \"F3IQK1\", \"8WMF4C\", \"L2H5FP\"]}\nassistant: I found your profile. You have several reservations. Let me check the details to find the one departing from Newark (EWR) on May 21.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"OWZ4XL\", \"user_id\": \"ivan_rossi_8555\", \"origin\": \"EWR\", \"destination\": \"LAX\", \"flight_type\": \"one_way\", \"cabin\": \"basic_economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT202\", \"origin\": \"EWR\", \"destination\": \"MIA\", \"date\": \"2024-05-21\", \"price\": 94}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT232\", \"origin\": \"MIA\", \"destination\": \"LAX\", \"date\": \"2024-05-21\", \"price\": 80}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Ivan\", \"last_name\": \"Rossi\", \"dob\": \"1954-01-14\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Olivia\", \"last_name\": \"Santos\", \"dob\": \"1984-06-23\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Lei\", \"last_name\": \"Johansson\", \"dob\": \"1995-10-22\"}], \"payment_history\": [{\"payment_id\": \"gift_card_9823297\", \"amount\": 522}], \"created_at\": \"2024-05-09T13:43:03\", \"total_baggage", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 6, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 0, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "919bdbad", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T19:15:42"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "amem", "phase": "test", "task_id": "29#0", "task_desc": "Hi, I'm calling because I'm dealing with a health problem and need to adjust my travel plans. I did purchase trip insurance for my booking, so I'd like any change fees waived if possible. \n\nRight now I have a roundtrip reservation from Detroit to LaGuardia and back, but I want to switch to nonstop flights from Detroit to JFK and back on the same dates as my current trip. I\u2019m only interested in early flights that arrive at the destination before 7am, and I need the cheapest regular Economy fare\u2014n", "score": 0.0, "em": 0.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I understand you'd like to change your roundtrip from Detroit\u2013LaGuardia to Detroit\u2013JFK. However, per our modification policy, flight changes cannot alter the origin or destination airport of a reservation\u2014only the specific flights, cabin, baggage, or passenger details can be modified while keeping the same origin and destination. Since changing LaGuardia (LGA) to JFK changes the destination, this isn't something I can process as a modification.\n\nI'll transfer you to a human agent who can look into alternatives (such as rebooking or cancellation) for you, especially given your travel insurance and health situation.\ntool: Transfer successful\nassistant: YOU ARE BEING TRANSFERRED TO A HUMAN AGENT. PLEASE HOLD ON.", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 1, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 0, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "919bdbad", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T19:15:42"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "amem", "phase": "test", "task_id": "31#0", "task_desc": "Hi, I need to change my upcoming flight. I'm supposed to fly out of JFK on May 17, but my cat is really sick back home and I need to get back sooner to take care of him. I was hoping to switch to a nonstop flight instead.\nOh, okay. My user ID is daiki_lee_6144. But I'm sorry, I don't have my reservation ID on me \u2014 I don't know what it is. Can you look it up with my user ID?\n###TRANSFER###", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'm sorry to hear about your cat. I'd be happy to help you look into changing your flight. \n\nTo get started, I'll need your user ID. Also, if you have your reservation ID handy, please share that as well. If you don't know your reservation ID, I can help locate it once I have your user ID.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"daiki_lee_6144\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Daiki\", \"last_name\": \"Lee\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"410 River Road\", \"address2\": \"Suite 380\", \"city\": \"Fort Worth\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"TX\", \"zip\": \"76173\"}, \"email\": \"daiki.lee6987@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1976-10-08\", \"payment_methods\": {\"credit_card_6198952\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_6198952\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"9734\"}, \"gift_card_3112961\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_3112961\", \"amount\": 51.0}, \"gift_card_5128346\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_5128346\", \"amount\": 262.0}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Raj\", \"last_name\": \"Muller\", \"dob\": \"1967-10-16\"}], \"membership\": \"regular\", \"reservations\": [\"DF89BM\", \"COVE6R\", \"IIHXDG\"]}\nassistant: I found your profile. You have three reservations: DF89BM, COVE6R, and IIHXDG. Let me look up the details of each to find the one departing from JFK on May 17.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"DF89BM\", \"user_id\": \"daiki_lee_6144\", \"origin\": \"JFK\", \"destination\": \"DTW\", \"flight_type\": \"round_trip\", \"cabin\": \"basic_economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT079\", \"origin\": \"JFK\", \"destination\": \"ORD\", \"date\": \"2024-05-17\", \"price\": 63}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT020\", \"origin\": \"ORD\", \"destination\": \"DTW\", \"date\": \"2024-05-17\", \"price\": 78}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT263\", \"origin\": \"DTW\", \"destination\": \"JFK\", \"date\": \"2024-05-24\", \"price\": 53}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Daiki\", \"last_name\": \"Lee\", \"dob\": \"1976-10-08\"}], \"payment_history\": [{\"payment_id\": \"gift_card_3112961\", \"amount\": 194}], \"created_at\": \"2024-05-01T23:25:01\", \"total_baggages\": 0, \"nonfree_baggages\": 0, \"ins", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 5, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 0, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "919bdbad", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T19:15:42"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "amem", "phase": "test", "task_id": "26#0", "task_desc": "Hi, I'm calling because I need to cancel my flight from MCO to CLT. I really need to make sure I get my refund for it.\nSure, my user ID is amelia_sanchez_4739. I'm Amelia Sanchez, by the way. I really need to get this flight from MCO to CLT canceled and make sure I get my refund.\nIt's just a change of plan, really. But regardless of the reason, I need to be clear that I insist on canceling this MCO to CLT flight and getting my refund processed.\nI understand what you're saying about the policy, b", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I can help you with that. First, I'll need some information to locate your reservation.\n\nCould you please provide your **user ID**?\nassistant: Thank you, Amelia. Let me look up your profile and reservations.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"amelia_sanchez_4739\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Amelia\", \"last_name\": \"Sanchez\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"225 Sunset Drive\", \"address2\": \"Suite 563\", \"city\": \"Los Angeles\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"CA\", \"zip\": \"91292\"}, \"email\": \"amelia.sanchez3631@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1955-02-01\", \"payment_methods\": {\"credit_card_4065275\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_4065275\", \"brand\": \"mastercard\", \"last_four\": \"3658\"}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Ivan\", \"last_name\": \"Martin\", \"dob\": \"1973-08-20\"}], \"membership\": \"gold\", \"reservations\": [\"3FRNFB\", \"Q4L9HS\"]}\nassistant: You have two reservations. Let me check the details of both to find the one from MCO to CLT.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"3FRNFB\", \"user_id\": \"amelia_sanchez_4739\", \"origin\": \"MCO\", \"destination\": \"CLT\", \"flight_type\": \"one_way\", \"cabin\": \"basic_economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT028\", \"origin\": \"MCO\", \"destination\": \"BOS\", \"date\": \"2024-05-28\", \"