{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "amem", "phase": "test", "task_id": "25#0", "task_desc": "Hello, I'm Ivan Muller. I'd like to make a reservation for my friend Ivan Smith \u2014 it should be exactly the same as the flight I currently have booked. Can you help me with that?\nSure, my user ID is ivan_muller_7015. Once you pull up my profile, you should see Ivan Smith listed there as my friend, and you can also see my current reservation details.\nYes, that's the correct Ivan Smith \u2014 he's the one saved in my profile, so the date of birth you found there is right.\n\nFor baggage, he won't need any", "score": 0.0, "em": 0.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: Hello! I'd be happy to help you book a reservation for your friend Ivan Smith with the same flights you currently have booked.\n\nFirst, I'll need your user ID to look up your current reservation. Could you please provide your user ID?\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"ivan_muller_7015\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Ivan\", \"last_name\": \"Muller\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"256 Pine Lane\", \"address2\": \"Suite 661\", \"city\": \"New York\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"NY\", \"zip\": \"10029\"}, \"email\": \"ivan.muller6623@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1968-04-25\", \"payment_methods\": {\"certificate_8998287\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_8998287\", \"amount\": 500.0}, \"credit_card_3563913\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_3563913\", \"brand\": \"mastercard\", \"last_four\": \"6710\"}, \"gift_card_8516878\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_8516878\", \"amount\": 128.0}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Ivan\", \"last_name\": \"Smith\", \"dob\": \"1986-03-14\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Lucas\", \"last_name\": \"Davis\", \"dob\": \"1988-10-12\"}], \"membership\": \"gold\", \"reservations\": [\"G72NSF\"]}\nassistant: Thank you! I can see your profile and that you have a current reservation (G72NSF). Let me pull up th