{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "amem", "phase": "test", "task_id": "4#0", "task_desc": "Hi, I'm Sophia Silva. I am absolutely furious right now. I had a business flight earlier this month that got canceled out of nowhere, and because of that I ended up missing a really important meeting. This whole situation caused me a ton of inconvenience and I expect to be compensated for it.\nYes, it's sophia_silva_7557. But honestly, just having my ID isn't going to fix the fact that I missed a critical business meeting because your airline canceled my flight without any warning. I need to be c", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'm sorry to hear about the inconvenience caused by the canceled flight. To look into this and confirm the details, I'll need your user ID. Could you please provide it?\nassistant: I understand your frustration. Let me look up your details to confirm the facts about the canceled flight.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"sophia_silva_7557\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Sophia\", \"last_name\": \"Silva\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"141 Cedar Avenue\", \"address2\": \"Suite 436\", \"city\": \"Columbus\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"OH\", \"zip\": \"43282\"}, \"email\": \"sophia.silva5929@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1957-10-05\", \"payment_methods\": {\"certificate_8045380\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_8045380\", \"amount\": 500.0}, \"certificate_3887113\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_3887113\", \"amount\": 150.0}, \"credit_card_4196779\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_4196779\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"7238\"}, \"gift_card_5094406\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_5094406\", \"amount\": 274.0}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Yara\", \"last_name\": \"Silva\", \"dob\": \"1972-06-16\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Isabella\", \"last_name\": \"Moore\", \"dob\": \"1988-06-04\"}], \"membership\": \"regu