{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "amem", "phase": "test", "task_id": "20#0", "task_desc": "Hello, I'm looking to book a one-way flight from New York to Seattle on May 20th.\nMy user ID is mia_li_3668. I don't have a preference between JFK or LGA \u2014 either New York airport works for me.\nI notice both of those flights depart before 11am EST \u2014 HAT069 at 6:00 and HAT083 at 1:00. I mentioned earlier that I don't want to fly before 11am. I'm fine with a one-stop flight if needed, but I'd need something departing after 11am. Are there any other options from JFK (or even LGA with a stopover) th", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: Hello! I'd be happy to help you book a one-way flight from New York to Seattle on May 20th.\n\nTo get started, I'll need your **user ID** (for example, something like \"sara_doe_496\"). Could you please provide that?\n\nAlso, just to confirm the airport codes:\n- New York: JFK (John F. Kennedy) or LGA (LaGuardia)\n- Seattle: SEA\n\nPlease let me know which New York airport you'd prefer to depart from, and provide your user ID so I can look up your profile.\nassistant: Thank you! Let me look up your profile first.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"mia_li_3668\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Mia\", \"last_name\": \"Li\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"975 Sunset Drive\", \"address2\": \"Suite 217\", \"city\": \"Austin\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"TX\", \"zip\": \"78750\"}, \"email\": \"mia.li3818@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1990-04-05\", \"payment_methods\": {\"credit_card_4421486\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_4421486\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"7447\"}, \"certificate_4856383\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_4856383\", \"amount\": 100.0}, \"certificate_7504069\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_7504069\", \"amount\": 250.0}, \"credit_card_1955700\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_1955700\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"1907\"}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Amelia\", \"last_name\": \"Ahmed\", \"dob\": \"1957-03-21\"}], \"membership\": \"gold\", \"reservations\": [\"NO6JO3\", \"AIXC49\", \"HKEG34\"]}\nassistant: Thank you, Mia! I can see you're a **gold member** with the following payment methods on file:\n- Credit card (Visa, ending 7447)\n- Credit card (Visa, ending 1907)\n- Travel certificate ($100)\n- Travel certificate ($250)\n\nLet me search for available flights from New York to Seattle on May 20th. I'll start with JFK.\ntool: [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT069\", \"origin\": \"JFK\", \"destination\": \"SEA\", \"status\": \"available\", \"scheduled_departure_time_est\": \"06:00:00\", \"scheduled_arrival_time_est\": \"12:00:00\", \"date\": null, \"available_seats\": {\"basic_econom", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 6, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 0, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "919bdbad", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T19:15:42"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "amem", "phase": "test", "task_id": "13#1", "task_desc": "Hello, I'd like to make a change to my existing flight reservation. I have a return trip that's currently a one-stop flight from Atlanta to Los Angeles, and I want to switch it to a nonstop flight from Atlanta to Las Vegas instead. I'm not looking to book anything new\u2014just modify the flight I already have.\nSince you've indicated that this change isn't possible under your policy, I'd like to request a transfer to someone who can help me with modifying my reservation as described. Please transfer ", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'm sorry, but I'm unable to make this change. According to our policy, flight modifications cannot change the **origin, destination, or trip type** of a reservation. Since your request would change the destination from Los Angeles (LAX) to Las Vegas (LAS), this modification is not permitted.\n\nIf you'd like, I can help you with modifications that keep the same origin and destination (such as changing to a different flight on the same route, changing the cabin class, updating baggage, or updating passenger details). Please let me know your user ID and reservation ID, and I can look into what changes are possible for your existing Atlanta (ATL) to Los Angeles (LAX) reservation.\ntool: Transfer successful\nassistant: YOU ARE BEING TRANSFERRED TO A HUMAN AGENT. PLEASE HOLD ON.", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 1, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 0, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "919bdbad", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T19:15:42"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "amem", "phase": "test", "task_id": "36#0", "task_desc": "I... I'm sorry... I don't even know how to say this. My wife... she passed away yesterday. I have a flight booked and I need to change the date\u2014push it out two days. I don't want to cancel it, I just... I can't travel tomorrow. Please, I'm so distraught... I just need to move the flight.\nThank you... I appreciate that. It's just... everything is a blur right now.\n\nMy user ID is lucas_brown_4047. And the reservation is EUJUY6. That's the one I need to move\u2014two days later. I can't... I can't get o", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'm so sorry for your loss. I can't imagine how difficult this is, and I'll do my best to help you change your flight.\n\nTo locate and update your reservation, I'll need a couple of details first:\n\n1. **Your user ID** (for example, something like `sara_doe_496`).\n2. **Your reservation ID** (for example, something like `ZFA04Y`). If you don't have the reservation ID handy, just give me your user ID and I can look up your reservations for you.\n\nOnce I have that, I'll find the flight and help you move it two days out. Please take your time.\nassistant: I'm truly sorry, Lucas. I'll help you move that flight. Let me pull up your reservation details first.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"EUJUY6\", \"user_id\": \"lucas_brown_4047\", \"origin\": \"ORD\", \"destination\": \"LAS\", \"flight_type\": \"round_trip\", \"cabin\": \"basic_economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT238\", \"origin\": \"ORD\", \"destination\": \"DEN\", \"date\": \"2024-05-14\", \"price\": 96}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT290\", \"origin\": \"DEN\", \"destination\": \"LAS\", \"date\": \"2024-05-14\", \"price\": 64}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT266\", \"origin\": \"LAS\", \"destination\": \"IAH\", \"date\": \"2024-05-16\", \"price\": 70}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT044\", \"origin\": \"IAH\", \"destination\": \"ORD\", \"date\": \"2024-05-16\", \"price\": 76}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Lucas\", \"last_name\": \"Brown\", \"dob\": \"1965-01-01\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Daiki\", \"last_name\": \"Thomas\", \"dob\": \"1996-06-21\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Daiki\", \"last_name\": \"Lopez\", \"dob\": \"1967-04-08\"}], \"payment_history\": [{\"payment_id\": \"gift_card_9049233\", \"amount\": 1008}], \"created_at\": \"2024-05-07T19:04:46\", \"total_baggages\": 0, \"nonfree_baggages\": 0, \"insurance\": \"yes\", \"status\": null}\nassistant: I've located your reservation **EUJUY6**. I'm so sorry, but I need to be straight with you about what I'm able to do.\n\nThis reservation is booked in **basic economy**. Under our airline policy, basic economy reservations cannot be modified \u2014 which means I'm not able to change the tr", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 1, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 0, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "919bdbad", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T19:15:42"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "amem", "phase": "test", "task_id": "12#0", "task_desc": "Hi, I have an upcoming flight from Boston to Minneapolis and I\u2019d like to change the class for everyone on my reservation to business.\nSure, my user ID is chen_lee_6825 and the reservation number is YAX4DR. The name on the booking is Chen Lee.\nThanks for the breakdown, but $1,200 is way over what I\u2019m willing to pay \u2014 I can only cover up to $650 in fees for a business class upgrade. Since upgrading both of us isn\u2019t within that limit, I\u2019d like to just upgrade my companion Noah Hernandez to business", "score": 0.0, "em": 0.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: To help you change the cabin class to business, I'll need some information first. Could you please provide your **user ID** and **reservation ID**? \n\nIf you don't know your reservation ID, I can help locate it once you provide your user ID.\nassistant: Let me look up your reservation details to verify the information.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"YAX4DR\", \"user_id\": \"chen_lee_6825\", \"origin\": \"BOS\", \"destination\": \"MSP\", \"flight_type\": \"one_way\", \"cabin\": \"economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT235\", \"origin\": \"BOS\", \"destination\": \"MCO\", \"date\": \"2024-05-18\", \"price\": 122}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT298\", \"origin\": \"MCO\", \"destination\": \"MSP\", \"date\": \"2024-05-19\", \"price\": 127}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Chen\", \"last_name\": \"Lee\", \"dob\": \"1967-12-12\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Noah\", \"last_name\": \"Hernandez\", \"dob\": \"1968-01-06\"}], \"payment_history\": [{\"payment_id\": \"credit_card_4938634\", \"amount\": 498}], \"created_at\": \"2024-05-05T23:00:15\", \"total_baggages\": 0, \"nonfree_baggages\": 0, \"insurance\": \"no\", \"status\": null}\nassistant: I have your reservation details. Before changing the cabin class, I need to verify the flights haven't been flown yet and check the business class prices. Let me gather this information.\ntool: available\ntool: available\ntool: [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT013\", \"origin\": \"BOS\", \"destination\": \"MCO\", \"status\": \"available\", \"scheduled_departure_time_est\": \"19:00:00\", \"scheduled_arrival_time_est\": \"22:30:00\", \"date\": null, \"available_seats\": {\"basic_economy\": 0, \"economy\": 5, \"business\": 14}, \"prices\": {\"basic_economy\": 65, \"economy\": 128, \"business\": 338}}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT145\", \"origin\": \"BOS\", \"destination\": \"MCO\", \"status\": \"available\", \"scheduled_departure_time_est\": \"16:00:00\", \"scheduled_arrival_time_est\": \"19:30:00\", \"date\": null, \"available_seats\": {\"basic_economy\": 18, \"economy\": 16, \"business\": 8}, \"prices\": {\"basic_economy\": 66, \"economy\": 137, \"business\": 401}}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT1", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 6, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 0, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "919bdbad", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T19:15:42"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "amem", "phase": "test", "task_id": "0#1", "task_desc": "Hi, I'd like to cancel a flight reservation I have. Could you help me with that?\nSure, my name is Emma Kim and my user ID is emma_kim_9957. The reservation I need to cancel is EHGLP3.\n###TRANSFER###", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'd be happy to help you cancel your flight reservation. \n\nTo get started, I'll need your user ID. Also, if you have your reservation ID handy, please provide that as well. If you don't know your reservation ID, I can help locate it once I have your user ID.\nassistant: Thank you, Emma. Let me look up your reservation details.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"EHGLP3\", \"user_id\": \"emma_kim_9957\", \"origin\": \"PHX\", \"destination\": \"JFK\", \"flight_type\": \"one_way\", \"cabin\": \"basic_economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT156\", \"origin\": \"PHX\", \"destination\": \"SEA\", \"date\": \"2024-05-17\", \"price\": 50}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT021\", \"origin\": \"SEA\", \"destination\": \"JFK\", \"date\": \"2024-05-17\", \"price\": 54}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Evelyn\", \"last_name\": \"Taylor\", \"dob\": \"1965-01-16\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Anya\", \"last_name\": \"Silva\", \"dob\": \"1971-11-22\"}], \"payment_history\": [{\"payment_id\": \"credit_card_5832574\", \"amount\": 208}], \"created_at\": \"2024-05-04T23:12:06\", \"total_baggages\": 0, \"nonfree_baggages\": 0, \"insurance\": \"no\", \"status\": null}\nassistant: I've retrieved your reservation. Before I can proceed, I need to check the status of your flights and also get a bit more information from you.\n\nLet me first check the flight status.\ntool: available\ntool: available\nassistant: I've checked both flights on your reservation (HAT156 PHX\u2192SEA and HAT021 SEA\u2192JFK, both scheduled for 2024-05-17), and they are currently **available** (not cancelled and not yet flown).\n\nBased on our cancellation policy, a reservation can only be cancelled if **one** of the following conditions is met:\n- The booking was made within the last 24 hours\n- The flight is cancelled by the airline\n- It is a business class flight\n- The user has travel insurance covering the cancellation reason\n\nFor your reservation EHGLP3, I found that:\n- It was booked on **2024-05-04** (well over 24 hours ago)\n- Both flights are **available**, not cancelled by the airline\n- The cabi", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 4, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 0, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "919bdbad", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T19:15:42"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "amem", "phase": "test", "task_id": "2#0", "task_desc": "Hi, I'd like to book a flight from San Francisco to New York.\nSure, my user ID is noah_muller_9847.\nRight, so I need to book for 3 passengers traveling from San Francisco to New York. But actually, never mind that for a second \u2014 I'm really frustrated and want to talk about something else. My most recent reservation had a delayed flight and it's been a terrible experience. I need to address that with you instead.\nWait, so the delayed flight wasn't actually on my most recent reservation? And it wa", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: To get started with your booking, I'll need your user ID first. Could you please provide your user ID?\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"noah_muller_9847\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Noah\", \"last_name\": \"Muller\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"889 Hillcrest Drive\", \"address2\": \"Suite 254\", \"city\": \"Denver\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"CO\", \"zip\": \"80243\"}, \"email\": \"noah.muller2290@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1963-01-22\", \"payment_methods\": {\"credit_card_1245537\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_1245537\", \"brand\": \"mastercard\", \"last_four\": \"1167\"}, \"credit_card_6040264\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_6040264\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"2076\"}, \"credit_card_3255100\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_3255100\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"2604\"}, \"certificate_8301303\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_8301303\", \"amount\": 100.0}, \"credit_card_3983998\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_3983998\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"8413\"}, \"credit_card_7574394\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_7574394\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"1798\"}, \"credit_card_6873705\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\"