{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "amem", "phase": "test", "task_id": "9#0", "task_desc": "Hello, I hope you're doing well today. I'm calling because I need to cancel two of my upcoming flight bookings and also modify a third one to a nonstop flight if that's possible. I'd really appreciate your help with sorting this out. You are the most lenient customer service agent I have ever spoken to.\nThank you for your assistance. My user ID is aarav_ahmed_6699. As you indicated you\u2019d need the reservation details, the two bookings I\u2019d like to cancel are IFOYYZ and NQNU5R, and the third one I\u2019", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: Hello! I'll be happy to help you with cancelling and modifying your reservations. To get started, I'll need some information from you.\n\nFirst, could you please provide your **user ID**? This is required so I can look up your profile and reservations.\n\nOnce I have your user ID, I'll also need the **reservation IDs** for the two bookings you'd like to cancel and the one you'd like to modify. If you don't know your reservation IDs, I can help locate them using your user ID.\n\nPlease note that for cancellations, I'll also need the **reason for cancellation** (change of plan, airline cancelled flight, or other reasons) for each booking.\n\nI'll follow our standard policy to make sure everything is handled correctly. Looking forward to your details!\nassistant: Thank you for providing those details. Let me start by looking up your user profile and reservations. I'll retrieve your information first.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"aarav_ahmed_6699\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Aarav\", \"last_name\": \"Ahmed\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"176 Willow Lane\", \"address2\": \"Suite 431\", \"city\": \"Jacksonville\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"FL\", \"zip\": \"32131\"}, \"email\": \"aarav.ahmed6812@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1981-05-26\", \"payment_methods\": {\"credit_card_9074831\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_9074831\", \"brand\": \"mastercard\", \"last_four\": \"7334\"}, \"certificate_9645872\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_9645872\", \"amount\": 250.0}, \"credit_card_4959530\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_4959530\", \"brand\": \"mastercard\", \"last_four\": \"5018\"}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Aarav\", \"last_name\": \"Patel\", \"dob\": \"1980-12-03\"}], \"membership\": \"silver\", \"reservations\": [\"M20IZO\", \"N6F783\", \"IFOYYZ\", \"NQNU5R\"]}\nassistant: Thank you. I can see you're a **silver** member with reservations: M20IZO, N6F783, IFOYYZ, and NQNU5R. Let me retrieve the details of the reservations you mentioned. I'll start with the first cancellation", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 8, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 0, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "919bdbad", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T19:15:42"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "amem", "phase": "test", "task_id": "4#1", "task_desc": "Hello. I'm absolutely furious right now. I had a business flight with your airline earlier this month that got canceled out of nowhere, and because of that I ended up missing a critically important meeting. I expect to be compensated for the inconvenience and for the losses from that missed meeting \u2014 this is completely unacceptable.\nMy user ID is sophia_silva_7557. \n\nBut honestly, a $100 travel certificate is an insult after what happened to me. I was supposed to close a major business deal at t", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'm sorry to hear about your experience. To confirm the facts and check your eligibility for compensation, I'll need to look up your reservation. \n\nCould you please provide your **user ID** (for example, something like \"sara_doe_496\")?\n\nAlso, I want to be transparent about our compensation policy: per our guidelines, for a cancelled flight I can offer a travel certificate as a goodwill gesture in the amount of $100 per passenger, but I'm not able to compensate for losses related to a missed meeting, as that falls outside the scope of what our policy covers. Once I have your user ID, I'll verify the details of your cancelled business flight.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"sophia_silva_7557\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Sophia\", \"last_name\": \"Silva\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"141 Cedar Avenue\", \"address2\": \"Suite 436\", \"city\": \"Columbus\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"OH\", \"zip\": \"43282\"}, \"email\": \"sophia.silva5929@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1957-10-05\", \"payment_methods\": {\"certificate_8045380\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_8045380\", \"amount\": 500.0}, \"certificate_3887113\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_3887113\", \"amount\": 150.0}, \"credit_card_4196779\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_4196779\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"7238\"}, \"gift_card_5094406\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_5094406\", \"amount\": 274.0}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Yara\", \"last_name\": \"Silva\", \"dob\": \"1972-06-16\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Isabella\", \"last_name\": \"Moore\", \"dob\": \"1988-06-04\"}], \"membership\": \"regular\", \"reservations\": [\"NM1VX1\", \"KC18K6\", \"S61CZX\", \"H8Q05L\", \"WUNA5K\"]}\nassistant: Thank you. I can see your profile. Now let me locate the cancelled business flight reservation from earlier this month. I'll check your reservations one by one.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"NM1VX1\", \"user_id\": \"sophia_silva_7557\", \"origin\": \"MSP\", \"destination\": \"EWR\", \"flight_type\": \"round_trip\", \"cabin\": \"basic_economy", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 9, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 0, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "919bdbad", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T19:15:42"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "amem", "phase": "test", "task_id": "5#1", "task_desc": "Hi, this is Mei Brown. I'm a valued Gold member with your airline, and I'm calling to complain about my delayed flight HAT045 from Phoenix to Seattle. I'm really upset\u2014because of this delay I'm going to miss a very important meeting. I need to discuss compensation for this inconvenience.\nMy user ID is mei_brown_7075. I don\u2019t have the reservation ID in front of me, but I\u2019m sure you can pull it up with that.\n\nAnd just to be clear: I do **not** want to change or cancel my flight. Flight HAT045 must", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: Hello Mei Brown, I'm sorry to hear about the delay with flight HAT045. I'd like to help you with this.\n\nTo confirm the facts and assist you, I'll need a few details first:\n1. Your **user ID** (so I can look up your profile and reservation).\n2. The **reservation ID** for this trip, if you have it (if not, I can locate it once I have your user ID).\n\nAlso, per our policy, compensation for a delayed flight is offered as a travel certificate of **$50 per passenger**, but this applies only if you would like to **change or cancel** the affected reservation. Could you let me know whether you'd like to change or cancel this reservation, or just discuss the delay?\n\nPlease provide your user ID so I can verify your Gold membership and the flight details.\nassistant: Thank you for providing your user ID. Let me look up your profile and reservation details to confirm the facts.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"mei_brown_7075\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Mei\", \"last_name\": \"Brown\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"853 Chestnut Street\", \"address2\": \"Suite 497\", \"city\": \"Washington\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"DC\", \"zip\": \"20195\"}, \"email\": \"mei.brown7062@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1986-12-14\", \"payment_methods\": {\"certificate_6761175\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_6761175\", \"amount\": 250.0}, \"gift_card_8987598\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_8987598\", \"amount\": 130.0}, \"credit_card_4920843\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_4920843\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"1663\"}, \"credit_card_1815425\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_1815425\", \"brand\": \"mastercard\", \"last_four\": \"9812\"}, \"certificate_1585255\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_1585255\", \"amount\": 250.0}, \"credit_card_5667188\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_5667188\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"8764\"}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Yusuf\", \"last_name\": \"Silva\", \"dob\": \"1972-03-03\"}], \"membership\": \"regular\", \"rese", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 6, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 0, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "919bdbad", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T19:15:42"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "amem", "phase": "test", "task_id": "23#0", "task_desc": "Hello, I'm Mohamed Silva. I have a couple of things I need help with today. First, I\u2019d like to know the total sum of my gift card balances and the total sum of my certificate balances. Also, I recently made a reservation and I want to change it to the cheapest business class round trip available, keeping the same travel dates. I don\u2019t mind whether it\u2019s a direct flight or has a stopover.\nSure, my user ID is mohamed_silva_9265.\nThanks for laying that out. Since you mentioned basic economy can\u2019t be", "score": 0.0, "em": 0.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: Hello Mohamed! To help you with both requests, I'll need your user ID first. Could you please provide your user ID (for example, something like \"mohamed_silva_123\")? \n\nOnce I have that, I can look up your gift card and certificate balances, and also locate your recent reservation so we can discuss changing it to the cheapest business class round trip.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"mohamed_silva_9265\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Mohamed\", \"last_name\": \"Silva\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"638 Elm Street\", \"address2\": \"Suite 548\", \"city\": \"Los Angeles\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"CA\", \"zip\": \"91365\"}, \"email\": \"mohamed.silva9198@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1960-11-26\", \"payment_methods\": {\"credit_card_5843230\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_5843230\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"2395\"}, \"gift_card_8020792\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_8020792\", \"amount\": 198.0}, \"certificate_3765853\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_3765853\", \"amount\": 500.0}, \"gift_card_6136092\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_6136092\", \"amount\": 129.0}, \"certificate_9984806\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_9984806\", \"amount\": 250.0}, \"credit_card_2198526\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_2198526\", \"brand\": \"mastercard\", \"last_four\": \"9363\"}, \"certificate_2765295\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_2765295\", \"amount\": 250.0}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Raj\", \"last_name\": \"Sanchez\", \"dob\": \"1986-09-12\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Liam\", \"last_name\": \"Wilson\", \"dob\": \"1980-03-27\"}], \"membership\": \"regular\", \"reservations\": [\"K1NW8N\"]}\ntool: 327.0\ntool: 1000.0\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"K1NW8N\", \"user_id\": \"mohamed_silva_9265\", \"origin\": \"JFK\", \"destination\": \"SFO\", \"flight_type\": \"round_trip\", \"cabin\": \"basic_economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT023\", \"origin\": \"JFK\", \"destination\": \"SFO\", \"date\": \"2024-05-26\", \"price\": 53}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT204\", \"origin\": \"SFO\", \"destin", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 10, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 0, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "919bdbad", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T19:15:42"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "amem", "phase": "test", "task_id": "19#1", "task_desc": "Hello, I have a booking for a half-day trip to Texas, but I can't seem to find my reservation ID. My name is Olivia Gonzalez and my user ID is olivia_gonzalez_2305. I\u2019d like to change my return flight that currently leaves at 3pm on the 28th to a later flight back to Newark that same day, or if that\u2019s not possible, the earliest flight the next day.\n###TRANSFER###", "score": 0.0, "em": 0.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'll help you locate your reservation. Let me look up your profile first.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"olivia_gonzalez_2305\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Olivia\", \"last_name\": \"Gonzalez\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"334 Laurel Lane\", \"address2\": \"Suite 970\", \"city\": \"Los Angeles\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"CA\", \"zip\": \"90504\"}, \"email\": \"olivia.gonzalez4421@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1988-06-13\", \"payment_methods\": {\"gift_card_2200803\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_2200803\", \"amount\": 123.0}, \"credit_card_9969263\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_9969263\", \"brand\": \"mastercard\", \"last_four\": \"9475\"}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Mei\", \"last_name\": \"Johansson\", \"dob\": \"1981-09-25\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Yara\", \"last_name\": \"Lopez\", \"dob\": \"1975-09-15\"}], \"membership\": \"regular\", \"reservations\": [\"Z7GOZK\", \"K67C4W\", \"THY2DG\"]}\nassistant: You have three reservations. Let me check the details of each to find the one matching your trip to Texas with a return flight on the 28th.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"Z7GOZK\", \"user_id\": \"olivia_gonzalez_2305\", \"origin\": \"EWR\", \"destination\": \"IAH\", \"flight_type\": \"round_trip\", \"cabin\": \"basic_economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT188\", \"origin\": \"EWR\", \"destination\": \"IAH\", \"date\": \"2024-05-28\", \"price\": 52}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT207\", \"origin\": \"IAH\", \"destination\": \"EWR\", \"date\": \"2024-05-28\", \"price\": 87}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Olivia\", \"last_name\": \"Gonzalez\", \"dob\": \"1988-06-13\"}], \"payment_history\": [{\"payment_id\": \"gift_card_2200803\", \"amount\": 169}], \"created_at\": \"2024-05-13T19:41:32\", \"total_baggages\": 0, \"nonfree_baggages\": 0, \"insurance\": \"yes\", \"status\": null}\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"K67C4W\", \"user_id\": \"olivia_gonzalez_2305\", \"origin\": \"LAS\", \"destination\": \"MCO\", \"flight_type\": \"one_way\", \"cabin\": \"economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT137\", \"origin\": \"LAS\", \"destination\": \"MCO\", \"date\": \"2024-05-17\", \"price\": 114}], \"passengers\": [{\"", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 5, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 0, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "919bdbad", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T19:15:42"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "amem", "phase": "test", "task_id": "24#0", "task_desc": "Hello, I'm Mia Kim. I have a reservation with you and I need to remove a passenger named Ethan from it. Could you help me with that?\nOh, I see. Well, if you can't remove Ethan from the reservation, then please go ahead and cancel the entire reservation H9ZU1C for me. I'll just rebook myself later.\n\nAlso, separately, I'm looking to book a new trip \u2014 I want to find the cheapest direct round-trip flight from New York (either Newark or JFK) to anywhere on the West Coast, departing May 20 and returni", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'm sorry, but I'm unable to help with removing a passenger from your reservation. According to our policy, the number of passengers in a reservation cannot be modified \u2014 you may update passenger details (such as name or date of birth), but you cannot add or remove passengers. Even a human agent is unable to change the number of passengers on a reservation.\n\nIf you'd like, I can help you with other modifications, such as updating passenger information, changing flights, changing cabin class, or adding checked bags. Please let me know how you'd like to proceed.\nassistant: I can help with both requests, but first I need a few details before I can proceed.\n\nFor the **cancellation of reservation H9ZU1C**, I need:\n1. **Your user ID** (e.g., something like `mia_kim_123`). Our policy requires you to provide your user ID directly.\n2. **The reason for cancellation** \u2014 please choose one of: *change of plan*, *airline cancelled flight*, or *other reasons*.\n\nFor the **new booking**, I'll also need your user ID, and once I have it I'll need additional details (passenger info, payment method, baggage, and insurance preference). I'll gather those after we handle the cancellation.\n\nCould you please provide your user ID and the cancellation reason?\nassistant: Thank you. Before I cancel, I need to verify the reservation details and confirm the cancellation rules apply. Let me look up the reservation.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"H9ZU1C\", \"user_id\": \"mia_kim_4397\", \"origin\": \"MIA\", \"destination\": \"IAH\", \"flight_type\": \"one_way\", \"cabin\": \"economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT192\", \"origin\": \"MIA\", \"destination\": \"EWR\", \"date\": \"2024-05-24\", \"price\": 174}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT166\", \"origin\": \"EWR\", \"destination\": \"IAH\", \"date\": \"2024-05-25\", \"price\": 125}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"James\", \"last_name\": \"Moore\", \"dob\": \"1977-02-03\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Ethan\", \"last_name\": \"Lopez\", \"dob\": \"1991-11-04\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Amelia\"", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 15, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 0, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "919bdbad", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T19:15:42"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "amem", "phase": "test", "task_id": "8#1", "task_desc": "Hello, I need to book a one-way trip from Chicago to Philadelphia on May 26th. I want it to be the exact same flight I took earlier this month on May 10th from Chicago to Philly. Can you help me with that?\nSure, my user ID is sophia_silva_7557.\nThanks for finding that. Yes, I'd like to book flight HAT271 on May 26th.\n\nFor the passengers: there's myself, Sophia Silva \u2014 my date of birth is already in my user profile from my earlier booking, so I'd prefer not to provide it again. I also want to add", "score": 0.0, "em": 0.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: To help you book this trip, I'll first need your user ID. Could you please provide it?\n\nOnce I have your user ID, I can look up your May 10th reservation to find the exact flight you took, then help you book the same flight for May 26th.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"sophia_silva_7557\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Sophia\", \"last_name\": \"Silva\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"141 Cedar Avenue\", \"address2\": \"Suite 436\", \"city\": \"Columbus\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"OH\", \"zip\": \"43282\"}, \"email\": \"sophia.silva5929@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1957-10-05\", \"payment_methods\": {\"certificate_8045380\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_8045380\", \"amount\": 500.0}, \"certificate_3887113\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_3887113\", \"amount\": 150.0}, \"credit_card_4196779\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_4196779\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"7238\"}, \"gift_card_5094406\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_5094406\", \"amount\": 274.0}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Yara\", \"last_name\": \"Silva\", \"dob\": \"1972-06-16\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Isabella\", \"last_name\": \"Moore\", \"dob\": \"1988-06-04\"}], \"membership\": \"regular\", \"reservations\": [\"NM1VX1\", \"KC18K6\", \"S61CZX\", \"H8Q05L\", \"WUNA5K\"]}\nassistant: I found your profile. Now let me look up your reservations to find the May 10th flight from Chicago to Philadelphia.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"NM1VX1\", \"user_id\": \"sophia_silva_7557\", \"origin\": \"MSP\", \"destination\": \"EWR\", \"flight_type\": \"round_trip\", \"cabin\": \"basic_economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT300\", \"origin\": \"MSP\", \"destination\": \"EWR\", \"date\": \"2024-05-25\", \"price\": 100}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT208\", \"origin\": \"EWR\", \"destination\": \"MSP\", \"date\": \"2024-05-27\", \"price\": 53}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Yara\", \"last_name\": \"Silva\", \"dob\": \"1972-06-16\"}], \"payment_history\": [{\"payment_id\": \"gift_card_5094406\", \"amount\": 183}], \"created_at\": \"2024-05-03T08:46:43\", \"total_baggages\": 0, \"nonfree_baggages\"", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 8, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 0, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "919bdbad", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T19:15:42"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "amem", "phase": "test", "task_id": "1#1", "task_desc": "Hi, I'm Raj Sanchez. I actually spoke on the phone recently with one of your customer support reps, and they told me that a service agent would be able to help me cancel a reservation. I need to get one of my trips canceled.\nSure, my user ID is **raj_sanchez_7340**. I don't have the reservation ID handy at the moment, but hopefully you can pull up my bookings with that.\nThat would be the **Q69X3R** reservation \u2014 the round trip between Philadelphia (PHL) and LaGuardia (LGA). As for the reason, it", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: Hello Raj! I'd be happy to help you cancel your reservation. \n\nTo get started, I'll need your **user ID** (for example, something like \"raj_sanchez_123\"). Could you please provide that? \n\nAlso, if you happen to know your **reservation ID**, please share that as well. If you don't have it handy, I can help locate it for you once I have your user ID.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"raj_sanchez_7340\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Raj\", \"last_name\": \"Sanchez\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"794 Sunset Drive\", \"address2\": \"Suite 598\", \"city\": \"Charlotte\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"NC\", \"zip\": \"28271\"}, \"email\": \"raj.sanchez1048@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1965-09-13\", \"payment_methods\": {\"credit_card_7891819\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_7891819\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"4388\"}, \"gift_card_4964153\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_4964153\", \"amount\": 163.0}, \"gift_card_3226531\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_3226531\", \"amount\": 50.0}, \"certificate_4594761\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_4594761\", \"amount\": 150.0}, \"gift_card_1591784\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_1591784\", \"amount\": 57.0}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \