{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "amem", "phase": "test", "task_id": "21#0", "task_desc": "Hi, I'm Sofia Kim. I need to change the return flight for my Houston to Denver trip. The departure is on May 27, and I want to change the return to the fastest possible option on the same day, May 27. This is urgent, so I need to get it done ASAP.\nSure, my user ID is sofia_kim_7287. I don't remember my reservation ID though \u2014 I must have misplaced it.\nYes, please go ahead with that Option E change \u2014 economy is fine, and I need this done ASAP. For payment, please use my gift card with the smalles", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: Hello Sofia! I'd be happy to help you change your return flight. To get started, I'll need a few details:\n\n1. **Your user ID** (e.g., something like 'sofia_kim_123') \u2014 this is required to locate your account and reservation.\n2. **Your reservation ID** \u2014 if you don't have it handy, I can help look it up once I have your user ID.\n\nCould you please provide your user ID?\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"sofia_kim_7287\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Sofia\", \"last_name\": \"Kim\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"825 Laurel Lane\", \"address2\": \"Suite 595\", \"city\": \"Houston\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"TX\", \"zip\": \"77243\"}, \"email\": \"sofia.kim1937@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1950-06-24\", \"payment_methods\": {\"certificate_8544743\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_8544743\", \"amount\": 250.0}, \"credit_card_9879898\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_9879898\", \"brand\": \"mastercard\", \"last_four\": \"9725\"}, \"gift_card_7091239\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_7091239\", \"amount\": 157.0}, \"gift_card_6276644\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_6276644\", \"amount\": 113.0}, \"gift_card_7480005\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_7480005\", \"amount\": 6.0}, \"certifica