{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "amem", "phase": "test", "task_id": "31#1", "task_desc": "Hello, I'm calling because I have an emergency at home. My cat is really sick and I need to get back sooner to take care of him. I have a flight leaving from JFK on May 17, and I was hoping to change it to a nonstop flight so I can get home faster. Can you help me with that?\nYes, of course. My user ID is daiki_lee_6144. I'm not sure what my reservation ID is, but hopefully you can find it with that.\n###TRANSFER###", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'm sorry to hear about your cat. I'd be happy to help you look into changing your flight. \n\nTo get started, I'll need your user ID. Could you please provide that? If you don't know your reservation ID, I can help locate it once I have your user ID.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"daiki_lee_6144\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Daiki\", \"last_name\": \"Lee\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"410 River Road\", \"address2\": \"Suite 380\", \"city\": \"Fort Worth\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"TX\", \"zip\": \"76173\"}, \"email\": \"daiki.lee6987@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1976-10-08\", \"payment_methods\": {\"credit_card_6198952\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_6198952\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"9734\"}, \"gift_card_3112961\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_3112961\", \"amount\": 51.0}, \"gift_card_5128346\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_5128346\", \"amount\": 262.0}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Raj\", \"last_name\": \"Muller\", \"dob\": \"1967-10-16\"}], \"membership\": \"regular\", \"reservations\": [\"DF89BM\", \"COVE6R\", \"IIHXDG\"]}\nassistant: I found your profile. You have three reservations (DF89BM, COVE6R, IIHXDG). Let me check the details to find the one with a flight from JFK on May 17.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"DF89BM\", \"user_id\": \"daiki_lee_6144\", \"origin\": \"JFK\", \"de