{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "amem", "phase": "test", "task_id": "6#0", "task_desc": "Hi, I'm looking at my upcoming trip and I'm pretty sure I purchased travel insurance when I booked, but when I log in to manage my booking it's not listed there. I'm traveling with my family and they all have coverage on their tickets, so I really need to make sure mine gets sorted out too \u2014 it's important to me that I'm not the only one without it.\nSure, my user ID is sophia_taylor_9065. I booked a flight for myself along with my family, and I'm certain I selected insurance for my ticket at che", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'd be happy to help you look into this. To start, I'll need your user ID so I can pull up your profile and reservation details. Could you please provide your user ID?\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"sophia_taylor_9065\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Sophia\", \"last_name\": \"Taylor\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"831 Elm Street\", \"address2\": \"Suite 304\", \"city\": \"Washington\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"DC\", \"zip\": \"20417\"}, \"email\": \"sophia.taylor4639@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1999-05-27\", \"payment_methods\": {\"credit_card_5237144\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_5237144\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"9796\"}, \"credit_card_9302073\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_9302073\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"5191\"}, \"certificate_6193508\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_6193508\", \"amount\": 100.0}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Lucas\", \"last_name\": \"Davis\", \"dob\": \"1987-10-27\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Mason\", \"last_name\": \"Khan\", \"dob\": \"1983-09-06\"}], \"membership\": \"silver\", \"reservations\": [\"6NSXQU\", \"J3SAZF\", \"PEP4E0\", \"NABCQ2\"]}\nassistant: Thank you. I can see you have several reservations. Let me look into them to find your family trip and v