{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "amem", "phase": "test", "task_id": "26#1", "task_desc": "I need to cancel my flight from MCO to CLT. I want to cancel it and get my refund.\nMy user ID is amelia_sanchez_4739. For the reason, I\u2019d say it\u2019s just under \u201cother\u201d \u2014 I simply need to cancel the trip. I really need to get this flight from MCO to CLT cancelled and have my refund processed.\nI hear what you\u2019re saying about the policy, but I really need to cancel this reservation \u2014 3FRNFB, MCO to CLT \u2014 and get my money back. I insist on it. I can\u2019t take this trip anymore, and I want a refund. Isn\u2019t", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: To help you cancel your flight, I'll need some information first. Could you please provide your **user ID**? \n\nAlso, I'll need to know the **reason for cancellation** (change of plan, airline cancelled flight, or other reasons).\n\nIf you don't know your reservation ID, I can help locate it once I have your user ID.\nassistant: Thank you. Let me look up your reservations to locate the one from MCO to CLT.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"amelia_sanchez_4739\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Amelia\", \"last_name\": \"Sanchez\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"225 Sunset Drive\", \"address2\": \"Suite 563\", \"city\": \"Los Angeles\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"CA\", \"zip\": \"91292\"}, \"email\": \"amelia.sanchez3631@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1955-02-01\", \"payment_methods\": {\"credit_card_4065275\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_4065275\", \"brand\": \"mastercard\", \"last_four\": \"3658\"}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Ivan\", \"last_name\": \"Martin\", \"dob\": \"1973-08-20\"}], \"membership\": \"gold\", \"reservations\": [\"3FRNFB\", \"Q4L9HS\"]}\nassistant: You have two reservations. Let me check the details of both to find the one from MCO to CLT.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"3FRNFB\", \"user_id\": \"amelia_sanchez_4739\", \"origin\": \"MCO\", \"destination\": \"CLT\", \"flight_type\": \"one_way\", \"cabin\": \"basic_economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT028\", \"origin\": \"MCO\", \"destination\": \"BOS\", \"date\": \"2024-05-28\", \"price\": 79}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT277\", \"origin\": \"BOS\", \"destination\": \"CLT\", \"date\": \"2024-05-28\", \"price\": 64}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Amelia\", \"last_name\": \"Sanchez\", \"dob\": \"1955-02-01\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Ivan\", \"last_name\": \"Martin\", \"dob\": \"1973-08-20\"}], \"payment_history\": [{\"payment_id\": \"credit_card_4065275\", \"amount\": 286}], \"created_at\": \"2024-05-06T13:25:06\", \"total_baggages\": 0, \"nonfree_baggages\": 0, \"insurance\": \"no\", \"status\": null}\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"Q4L9HS\", \"user_id\": \"amelia_sanchez_4739\", \"origin\": \"EWR\", \"destination\": \"SEA\", \"fligh", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 4, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 0, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "919bdbad", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T19:15:42"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "amem", "phase": "test", "task_id": "6#1", "task_desc": "Hi, I'm calling about my upcoming flight. I'm pretty sure I added travel insurance when I booked it, but when I look at my reservation online, it's not showing up at all. I really need to get this sorted out because I'm flying with my family and everyone else already has insurance on their flights.\nSure, yes. My user ID is sophia_taylor_9065, and the reservation number is PEP4E0. \n\nLike I mentioned, I really thought I'd purchased the travel insurance for this trip \u2014 and it's important to me beca", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'd be happy to help you look into this. To get started, I'll need some information to locate your reservation.\n\nCould you please provide me with:\n1. Your user ID (for example, something like \"sara_doe_496\")\n2. Your reservation ID (if you have it)\n\nIf you don't know your reservation ID, I can help locate it once I have your user ID.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"PEP4E0\", \"user_id\": \"sophia_taylor_9065\", \"origin\": \"CLT\", \"destination\": \"PHX\", \"flight_type\": \"one_way\", \"cabin\": \"basic_economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT176\", \"origin\": \"CLT\", \"destination\": \"DTW\", \"date\": \"2024-05-20\", \"price\": 51}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT097\", \"origin\": \"DTW\", \"destination\": \"PHX\", \"date\": \"2024-05-20\", \"price\": 77}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Sophia\", \"last_name\": \"Taylor\", \"dob\": \"1999-05-27\"}], \"payment_history\": [{\"payment_id\": \"credit_card_9302073\", \"amount\": 128}], \"created_at\": \"2024-05-05T05:10:43\", \"total_baggages\": 0, \"nonfree_baggages\": 0, \"insurance\": \"no\", \"status\": null}\nassistant: I've pulled up your reservation PEP4E0. Here's what I found:\n\n- **Reservation:** PEP4E0\n- **Passenger:** Sophia Taylor\n- **Trip:** One-way, CLT \u2192 PHX (via DTW), May 20, 2024\n- **Cabin:** Basic Economy\n- **Insurance:** Currently showing as \"no\" in the system\n\nI understand your concern about wanting travel insurance in place, especially since your family members have it on their own bookings. However, I'm unable to add travel insurance to this reservation at this time.\n\nPer our booking policy, **travel insurance cannot be added after the initial booking is completed**. The system confirms that insurance was not included when this reservation was created on May 5, 2024, and there is no option to add it retroactively.\n\nI'm sorry I can't make that change for you. If you'd like, I can help you with other aspects of this reservation \u2014 such as reviewing flight details, baggage, or passenger information \u2014 or assist with any new bookings where", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 3, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 0, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "919bdbad", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T19:15:42"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "amem", "phase": "test", "task_id": "12#1", "task_desc": "Hello, I'm Chen Lee. I have an upcoming flight from Boston to Minneapolis, and I'd like to change the class for all passengers on my reservation to business. Also, I want to add two checked bags under my name using my Gold membership, even if the upgrade isn't possible.\nSure, my user ID is chen_lee_6825. And the reservation ID for that Boston to Minneapolis flight is YAX4DR.\nThanks for laying that out. I notice the total to upgrade both passengers to business is $1,200, but I\u2019m only willing to p", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: Hello Chen Lee! To help you with changing the cabin class and adding checked bags, I'll need some information first.\n\nCould you please provide your **user ID** (e.g., a format like `chen_lee_123`)? Also, if you have your **reservation ID** handy, please share that as well. If you don't know your reservation ID, I can help locate it once I have your user ID.\nassistant: Thank you! Let me look up your reservation and profile details.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"YAX4DR\", \"user_id\": \"chen_lee_6825\", \"origin\": \"BOS\", \"destination\": \"MSP\", \"flight_type\": \"one_way\", \"cabin\": \"economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT235\", \"origin\": \"BOS\", \"destination\": \"MCO\", \"date\": \"2024-05-18\", \"price\": 122}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT298\", \"origin\": \"MCO\", \"destination\": \"MSP\", \"date\": \"2024-05-19\", \"price\": 127}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Chen\", \"last_name\": \"Lee\", \"dob\": \"1967-12-12\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Noah\", \"last_name\": \"Hernandez\", \"dob\": \"1968-01-06\"}], \"payment_history\": [{\"payment_id\": \"credit_card_4938634\", \"amount\": 498}], \"created_at\": \"2024-05-05T23:00:15\", \"total_baggages\": 0, \"nonfree_baggages\": 0, \"insurance\": \"no\", \"status\": null}\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"chen_lee_6825\", \"name\":