nassistant: I've reviewed your reservation XEWRD9. I need to let you know that this modification cannot be processed through my tools, for the following reasons:\n\n1. **Basic economy cannot be modified for flights.** Your reservation is booked in **basic economy**, and per policy, basic economy flight itineraries cannot be changed (only cabin class can be changed, and even that is blocked here since some flights have already been flown).\n2. **Destination cannot be changed.** Your current reservation is a round trip between LAX and ATL. Modifying a reservation must keep the same origin, destination, and trip type \u2014 changing the return destination from Los Angeles to Las V", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 2, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 1, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "919bdbad", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T20:11:25"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "amem", "phase": "test", "task_id": "3#0", "task_desc": "Hi, I'm calling because I'm really stressed about my upcoming trip \u2014 I have a ton of stuff I need to bring with me, and it's really important that I get the exact baggage allowance right for my flight. I think I'm a Gold member, which I believe gives me some extra suitcase allowance. Could you help me find out the total number of suitcases my reservation lets me take?\nSure, yes. My name is Anya Garcia and my user ID is anya_garcia_5901. As for the reservation, my confirmation number is JMO1MG. I", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'd be happy to help you figure out your baggage allowance. To do that, I'll need a couple of details first:\n\n1. Your **user ID** (for example, something like `sara_doe_496`).\n2. Your **reservation ID** (for example, something like `ZFA04Y`). If you don't know your reservation ID, I can help locate it once I have your user ID.\n\nCould you please provide your user ID and reservation ID?\nassistant: Thank you, Anya. Let me look up your profile and reservation details.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"anya_garcia_5901\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Anya\", \"last_name\": \"Garcia\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"555 Highland Drive\", \"address2\": \"Suite 243\", \"city\": \"San Antonio\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"TX\", \"zip\": \"78256\"}, \"email\": \"anya.garcia8816@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1992-11-12\", \"payment_methods\": {\"gift_card_2550356\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_2550356\", \"amount\": 149.0}, \"certificate_7583008\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_7583008\", \"amount\": 150.0}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Mei\", \"last_name\": \"Lee\", \"dob\": \"1989-12-13\"}], \"membership\": \"silver\", \"reservations\": [\"82K959\", \"790JYN\", \"BE2L57\", \"CXBB4L\", \"TAMSDK\", \"3RK2T9\", \"VAOW1B\", \"Q4MCUF\", \"JMO1MG\"]}\n