{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "amem", "phase": "test", "task_id": "31#0", "task_desc": "Hello, I really need some help with my travel plans. I have a flight out of JFK on May 17, but my cat is very sick and I need to get home sooner to take care of him. I\u2019d like to change that flight to a nonstop one if at all possible.\nOf course, my user ID is daiki_lee_6144. I\u2019m really worried about my cat, so I\u2019m hoping we can find a nonstop flight to get me home earlier.\n###TRANSFER###", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I\u2019m sorry to hear about your cat. I\u2019d be happy to help you look into changing your flight.\n\nTo get started, I\u2019ll need your **user ID** so I can locate your reservation. Could you please provide that?\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"daiki_lee_6144\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Daiki\", \"last_name\": \"Lee\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"410 River Road\", \"address2\": \"Suite 380\", \"city\": \"Fort Worth\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"TX\", \"zip\": \"76173\"}, \"email\": \"daiki.lee6987@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1976-10-08\", \"payment_methods\": {\"credit_card_6198952\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_6198952\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"9734\"}, \"gift_card_3112961\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_3112961\", \"amount\": 51.0}, \"gift_card_5128346\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_5128346\", \"amount\": 262.0}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Raj\", \"last_name\": \"Muller\", \"dob\": \"1967-10-16\"}], \"membership\": \"regular\", \"reservations\": [\"DF89BM\", \"COVE6R\", \"IIHXDG\"]}\nassistant: Thank you, Daiki. I can see you have three reservations (DF89BM, COVE6R, IIHXDG). Let me look into them to find the one with a flight out of JFK on May 17.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"DF89BM\", \"user_id\": \"daiki_lee_6144\", \"origin\": \"JFK\", \"destination\": \"DTW\", \"flight_type\": \"ro