{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "amem", "phase": "test", "task_id": "12#0", "task_desc": "Hello, this is Chen Lee. I have an upcoming flight from Boston to Minneapolis booked under reservation YAX4DR, and I\u2019d like to change the cabin class for everyone on that reservation to business. Can you help me with that?\nThanks for laying that out, but $1,200 is quite a bit more than I\u2019m prepared to spend \u2014 I\u2019m only willing to pay up to $650 for a class upgrade. Since the full change for both of us comes in over that limit, I\u2019d like to just upgrade my companion Noah Hernandez to business inste", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'll help you change the cabin class to business. First, let me look up the reservation details to verify the information.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"YAX4DR\", \"user_id\": \"chen_lee_6825\", \"origin\": \"BOS\", \"destination\": \"MSP\", \"flight_type\": \"one_way\", \"cabin\": \"economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT235\", \"origin\": \"BOS\", \"destination\": \"MCO\", \"date\": \"2024-05-18\", \"price\": 122}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT298\", \"origin\": \"MCO\", \"destination\": \"MSP\", \"date\": \"2024-05-19\", \"price\": 127}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Chen\", \"last_name\": \"Lee\", \"dob\": \"1967-12-12\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Noah\", \"last_name\": \"Hernandez\", \"dob\": \"1968-01-06\"}], \"payment_history\": [{\"payment_id\": \"credit_card_4938634\", \"amount\": 498}], \"created_at\": \"2024-05-05T23:00:15\", \"total_baggages\": 0, \"nonfree_baggages\": 0, \"insurance\": \"no\", \"status\": null}\nassistant: Thank you. I found the reservation under user ID **chen_lee_6825**. Let me verify the current flight prices for business class so I can calculate any price difference. I'll search for the two flight segments.\ntool: [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT013\", \"origin\": \"BOS\", \"destination\": \"MCO\", \"status\": \"available\", \"schedule