{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "amem", "phase": "test", "task_id": "6#0", "task_desc": "Hi, I'm calling because I think I added travel insurance to my upcoming flight when I booked it, but when I look at my booking online, it's not showing up. I'm flying with my family and everyone else already has insurance on their tickets, so I really need to make sure mine gets added too. Can you help me check?\nSure, my user ID is sophia_taylor_9065. I booked a flight for myself and my family, and I'm pretty sure I selected the insurance option for my ticket, but it's not appearing in the booki", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'd be happy to help you check your booking. To look up your reservation, I'll need your user ID first. Could you please provide your user ID?\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"sophia_taylor_9065\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Sophia\", \"last_name\": \"Taylor\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"831 Elm Street\", \"address2\": \"Suite 304\", \"city\": \"Washington\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"DC\", \"zip\": \"20417\"}, \"email\": \"sophia.taylor4639@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1999-05-27\", \"payment_methods\": {\"credit_card_5237144\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_5237144\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"9796\"}, \"credit_card_9302073\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_9302073\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"5191\"}, \"certificate_6193508\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_6193508\", \"amount\": 100.0}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Lucas\", \"last_name\": \"Davis\", \"dob\": \"1987-10-27\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Mason\", \"last_name\": \"Khan\", \"dob\": \"1983-09-06\"}], \"membership\": \"silver\", \"reservations\": [\"6NSXQU\", \"J3SAZF\", \"PEP4E0\", \"NABCQ2\"]}\nassistant: I found your profile. You have several reservations. Let me pull up the details to find your upcoming family flight.\ntool: {\"reserva