{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "amem", "phase": "test", "task_id": "1#1", "task_desc": "Hello, I'm Raj Sanchez. I actually called earlier and spoke with a support representative who said a service agent would be able to help me cancel my reservation. I need to cancel my upcoming trip from Philadelphia to LaGuardia.\nSure, my user ID is raj_sanchez_7340. I don't have the reservation ID handy, but the trip I need to cancel is the one from Philadelphia to LaGuardia.\n###TRANSFER###", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: Hello Raj! I'd be happy to help you cancel your reservation. To get started, I'll need a few details:\n\n1. Your **user ID** (this is required to locate your account).\n2. Your **reservation ID** (if you don't have it, I can help locate it once I have your user ID).\n3. The **reason for cancellation** (options: change of plan, airline cancelled flight, or other reasons).\n\nCould you please provide your user ID?\nassistant: Thank you! Let me look up your account to locate the reservation for your Philadelphia to LaGuardia trip.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"raj_sanchez_7340\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Raj\", \"last_name\": \"Sanchez\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"794 Sunset Drive\", \"address2\": \"Suite 598\", \"city\": \"Charlotte\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"NC\", \"zip\": \"28271\"}, \"email\": \"raj.sanchez1048@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1965-09-13\", \"payment_methods\": {\"credit_card_7891819\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_7891819\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"4388\"}, \"gift_card_4964153\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_4964153\", \"amount\": 163.0}, \"gift_card_3226531\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_3226531\", \"amount\": 50.0}, \"certificate_4594761\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_4594761\", \"amount\": 150.0}, \"gift_card_1591784\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_1591784\", \"amount\": 57.0}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Olivia\", \"last_name\": \"Taylor\", \"dob\": \"1976-06-27\"}], \"membership\": \"silver\", \"reservations\": [\"MZDDS4\", \"60RX9E\", \"S5IK51\", \"OUEA45\", \"Q69X3R\"]}\nassistant: I found your account, Raj. You have several reservations. Let me check the details of each to find the one from Philadelphia (PHL) to LaGuardia (LGA).\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"MZDDS4\", \"user_id\": \"raj_sanchez_7340\", \"origin\": \"MIA\", \"destination\": \"LAX\", \"flight_type\": \"round_trip\", \"cabin\": \"business\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT050\", \"origin\": \"MIA\", \"destination\": \"LAX\", \"date\": \"2024-05-17\", \"price\": 1305}, {\"fligh", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 10, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 1, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "919bdbad", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T20:11:25"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "amem", "phase": "test", "task_id": "36#0", "task_desc": "I... I'm sorry... I need to change my flight... my wife... she passed away yesterday... I can't... I can't go as planned... I need to move it out two days... please...\nI... thank you... my user ID is lucas_brown_4047... my wife... she's gone... I just need to move the flight out two days... I can't cancel it... I just... I can't travel tomorrow...\n###TRANSFER###", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'm so sorry for your loss. I'm here to help you with this.\n\nTo locate your reservation and make the change, I'll need a few details first. Could you please provide your **user ID** (for example, something like \"sara_doe_496\")?\n\nIf you don't know your reservation ID, that's okay \u2014 once I have your user ID, I can look up your reservations for you.\nassistant: I'm truly sorry. Let me look up your reservations now.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"lucas_brown_4047\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Lucas\", \"last_name\": \"Brown\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"379 Pine Lane\", \"address2\": \"Suite 757\", \"city\": \"Jacksonville\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"FL\", \"zip\": \"32230\"}, \"email\": \"lucas.brown9700@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1965-01-01\", \"payment_methods\": {\"certificate_3138963\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_3138963\", \"amount\": 500.0}, \"credit_card_7872117\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_7872117\", \"brand\": \"mastercard\", \"last_four\": \"8056\"}, \"gift_card_5205020\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_5205020\", \"amount\": 86.0}, \"gift_card_9049233\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_9049233\", \"amount\": 15.0}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Daiki\", \"last_name\": \"Lopez\", \"dob\": \"1967-04-08\"}], \"membership\": \"silver\", \"reservations\": [\"UX0R03\", \"Q4TE65\", \"EUJUY6\", \"ODH78Z\", \"800DQL\", \"WYT8OO\"]}\nassistant: I found your profile. You have several reservations. Let me check the details to find the flight you're scheduled to take tomorrow.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"UX0R03\", \"user_id\": \"lucas_brown_4047\", \"origin\": \"ORD\", \"destination\": \"LGA\", \"flight_type\": \"one_way\", \"cabin\": \"business\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT289\", \"origin\": \"ORD\", \"destination\": \"PHL\", \"date\": \"2024-05-22\", \"price\": 1543}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT135\", \"origin\": \"PHL\", \"destination\": \"LGA\", \"date\": \"2024-05-22\", \"price\": 1404}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Lucas\", \"last_name\": \"Brown\", \"dob\": \"1965-01-01\"}], \"payment_history\": [{\"payme", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 8, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 1, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "919bdbad", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T20:11:25"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "amem", "phase": "test", "task_id": "13#1", "task_desc": "Hi, I need to make a change to my upcoming return trip. I currently have a one-stop flight from Atlanta to Los Angeles, and I\u2019d like to switch it to a nonstop flight from Atlanta to Las Vegas instead.\nI'm sorry, but I don't want to cancel and book a new flight \u2014 I only want to change my existing reservation to a nonstop from ATL to LAS. Since you're saying that kind of change isn't possible through modification, I'd like to be transferred to someone who can help me with this.\n\n###TRANSFER###", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I can help you with modifying your reservation. First, I'll need some information from you.\n\nCould you please provide your **user ID**? Also, if you have your **reservation ID**, please share that as well (if not, I can help locate it using your user ID).\n\nI should also let you know that per our modification policy, a reservation can be modified **without changing the origin, destination, and trip type**. Changing your destination from Los Angeles (LAX) to Las Vegas (LAS) is not permitted through a flight modification. If you'd like to fly to a different destination, that would require canceling the current reservation and booking a new one.\n\nPlease provide your user ID so we can proceed, and let me know how you'd like to move forward.", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 0, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 1, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "919bdbad", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T20:11:25"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "amem", "phase": "test", "task_id": "14#0", "task_desc": "Hello, I'm calling to find out how much I have left on my gift cards and travel certificates with your airline.\nSure, my user ID is mohamed_silva_9265.\nThanks for that. Could you give me the total sum of the gift card balances and the total sum of the certificate balances, rather than just the individual amounts?\nGreat, thanks for those totals. Now I'd like to change my upcoming reservation. I want to keep the same travel dates, but change it to the cheapest business class round trip available, ", "score": 0.0, "em": 0.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: To look up your gift cards and travel certificates, I'll need your user ID first. Could you please provide your user ID?\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"mohamed_silva_9265\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Mohamed\", \"last_name\": \"Silva\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"638 Elm Street\", \"address2\": \"Suite 548\", \"city\": \"Los Angeles\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"CA\", \"zip\": \"91365\"}, \"email\": \"mohamed.silva9198@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1960-11-26\", \"payment_methods\": {\"credit_card_5843230\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_5843230\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"2395\"}, \"gift_card_8020792\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_8020792\", \"amount\": 198.0}, \"certificate_3765853\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_3765853\", \"amount\": 500.0}, \"gift_card_6136092\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_6136092\", \"amount\": 129.0}, \"certificate_9984806\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_9984806\", \"amount\": 250.0}, \"credit_card_2198526\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_2198526\", \"brand\": \"mastercard\", \"last_four\": \"9363\"}, \"certificate_2765295\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_2765295\", \"amount\": 250.0}}, \"saved_passenger