{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "amem", "phase": "test", "task_id": "12#1", "task_desc": "Hello, I have a reservation YAX4DR for a flight from Boston to Minneapolis coming up. I want to change the class for all passengers on that booking to business, and I'd also like to add 2 checked bags under my name using my Gold membership.\nSure, my user ID is chen_lee_6825.\nWait, $1,200 is way over what I'm willing to pay. I can only spend up to $650 total for the class upgrade. Since upgrading both of us costs more than that, I'd like to just upgrade my companion Noah Hernandez to business cla", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: Hello! I'd be happy to help you change the cabin class to business and add checked bags to your reservation YAX4DR.\n\nTo proceed with modifying your reservation, I'll need your **user ID** (for example, something like \"sara_doe_496\"). Could you please provide that?\nassistant: Thank you! Let me look up your reservation and profile details.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"YAX4DR\", \"user_id\": \"chen_lee_6825\", \"origin\": \"BOS\", \"destination\": \"MSP\", \"flight_type\": \"one_way\", \"cabin\": \"economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT235\", \"origin\": \"BOS\", \"destination\": \"MCO\", \"date\": \"2024-05-18\", \"price\": 122}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT298\", \"origin\": \"MCO\", \"destination\": \"MSP\", \"date\": \"2024-05-19\", \"price\": 127}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Chen\", \"last_name\": \"Lee\", \"dob\": \"1967-12-12\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Noah\", \"last_name\": \"Hernandez\", \"dob\": \"1968-01-06\"}], \"payment_history\": [{\"payment_id\": \"credit_card_4938634\", \"amount\": 498}], \"created_at\": \"2024-05-05T23:00:15\", \"total_baggages\": 0, \"nonfree_baggages\": 0, \"insurance\": \"no\", \"status\": null}\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"chen_lee_6825\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Chen\", \"last_name\": \"Lee\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"355 Hillcrest D