{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "amem", "phase": "test", "task_id": "18#1", "task_desc": "Look, I'm dealing with some money troubles right now and it's really frustrating, but I need to get this sorted out. I have business class flights booked and I want to downgrade all of them to economy. I don't want to change any of the flight details or the passengers \u2014 just the cabin class on every reservation I have. Can you help me with that?\nYeah, fine. It's omar_davis_3817. That's my user ID. Like I said, I'm in a tight spot financially and I need every one of those business class bookings ", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I can help you with changing the cabin class on your reservations. To get started, I'll need your user ID so I can locate all of your reservations. Could you please provide your user ID?\nassistant: Let me look up your profile and reservations to find all your bookings.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"omar_davis_3817\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Omar\", \"last_name\": \"Davis\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"281 Spruce Street\", \"address2\": \"Suite 942\", \"city\": \"San Diego\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"CA\", \"zip\": \"92164\"}, \"email\": \"omar.davis7857@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1982-10-19\", \"payment_methods\": {\"gift_card_3481935\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_3481935\", \"amount\": 22.0}, \"credit_card_2929732\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_2929732\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"7803\"}, \"credit_card_9525117\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_9525117\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"2172\"}, \"gift_card_6847880\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_6847880\", \"amount\": 31.0}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Juan\", \"last_name\": \"Ahmed\", \"dob\": \"1992-11-19\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Anya\", \"last_name\": \"Thomas\", \"dob\": \"1990-10-11\"}], \"membership\": \"reg