{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "amem", "phase": "test", "task_id": "31#1", "task_desc": "Hello, I'm calling because I need to change my upcoming flight. I have a reservation flying out of JFK on May 17, but my cat is very sick and I need to get back home earlier to take care of him. I was hoping to switch to a nonstop flight if possible.\nYes, of course. My user ID is daiki_lee_6144. I'm not sure what my reservation ID is, but hopefully you can pull it up with that.\nYes, I'd appreciate that. Please connect me with someone who can help. I really need to get back home to my sick cat an", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'm sorry to hear about your cat. I'll help you look into changing your flight. \n\nFirst, I'll need your user ID to locate your reservation. Could you please provide your user ID? If you don't know your reservation ID, I can help find it once I have your user ID.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"daiki_lee_6144\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Daiki\", \"last_name\": \"Lee\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"410 River Road\", \"address2\": \"Suite 380\", \"city\": \"Fort Worth\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"TX\", \"zip\": \"76173\"}, \"email\": \"daiki.lee6987@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1976-10-08\", \"payment_methods\": {\"credit_card_6198952\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_6198952\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"9734\"}, \"gift_card_3112961\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_3112961\", \"amount\": 51.0}, \"gift_card_5128346\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_5128346\", \"amount\": 262.0}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Raj\", \"last_name\": \"Muller\", \"dob\": \"1967-10-16\"}], \"membership\": \"regular\", \"reservations\": [\"DF89BM\", \"COVE6R\", \"IIHXDG\"]}\nassistant: I found your profile. You have three reservations (DF89BM, COVE6R, IIHXDG). Let me check the details to find the one flying out of JFK on May 17.\ntool: 