{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "amem", "phase": "test", "task_id": "6#1", "task_desc": "Hello, I'm calling because I'm pretty sure I added travel insurance to my upcoming flight, but when I check my booking online it's not showing up there at all. I'm flying with my family, and everyone else in my group already has insurance on their tickets, so I really need to get mine sorted out and added properly.\nOkay, my user ID is sophia_taylor_9065 and the reservation number is PEP4E0. \n\nBut I really need to push back on this \u2014 I specifically remember selecting insurance when I booked, and ", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'm sorry, but I'm unable to add travel insurance to your reservation after the initial booking has been made. According to our policy, travel insurance cannot be added after the initial booking is completed.\n\nIf you believe insurance was included at the time of booking but isn't showing up, I can help you look into the details of your reservation to verify what's currently on file. To do that, I'll need your user ID and reservation ID (or I can help locate your reservation using your user ID if you don't have the reservation ID handy).\n\nPlease note that while I can review the booking details with you, I won't be able to add insurance to it at this stage. Let me know your user ID and I can pull up your reservation to confirm what's currently recorded.\nassistant: I understand your frustration, and I want to verify what's currently on file for your reservation. Let me pull up the details.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"PEP4E0\", \"user_id\": \"sophia_taylor_9065\", \"origin\": \"CLT\", \"destination\": \"PHX\", \"flight_type\": \"one_way\", \"cabin\": \"basic_economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT176\", \"origin\": \"CLT\", \"destination\": \"DTW\", \"date\": \"2024-05-20\", \"price\": 51}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT097\", \"origin\": \"DTW\", \"destination\": \"PHX\", \"date\