{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "amem", "phase": "test", "task_id": "14#1", "task_desc": "Hello. I'm Mohamed Silva, my user ID is mohamed_silva_9265. I'd like to check the total amounts I have on my gift cards and travel certificates, please.\nThanks, that's clear \u2014 so $327 total on gift cards and $1,000 total on certificates.\n\nNow, I'd like to change my upcoming reservation. I want to keep the same travel dates, but switch it to the cheapest business class round trip available, with or without connections, doesn't matter to me.\nThanks for explaining that. Since the basic economy book", "score": 0.0, "em": 0.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"mohamed_silva_9265\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Mohamed\", \"last_name\": \"Silva\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"638 Elm Street\", \"address2\": \"Suite 548\", \"city\": \"Los Angeles\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"CA\", \"zip\": \"91365\"}, \"email\": \"mohamed.silva9198@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1960-11-26\", \"payment_methods\": {\"credit_card_5843230\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_5843230\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"2395\"}, \"gift_card_8020792\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_8020792\", \"amount\": 198.0}, \"certificate_3765853\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_3765853\", \"amount\": 500.0}, \"gift_card_6136092\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_6136092\", \"amount\": 129.0}, \"certificate_9984806\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_9984806\", \"amount\": 250.0}, \"credit_card_2198526\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_2198526\", \"brand\": \"mastercard\", \"last_four\": \"9363\"}, \"certificate_2765295\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_2765295\", \"amount\": 250.0}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Raj\", \"last_name\": \"Sanchez\", \"dob\": \"1986-09-12\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Liam\", \"last_name\":