{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "amem", "phase": "test", "task_id": "29#1", "task_desc": "Hi, this is Raj Brown. I\u2019ve been dealing with some health issues lately, and fortunately I took out trip insurance for my upcoming flight. Because of that, I\u2019d like to change my reservation and have any change fees waived. \n\nRight now I have a roundtrip booked from Detroit (DTW) to LaGuardia (LGA) and back. I need to switch both legs to nonstop flights from Detroit to JFK instead, keeping the same travel dates as my current booking. I\u2019m only interested in early morning flights that arrive at the", "score": 0.0, "em": 0.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: Hi Raj, I\u2019d be happy to help you modify your reservation. To get started, I\u2019ll need your **user ID** (for example, something like `raj_brown_123`). \n\nOnce I have that, I can locate your reservation and review the current flights and travel dates. Could you please provide your user ID?\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"raj_brown_5782\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Raj\", \"last_name\": \"Brown\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"127 Chestnut Street\", \"address2\": \"Suite 411\", \"city\": \"San Jose\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"CA\", \"zip\": \"95153\"}, \"email\": \"raj.brown6519@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1967-03-12\", \"payment_methods\": {\"credit_card_7686643\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_7686643\", \"brand\": \"mastercard\", \"last_four\": \"2273\"}, \"gift_card_6468981\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_6468981\", \"amount\": 279.0}, \"credit_card_8003957\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_8003957\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"6521\"}, \"credit_card_8782472\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_8782472\", \"brand\": \"mastercard\", \"last_four\": \"1949\"}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Juan\", \"last_name\": \"Thomas\", \"dob\": \"1990-07-04\"}], \"membership\": \