{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "amem", "phase": "test", "task_id": "13#0", "task_desc": "Hi, I have an upcoming return flight booked with you and I need to make a change to it. Right now I\u2019ve got a one-stop flight from Atlanta to Los Angeles, but I\u2019d like to switch it to a nonstop flight from Atlanta to Las Vegas instead.\nMy info is James Lee, user ID james_lee_6136, reservation XEWRD9. But if I'm understanding you correctly, you're saying the destination can't be changed on my current booking? I don't want to book a new flight \u2014 I only want to modify my existing reservation to go t", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I can help you look into modifying your reservation. First, I'll need some information to locate your booking.\n\nCould you please provide:\n1. Your **user ID** (e.g., `sara_doe_496`)\n2. Your **reservation ID** (if you have it \u2014 if not, I can help find it using your user ID)\n\nAlso, I should note an important policy constraint: when modifying a reservation, the **origin, destination, and trip type cannot be changed**. Since your current flight is to Los Angeles (LAX) and you'd like to change it to Las Vegas (LAS), that would be changing the destination, which is not permitted through a flight modification.\n\nPlease provide your user ID and reservation ID, and we can review your options.", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 0, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 2, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "919bdbad", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T21:18:00"}
