{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "amem", "phase": "test", "task_id": "0#0", "task_desc": "Hello, I need to cancel a flight reservation I have with you. The confirmation code is EHGLP3.\nYes, my user ID is emma_kim_9957. \n\nAs for the reason \u2014 it's a change of plans. I booked the trip but then ended up being out of town, so I wasn't able to use it. I know it's been more than 24 hours since I booked, but I figured that would be okay given I was away.\nWait, that doesn't seem right to me. When I made this booking, I was specifically told I didn't need to purchase insurance because my previ", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'll help you cancel your reservation. Let me first look up the details of this reservation.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"EHGLP3\", \"user_id\": \"emma_kim_9957\", \"origin\": \"PHX\", \"destination\": \"JFK\", \"flight_type\": \"one_way\", \"cabin\": \"basic_economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT156\", \"origin\": \"PHX\", \"destination\": \"SEA\", \"date\": \"2024-05-17\", \"price\": 50}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT021\", \"origin\": \"SEA\", \"destination\": \"JFK\", \"date\": \"2024-05-17\", \"price\": 54}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Evelyn\", \"last_name\": \"Taylor\", \"dob\": \"1965-01-16\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Anya\", \"last_name\": \"Silva\", \"dob\": \"1971-11-22\"}], \"payment_history\": [{\"payment_id\": \"credit_card_5832574\", \"amount\": 208}], \"created_at\": \"2024-05-04T23:12:06\", \"total_baggages\": 0, \"nonfree_baggages\": 0, \"insurance\": \"no\", \"status\": null}\nassistant: I've located your reservation. Before I can proceed with the cancellation, I need a couple of details from you:\n\n1. **Your user ID** (the reservation shows this is associated with `emma_kim_9957` \u2014 please confirm this is your user ID).\n2. **The reason for cancellation** (change of plan, airline cancelled flight, or other reasons).\n\nIn the meantime, let me check the status of your flights.\ntool: available\ntool: available\nassistant: I've checked the status of both flights on your itinerary (HAT156 PHX\u2192SEA and HAT021 SEA\u2192JFK, both on 2024-05-17), and both are currently **available** (not cancelled by the airline).\n\nTo proceed, I still need you to confirm:\n\n1. **Your user ID** \u2014 please confirm it is `emma_kim_9957`.\n2. **The reason for cancellation** \u2014 is it a change of plan, airline cancelled flight, or other reasons?\n\nPlease note: based on the reservation details, this booking was created on 2024-05-04 (more than 24 hours ago), it is a **basic economy** fare with **no travel insurance**, and the flights have not been cancelled by the airline. Cancellation is only permitted if one of these conditions is met:\n- Th", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 7, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 2, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "919bdbad", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T21:18:00"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "amem", "phase": "test", "task_id": "36#0", "task_desc": "Hello... I'm sorry, I'm just... I'm really not doing well right now. My wife... she passed away yesterday. I have a flight booked that I need to change. I don't want to cancel it, I just... I need to move it out a couple of days because of what happened. I can't... I can't fly as planned.\nThank you... *sniffles*... it's been so hard. My user ID is lucas_brown_4047. And the reservation I need to change is EUJUY6. I just... I can't believe she's gone. I need to move that flight out two days. I don", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'm sorry for your loss. I'll help you change your flight.\n\nTo get started, I'll need a couple of details:\n1. Your user ID (for example, something like \"sara_doe_496\").\n2. Your reservation ID (for example, something like \"ZFA04Y\").\n\nIf you don't have your reservation ID handy, just let me know your user ID and I can look up your reservations for you.\nassistant: I'm sorry for your loss. Let me look up your reservation and account details.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"EUJUY6\", \"user_id\": \"lucas_brown_4047\", \"origin\": \"ORD\", \"destination\": \"LAS\", \"flight_type\": \"round_trip\", \"cabin\": \"basic_economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT238\", \"origin\": \"ORD\", \"destination\": \"DEN\", \"date\": \"2024-05-14\", \"price\": 96}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT290\", \"origin\": \"DEN\", \"destination\": \"LAS\", \"date\": \"2024-05-14\", \"price\": 64}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT266\", \"origin\": \"LAS\", \"destination\": \"IAH\", \"date\": \"2024-05-16\", \"price\": 70}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT044\", \"origin\": \"IAH\", \"destination\": \"ORD\", \"date\": \"2024-05-16\", \"price\": 76}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Lucas\", \"last_name\": \"Brown\", \"dob\": \"1965-01-01\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Daiki\", \"last_name\": \"Thomas\", \"dob\": \"1996-06-21\"}, {