{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "amem", "phase": "test", "task_id": "1#0", "task_desc": "Hello. I recently called your customer support line and was told that a service agent would be able to help me cancel my reservation. I\u2019d like to cancel my upcoming trip from Philadelphia to LaGuardia.\nSure, my name is Raj Sanchez and my user ID is raj_sanchez_7340.\nWait, but the customer support representative I spoke with on the phone specifically told me that a service agent would be able to help me cancel, and they approved the cancellation. I was assured it would be okay to cancel this trip", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: Hello! I'd be happy to help you cancel your reservation. To get started, I'll need your user ID. Could you please provide it?\nassistant: Thank you! Let me look up your profile and reservations.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"raj_sanchez_7340\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Raj\", \"last_name\": \"Sanchez\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"794 Sunset Drive\", \"address2\": \"Suite 598\", \"city\": \"Charlotte\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"NC\", \"zip\": \"28271\"}, \"email\": \"raj.sanchez1048@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1965-09-13\", \"payment_methods\": {\"credit_card_7891819\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_7891819\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"4388\"}, \"gift_card_4964153\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_4964153\", \"amount\": 163.0}, \"gift_card_3226531\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_3226531\", \"amount\": 50.0}, \"certificate_4594761\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_4594761\", \"amount\": 150.0}, \"gift_card_1591784\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_1591784\", \"amount\": 57.0}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Olivia\", \"last_name\": \"Taylor\", \"dob\": \"1976-06-27\"}], \"membership\": \"silver\", \"reservations\": [\"MZDDS4\", \"60RX9E\", \"S5IK51\", \"OUEA45\", \"