rrent time is 2024-05-15 15:00 EST).\n2. **Airline cancellation**: Both flights (HAT062 on 2024-05-16 and HAT284 on 2024-05-17) currently show a status of \"available\" \u2014 they have not been cancelled by the airline.\n3. **Cabin class**: The booking is in **basic economy**, not business.\n4. **Travel insurance**: There is no travel insurance on this reservation.\n\nPer our cancellation policy, a flight can only be cancelled (with refund) if one of the following is true: the booking was made within the last 24 hours, the flight was cancelled by the airline, it is a business-class booking, or the user has travel insurance covering the cancellation reason. Since none of these apply, I'm not able to process the cancellation.\n\nIf you believe there's an", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 5, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 2, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "919bdbad", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T21:18:00"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "amem", "phase": "test", "task_id": "3#1", "task_desc": "Hi, I'm calling because I'm getting really stressed about my upcoming trip \u2014 I have a lot of things I need to bring with me and it's really important that I get the right information. I need to figure out exactly how many suitcases my reservation allows me to take on the flight. I'm pretty sure I'm a Gold member, so I think that should give me a certain allowance. Can you help me find out the total number?\nSure, yes \u2014 I have that information right here. My name is Anya Garcia and my user ID is a", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'd be happy to help you find out your checked baggage allowance. To look up your reservation details, I'll need some information first.\n\nCould you please provide me with:\n1. Your user ID (for example, something like \"sara_doe_496\")\n2. Your reservation ID (for example, something like \"ZFA04Y\")\n\nIf you don't know your reservation ID, just let me know your user ID and I can help locate it for you.\nassistant: Let me look up your reservation and profile details to give you the exact information.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"JMO1MG\", \"user_id\": \"anya_garcia_5901\", \"origin\": \"DEN\", \"destination\": \"MIA\", \"flight_type\": \"one_way\", \"cabin\": \"economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT255\", \"origin\": \"DEN\", \"destination\": \"MIA\", \"date\": \"2024-05-16\", \"price\": 149}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Anya\", \"last_name\": \"Garcia\", \"dob\": \"1992-11-12\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Raj\", \"last_name\": \"Jackson\", \"dob\": \"1956-03-09\"}], \"payment_history\": [{\"payment_id\": \"gift_card_2550356\", \"amount\": 358}], \"created_at\": \"2024-05-13T23:20:29\", \"total_baggages\": 1, \"nonfree_baggages\": 0, \"insurance\": \"yes\", \"status\": null}\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"anya_garcia_5901\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Anya\", \"last_name\": \