{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "amem", "phase": "test", "task_id": "12#0", "task_desc": "Hello, I have an upcoming flight from Boston to Minneapolis and I\u2019d like to change the cabin class for everyone on my booking to business. I also need to add two checked bags under my name using my Gold membership benefits. Can you help me with that?\nSure, my user ID is chen_lee_6825.\nOh, $1,200 is quite a bit more than I was expecting to pay. I'm only willing to spend up to $650 total for the cabin upgrade. Since upgrading both of us would go over that limit, could we just upgrade my companion ", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'd be happy to help you with changing the cabin class and adding checked bags. \n\nTo get started, I'll need some information:\n1. Your **user ID** (e.g., 'sara_doe_496')\n2. Your **reservation ID** (e.g., 'ZFA04Y') \u2014 if you don't know it, I can help locate it once I have your user ID.\n\nCould you please provide your user ID?\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"chen_lee_6825\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Chen\", \"last_name\": \"Lee\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"355 Hillcrest Drive\", \"address2\": \"Suite 365\", \"city\": \"San Francisco\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"CA\", \"zip\": \"94178\"}, \"email\": \"chen.lee7831@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1967-12-12\", \"payment_methods\": {\"certificate_6730850\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_6730850\", \"amount\": 250.0}, \"certificate_9982533\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_9982533\", \"amount\": 100.0}, \"credit_card_4938634\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_4938634\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"9990\"}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Noah\", \"last_name\": \"Hernandez\", \"dob\": \"1968-01-06\"}], \"membership\": \"gold\", \"reservations\": [\"JW6LEQ\", \"ICJ5WM\", \"TVN3KL\", \"ZBCR1P\", \"4KG36I\", \"YAX4DR\", \"9NK7W8\"]}\nassistant: Thank you! 