{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "amem", "phase": "test", "task_id": "17#0", "task_desc": "Hello. For my upcoming trip from New York to Chicago, I\u2019d like to add three checked bags, change the passenger to myself, and upgrade the booking to economy class.\nSure, my user ID is omar_rossi_1241. I don\u2019t have the reservation ID handy, but maybe you can locate it using that ID?\nYes, I confirm all three changes \u2014 adding the three checked bags, switching the passenger to me, and upgrading to economy. For the $209, I\u2019d like to pay with my gift card on file, the one with the $280 balance (gift_c", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: To help you modify your reservation, I'll need some information first. Could you please provide your **user ID**? \n\nAlso, if you know your **reservation ID**, please share that as well. If you don't have it, I can help locate it once I have your user ID.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"omar_rossi_1241\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Omar\", \"last_name\": \"Rossi\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"901 Pine Lane\", \"address2\": \"Suite 360\", \"city\": \"Houston\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"TX\", \"zip\": \"77271\"}, \"email\": \"omar.rossi5980@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1970-06-06\", \"payment_methods\": {\"gift_card_8190333\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_8190333\", \"amount\": 280.0}, \"credit_card_6754990\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_6754990\", \"brand\": \"mastercard\", \"last_four\": \"3848\"}, \"certificate_8390038\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_8390038\", \"amount\": 150.0}, \"certificate_1778167\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_1778167\", \"amount\": 250.0}, \"gift_card_6490722\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_6490722\", \"amount\": 127.0}, \"credit_card_7407366\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_7407366\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four