{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "amem", "phase": "test", "task_id": "39#0", "task_desc": "Bonjour, hello. I would like to cancel all of my upcoming flights, s'il vous pla\u00eet. I am a bit worried because I don't have my reservation IDs with me, but I am the account holder. Can you help me with this?\nOui, of course. My user ID is amelia_davis_8890. I am Amelia Davis. I think you can find all my flights with this, non?\nAh, bon. The reason for cancellation, it is that I want to give up my seat for someone else who needs it more, you see? So I think it is \"other reasons\", non? For the MSJ4O", "score": 0.0, "em": 0.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: Hello! I'd be happy to help you cancel your upcoming flights. To locate your reservations, I'll need your user ID first. Could you please provide your user ID?\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"amelia_davis_8890\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Amelia\", \"last_name\": \"Davis\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"442 Sunset Drive\", \"address2\": \"Suite 708\", \"city\": \"San Diego\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"CA\", \"zip\": \"92125\"}, \"email\": \"amelia.davis1624@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1984-03-05\", \"payment_methods\": {\"gift_card_7397998\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_7397998\", \"amount\": 74.0}, \"gift_card_1647044\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_1647044\", \"amount\": 236.0}, \"credit_card_4074252\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_4074252\", \"brand\": \"mastercard\", \"last_four\": \"5435\"}, \"credit_card_6738701\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_6738701\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"5308\"}, \"credit_card_5799376\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_5799376\", \"brand\": \"mastercard\", \"last_four\": \"9326\"}, \"gift_card_5251654\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_5251654\", \"amount\": 179.0}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Amelia\", \"last_name\": \"Jackson\", \"dob\": \"1999-04-26\"}], \"membership\": \"silver\", \"reservations\": [\"8C8K4E\", \"UDMOP1\", \"XAZ3C0\", \"LU15PA\", \"MSJ4OA\", \"I6M8JQ\", \"4XGCCM\"]}\nassistant: Thank you, Amelia. I found your account and you have 7 reservations: 8C8K4E, UDMOP1, XAZ3C0, LU15PA, MSJ4OA, I6M8JQ, and 4XGCCM. Let me review each one to determine which are upcoming and can be cancelled. I'll start by checking the details of your first reservation.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"8C8K4E\", \"user_id\": \"amelia_davis_8890\", \"origin\": \"BOS\", \"destination\": \"DEN\", \"flight_type\": \"one_way\", \"cabin\": \"business\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT247\", \"origin\": \"BOS\", \"destination\": \"MIA\", \"date\": \"2024-05-24\", \"price\": 904}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT193\", \"origin\": \"MIA\", \"destination\": \"DEN\", \"date\": \"2024-05-2", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 17, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 2, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "919bdbad", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T21:18:00"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "amem", "phase": "test", "task_id": "20#1", "task_desc": "Hi, I'd like to book a one-way flight from New York to Seattle on May 20th.\nSure, my user ID is mia_li_3668.\nYes, destination is Seattle (SEA). For the departure airport, I don't have a specific preference \u2014 any of JFK, LGA, or EWR works for me.\nActually, I don't want to fly before 11am EST, so neither of those options works for me. Do you have any flights departing after 11am on May 20, maybe with a stopover or from the other NYC airports?\nI'd like to fly in economy. However, I notice you didn'", "score": 0.0, "em": 0.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: To get started with your booking, I'll need your user ID first. Could you please provide it?\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"mia_li_3668\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Mia\", \"last_name\": \"Li\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"975 Sunset Drive\", \"address2\": \"Suite 217\", \"city\": \"Austin\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"TX\", \"zip\": \"78750\"}, \"email\": \"mia.li3818@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1990-04-05\", \"payment_methods\": {\"credit_card_4421486\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_4421486\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"7447\"}, \"certificate_4856383\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_4856383\", \"amount\": 100.0}, \"certificate_7504069\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_7504069\", \"amount\": 250.0}, \"credit_card_1955700\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_1955700\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"1907\"}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Amelia\", \"last_name\": \"Ahmed\", \"dob\": \"1957-03-21\"}], \"membership\": \"gold\", \"reservations\": [\"NO6JO3\", \"AIXC49\", \"HKEG34\"]}\nassistant: Thank you, Mia. I can see you're a gold member. \n\nNew York has multiple airports (JFK, LGA, EWR). Which airport would you like to depart from? And just to confirm, your destination is Seattle (SEA), correct?\nassistant: Let me search for available flights. I'll start with JFK.\ntool: [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT069\", \"origin\": \"JFK\", \"destination\": \"SEA\", \"status\": \"available\", \"scheduled_departure_time_est\": \"06:00:00\", \"scheduled_arrival_time_est\": \"12:00:00\", \"date\": null, \"available_seats\": {\"basic_economy\": 17, \"economy\": 12, \"business\": 3}, \"prices\": {\"basic_economy\": 51, \"economy\": 121, \"business\": 239}}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT083\", \"origin\": \"JFK\", \"destination\": \"SEA\", \"status\": \"available\", \"scheduled_departure_time_est\": \"01:00:00\", \"scheduled_arrival_time_est\": \"07:00:00\", \"date\": null, \"available_seats\": {\"basic_economy\": 16, \"economy\": 7, \"business\": 3}, \"prices\": {\"basic_economy\": 87, \"economy\": 100, \"business\": 276}}]\nassistant: I found ", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 7, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 2, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "919bdbad", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T21:18:00"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "amem", "phase": "test", "task_id": "6#1", "task_desc": "Hi, I'm calling because I booked a flight for myself and my family, and I'm pretty sure I added travel insurance for my ticket when I was booking everything, but now when I look at my reservation online it's not showing up at all. Everyone else in my family already has their insurance showing on their flights, so I really need to get this fixed for mine.\nExcuse me? I really don't want to be transferred to another agent. You can help me with this, can't you? I just need the travel insurance added", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\ntool: Transfer successful\nassistant: YOU ARE BEING TRANSFERRED TO A HUMAN AGENT. PLEASE HOLD ON.\nassistant: I understand you'd prefer to resolve this directly, and I'm sorry for the frustration. However, I'm unable to add travel insurance to a reservation after the initial booking \u2014 this is a fixed policy rule that I must follow, and it applies regardless of whether the other passengers on the same reservation already have insurance showing.\n\nBecause adding or fixing insurance after booking is outside of what I'm permitted to do, this is exactly the kind of situation that needs a human agent, who may have options I don't. That's why I've transferred you. The human agent will already have the summary of your issue and can look into your reservation with you.\n\nIf you'd like, you can provide me with your user ID and reservation ID now, and I can include those details so the human agent has them ready \u2014 but I won't be able to add the insurance myself.\nassistant: I hear you, and I want to be completely transparent about what's actually possible on my end, because I'm not trying to push you off \u2014 I genuinely don't have a way to do what you're asking.\n\nHere's the situation: even if the insurance was correctly purchased at the time of booking, I do not have any tool that can modify or correct the insurance field on an existing reservation. The only reservation details I'm able to update are:\n- the flights/cabin,\n- the baggage count, and\n- passenger name and date-of-birth information.\n\nThere is no function available to me for changing or re-adding insurance after a reservation has already been created. So even if we both agree the insurance should be there, I have no means to make the system reflect that \u2014 this isn't a choice on my part, it's a limitation of what I can access.\n\nBecause fixing the insurance display requires a change I'm not able to make, this falls outside the scope of what I can handle, which is exactly why a human ag", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 3, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 2, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "919bdbad", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T21:18:00"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "amem", "phase": "test", "task_id": "34#1", "task_desc": "Hi, I need to modify my airline reservation HXDUBJ. I\u2019d like to change the outgoing flight to a nonstop one leaving the next day, and also shift my return from SFO back by one day, upgrade to business class, and add two checked bags. Just so you know, I only want flight options that depart after 8am and before 9pm. Can you help me with all of that?\nActually, I have travel insurance, and I specifically read on your website that change fees should be waived for insured customers \u2014 I expect you to ", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'll help you with that. Let me first look up your reservation details.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"HXDUBJ\", \"user_id\": \"yara_garcia_1905\", \"origin\": \"IAH\", \"destination\": \"SFO\", \"flight_type\": \"round_trip\", \"cabin\": \"economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT085\", \"origin\": \"IAH\", \"destination\": \"JFK\", \"date\": \"2024-05-18\", \"price\": 177}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT023\", \"origin\": \"JFK\", \"destination\": \"SFO\", \"date\": \"2024-05-18\", \"price\": 146}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT278\", \"origin\": \"SFO\", \"destination\": \"IAH\", \"date\": \"2024-05-22\", \"price\": 180}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Yara\", \"last_name\": \"Garcia\", \"dob\": \"1974-08-15\"}], \"payment_history\": [{\"payment_id\": \"gift_card_6941833\", \"amount\": 533}], \"created_at\": \"2024-05-04T06:04:48\", \"total_baggages\": 0, \"nonfree_baggages\": 0, \"insurance\": \"yes\", \"status\": null}\nassistant: Let me get your user details and search for available flights that meet your requirements.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"yara_garcia_1905\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Yara\", \"last_name\": \"Garcia\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"377 Pine Lane\", \"address2\": \"Suite 694\", \"city\": \"Denver\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"CO\", \"zip\": \"802