{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "amem", "phase": "test", "task_id": "10#1", "task_desc": "Hello, I have a flight booked from Houston to Seattle on May 23rd and I need to adjust it. I\u2019d like to push the departure back by a day to May 24th, and on top of that, I want to upgrade the cabin to business class for all the passengers on that flight.\nSure, my user ID is liam_khan_2521. I don\u2019t have the reservation ID in front of me right now, but hopefully you can pull up the booking with that.\nOkay, I see what you're saying \u2014 since your policy requires the cabin to be uniform across the whol", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: To help you modify your reservation, I'll need a few details first. Could you please provide your **user ID**? \n\nAlso, if you have your **reservation ID** handy, please share that as well. If you don't know it, I can help locate it for you once I have your user ID.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"liam_khan_2521\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Liam\", \"last_name\": \"Khan\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"626 Willow Lane\", \"address2\": \"Suite 707\", \"city\": \"New York\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"NY\", \"zip\": \"10148\"}, \"email\": \"liam.khan7273@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1979-09-27\", \"payment_methods\": {\"certificate_9254323\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_9254323\", \"amount\": 500.0}, \"gift_card_7194529\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_7194529\", \"amount\": 62.0}, \"credit_card_7434610\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_7434610\", \"brand\": \"mastercard\", \"last_four\": \"9448\"}, \"credit_card_7231150\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_7231150\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"3422\"}, \"certificate_1849235\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_1849235\", \"amount\": 250.0}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Fatima\", \"last_name\": \"Ito\", \"dob\": \"1983-03-27\"}], \"membership\": \"gold\", \"reservations\": [\"4NQLHD\", \"KHIK97\", \"NO6SVK\", \"AJVCTQ\", \"ZB7LBX\"]}\nassistant: I found your profile. You have several reservations. Let me locate the one from Houston to Seattle on May 23rd by checking your bookings.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"4NQLHD\", \"user_id\": \"liam_khan_2521\", \"origin\": \"IAH\", \"destination\": \"SEA\", \"flight_type\": \"round_trip\", \"cabin\": \"economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT190\", \"origin\": \"IAH\", \"destination\": \"LAS\", \"date\": \"2024-05-23\", \"price\": 126}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT047\", \"origin\": \"LAS\", \"destination\": \"SEA\", \"date\": \"2024-05-23\", \"price\": 139}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT021\", \"origin\": \"SEA\", \"destination\": \"JFK\", \"date\": \"2024-05-26\", \"price\": 148}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT279\", \"origin\": \"JFK\", \"dest", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 9, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 2, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "919bdbad", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T21:18:00"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "amem", "phase": "test", "task_id": "35#1", "task_desc": "Hi, I'm Aarav Ahmed. I need to cancel my upcoming trip from JFK to MCO on May 22. I'm a silver member with your airline, so I should be getting a full refund for that cancellation. Let's take care of that first\u2014I'll also need to book a different flight afterward, but the refund is my priority right now.\nSure, my user ID is aarav_ahmed_6699. And just to be clear, I'm a silver member, so I expect a full refund on that May 22 JFK to MCO flight\u2014no cancellation fees or partial credit. That's a standa", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: Hello Aarav! I'd be happy to help you cancel your upcoming trip and then assist with booking a new flight.\n\nTo get started with the cancellation, I'll need your **user ID** (for example, something like `aarav_ahmed_123`). Could you please provide that? \n\nAlso, if you don't know your reservation ID for the JFK \u2192 MCO trip on May 22, I can help locate it once I have your user ID.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"aarav_ahmed_6699\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Aarav\", \"last_name\": \"Ahmed\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"176 Willow Lane\", \"address2\": \"Suite 431\", \"city\": \"Jacksonville\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"FL\", \"zip\": \"32131\"}, \"email\": \"aarav.ahmed6812@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1981-05-26\", \"payment_methods\": {\"credit_card_9074831\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_9074831\", \"brand\": \"mastercard\", \"last_four\": \"7334\"}, \"certificate_9645872\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_9645872\", \"amount\": 250.0}, \"credit_card_4959530\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_4959530\", \"brand\": \"mastercard\", \"last_four\": \"5018\"}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Aarav\", \"last_name\": \"Patel\", \"dob\": \"1980-12-03\"}], \"membership\": \"silver\", \"reservations\": [\"M20IZO